-- QuestLocFlavor (generado 2026-10-17): objetivos completos, con dialogos, solo para narrar.
_G.QuestLocFlavor = _G.QuestLocFlavor or {}
QuestLocFlavor[2] = {
[1001]={"Espíritu funesto maldito","Derrota a espíritus funestos malditos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Espíritus funestos malditos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Los espíritus funestos malditos se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo."},
[1003]={"Habla con Radagast","'Whatever - whoever this dweller of Caras Tilion may be, he is aware of our presence already, I feel certain of it. If we tarry, he will be upon us.\
\
'The wisest counsel would have you leave me, with my injured leg, and go to Felegoth for aid. But I see in your face you have no intention of such a cautious course.'","You should stand by Oroniel's side and face the dweller of Caras Tilion.","Someone - or something - has come to dwell in Caras Tilion.","Talk to Oroniel","'This man you encountered in Caras Tilion is hair-raising, indeed, by your account. However, you must take me at my word that no one man holds the power to corrupt a river so.\
\
'Nay, even the Dark Lord himself, in the guise of the Necromancer, could not have done so in mere days. Long have I watched the dark workings of Dol Guldur and their effect upon these forests, and I know it to be so.'","Acolyte of the Necromancer","'Do you feel the air getting colder? He approaches! Prepare yourself!'","Radagast can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.\
\
You should tell Radagast about what you have encountered at Caras Tilion."},
[1005]={"Reach Acquaintance tier with the Ikorbâni","${PLAYERNAME:Conocido[m]|Conocida[f]} de los Ikorbâni","Your efforts to assist the Ikorbâni are noted among the people. To recognize your efforts, the leaders of the Shagâni at Iridír wish to honour you with a gift and thanks.","Visit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift","Your standing among the Ikorbâni earns you a gift. Return to Kildûg at Iridír to claim your reward.","'You are true to your word. We recognize all you have done with this simple offering. We would provide you more if you are willing to part with Ghín.\
\
'If you wish, speak with Nêkhur and see what we offer.'","You have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance."},
[1006]={"'The secrets of the land, its history, and its people become clearer with every effort you undertake for us. We want to recognize your contributions.\
\
'Please accept one of these fine gifts provided to us by Captain Rothog as a reward for your efforts.\
\
'Be certain to speak with Shulêga. She has other gifts from Captain Rothog.'","Your standing with the Phetekâri grows. You should visit one of their assistants at Telperiën's Gate, Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a well-earned gift.","Visit Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate to claim your gift","Visit a Tale-warden's assistant at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh","'Please accept one of these fine gifts provided to us by Captain Rothog as a reward for your efforts.\
\
'Speak with one of our quartermasters to see what other gifts Lord Rothog offers.'","Acquaintance of the Phetekâri","Visit the Tale-warden Assistant, Mashêm at Telperiën's Gate, or any of the other Phetekâri quartermasters at Iridír, Jirush, or Urmâkh to claim a gift from the Tale-wardens of Umbar.","Your standing among the Tale-wardens earns you a gift. Return to one of their members' quartermasters to be rewarded.","Reach Acquaintance tier with the Phetêkari"},
[1007]={"In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed. Among the adventurous dwarves who dared leave the deep halls, your name and effort gain heft. Return to the quartermaster to see new wares awaiting those proven.","${PLAYERNAME:Conocido[m]|Conocida[f]} de los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh","In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed.","'You endure where others fall. In this, you have earned the regard of those who rose from the deep. Your name, your bearing, your deeds all speak well. We hold to our word. Choose a gift, earned by toil.'","Reach Acquaintance standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh","Speak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh","You stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought."},
[1009]={"Habla con Hórin","'We return to Glimmerdeep. Now is the time to fight. Is your weapon ready, ${PLAYER}?'","'Two heads! Old tales are told of such trolls who lurk in the shadows of the northern mountains. Never have I dreamt to see one. But then, never had I dreamt the Zhélruka would come back here.\
\
'And yet, it is clear, we alone do not seek to claim this place. These Orcs, these Hobgoblins, this two-headed troll sought the mine for wealth and not shelter. Treasure for some master or cause we know not of. It is troubling, ${PLAYER}! We must guard ourselves well. We must watch our backs.'","Across the Chasm","Completa la instancia El Brilloprofundo","You should talk to Hórin at Skarháld.","Hórin believes you have seen the true threat of Glimmerdeep across the bridgeless chasm.","'Do you recall the chasm we found in the mine, ${PLAYER}? The bridge was out and we could not cross, yet on that far side, I thought I saw... no, I could not tell. Some great form. Far greater than an Orc, but up upon two legs, arms at its sides. Did you see it too?\
\
'I know not what it was, and I fear to know the truth, but within my heart know that is what we must face, if we are to claim those mines.'","Join Hórin in 'Glimmerdeep'.\
\
You will find the instance on the Specific tab of the Instance Finder panel, under the Grey Mountains section."},
[1011]={"'Las Quebradas de los Túmulos son un lugar peligroso. ¡Espero que mis hijos estén a salvo!'","Llevar el diario a Addie Trigal","'Oh, qué persona tan fuerte y noble eres. Me recuerdas a mis propios hijos, mis pobres hijos. Se han ido hace ya tiempo, y no he recibido ni una sola palabra de ellos.\
\
'Verás, todo comenzó con mi hijo, Malin. Estaba convencido de que había tesoros en las Quebradas de los Túmulos esperando ser tomados, y partió en busca de fortuna. Pasaron unos días y no regresó, así que envié a su hermano, Amlach, tras él... y tampoco he sabido nada de él.\
\
'Ahora he venido aquí con estos otros en busca de mis hijos. Amlach dijo que acamparía en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, en los acantilados del este, pero no estaba allí cuando llegamos. Los demás creen que ha ido más al sur. ¿Podrías ir a buscarlo?'","Buscar a Amlach","Has encontrado el cadáver de Amlach.","'Debo saber qué ocurrió con mis hijos. Mis guías dicen que hay ruinas grises en el sur, a veces confundidas con el Alto del Hombre Muerto, quizás mi hijo Amlach esté allí. ¡Por favor, apúrate!'","'¡Quizás Malin aún viva!'","Hay un lugar justo al entrar que algunos confunden con el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Addie Trigal dijo que su hijo Amlach iba a montar un campamento en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, pero no estaba allí cuando ella y sus guías llegaron. Teme que Amlach se haya perdido en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos mientras buscaba a su hermano, Malin.","Los Hijos Perdidos de Addie","Addie Trigal, una mujer anciana y empobrecida, temerosa por sus hijos Amlach y Malin, se adentró en las Quebradas de los Túmulos en busca de sus hijos cazadores de tesoros.","'¡Oh, mi pobre Amlach!'","Addie Trigal espera tu regreso entre la relativa seguridad que ofrecen los guías en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Has encontrado al hijo de Addie Trigal, Amlach, muerto entre las lápidas en el sur de las Quebradas de los Túmulos. En su mano, sostenía un diario desgarrado. Deberías llevar el diario de vuelta a Addie, pues querrá saber el destino de sus hijos.","'¡Has regresado con el diario de Malin! Nunca lo dejaba fuera de su vista. ¿Qué destino maligno ha caído sobre mis hijos?\
\
'¿Amlach... muerto? Malin... debes regresar y buscar a Malin, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[1013]={"Pervinca Tuk cometió el error de ayudar a sus primos Isembard e Imbert a gastarle una broma al anciano Adelard Tuk. Pervinca se escapó con el capítulo que él escribió para el Anuario de Alforzaburgo, e Isembard lo escondió.","Habla con Isembard Tuk","Capítulo de Adelard","Pervinca pensó que sus primos Isembard e Imbert Tuk podrían estar cerca del Gran Sauce al este de los Grandes Smials en Alforzaburgo.\
\
Pervinca te pidió que buscaras a sus primos Isembard e Imbert, quienes fueron a recuperar el capítulo de Adelard del Anuario, y ver qué les está tomando tanto tiempo.","'¡Te dije que sacaríamos la bolsa del árbol rápido! Será mejor que se la lleves a Pervinca.\
\
'Aunque, ojalá la hubiéramos guardado un poco más... seguro que ahora escucharemos otro discurso del viejo Adelard.'","Capítulo de Adelard recogido","'¡Muchas gracias, {Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}! ¡No dejaré que Isembard e Imbert me metan en problemas otra vez!'","'¿Qué? ¿Pervinca envió a ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]} aquí? ¡Es tan preocupada! No hay nada que temer, el viejo Imbert y yo tendremos ese capítulo de Adelard en un santiamén.\
\
'Ve, escondimos el capítulo en una bolsa en el árbol, pero la rama por la que subimos se rompió. Hemos estado aquí rascándonos la cabeza sobre cómo bajarla... ¡pero tú me diste una gran idea!'","'¡Oh, buen día! ¿También vienes por el capítulo de Adelard? Lo mejor es hablar con Isembard, él es el más listo de los dos. ¡Yo solo estoy aquí para echarle una mano, si puedo!'","'Isembard e Imbert deberían estar cerca del gran sauce al este de los Grandes Smials en Alforzaburgo. ¡Por favor, date prisa, no sé cuánto tardará Adelard en descubrir que falta su capítulo!'","'¡Bien, encontraste la bolsa! Ahora, ¿dónde está el capítulo que Isembard puso dentro? ¡Debes traérmelo rápido, antes de que Adelard descubra que falta!'","'¡Bien, lo encontraste! Ahora a devolverlo a la biblioteca antes de que Adelard note que falta. ¡Gracias! ¡Me has salvado de muchos problemas!'","'Me sentí fatal después de llevarme el capítulo del viejo Adelard. ¡Gracias por recuperarlo!'","Recoge el capítulo de Adelard","Lleva el capítulo de Adelard a Pervinca Tuk","Has protegido a Isembard e Imbert Tuk","'Pensé que esa bolsa nunca caería del árbol. Pero, afortunadamente, el plan de Isembard funcionó. Siempre dije que era el más listo de los dos, ¡y esto lo prueba otra vez!'","Lleva el capítulo de Adelard de vuelta a Pervinca Tuk en los Grandes Smials.\
\
Después de sobrevivir a la gran idea de Isembard para bajar la bolsa con el capítulo de Adelard del árbol, finalmente tienes el capítulo en mano para devolvérselo a Pervinca.","'¡Necesito tu ayuda! Cometí un terrible error al escuchar a Isembard e Imbert, mis primos tontos. Verás, el viejo Adelard siempre nos da lecciones a los jóvenes Tuk sobre la historia de la familia, y bueno, eso cansa. Mis primos decidieron gastarle una broma y me convencieron de escabullirme con el último capítulo que Adelard escribió para el Anuario de Alforzaburgo.\
\
'¡Ahora estoy preocupada por los problemas en los que me voy a meter! Isembard, sin embargo, fue a buscar el capítulo donde lo escondió, pero aún no ha regresado.\
\
'Creo que dijo que lo escondió en un árbol alto al este de los Grandes Smials en Alforzaburgo. ¿Podrías ir allí y ver qué le está tomando tanto tiempo?'"},
[1014]={"Defeat the risen dwarf-lords","Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Defeat Loknashra","Talk to Kyrstig","Defeated Loknashra","Use the summoning horn to call Kyrstig","Adkhât-zahhar, the Houses of Rest -- Solo","Defeat the wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Defeated the wight of Vethúg Wintermind","Deep in the Pit of Stonejaws, a grand tomb holds the remains of the many ancient dwarf-lords of Gundabad. The necromancer Loknashra, now empowered with the spirit of Drugoth, has returned to raise an army and claim her vengeance upon all those who wronged her.","Find and speak to Kytstig at the entrance of The Houses of Rest.","Defeated the risen dwarf-lords","'That hobgoblin was formidable enough before she possessed the spirit of a Gauntlord in addition to her own! I think we need to hurry. I definitely saw Loknashra come in here, and she has no doubt already set to work disturbing the rest of my ancestors. Come on, let's go! Be brave, Kyrstig, be brave!'"},
[1021]={"Toca la campana para llamar a Helechal o a su ayudante","Bill Helechal o su agente estará en la granja Viejo Dulcésped, al noreste del campamento de Adso Henoloma.\
\
Para reducir su deuda, Adso Henoloma te ha pedido que lleves una bolsa a un tal Bill Helechal. Te advierte que solo encontrarás a Helechal en el lugar acordado después de anochecer. Debes tocar el timbre para hacerle saber a Helechal o a su agente que has llegado.","'Has hecho lo que tenías que hacer, ahora vete. Dile a ese hobbit que volveremos a contactar con él.'","'¡Ja! Pronto los hombres de Zarquino tendrán todo Bree bajo control. Con cobardes como ese gusano de Adso bajo su bota, no hay duda de eso.\
\
'Solo dile a Adso que este pago ha sido recibido, pero que mejor tenga otro listo para la semana que viene, o le irá mal.'","Adso Henoloma, un Hobbit de Bree, dirige un albergue de caza y una estación de paso a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Para facilitar la construcción del albergue, su empresa se vio envuelta en asuntos poco recomendables y ahora tiene que hacer pagos.","'¿Otro pago? ¡Se suponía que este sería el último! Me va a arruinar, ese maldito...\
\
'Pero basta de mis quejas. No debería molestarte con mis problemas, no, debería agradecerte tu ayuda. La verdad es que tenía un poco de miedo de ir allí solo por la noche.\
\
'Si no te importa, ¿podrías ayudarme a pagar otras deudas? A gente más decente, por supuesto.'","La entrega de Adso","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento","'Veo que no eres de por aquí, y eso es bueno. Esto es un asunto serio, y no puedo confiar en mis trabajadores para algo tan... delicado. Quiero crear mi propio establecimiento y, hace poco, las cosas tomaron un giro inesperado... Me da vergüenza contarle a mis empleados lo que ha pasado y espero que puedas ayudarme con este asunto. Esta bolsa contiene el último pago que debo hacer para asegurar la seguridad de mis trabajadores y la santidad de este lugar prometedor.\
\
'Llévala a la granja Viejo Dulcésped, al noreste de aquí, y dásela al hombre que te abra la puerta. Puede ser Bill - Bill Helechal, me refiero - o uno de sus ayudantes.\
\
'Bill dijo que solo estaría allí por la noche, así que no pierdas el tiempo tratando de encontrarlo durante el día. Solo tienes que tocar la puerta o tocar el timbre y darle la bolsa, ¿entendido?'","'¡Eh! ¿No tienes nada para mí?'","El campamento de Adso Henoloma se encuentra al suroeste de la granja Dulcésped.\
\
Adso Henoloma te envió a entregar un pago a la brutalidad de Bill Helechal y ahora espera tu regreso.","Lleva el paquete a Bill Helechal de noche","'Por favor, haz la entrega rápidamente. No quiero que mis trabajadores corran más peligro.'"},
[1023]={"Valdamarca Haith would like your help hunting and gathering from the grounds near Malbarth.","Hunt wild boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well hullo! How are you? Nice to meet you!'\
\
The enthusiastic woman shakes your hand up and down, and up and down, and up again.\
\
'My name is Valdamarca Haith, but everybody calls me the trencher-woman! Well, no one calls me the trencher-woman, but I'm hoping the name will catch on!\
\
'I'm on a journey to sample the delicious flavours our fair Middle-earth has to offer.\
\
'Malbarth has been so lovely to me. I plan to throw a feast for them. Could you do a little hunting and foraging for me? I'll trade you for some delicious bread. I learned the recipe from a young lad all the way over in Lhan Garan.\
\
'What do you mean a loaf of bread isn't enough compensation? Very well, I'll throw in some coin, too.'","Talk to Valdamarca Haith","Adventures of the Trencher-woman: Malbarth","Hunted wild boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Valdamarca, the trencher-woman, takes your offerings and sets them aside.\
\
'Oh well this will make for a proper feast, won't it? Thank you, new friend.\
\
'When my business in Malbarth is complete, I wonder where the road will take me.'\
\
You tell her of an increasingly popular establishment in Pelargir.\
\
'How enticing! Maybe we'll meet again there someday.'","You have hunted enough boars and should return to Valdarmaica, the trencher-woman.\
\
Deliver boar meat to the trencher-woman.","The trencher-woman needs you to hunt wild boars around Lower Lebennin.\
\
Defeat wild boars around Lower Lebennin."},
[1024]={"Stained merrevail have invaded Minas Morgul and taken over the Circle of Madness.","Stained merrevail have taken over the third tier in Minas Morgul, the Circle of Madness.\
\
You should defeat stained merrevail.","Defeated stained merrevail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aerial Invaders","Faeron is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Talk to Faeron","'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. While this enemy is known to us, it is prudent not to let your guard down. We know full well of what they are capable.'","'The Circle of Madness has been completely overrun by Lhaereth's forces. We will not be able to press farther into the city until they are removed. I ask that you defeat any you come across.'","Defeat stained merrevail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1025]={"Al derrotar a Talug, descubriste una nota escrita apresuradamente y con una caligrafía casi ilegible. Después de un tiempo, pudiste descifrar lo que decía.","'¿Orcos que tienen miedo de algo que no somos nosotros los enanos? ¡Ja! Parece que esto tiene algo que ver con los rumores que he escuchado de nuestros Elfos y la compañía que envié al Refugio Sombrío.'","¿Miedo a la Oscuridad?","Lleva el mensaje a Veúlfur en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","La nota dice:\
\
'Mazog, algo no está bien con ese Uruk Kranklûk. Los chicos también lo ven. Creo que sería mejor que empezáramos a prestar mucha atención a esas tropas que desaparecen en la profunda oscuridad de ese lugar sombrío. Podría haber algo más que hongos allí.'\
\
Quizás haya alguien en la Sala Vigesimoprimera que pueda ayudarte con esto.","Podría haber un enano que pueda ayudarte con la nota en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
La nota parece indicar que el general Talug tiene cierto grado de miedo y aprensión sobre lo que se encuentra en los lugares oscuros y profundos de Moria."},
[1026]={"Speak with Imrahil","Imrahil can be found just outside the city walls of Minas Tirith","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, I am glad you were able to come so quickly to aid the efforts here. There is much to be done.'","The Battle of the Pelennor Fields is at an end and Gondor has seen victory on this day. However, the city of Minas Tirith has succumbed to much death and destruction. Imrahil, Prince of Dol Amroth, has summoned you to his side as he begins the task of rebuilding the White City.","After the Battle","After the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, Imrahil has summoned you to aid the great city of Minas Tirith.","The horse to after-battle Minas Tirith can be found in the Threshold of the City, or in Minas Tirith pre-battle.\
\
Take the horse to after-battle Minas Tirith so that you may meet with Imrahil.","Imrahil can be found just outside the walls of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Imrahil.","Take the horse to Minas Tirith, After the Battle"},
[1027]={"Disturbed by the presence of Angmarim still loyal to the Iron Crown in Elderslade, Glóin has asked you to rally with one of his scouts, Múta, and investigate the settlement of Caivád Sâr.","After the Fall","Find Múta at Caivád Sâr","'One of my scouts, Múta, has travelled north to the Angmarim settlement at Caivád Sâr.\
\
'She is a cunning Stout-axe, and I would have you aid her in repelling the forces of the Iron Crown that now dwell in Elderslade. Chief among them is a sorcerer of some infamy, Bandrauth Adder-fang. In addition, we know little of why so many Angmarim have migrated to Elderslade... aside from recent happenings in Angmar.\
\
'Múta can tell you more of each of these, ${PLAYER}. As for me, I must return to my duties.\
\
'Be swift, my friend!'","Múta can be found somewhere near Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
Glóin has asked you to rally with one of his scouts, Múta, near the Angmarim settlement of  Caivád Sâr. You should travel north and find Múta.","'Ah! Are you the one Commander Glóin promised to send?\
\
'I am Múta, and that...'\
\
Múta gestures toward the Angmarim village nearby.\
\
'...is Caivád Sâr.'","You discover Múta keeping watch just outside Caivád Sâr","Múta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade.\
\
You have found Múta and you should now talk to her.","Talk to Múta at Caivád Sâr"},
[1028]={"Derrota a los trasgos en Gloku-ru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No todas las empresas en Moria han sido fructíferas. Uno de nuestros primeros asentamientos en el Camino de Durin fue un puesto avanzado construido por Gerwith, en Gloku-ru al sur. El campamento fue invadido por trasgos y completamente quemado, mientras que solo Gerwith y unos pocos otros lograron escapar.\
\
'Los trasgos amenazan con fortificar Gloku-ru y representan un peligro persistente para nosotros si no actuamos contra ellos. Dirígete allí y derrota a tantos como puedas. Luego informa a Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân, hacia el este, cuando hayas terminado.'","'Me alegra verte, ${PLAYER}. Me alegra saber que los trasgos han pagado por lo que sucedió en Gloku-ru. Cuando pienso en ese día, todavía puedo sentir el calor del fuego a mi alrededor...\
\
'Bueno, tus hazañas me han dado esperanza. Quizás algún día construiré un nuevo puesto avanzado en Gloku-ru, y haré saber que solo fue posible gracias a tu valentía.'","Tharâkh Bazân está al norte y al este de Gloku-ru.\
\
Se te ha pedido que informes a Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân sobre tu éxito en Gloku-ru.","Has derrotado a los trasgos en Gloku-ru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los trasgos han incendiado el puesto avanzado que una vez estuvo en Gloku-ru, y ahora amenazan con construir sus propias fortificaciones en el mismo lugar.","Habla con Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân","'Gloku-ru está al sur, más allá del cruce de Durin, y ligeramente al oeste. Cuando termines, puedes encontrar a Gerwith en Tharâkh Bazân hacia el este.'","Después del Incendio","El campamento de trasgos de Gloku-ru está al sur y ligeramente al oeste de la entrada de Zirakzigil y la Puerta de las Nubes.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que derrotes a los trasgos que quemaron el campamento que una vez estuvo en Gloku-ru."},
[1029]={"Chop firewood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have completed Tornir's tasks and should let him know.\
\
He can be found outside his house in Glaniath.","Tornir tries to keep up with his daily tasks.","Malas hierbas arrancadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arranca las malas hierbas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Chopped firewood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","After the War","Talk to Tornir","'What is left, what is left... Hador is taking care of that, but... I must be forgetting something --\
\
'Forgive me, traveller, I was lost in thought. Are you looking for work? There is firewood to be chopped, and weeds to be pulled in the yard. Should you accept, I will pay you for your efforts.\
\
'It feels strange worrying about such minor tasks after such ferocious fighting. The war did not destroy Glaniath, but... it would not be right to say we were left unscathed.'","'It's getting harder to remember everything that needs tending to around here. My children would remember better, but...'\
\
He pauses. When he speaks up again, his voice is thicker.\
\
'They defended those who needed defending, until the end.\
\
'My neighbours help where they can, but they can't do everything for me, of course. It was good of you to pitch in, traveller.'","Tornir has asked you to chop firewood and pull weeds in his yard.\
\
His home is located in Glaniath."},
[1030]={"Habla con Egfrith en las mazmorras bajo Isengard.","La prisionera te resulta curiosamente familiar.","Epílogo: ...y Respuestas","Entrega la pequeña porción de comida a la prisionera indisciplinada en la celda de la izquierda de los calabozos.","'¡Yar! ¡Tú, ahí! Tengo mejores cosas que hacer que llevar comida a prisioneros altivos en las mazmorras. Lleva esta pequeña porción a la prisionera indisciplinada de la celda de la izquierda. ¡Quizá la escasez le enseñe que no es mejor que nosotros!'","Espera... ¿puede ser?","No cabe duda: es Egfrith, traidora de Rohan y sierva de Saruman.","El trabajo es duro y las condiciones deplorables bajo Isengard, y aun aquellos que sirven a Saruman siguen siendo prisioneros.","Egfrith ha sido encarcelada bajo Isengard, a pesar de su traición al reino de Rohan.","Egfrith calla y, tras un momento, parece no verte más.","'Lleva esa pequeña porción de comida a la prisionera indisciplinada de la celda de la izquierda. ¡Quizás la escasez le enseñe que no es mejor que el resto de nosotros!'","'¿Eres tú, ? No sabía si podía confiar en mis ojos... He visto a otros durante mi cautiverio, otros a quienes traicioné, y ellos no estaban realmente aquí. No, tú has sido ${PLAYERNAME:traído[m]|traída[f]} hasta aquí por otro propósito inescrutable de Saruman.\
\
Egfrith te mira con tristeza, el rostro demacrado y la armadura colgando de su ahora enjuto cuerpo.\
\
'Cuando regresé a Isengard con lo que había aprendido del viaje de Boromir, Saruman estaba enfurecido. El sueño que envió a Boromir en busca de Imladris tenía el tinte de una profecía para el hijo de Gondor, pero para Saruman significaba mucho más. En él vio el desmoronamiento de innumerables planes, intrigas que ocultaba incluso a sus consejeros más cercanos, y eso lo llenó de una ira grande y terrible, escalofriante de presenciar. Que no hubiera matado a Boromir, como me ordenó, era algo que no podía comprender, y a partir de ese fracaso tejió un tapiz de palabras crueles que arrastró a Rohan a una espiral hacia la ruina.\
\
'Pero eso no fue lo peor, . Lo peor fueron las últimas palabras que me dijo, antes de que los uruks me arrastraran a esta celda. \\qEres una necia ciega, Egfrith, si creíste que Rohan caería sin ayuda. ¿Cuántas veces te dije que Théoden enfermaba, que su fuerza menguaba y que jamás se recuperaría? Eso fue obra mía,\\q se regodeó Saruman, \\qun regalo administrado cuidadosamente por otros de mis siervos. ¡Y aun así desesperaste a la primera oportunidad! Que ese conocimiento te devore viva, sabueso roto de Rohan. Abandonaste a tu rey y a tu reino, pues no tenías fuerza alguna, y ahora te pudrirás en la oscuridad, y tus únicos compañeros serán dunlendinos y de Rohan que te reconocerán como traidora.\\q\
\
'He fallado a mi rey, , y he fallado a Rohan. ¿Cómo pude ser tan ciega, tan fácilmente usada?'\
\
Egfrith sonríe, las líneas secas de su rostro agrietándose con el esfuerzo desconocido.\
\
'Es mejor que no estés realmente aquí, , porque no creo que pudiera soportar ver a nadie de los nuestros en este lugar: el agotado Meneldir, un Montaraz que insiste en que no es un Dúnadan, o el noble Boromir, tan lejos de su hogar. Es mejor creer que llegaron al final de sus viajes con los éxitos que merecían y alcanzaron la felicidad que les era debida... a diferencia de Egfrith, gran necia de Rohan, prisionera de su propia ilusión.\
\
'Pero esa ilusión... era por Rohan.\
\
'Siempre.'","El uruk malhumorado te dio una pequeña porción de comida para entregársela a una prisionera indisciplinada en la celda de la izquierda, en los calabozos.","La mujer no te mira a los ojos cuando le pasas la pequeña porción de comida a través de los barrotes."},
[1031]={"'Estas piedras señalan el sacrificio de aquellos Dúnedain que cayeron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad a finales de septiembre. Cada vez que regreso a Tornhad, me tomo un tiempo para venir aquí y recordar a quienes perdimos.'","Epílogo: En memoria de los caídos","Gorwen permanece junto a varios túmulos construidos recientemente en la aldea de Tornhad, recordando a quienes se perdieron en el Vado de Sarn y bajo Dol Ernil.","'Es bueno verte fuera de Tyrn Gorthad, ${PLAYER}, lejos del inquieto bastión de Dol Ernil.'\
\
Gorwen hace un gesto hacia los túmulos construidos cerca.\
\
'Estas piedras señalan el sacrificio de aquellos Dúnedain que cayeron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad a finales de septiembre. Cada vez que regreso a Tornhad, me tomo un tiempo para venir aquí y recordar a quienes perdimos.'","Gorwen te mira con tristeza.\
\
'Mis pensamientos no dejan de volver a Meneldir, ${PLAYER}. ¿Habría podido salvarse? Si lo hubiera apartado de la búsqueda del Miedo Gris, si lo hubiera enviado lejos de mi campamento cuando llegó por primera vez...'\
\
Le dices a Gorwen que ni siquiera atar a Meneldir con cuerdas fuertes habría evitado que saliera en busca del gran enemigo de la antigua Cardolan, y ella ríe entre lágrimas.\
\
'Quizá no, ${PLAYER}. Era testarudo, ¿verdad? Pero bueno con sus amigos. Debió de tener amigos en el sur, ¿no? No vivía como un ermitaño, seguro.'\
\
Le dices a Gorwen que cuando lo conociste, había decidido por su cuenta proteger a la gente de Musgovilla, una pequeña aldea en el borde de Ciénaga de los Cisnes. Le hablas de su amistad con el herrero del pueblo, un enano llamado Skardí Doblafilos, y de cómo tú y Meneldir intentaron evitar que los niños de Musgovilla se metieran en problemas... casi siempre sin éxito. Meneldir siempre decía que no se le daban bien los niños, pero por lo que viste, parecían fascinados por él. Gorwen sonríe.\
\
'Me alegra saberlo, ${PLAYER}, y te agradezco estos recuerdos. Recordar puede doler, pero quizá también pueda traer algo de paz.'","Gorwen permanece junto a varios túmulos construidos recientemente fuera de la aldea de Tornhad, recordando a quienes se perdieron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad.","Muchos Montaraces perecieron en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad, y quienes sobrevivieron jamás olvidarán a sus amigos y parientes caídos.","<rgb=#00FF00>Lamenta</rgb> a los caídos en el Vado de Sarn y en Tyrn Gorthad","Habla con Gorwen junto a los túmulos en Tornhad"},
[1032]={"Ratas derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota sierpes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Contra Su Diseño","Derrota ratas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plagas molestas han excavado en los cimientos de la Torre Oscura....","Estás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.","Se pueden encontrar sierpes y ratas por todas las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.","Defeated maggots (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1033]={"After noticing strange and violent behaviour between animals of Blackroot Vale, Sarnir has asked you to investigate further.","The bear corpse you discovered can be found directly east of Alagrant.\
\
You have discovered a mauled bear corpse in the field of Blackroot Vale, and should examine it to determine what brought about its demise.","You have come across a freshly slain bear riddled with enormous bites and gashes","Examine the mauled bear","Sensing their prey is being stolen, maddened bears rush forth","Search for evidence of mauled animals outside Alagrant","DNT -- will not be seen","Against Their Nature","'${PLAYER}, I worry greatly for the vale.\
\
'I know not what drives the beasts to such violence, but as of late, their behaviour has only grown more cruel. Beasts seem to slay each other not for subsistence, but for the sheer violence they can wreak on the valley floor. Even after spending my life as a hunter, it is horrifying to behold. \
\
'The beasts have taken to displaying their kills along the road due east. Perhaps if you can get a better look at one of the fallen, we can gain some insight into what is driving them to such madness.'","You can likely find slain creatures to the east of Alagrant, across the Blackroot.\
\
Sarnir has asked you to investigate the mauled animals that have been appearing near Alagrant.","Talk to Sarnir","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have managed to survive a brutal attack after finding a mauled bear in the vale. You should report what you have found to Sarnir.","'The bears are devouring their own, ${PLAYER}? \
\
'What could drive them to do that? I only have one thought as to what... but I do not wish it to be true.'"},
[1034]={"'¿Has encontrado ya algunas pieles de oso? Será un invierno frío si no podemos conseguir más pronto. Los osos suelen pescar al sur de Sûri-kylä al otro lado de la bahía de hielo. Allí deberías poder darles caza.'","'Las pieles de oso han sido muy útiles. Gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","'Es extraño ver a tantos extranjeros tan al norte. Sûri-kylä no ha visto nada igual desde los tiempos antiguos. Al menos, eso es lo que dicen las antiguas historias. Han pasado por aquí muchos comerciantes y aún así los suministros siguen escaseando. Ha hecho frío durante mucho tiempo y muchos han notado un cambio en el viento. Los ancianos temen que no veamos el fin de este crudo periodo durante mucho tiempo.\
\
'Uno de los suministros que me hace mucha falta son las pieles de oso. Los usamos para nuestras ropas y rituales, pero los cazadores están teniendo grandes dificultades para conseguirlas.\
\
'Los osos suelen merodear por la bahía en busca de pescado, al sur de Sûri-kylä. Si pudieras ir hasta allí y conseguirme algunas pieles, encontraré un modo de recompensarte por tus servicios.'","'¿Has encontrado ya algunas pieles de oso?'","Contra el frío","Los osos pueden encontrarse al sur de Sûri-kylä, al otro lado de la bahía de hielo.\
\
Nôra te ha pedido que ayudes a abastecer al pueblo de Sûri-kylä para el invierno consiguiendo pieles de oso.","'¡Has vuelto con las pieles de oso! Nuestros cazadores y tramperos estarán agradecidos por tu trabajo.'","Habla con Nôra","Un viento terrible sopla desde Angmar, trayendo con él un invierno glacial.","Nôra está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Deberías llevar las pieles que has conseguido a Nôra.","Pieles de oso conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue pieles de oso (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1035]={"Orcs can be found at the silo to the east of Snowbourn.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defend the eastern silo.","Talk to a croft-guard to the east of Snowbourn","Defeated Orcs at the northern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My men in the field have reported that Orcs have taken to assaulting the grain-silos around Snowbourn.\
\
'They cannot be allowed to succeed. Our people struggle enough... to lose our stores would push us beyond breaking.\
\
'Find my three men in the field and aid them at the silos. They can hold them for now, but I know not how long they can hold against these new invaders.'","Defeated Orcs at the eastern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcs can be found at the silo to the north of Snowbourn.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defeat the Orcs attacking the northern silo.","Defeat Orcs at the northern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to a croft-guard to the south-east of Snowbourn","Defeat Orcs at the south-eastern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orcs at the eastern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The second croft-guard can be found near the silo directly east of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","Orcs can be found fighting with Rohirrim near the south-eastern silo.\
\
You should help the croft-guard defend the south-eastern silo against the Orcs.","Talk to Ecgar","Against the Grain","'They come! At the ready!'","Ecgar can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
You should return to Ecgar and let him know that you have done as he asked.","Defeated Orcs at the south-eastern silo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have come just in time... the Orcs are upon us! Quickly, defend the silo!'","'We have almost broken them, but yet more attack! Fight them back!'","The first Croft-guard can be found near the silo to the north of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","'I am sure the Orcs will continue to throw themselves upon our blades, but for your part, you have done us a great service.\
\
'Snowbourn will stand strong for as long as we are able....'","The last croft-guard can be found at the silo to the south-east of Snowbourn.\
\
Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.","Ecgar has heard reports of vicious Orc-assaults being made on the grain-silos near Snowbourn. Food is already scarce, and they cannot afford to lose these supplies.","Talk to a Croft-guard to the north of Snowbourn"},
[1036]={"'Entonces, ${PLAYER}, ¿ya has regresado? Parece que los huargos siguen organizados de algún modo, y seguramente son aliados de los trasgos. Ojalá hubiera alguna manera de romper esa vil alianza.'","'Glorwen había sido enviada a explorar la fuerza de las manadas de huargos en las Montañas Nubladas, especialmente de aquellos que merodean por el Paso Alto, cerca de las puertas de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. No ha regresado, así que debemos continuar su misión.\
\
'Las ruinas al este estuvieron habitadas en tiempos por gigantes caprichosos, pero se dice que llegaron a las manos con los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, y la mayoría se desplazó hacia el sur y el este, incapaces de perseguir a los despiadados trasgos en su reino subterráneo. Ahora esas ruinas parecen haberse convertido en el cubil de una gran manada de huargos, que probablemente están aliados con los trasgos.\
\
'Ponlos a prueba, si quieres, y observa si luchan o huyen: si luchan incluso ante pérdidas, es muy probable que estén bajo un líder de manada fuerte y sigan fieles a los trasgos.'","Huargos de la tempestad derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nogmeldir está en Vindurhal, al oeste de las ruinas de los gigantes.\
\
Debes regresar con Nogmeldir y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre los huargos de tempestad.","Contra la Manada","'Derrota a los huargos, ${PLAYER}, y quizá aprendamos algo del destino de Glorwen.'","La exploradora elfa Glorwen, amiga de Nogmeldir, desapareció mientras cazaba cerca de las ruinas de los gigantes.","Los huargos ocupan las ruinas de los gigantes en la parte noreste del Paso Alto.\
\
Nogmeldir te ha pedido que combatas a los huargos para poner a prueba su fuerza y su número.","Derrota huargos de la tempestad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1037]={"Set fires in Cirith Ungol to repel Shelob's brood (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Against the Shadow","You have set many fires within Cirith Ungol.","Ruined scraps of wood and wreckage can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to set fires in Cirith Ungol to repel the spiders of Shelob's brood.","'As with her many children in Mirkwood, those of Shelob's brood are fearful of the light. There is little light to be found in Lhingris, but... the glow of flames might fend them off for a time.\
\
'See if you can find any loose wood or wreckage within Cirith Ungol, and set it aflame. It will not repel them for long, but perhaps it shall be enough.'","You have set many fires within Cirith Ungol, and the light of the flames has worked to repel Shelob's brood for the moment.","Completado","Hoping to keep the spiders of Shelob's brood from overtaking the Tower of Cirith Ungol, Legolas has asked you to light bright fires within the walls of the fortress."},
[1038]={"Talk to Gelbes","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Speak with her to call a ranger to the Ettenmoors.\
\
The Rangers will assist in retaking Lugazag, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they come to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead.","'What say you? Will you take up the duties of a Ranger to further assist the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors?'","Against the Stone-foe","Talk to Gelbes at Glân Vraig","'Your duty is done, and we have done much to further solidify the strength of the Free Peoples here in the Ettenmoors. You have our thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly, while you patrolled Eriador in his stead. You should now return to Gelbes.","'Take heart! The battle here is ours, and though the foe has breached the walls of Lugazag, we may yet hold back their tide. Listen well, for I have an offer that you must consider strongly, ${RACE}.\
\
'You are a proven warrior, a hero amongst the Free Peoples, and we ask this only of those who are willing. Lainedhel asked for assistance from the Rangers, and we have come to offer our aid. We have duties that need looking after elsewhere in Eriador, and if you are willing to stand there in our stead, we will remain here to fight the foes from the North.\
\
'Think on this and speak to me when you have an answer to my request. I will wait here, friend.'","Rangers have come to the Ettenmoors to stand against the trolls sent from Angmar. They seek assistance with their patrols from the heroes of the Free Peoples."},
[1041]={"Agarnaith Skip","'Off you go! Say hi to Viznak for me!'","Completion of this quest will allow you access to the Seregost endgame area for testing.","Talk to Lansu","'So, you want to get to Seregost? I suppose I can help with that.'\
\
Completing this quest will unlock access to the Bloody Watchers in Agarnaith and the Seregost level 115 area."},
[1042]={"'Hemos lanzado muchas ofensivas para conseguir el control de Tirband, la plaza bajo la gran torre de vigilancia del nivel más alto de la ciudad, pero Agarochir siempre nos repele.\
\
'Es uno de los Númenóreanos negros de Amarthiel, y es un hechicero temible. Si queremos tener el control de Tirband, Agarochir debe ser derrotado.\
\
Si tus aliados y tú podéis terminar con Agarochir, nuestra suerte podría cambiar a mejor; ¡la importancia estratégica de Tirband no puede ser subestimada!'","Agarochir, guardián de Tirband","Eirieniel está en Echad Garthadir.\
\
Has derrotado a Agarochir, uno de los Númenóreanos negros tenientes de Amarthiel, y debes llevarle la noticia de tu victoria a Eirieniel.","'¿Agarochir ha muerto? ¡No puedo creer nuestra buena suerte, ${PLAYER}! Ya has hecho mucho por los Dúnedain, ¡pero esto me llena realmente de asombro!'","'Agarochir es un poderoso hechicero y no debe ser subestimado, ${PLAYER}. No será tarea fácil tomar el control de Tirband, la plaza en la base de la gran torre de vigilancia en el nivel más alto de la ciudad.'","Eirieniel te ha hablado de Agarochir, el Númenóreano negro que dirige a los Angmarim que controlan la corte de Tirband.","Agarochir se encuentra en la plaza de Tirband en la base de la gran torre de vigilancia, en el nivel más alto de la ciudad.\
\
Eirieniel te ha pedido que derrotes a Agarochir, uno de los Númenóreanos negros tenientes de Amarthiel, para que los Montaraces puedan tomar la plaza de Tirband."},
[1043]={"Agelwyn has decided upon her next course of action, and has asked for help in determining the best path for the refugees' escape towards Helm's Deep.","'To the river, then! I mourn for our lands, and for the people who met their doom upon roads that should be safe for travel.\
\
'I only pray that we do not share their fate....'","Scout the road to the east","Return to Agelwyn with your report","There are bodies on the road ahead...this way does not seem safe at all","The east road should be scouted by heading east and then south from the refugees' camp. The west road should be scouted by heading west through the woods. The river should be scouted by heading directly south-east.\
\
Agelwyn has asked you to scout possible routes towards Helm's Deep: the road to the west, the road to the east, and the along the river banks.","Scout towards the road to the west","'Now that I know we are going to Helm's Deep, I would have your counsel, ${PLAYER}. Which way should we go? Is it safe to pass Marton? There are two roads coming from the north on either side of the town, but I would not usher my people down them if they are not safe. Maybe investigate the river, as well.\
\
'Will you scout some possible routes for us to take? Please hurry -- I wish to begin our journey as soon as possible.'","Agelwyn's First Command","Agelwyn can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton.\
\
You should return to Agelwyn.","The river does not seem to be overrun by the enemy...yet.","Loud noises and felled trees everywhere indicate that this way does not seem safe","Scout the river to the south-east"},
[1044]={"Habla con Arvedui","Agoroth, el Narrowdelve","Complete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter Agoroth, the Narrowdelve.","Talk to Lothrandir","'Welcome back, ${PLAYER}. The lightness of your steps informs me of your success! Please, tell me everything that has happened.'\
\
You tell Elrond of everything that transpired: your promise to the Lossoth in exchange for the key, the realization that the Helcessar was contained in Agoroth, the Sardirath bound for thousands of years by oath, the battles with the Angmarim and Gauredain, the vision of the moment of Arvedui's death, the Helcessar's destruction, and finally, the releasing of the Sardirath.\
\
'Astonishing, and a tale worth recording. While I am saddened to hear of the destruction of an artifact from Númenor, it is perhaps for the best. Many of the Vandassari have already fallen into the hands of the Enemy over the years, leading to calamity. The Helcessar would no doubt have turned the tide of war in favour of Angmar. I am, however, heartened to learn that Arvedui feels he will be able to move on upon his heir's coronation. I know you will do all in your power to help Aragorn reach that goal, as will I.\
\
'You must be rewarded for all your efforts. This tabard was recovered from Annúminas along with the log that set you on this adventure. For your service to the fallen kingdom of Arnor, you have earned it.'","The time has come to enter Agoroth. You must reach the Helcessar before the Angmarim!","Habla con Elrond","Complete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty","The Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed.\
\
You should speak to Lothrandir. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.","'${PLAYER}, we must speak. I feel my connection to this world fading, but I cannot quite move on yet.\
\
'Glamagol's honest words, and the knowledge that my line continues still have freed me from despair. I could never have imagined that in death I would finally deal a meaningful blow to Angmar.\
\
'My deepest thanks to thee and to Lothrandir. Were it not for thy actions, I would still be haunting the shipwreck of the Thoroval, overcome with despair until the end of days. When thou returnest to Rivendell, offer my salutations to Elrond and Aragorn, but please, do not share with my heir that I can only rest upon his coronation. He carries the weight of the world as it is. I wish him fortune in the many battles to come.\
\
'Farewell for now, ${PLAYER}. I will linger in the shadows, unseen, until the day I may depart.'","The Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed.\
\
You should speak to Arvedui. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.","You have won a great victory against Angmar and freed Arvedui from his fate.\
\
You should return to Elrond in Rivendell and inform him of your success.","'We have done it! The combined power of Arvedui and the Sardirath was enough to destroy the Helcessar for good. We have kept our word to the Lossoth, kept the Witch-king from corrupting the relic, and freed the Sardirath from their oath, allowing them to rest. And it seems they are not the only ones who have achieved some overdue peace.\
\
'Arvedui's spirit seems to have changed from our experiences together, as if a great weight has been lifted from his shoulders. You should speak to him and see if this be so.'","Completed 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve'","'Whenever you are ready, we will enter the Narrowdelve. Not even Arvedui knows what awaits us inside, but we must reach the Oath-stone before the Angmarim. And you must not forget, you promised the Lossoth you would find a way to destroy it so they are no longer bound by its magic.'\
\
Lothrandir crosses his arms and looks down at the ice below. A wry smile appears on his face, barely visible beneath the shadows cast by his hood.\
\
'Elrond did say that Men might remain in the world as shades if they break their sworn promises. If we are not careful, we might share the fate of King Arvedui! Come now, let us face our destinies together!'"},
[1049]={"Collected iron bars","Arrow bundles can be retrieved from the market, iron bars from the miners, wood planks near the farm-house, and food from inside the farm-house.\
\
Herubrand asked you to gather supplies for Brockbridge.","Brockbridge is south and a little east of Woodhurst.\
\
Herubrand has asked you to take the supplies to Brockbridge and support his son Herefara.","Collect supplies for Brockbridge (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Aid for Brockbridge","Collected planks of wood","Collected food stuffs","Collected arrow bundles","'Thank you, ${CLASS}. A capable warrior who also came with supplies! Your arrival is unexpected, but most welcome.'","Bring supplies to Herefara in Brockbridge","'Herefara, my eldest son, departed to aid the defences in Brockbridge, which has been under siege. Should that bridge fall, the Stonedeans will be overrun by Saruman's armies.\
\
'If you wish to aid them, please bring supplies with you. They could use arrow bundles from the market, iron bars from the ore-house, wood planks from near the farm-house, and food from in the farm-house.\
\
'Herefara is a capable leader, but he would benefit from your aid...that of a veteran of battle.'","Woodhurst sends aid to Brockbridge in the form of supplies, but not many men in Woodhurst are willing to fight against their brethren or the vast armies of the White Hand."},
[1050]={"You have come to the freshest waters of the river.","'An odd sort, these Men....\
\
'We have heard they never take prisoners, and yet, here we are.\
\
'Thank you, ${RACE}. This water soothes my ills....'","'You have my thanks. I have no love for these Men, but if bloodshed can be avoided this day, I shall do what I must.'","Travel east to the source of the river flowing through Aelin Veren","'Why even bother, ${RACE}?'","Offer filled water-skins to the Haradrim prisoners (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Maendal can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have offered a water-skin to each of the prisoners and should now speak to Maendal.","'I hope it is enough to soothe their thirst for a time, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I do not wish to offer them more than we can spare our own, but water is plentiful in these lands.\
\
'Let us hope such a gesture gives them pause should they wish to attack us yet.'","Talk to Maendal","The Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien.\
\
You have returned with the filled water-skins and should now offer them to the Haradrim prisoners.","'I did not expect such treatment from these Rangers....'","Filled water-skins in the waters of the river east of Aelin Veren (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${PLAYER}, a few of the Southrons have complained of thirst. I do not doubt it,  but I will not send my Rangers away from their sides. We still know little of their purpose here, and I dare not offer them the chance to slay us while our numbers are thinned.\
\
'Still, I would not deny a prisoner such care, even one as hated as a Man of Harad. To the east of Aelin Veren lies the source of this river, beneath a great waterfall.\
\
'I would ask that you take these water-skins and fill them there. When you return, offer them to the prisoners and let us hope it's enough to calm them for a time.\
\
'If we are so fortunate, perhaps they may be more inclined to tell us of the Enemy's plots in Ithilien.'","Fill water-skins in the waters of the river east of Aelin Veren (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Offered filled water-skins to the Haradrim prisoners (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The Rangers of Ithilien do not often show mercy to their foes, but to hold prisoners demands a certain watchful care.","Aid for the Enemy","The river that flows through Aelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien.\
\
Maendal has asked you to fill water-skins in the eastern waters of the river flowing through Aelin Veren before giving them to the prisoners."},
[1051]={"Speak with people in Harwick who have homes for sale (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","This man asks a hefty price for his home, and appears to have little sympathy for the plight of Langhold's people","'I admire your boldness to come into this city on a mission of charity when all the guards are looking out for you, but I wish only to go about my business, and not give myself any unnecessary trouble.\
\
'I cannot sell you my house; I am sorry. Please leave me be.'","Return to Cíllan in the refugee camp","Cíllan is waiting in the refugee camp outside Harwick to find out if there are any houses available for purchase in Harwick.\
\
You should tell Cíllan everything you found out.","Cíllan makes a grim face as you recount your conversations with the townspeople of Harwick.\
\
'Only one seller that would suit our needs, and he asks for three hundred gold? That is a steep price... and we have so little.\
\
'I must find a way to come into gold. Let me think on this matter, ${PLAYER}. I cannot thank you enough for risking Harding's wrath by venturing back into Harwick on our behalf!'","Someone in Harwick must deal with the acquisition of houses in the city.\
\
You should speak with people in Harwick who may have homes for sale, so that she may begin to move her people out of the refugee camp and into more permanent homes.","Cíllan is at the refugees' camp outside of Harwick.\
\
You should find Cíllan and see how she fares.","'I am loyal to Harding, not to strangers of distant lands! My Reeve, whom I serve with pride, does not want you in Harwick. I am done talking to you.\
\
'I will not report you to the guards this time, since you speak on Cíllan's behalf, but do not let me see you here again.'","This fearful townsperson has no interest in doing business with a wanted trespasser","'Ah, you say you are looking for a house for those refugees from Langhold? It is difficult with a city so full, but my old family manor has been vacant for over a year. It is likely large enough for all of them.\
\
'But alas! It will be hard for me to part with it, seeing as it is so dear to me. With so many tenants, I would be willing to sell it for three hundred gold.\
\
'Now... I hear the guards have been ordered to arrest you on sight, so I would rather not be seen with you. Three hundred is of course my final offer, since I do not wish to be spotted with the trespasser! But do deliver my offer to lovely Cíllan, with my condolences for her loss.'","'No, I cannot risk doing business with you. Unlike you travellers who roam about the lands, I like it here, and do not wish to get ousted from my city by an angry Reeve.'","'I know you are anxious to help the refugees of Langhold, ${PLAYER}. You have helped us enough -- I will not keep you anymore. I will be sure to put in a good word for you with Aldor Harding.\
\
'He is a great man, but not a trusting one. I will not keep you from your friends, though. Be safe, ${PLAYER}, and good luck.'","This townsperson will report you to the guards if she sees you again","This townsperson only looks out for himself","The refugees from Langhold have built a makeshift camp outside of Harwick with the permission of the Reeve, but better housing is clearly needed.","Talk to Cíllan","Aid for the Refugees","'You are so brave to venture here against the wishes of the Reeve on behalf of those poor people from Langhold! It is so terrible, what happened.\
\
'I do have a house for sale, but it is dreadfully small. I left it when I married, for it could not fit more than a single man. I am terribly sorry I could not be of more aid....'","This townsperson wishes he could help, but his home is far too small","'My home is razed, my husband and Thane dead, but... I have my children and the people of Langhold in my care, so there is much to live for. It is enough to fend off my despair.\
\
'There are problems I must solve, but I am not quite sure what to do. We cannot stay in this camp outside Harwick for much longer with meagre supplies and no protection against the dangers of the plains.\
\
'Harwick is a densely populated city, but surely there must be some housing for sale. Will you find out if there is any space for my people, and what we can do to acquire permanent housing quickly?'"},
[1052]={"Habla con Glavroleth en Echad Dúnann","Lengliel teme que los semiorcos de Barad Morlas y Pembar pidan refuerzos desde el este.","'Ve a Echad Dúnann, ${PLAYER}, y advierte a Glavroleth de la amenaza semiorca.'","'Valiente esfuerzo, ${PLAYER}, pero me temo que será en vano. Los semiorcos tienen más efectivos acampados en la Puerta del Cuerno Rojo, y los dunlendinos al servicio de Saruman están acampados no muy lejos al este.\
\
'Te pido que vayas a Echad Dúnann al este, cerca de las puertas de Moria, llamadas las Puertas de Durin, y hables con Glavroleth. Adviértele de la amenaza de los semiorcos... tal vez ella tenga alguna idea sobre ellos.\
\
'Ve sin demora, ${PLAYER}. Me temo que una marea maligna está creciendo.'","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. ¿Vienes con noticias de Lengliel?\
\
'¿Los semiorcos han entrado en las ruinas de Eregion? No es nada nuevo para nosotros, pero Lengliel tiene motivos para estar preocupada. Hay algún mal actuando aquí, contra el cual debemos prepararnos.'","Ayuda desde el Este","Echad Dúnann se encuentra a lo largo de la carretera al sur y al este de Echad Eregion, en Nan Sirannon.\
\
Lengliel te ha pedido que busques a Glavroleth en Echad Dúnann."},
[1053]={"'Greetings, ${RACE}, you fight against the foes of Eriador in these lands, and this is good. There is no doubt within me that your resolve to win this battle is strong.\
\
'Please, hear me out. We are assisting in this battle where we can, and we will continue to do so. I would ask, though, that you support us in our endeavours elsewhere to safe-guard Eriador from the machinations of the North.\
\
'Should you wish to assist us, return to me, and I will arrange for you to take the place of one of my brethren while he patrols the wilds of the Ettenmoors.'","Uirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
You should return to Uirnen and inform him that you have fulfilled your duty.","'Your efforts allowed one of our number to assist the Free Peoples greatly, ${PLAYER}. You are to be thanked for the efforts that you put forth.\
\
'The Rangers of Esteldín are indebted to you. You are truly a hero in the war against the Iron Crown.'","'I expected that you would return, ${PLAYER}. If you are prepared, I will set you to your task and call one of our number to patrol the Ettenmoors in your stead.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This quest begins a special session quest. You will be logged out of your normal character and take on the guise of a player-friendly npc. You will not be able to leave the Ettenmoors as this character and will attain a set of skills unique to this special player character.</rgb>","Uirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The Rangers are attempting to augment the forces fighting in the Ettenmoors, but fear that committing too much to the battle will result in Angmar succeeding elsewhere. The Ranger Uirnen has asked you to speak with him if you wish to assist the Rangers with their duties.","Aid from the Rangers","A scarce few Rangers from Esteldín came east to the Ettenmoors to support Lainedhel's efforts against Angmar's army.","Talk to Uirnen at Glân Vraig","Speak with Uirnen and complete your patrol of the Ettenmoors as a Ranger (Cost: 500 Commendations)"},
[1054]={"'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. I cannot thank you enough for the aid you have given us. I knew in my heart that there was something dark within Ordlac's heart...indeed, he knew not how to love anything but power.\
\
'I have sent word to my father of the events which have transpired here. I doubt not that he will now bless my marriage to Torferth, since he has the favour of Reeve Fríthbert.\
\
'Go with honour, my friend!'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! You have shown more kindness than we need expect from a stranger to the Acres...how can we repay you? Name it, and I will have Torferth grant it!\
\
'Well, I suppose until I come of age, I do not have the authority to do so. I hope he rewarded you well enough for your aid.\
\
'Thank you for your friendship! I will bear the arms you gave me with pride.'","Alongside Thane Torferth of Torsbury, you freed Stoke from Ordlac's control and saved Reeve Fríthild's children from a terrible fate.","'Hail! What brings you into this part of the Mark? It is a dangerous road you travel, but you are welcome to share our fire for a time....'","Talk to Léoflac","'We are in great need of aid! The Mead Hall of Woodhurst was attacked, and we know not the state of things within...the village council will not allow anyone inside.\
\
'Dunlendings and their allies flood into the Stonedeans and threaten our very existence. There are many in Woodhurst who share the blood of both the Riddermark and of Dunland...some side with the White Hand and the Dunlendings, while others choose to remain neutral. Very few remain loyal to Rohan.\
\
'Will you go to Woodhurst and lend your aid?'","Woodhurst lies to the north-west of Stoke, in the Stonedeans.\
\
You should find someone near Woodhurst who might give you some insight into the situation in the Stonedeans.","Talk to Lúfa","Talk to Reeve Fríthbert","Aid the Stonedeans","A herald from the Stonedeans arrived in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with the herald from the Stonedeans.","Lúfa, Edhild, and Reeve Fríthbert are in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
Thane Torferth told you that Lúfa and the children wished to say their farewells to you before you depart.","Thane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Torferth again.","Talk to Torferth","'${PLAYER}...we cannot thank you enough for your aid. If you had not come to us, Ordlac might have usurped the leadership of the Broadacres and left an even bloodier path of destruction than he did.\
\
'The young Reeve has appointed me, as Thane of both Torsbury and now Oserley, his regent to lead in his stead until he is come of age. Lúfa and I shall be wed, and together we will maintain the alliance her father had hoped for.\
\
'Alas, the Dunlendings and their vile allies still threaten the Acres...we must secure the Riding before we can send a muster to Théoden King's aid. Before you leave, I know Lúfa and the children also wish to speak with you.'","'You are such a kind ${CLASS}...must you go so soon? There are enemies everywhere, and we still need your help.\
\
'I suppose Théoden King needs your help too, so you must go. Do not worry for us. I am not scared anymore...I am going to become a shield-maiden, just like my mother.\
\
'The Riddermark will remember Edhild, daughter of Fríthild!'","Find someone near Woodhurst who might have some insight into the Stonedeans' travails","Talk to Edhild","'Once again, I say thanks....\
\
'What is this disturbance at the door?'"},
[1055]={"Nan Dhelu se encuentra al norte de las ruinas de Dol Vaeg.\
\
Cwendreda te ha pedido que estés atento a cualquier tesoro que puedas encontrar en las ruinas de Nan Dehlu. Ella cree que los tumularios que habitan en las ruinas pueden llevarlos consigo.","'Los Eglain siempre han mantenido las distancias con Nan Dhelu. Las ruinas tienen un aire siniestro que es imposible de ignorar. \
\
'Desde que llegué a este lugar, he luchado contra algunas de las criaturas que lo habitan y he descubierto que poseen tesoros que nos serán muy útiles para el comercio. \
\
'Mientras luchas contra estos enemigos, te pediría que recogieras estos objetos para que pudiéramos obtener algo a cambio de la ayuda que nos estás brindando.'","'Estoy seguro de que los seres que habitan en las ruinas de Nan Dhelu poseen tesoros raros y valiosos. Si pudieras buscar entre sus restos para encontrarlos mientras luchas en esas ruinas, los Egalin te estarían muy agradecidos.'","Un poco de ayuda","Recoge valiosos tesoros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las ruinas de Nan Dhelu siempre han despertado malos presentimientos en los Eglain, pero la llegada o aparición de los Muertos desde el interior de las ruinas les ha infundido aún más temor. Una valiente guerrera, Cwendreda, fue enviada para vigilar y recabar información sobre las ruinas, y ahora sus tareas recaen sobre ti, mientras el terror comienza a crecer desde el interior de aquellos salones que en su día fueron majestuosos.","Tesoros valiosos recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega los tesoros a Cwendreda en Dol Vaeg","'Estos objetos son muy valiosos. Si conseguimos mantenerlos intactos, podremos intercambiarlos por una buena cantidad de mercancías con los comerciantes de Bree.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[1056]={"Reach the Ashâgir hideout in the cliffs","Aiding Ashâgir","You found the refugees who remained in Ashâgir. Ask one of them if the are in need of help.","Gûzinir has asked you to go to Ashâgir and see if there are any refugees remaining there as they may be in need of help.","'Hello ${CLASS}, what brings you here?'\
\
You explain to them that you were sent by Gûzinir.\
\
'I see. We remained because we know what to expect here and wanted to rebuild. We did not wish to risk new dangers elsewhere. Though I am glad to hear that they are well.'","'Hello stranger, you must be the ${CLASS} of which Galâmka spoke.\
\
'I am Gûzinir, and if you are willing, I have a request for you. If you find yourself near Ashâgir to the west, could I ask of you to search around the hideout there to see if anyone remains? I fled when the Orcs arrived and found myself here, but my friends may still be there and may be in need of your help.'","Reached the Ashâgir hideout","Speak with a nearby Ashâgir refugee","Gûzinir asked you to go to Ashâgir and see if there is anyone there in need of help."},
[1057]={"You have helped the inhabitants of Kafagur.\
\
You should return to Zagdúr in Kafagur and talk to her.","According to Zagdúr, a Man was sighted outside of Kafagur.\
\
You should talk to the guard Grúshul for more information.","'Shúkurz's friendship with you means something to me, but I require some more convincing.\
\
'Should you wish to stay in Kafagur, then help my people. Prove to me that you are someone worth trusting.\
\
'If not, then heed my warning: leave us be.'","Aiding Kafagur","Talk to Grúshul","Complete quests in Jeb Khâtel (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You have proven that you are worthy of my trust, ${CLASS}. Now I would call upon you to aid us.\
\
'The guards have sighted a strange Man outside Kafagur -- perhaps the outlander you spoke of before. Shúkurz left in hopes of talking to the man peacefully, but he has not returned.\
\
'Grúshul will have more information.'","'Here to help your friend?\
\
'We saw the Man sneaking around near the trees, but he fled after Shúkurz tried to approach. Then the fool ignored my protests and ran after him!'","Completed quests in Jeb Khâtel (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Zagdúr will need to be convinced that you mean no harm to the people of Kafagur.","Talk to Zagdúr in Kafagur","You should complete quests in Jeb Khâtel to win the Orcs' trust."},
[1058]={"Talfryn te pidió ayudar a algunas personas clave dentro y alrededor de Lhan Garan.\
\
Ayuda a Eluna, Madog y Undeg.","Completa 'Aprendiendo a Pescar en Lhan Garan'","Completa 'Introducción a la Artesanía'","'Nuestro hogar de Lhan Garan fue asentado recientemente. Dejamos Brundir, o Tierras Brunas como tú lo conocerías, hace apenas unos meses, y tuvimos que dejar mucho atrás al partir. Las comunidades cercanas de Musgovilla y las aldeas hobbit han sido muy generosas con nosotros, por lo cual estoy agradecido, pero aún hay más por hacer si queremos recibir el invierno de forma segura.\
\
'Busca a Madog y Teilo Gwyniad pescando junto al agua. Podrían usar tu ayuda para atrapar pescado que pueda ser salado y ahumado para el invierno.\
\
'Busca a Undeg. Ella coordina a nuestros artesanos y puede ayudarte a tomar una profesión artesanal, como herrería de armas o cocina. Dirígete al noroeste por el sendero junto al agua. Estará con otros artesanos y el horno comunitario.\
\
'Eluna aquí está entrenando a muchos de nuestros nuevos exploradores, y por mucho que lo niegue, podría usar una mano amiga, como todos de vez en cuando.'","Ayudando a Lhan Garan","Talfryn te habló de varias personas que necesitan ayuda en Lhan Garan.","Completa 'Tratar con Cuencasangre'"},
[1059]={"Complete quests in aiding Minas Tirith after the battle (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aiding Minas Tirith","There is much to do to aid the people in Minas Tirith after the Battle of the Pelennor Fields.","'There is much to be done in Minas Tirith as we pick up the pieces. Though this was a victory, it was only nearly won.\
\
'Many need help within the city walls. Much of the first tier has been bombarded by the Enemy and the Houses of Healing are over capacity as they treat the injured and dying. Can I count on you to assist those in need?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will fail any Aiding Minas Tirith quests not yet completed for the day.</rgb>","People who need aid after the battle may be found either in the First Circle of the city or in the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle.\
\
You have been asked to aid the people of Minas Tirith as they recover from the Battle of the Pelennor Fields.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will fail any Aiding Minas Tirith quests not yet completed for the day.</rgb>"},
[1060]={"Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân","Speak with Sênjar in Sormedân","'We do not know you, but in Sormedân we judge everyone by their actions rather than their words, outsiders and Kighâni alike.\
\
'Sormedân is not free from its share of troubles. Sênjar, Khaljûn, and Lurâkha have each come to me recently, beset with problems.\
\
'Speak with these villagers. Assist them with their troubles, and I may have further information to aid you.'","'Jurmêna sent you to do the rounds, did she? I do have something I've been complaining to her about, come to think of it.\
\
'I cannot sleep. A terrible racket keeps puncturing my restless dreams.'","Speak with Khaljûn in Sormedân","Aiding Sormedân","Return to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân and let her know you have spoken with each of the villagers.","There are many things to do in the farming village of Sormedân. Elder Jurmêna has requested you speak with some of the local peoples and help them to prove that you are a friend to the village.","'Yes. There is a way you can help. It is the bees. They have gone mad, driving me and my son from their hives.'","'You want to help? My cattle are ailing, and my list of chores long. I will take whatever aid you are willing to give, outsider.'","'You have spoken with each of them? That is welcome news indeed.\
\
'See that the villagers' needs are met, and I will tell you what I know of Khâbakh's whereabouts.'","Speak with Lurâkha in Sormedân","Elder Jurmêna has requested you speak with Sênjar, Khaljûn, and Lurâkha about their daily troubles and assist them where you are able."},
[1061]={"¡Ayuda a los Fronteros con una donación!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión consumirá cincuenta fichas de Frontero.</rgb>","Lleva cincuenta fichas a Meg Ganapié en Cavada Grande","'Por favor, vuelve cuando tengas suficientes fichas de Frontero. Solo aceptamos donación de una cantidad concreta. ¡Muchas gracias por la ayuda!","'${PLAYER}, ¿tienes fichas de Frontero para donar? Una pequeña cantidad nos ayudaría mucho.\
\
'Cada ficha de Frontero que dones ayudará a nuestra causa. Si conseguimos suficientes, ¡se os ofrecerán a tus compañeros y a ti grandes recompensas!'","¡Los Fronteros de la Comarca quieren reforzar las fronteras! Dona todas las fichas de Frontero que encuentres para apoyar su causa.","'¡Gracias, ${PLAYER}! Hacen falta muchas gotas para llenar un cubo, ¡pero cada una de ellas cuenta! Tu ayuda salvará incontables vidas. ¡Vuelve cuando tengas más para donar!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión consumirá cincuenta fichas de Frontero.</rgb>","Una ayuda para la Recompensa"},
[1062]={"Has recogido leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the firewood and berries to Enkárvo","Enkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale.\
\
You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.","The camps of the Easterling refugees are east and across the river from Dale.\
\
You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.","Bayas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Easterling refugee encampments need more food and firewood than they can gather.","Aiding the Dispossessed: Feeding the Cold","Recoge leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'It is challenging enough to manage the needs of Dale, but I continue to hear reports of failing fires and food-stores among the refugees of Rhûn.\
\
'They have grown fond of the berries that grow nearby, and there is plenty of wood to be harvested for a warm fire. I would ask that you assist them in their efforts to gather both.\
\
'Aid them in collecting as much as you are able, and perhaps they shall sleep free of worry for a night.'","recoge bayas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done so much for us. Your help and humility are beyond reckoning, ${PLAYER}!'"},
[1063]={"'I have heard troubling reports that the refugees of Rhûn are beset by wolves. I will not see the dispossessed left to die, especially through the inaction of leadership.\
\
'Travel out to their encampment and cull the wolves that harry them. Let them know that they are safe in our lands.'","You should speak to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale.","You should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.","Talk to Komúsi","Lobos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I am glad the Queen Regent of Dale has not forgotten us or our plight. The wolves will fall back into the deep trees and not bother us, at least for a spell.\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'","Wolves still attack the Easterling refugees when they stray from their camps.","Aiding the Dispossessed: Wolves In Waiting","Derrotar lobos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1065]={"Thrâng derrotado","Thrâng se encuentra dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Tortrygg te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Thrâng, líder de los Ghâshfra en la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.","'Derrota a Thrâng y habrás ayudado enormemente a los Eldgangs.'","'¡Hola, pequeño ser! Quizás aceptarás ayudarnos con nuestros problemas aquí. Los Ghâshfra, los Orcos de fuego del mundo de la superficie, han venido a Norbar y nos hacen la guerra. Quizás nos ayudarás a expulsarlos?\
\
'El nombre de su jefe es Thrâng. Si es asesinado, los Ghâshfra pueden aprender a no molestar a los Eldgangs. Asmólf buscó a Thrâng, pero en su lugar fue enviado a la mina de los intrusos por Eimyr a petición del que todo lo ve.\
\
'¿Quizás harías esto por nosotros? Thrâng se puede encontrar dentro de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu. Si lo derrotas, tu ayuda no será olvidada.'","Iorelen se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen, sobre la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Debes llevar tu informe de la derrota de Thrâng a Iorelen y aprender cómo debes proceder.","Ayudando a los Eldgangs","'¿Orcos de fuego han invadido la Falla? Debemos ser cautelosos y aprender más sobre la situación en Nûrz Ghâshu.'","'¿Has derrotado a Thrâng? Eres muy valiente entre tu gente. Tortrygg no te olvidará.'\
\
Tortrygg parece no tener mucho más que decir. Puede que Glathlírel tenga más información sobre cómo deberías proceder.","'Los Ghâshfra son una raza de Orcos muy peligrosa. Debemos proceder con cautela.'","La ciudad de gigantes de fuego de Norbar ha sido invadida por Orcos de fuego de Angmar.","Derrota a Thrâng"},
[1066]={"Derrota orcos en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Una vez más demostraste ser gran enemigo de los orcos, ${PLAYER}. Te avisaré cuando volvamos a necesitar tu fuerza y tu habilidad.'","'Los orcos siguen siendo una amenaza para los viajeros en el camino que lleva de aquí a Moria. Derrota a los orcos y prende fuego a las barricadas que han erigido frente a sus campamentos en Nanduhirion, hacia el noroeste.'","Ayudando a los Elfos I","Orcos derrotados en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Prende fuego a las barricadas orcas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hadroneth está en Talan Haldir, a orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has continuado tus esfuerzos contra los orcos invasores de Nanduhirion, matando a muchos de ellos e incendiando las barricadas que han levantado a lo largo del camino.","Barricadas orcas incendiadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos en favor de los Elfos de Lothlórien, Hadroneth te ha pedido continuar tu campaña contra los orcos que han invadido Nanduhirion.","Los orcos se encuentran al noroeste de Talan Haldir, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion hacia Moria. Han levantado barricadas frente a sus campamentos a lo largo de la ruta: Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul.\
\
Hadroneth te ha pedido que derrotes orcos en Nanduhirion y que incendies las barricadas que construyen frente a sus campamentos a lo largo del camino.","'Los orcos aún no han abandonado Nanduhirion, ${PLAYER}; parece que todavía tienen planes para Lothlórien.\
\
'Ya nos has ayudado antes, y si continúas haciéndolo no lo olvidaremos. Tampoco lo olvidarán los orcos, si sigues hostigando sus siniestros propósitos de esta manera.\
\
'Viaja al noroeste hasta los campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion. Mata a los orcos allí y prende fuego a cualquier barricada que hayan levantado de nuevo. No cesaremos jamás en nuestro empeño de empujar a los orcos de vuelta bajo las montañas y proteger las fronteras de nuestra hermosa tierra.'"},
[1067]={"Recoge armas orcas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las armas orcas a Maethoron","'Los orcos siguen poniendo en peligro a los viajeros en el camino que cruza Nanduhirion, ${PLAYER}. ¡Parece que el trabajo contra sus maldades nunca acaba!\
\
'Conoces bien sus campamentos ahora: Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh y Athmadhul. Regresa a esos asquerosos campamentos al noroeste de aquí, a lo largo del camino que atraviesa Nanduhirion, y roba más de sus armas de los armeros que allí guardan. Un orco sin hoja es un orco del que tenemos poco que temer.\
\
'Mata también a los orcos emboscadores que merodean por el camino entre aquí y Moria. No se les puede permitir amenazar ni siquiera a los pocos viajeros que pasan por esta ruta.'","Maethoron está en Talan Haldir, cerca de las orillas del Nimrodel, al sureste de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has robado armas de los campamentos orcos de Nanduhirion y has derrotado a más orcos emboscadores a lo largo del camino; ahora debes regresar con Maethoron para informarle de tu éxito.","Derrota orcos emboscadores en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los campamentos orcos se encuentran a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion, al noroeste de Talan Haldir. Los orcos emboscadores también patrullan este camino y pueden hallarse en las afueras de esos campamentos.\
\
Maethoron te ha pedido continuar tus esfuerzos contra los orcos de Moria que han invadido Nanduhirion: derrotar a sus emboscadores a lo largo del camino y robar armas de sus campamentos.","Armas orcas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ayudando a los Elfos II","'Una vez más has demostrado tu gran valentía, ${PLAYER}. Te avisaré cuando necesitemos de nuevo tu ayuda; con tantos orcos tan cerca de Lothlórien, me temo que no pasará mucho tiempo.'","Orcos emboscadores derrotados en Nanduhirion (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos en favor de los Elfos de Lothlórien, Maethoron te ha pedido continuar tu campaña contra los orcos que han invadido Nanduhirion.","'Regresa a Nanduhirion, hacia el noroeste, y derrota a los orcos emboscadores a lo largo del camino. Busca también los campamentos orcos entre aquí y Moria, y roba las armas que encuentres. Los Elfos de Lothlórien no olvidarán tus esfuerzos.'","'¿Has tenido éxito contra los orcos emboscadores a lo largo del camino? ¿Dónde están las armas que te pedí? No te demores... los orcos se vuelven letales cuando se les deja actuar a sus anchas por demasiado tiempo.'"},
[1068]={"Meredhrandir está en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento justo fuera de la entrada oriental de Moria, muy al noroeste de Echad Andestel. Celegúien te dijo que siguieras la carretera hacia el oeste y luego al norte hasta llegar a Mekhem-bizru, y que evitaras a los orcos que merodean en Nanduhirion mientras transportas las flechas hacia Meredhrandir.\
\
Se te ha pedido llevar un lote de flechas a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru.","¡Has entregado las flechas a Meredhrandir con éxito!","Celegúien está en Echad Andestel, el campamento junto a las orillas del Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Has recuperado flechas de los cadáveres de orcos a lo largo del borde del Bosque de Oro, y ahora debes regresar con Celegúien.","Animada por tus esfuerzos en nombre de los Elfos, Celegúien desea que continúes la labor que iniciaste contra los orcos.","'Aún no me has traído suficientes flechas, ${PLAYER}.'","Toma un lote de flechas junto a Celegúien","'¿Otra entrega de flechas, ${PLAYER}? ¡Perfecto! Al traerme esto, has sellado el destino de más orcos de Moria.\
\
'Los Elfos de Lórien no olvidarán tus continuos esfuerzos en nuestro nombre.'","'¿Has regresado con más flechas, ${PLAYER}? ¡Muy bien! He preparado un lote de flechas para que lo lleves a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru, como antes.\
\
'Tómalas de las cajas junto a mí, y llévalas hacia el oeste y luego al norte, por la carretera a través de Nanduhirion, hasta Meredhrandir en el campamento justo fuera de la Puerta Este de Moria.\
\
'¡Evita el agua profunda o no podrás sostener las flechas por mucho tiempo!'","Meredhrandir está en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento junto a la Puerta Este de Moria.\
\
Has llevado las flechas a Meredhrandir y ahora debes hablar con él sobre el viaje.","Recupera flechas de cadáveres de orcos cerca de la frontera de Lórien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ayudando a los Elfos III","Flechas recuperadas de cadáveres de orcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las flechas élficas a Celegúien","'Al este de aquí, a lo largo de la frontera norte y sur de Lórien, encontrarás orcos muertos por los Galadhrim. Recupera flechas de sus cuerpos, como has hecho antes, y tráemelas.'","Los cadáveres de orcos abatidos por los Galadhrim ocultos a lo largo de la frontera de Lothlórien, al este de Echad Andestel, pueden ser la fuente de más flechas que Celegúien desea recuperar. Ella te advirtió que no te acerques demasiado a la frontera, pues los Galadhrim dispararán si no te reconocen.\
\
Celegúien espera que recojas flechas de los cadáveres de orcos a lo largo del borde de Lórien.","'Toma un lote de flechas de la caja junto a mí y llévalas a Meredhrandir en Mekhem-bizru, el campamento justo fuera de la Puerta Este de Moria. Sigue la carretera hacia el noroeste a través de Nanduhirion y evita a los orcos que merodean mientras transportas las flechas.'","'Los orcos siguen en Nanduhirion, ${PLAYER}, y mientras permanezcan allí, los Galadhrim necesitarán flechas para oponérseles.\
\
'Regresa a la frontera del Bosque de Oro, al este de aquí, y busca más orcos muertos por las flechas de los arqueros elfos. Recupera las flechas de sus cadáveres, como ya has hecho antes, y tráemelas.\
\
'¡Pero no te acerques demasiado a la frontera! Si los Galadhrim ocultos no te reconocen, podrían desperdiciar algunas de sus flechas contigo, ¡y tendría que enviar a otros aventureros a recuperarlas de tu infortunado cuerpo! No es así como debería terminar tu historia.'"},
[1069]={"Hay campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion, al oeste y norte de Echad Andestel.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido quemar la inmundicia orca en una hoguera dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion.","'Hay campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino que cruza Nanduhirion, hacia el oeste. Quema la inmundicia orca en la hoguera de uno de esos campamentos, ${PLAYER}, y demuestra a los orcos una vez más que ninguna mancha sobre esta tierra quedará sin castigo por parte de los Elfos de Lórien.'","Ayudando a los Elfos IV","'¿Aún no has recogido la inmundicia orca del Nimrodel?'","Inmundicia orca recogida en las riberas del Nimrodel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge la inmundicia orca de las riberas del Nimrodel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Satisfecho con tus esfuerzos contra los orcos, Dindirith desea que sigas prestando ayuda a los Elfos de Lothlórien.","Puede encontrarse inmundicia orca a lo largo de las riberas norte y sur del río Nimrodel, al oeste de la frontera de Lórien.\
\
Dindirith te ha pedido limpiar una vez más las riberas del Nimrodel de la suciedad que las mancilla.","'Gracias de nuevo por mantener el Nimrodel libre de la suciedad de los orcos. Llévala ahora a una hoguera dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos a lo largo del camino por Nanduhirion, hacia el oeste y norte de aquí, y deshazte de ella en un fuego orco, como ya hiciste antes.'","Dindirith está en Echad Andestel, fuera de la frontera de Lórien y al este de Nanduhirion.\
\
Has eliminado una vez más la inmundicia orca y debes informar a Dindirith.","Quema la inmundicia orca en una hoguera dentro de uno de los campamentos orcos en Nanduhirion","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Los orcos aprenderán que ninguna mancha en nuestra tierra quedará sin castigo. Te avisaré cuando vuelva a necesitar tu ayuda.'","Dindirith está en Echad Andestel, al norte del camino que conduce a Lórien y al oeste de la frontera.\
\
Has recogido la inmundicia orca de las riberas del Nimrodel y debes llevarla ahora a Dindirith.","'Recorre las riberas norte y sur del Nimrodel, como hiciste antes, y límpialas de la inmundicia orca, ${PLAYER}.'","Lleva la inmundicia orca a Dindirith","'Más orcos han cruzado el Nimrodel, ${PLAYER}, dejando suciedad a su paso.\
\
'If sigues dispuesto a ayudar, te pediré que una vez más recorras las riberas, al norte y al sur, recogiendo la inmundicia de los orcos para que el Nimrodel vuelva a correr limpio.\
\
'Vuelve a mí cuando lo hayas hecho, y devolveremos a los orcos su pestilencia, como ya hicimos antes.'"},
[1070]={"You have finished distributing medical supplies among the Dâr Tabib healers.","The healers of Dâr Tabib await fresh medical supplies.","Chakâr has asked you to deliver medical supplies to healers in and around Dâr Tabib.\
\
Dâr Tabib is located in the south-west area of the Tor-gardens.","'I have some fresh medical supplies that need to be distributed among the healers in and around the building.\
\
'Could you assist me with this task? I would be happy to pay you in advance.'","Deliver medical supplies to healers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Aiding the Healers of Dâr Tabib","Delivered medical supplies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Completado","You have finished distributing medical supplies among the Dâr Tabib healers, and in the process, alleviated some of their stress."},
[1071]={"Groomed horse (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The festival has filled up the city stables of Minas Tirith with horses from all over, and the stable-hands are overwhelmed.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Groom the horses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fed horse (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aiding the Stable-hands","Return to Loborís","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. The horses look much happier already. I can breathe a sigh of relief knowing they are content.\
\
'If you are able, please come back tomorrow. We may need more help then.'","'Pardon me. Do you have time to spare?\
\
'Many have come to witness the celebrations and left their steeds in our care. These weary horses have seen much travel and need people to look after them. With how hectic things have been, we do not have enough stable-hands. There are a few horses around the stable that need grooming, and others that deserve treats for good behaviour. We would appreciate the help -- if you do not mind, of course.\
\
'There are crates at the back of the stables with equipment and apples.'","The horses that require attention can be found around the city stables.\
\
Loborís has asked you to groom or give treats to several of them.","Find a grooming brush from the equipment crate","Collected apples","Found a grooming brush","Collect apples from the apple crate","Feed the horses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Loborís is working near the front doors in the city stables.\
\
She will want to hear that you've taken care of the horses.","Grooming brushes and apples are in crates at the back of the city stables.\
\
You will need both items in order to help Loborís with the horses."},
[1072]={"You have found Cherêka, keeping watch over the road that leads to Jiret-menêsh from the city above. You should talk to her and give her the water Mísikir asked you to deliver.","You have delivered the water to Cherêka, and had a nice chat. You should return to Mísikir, who was near Jiret-menêsh's stable-master.","Find the guard watching over the road","Mísikir has given you a water-skin and asked you to find Cherêka, who watches over the road that all must take to approach the mountain-top. She should be somewhere nearby, looking down upon the road.","'Who is this, then, a friend of Mêshaget? A ${RACE} offering help, no less! Interesting indeed!\
\
'I am Mísikir and see after the safety of all at Jiret-menêsh. I assume you are quite trustworthy, else Mêshaget would not have sent you to me. Aye, there is one simple task for which I could use someone's help. I apologize that it is not very exciting, but still, it must be done!\
\
'An Shêru is as dry as Châmelek Gêta's sense of humour, and standing guard is thirsty work. Please, take this water-skin to Cherêka, who is keeping watch over the road that all must take to approach the mountain. She will be somewhere nearby, looking down upon the road.'","Khagâmi thanked you for getting her safely to Jiret-menêsh. Mêshaget appears to have something to say. You should talk to Mêshaget.","Talk to Mêshaget","Talk to Cherêka and give her the water-skin","You have come to the legendary dwarf-city of Jiret-menêsh, where some of the Temámir have come to the surface after one hundred years of sheltering in the mountain.","'I thank you for your help! A woman came by earlier, asking after your whereabouts. She said she wanted to talk to you, but I am unsure where she went.'","Mísikir tells you that a woman was recently looking for you, but does not know where she went. You should find Khagâmi in Jiret-menêsh.","You spot Cherêka","Talk to Khagâmi","'${PLAYER}, there you are! I wanted to thank you for all you have done. Getting me here safely was no small thing, and rescuing Tâklu was an extraordinary act. I dare say I have never met another like you, so willing to help others. I will make sure Doorward Azagâya knows of your heroism.'\
\
Khagâmi gives you a respectful bow.","'Khagâmi's words speak true, my friend. Your willingness to help people tells much about your noble nature. You are exceptional, indeed!'","'By my mother's beard! You have good timing, my friend. My own water-skin is empty, and I was just thinking of my thirst.\
\
'I must tell you that I have never spoken to a ${RACE} before. You are taller than I expected! Only recently has the Gêta allowed us to come to the surface, and I am a mere forty-seven years of age, so I have only recently seen the open sky for the first time. Its vastness is intimidating, and I have no love for the wind!\
\
'This is a good experience, though. One must be comfortable with being uncomfortable if they wish to travel, or so I am told, and I would like to see the Shoreward Stone one day!\
\
'My thanks for the water, friend, and send the captain my thanks as well.'","Mêshaget needs to speak to the Lord of the city, Châmelek Gêta, and suggested you talk to Mísikir, the captain of the guard.","Talk to Mísikir","Aiding the Temámir","'${PLAYER}, I must report to Châmelek Gêta. She is the Gêta... the Lord of Jiret-menêsh. Please - feel free to explore our community here on the surface. Should you feel restless for something to do, Mísikir is the captain of our guard and would surely have a task to offer you.'"},
[1073]={"'My daughter Cyneberg will need help with the preparations for battle, if you have time to spare for her.\
\
'She is a strong girl, and I trust her to make us ready. You can find her in Scylfig; she will tell you what you can do to aid us.'","Cyneberg is in Scylfig.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg.","These rations will allow the villagers to keep up their strength","Thane Cynegar and his daughter, Cyneberg, need help with preparing Scylfig for an Orc-assault.","Deliver the barrel of arrows to the waggon west of Cyneberg","Introduce yourself to Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter","Cyneberg welcomes you as best she can at this troubled hour","The battle-readying items you gathered can be distributed around Scylfig.\
\
You should bring the preparatory items to various points throughout Scylfig.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}! That was a speedy delivery. The battle is nearly upon us...I can feel it.\
\
'Where is Thrymm? I want to wish him luck before it begins -- not that he needs it!'","Arrows, wood slats, and food rations can be found at the cart near Cyneberg.\
\
You should deliver the battle preparations around town so that the people of Scylfig can brace for the looming Orc attack.","Speak with Cyneberg in the centre of Scylfig","The villagers here can now finish boarding up their homes","'Well met, ${PLAYER}. You came from Thrymm's camp, did you not? He and I are to be wed soon; if you have his loyalty, you have mine as well!\
\
'If you wish to help us, I must unload these supplies that we just pulled from storage. Scylfig has not needed arms such as these in many a year.\
\
'Will you deliver the supplies around town?'","Deliver the food rations to the waggon north of Cyneberg","Cyneberg can be found in Scylfig, unloading battle-supplies from storage.\
\
You should assist Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter.","Deliver the wood slats to the waggon east of Cyneberg","Scylfig's archers will now be ready to fell many of the Orcs that dare to approach","Pick up the wood slats","Aiding the Thane and His Daughter","Pick up the food rations","Pick up the barrel of arrows"},
[1074]={"Legolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Legolas.","Confront the wounded devoted","'Legolas has spoken to me and explained why we must not retrieve the spear of Aiglos from atop the spire it rests upon in Dor Amarth.\
\
'Though it pains me not to remove the sacred weapon of the Elves from Mordor, I must agree with him.\
\
'Aiglos has given hope to those of Elves and others in this company. The spear has become a beacon in Mordor, a banner planted, to show all those that the time of darkness in Mordor is at a close.\
\
'The light of Aiglos will show the way for us and strike fear in those who believe they lay claim to the plains of Gorgoroth.\
\
'Perhaps one day we will be able to construct a monument to Gil-galad and to all Elves who fought valiantly against Sauron, here in Dor Amarth, where Aiglos lies.'","Aiglos","Aiglos can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should bring the corrupted idol you found to Aiglos.","Talk to Hithgol","Hithgol asks for you and Legolas to assess if Aiglos is at all retrievable in its current location.","The idol disintegrates in your hands as you hold it up to the glow of Aiglos","'You spoke to one of these devoted of The Order, yes? Perhaps we should find out why they are pursuing this mighty spear of the Elves.\
\
'We must not let Aiglos fall into their hands. None but Gil-galad would be worthy to hold the spear.\
\
'It is said that Aiglos can be touched by few, for the spear's power is great.'","Find and defeat Rabôkhor","The devoted is overcome with conflicted beliefs","Rabôkhor, high priest of the Order of the Eye, can be found in Dor Amarth.\
\
You should find and defeat Rabôkhor.","Hithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Hithgol.","'${PLAYER}, I am not sure if we should scale the spire either. I have been thinking about it and would like to speak with Hithgol.\
\
'Let us return to him and hear his thoughts on the matter.\
\
'I know, we have come all this way, but you must trust me, as I have trusted you many times.\
\
'Now let us depart.'","Collect a corrupted trinket","Rabôkhor drops an strange idol","Habla con Legolas.","The wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos.\
\
You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.","You confront the devoted member of The Order of The Eye and ask him why they seek the spear.\
\
'You know not the story? Indeed you are a fool, but I shall enlighten thee.\
\
'In Sauron's great trickery, an Elf bearing this mighty spear fell into the Dark Lord's trap. The Elf perished, releasing the spear from his grasp. Many thought the spear lost, but it was not, for the Dark Lord knew of it. When his strength returned, Sauron retrieved the spear and kept it high in his tower as a remembrance to all who dare defy his rule.\
\
'Rabôkhor, the leader of our sect, shall soon scale the spire and hold the spear in his hands.'\
\
You decide you must find this Rabôkhor and show The Order of The Eye that the spear can never be wielded by them.","'It cannot be. You held the sacred idol of our sect up to the spear and now it is gone! Why would Sauron keep such an object of destruction when we could never use it?'\
\
You tell the devoted member of The Order to share what he has seen today.\
\
'No more shall we worship such a horrid object. I feel sickened being near it! If only I had the strength to slay you, ${RACE}!'","Bring the corrupted idol near Aiglos"},
[1075]={"'¿Traes un remedio herbal de Eldo? ¡Rápido, dáselo a Gar! ¡Espero que le ayude!'","'¿Me trajiste las semillas de hinojo? Bien, bien, dámelas y las herviré con el resto.\
\
'Listo. Lleva este remedio a Gar y haz que lo beba. Puede que no le guste mucho, pero asegúrate de que lo tome todo. Debería recuperarse pronto.'","Trae las semillas de hinojo a Eldo Swatmidge","Los niquebriques se encuentran principalmente en el sur de los Pantanos de Moscagua. La granja de Eldo Swatmidge está al oeste de los Pantanos y al este de Entibo.\
\
Longo Daegmund te envió a hablar con Eldo Swatmidge sobre una cura para su perro Gar, pero a Eldo le faltan las semillas de hinojo para preparar el remedio. Eldo te dice que los niquebriques tienen predilección por el hinojo y que quizá puedas encontrar semillas atrapadas en sus pinzas.","Longo Daegmund y su perro Gar están junto al carro de Ferdibrand Tuk, justo al oeste de la plaza del pueblo en Entibo.\
\
Eldo ha preparado un remedio herbal para curar a Gar de la enfermedad que lo aqueja y te ha pedido que se lo des para que lo beba.","Eldo Swatmidge vive al este de Entibo y al norte y este de la granja de la Viuda Froghorn.\
\
Longo Daegmund te ha pedido que hables con Eldo Swatmidge sobre la enfermedad de su perro y averigües si conoce algún remedio que pueda curarlo.","'No deberías perder tiempo aquí. Gar necesita el remedio que preparé para él. Regresa a Entibo y dáselo.'","Gar te mira con tristeza. Parece estar muy enfermo.","El perro de Longo Daegmund, Gar, parece haberse enfermado, y Longo está preocupado por él.","Lleva el remedio herbal de Eldo a Gar","'¿Estás buscando semillas de hinojo para ayudar a Gar? Gracias, ${PLAYER}, ¡pero por favor, date prisa! ¡No soporto ver a mi pobre perro tan decaído!'","'Ese remedio debería hacerlo sentir mucho mejor.\
\
'¡Buen chico, Gar! ¡Eso lo arreglará! Debes haber comido algo que te cayó mal, nada más. Aquí, puedes acompañarlo con agua... ¡eh, espera! ¿Qué es esto?\
\
'Saqué esta agua del pozo del pueblo esta mañana, ¡pero huele raro! ¿Será esto lo que enfermó a Gar?'","'Los niquebriques en los Pantanos de Moscagua suelen tener hinojo atrapado en sus pinzas. Si puedes recuperar algunas semillas, podré preparar un remedio que debería ayudar a Gar.'","'Eldo vive al este de Entibo, casi en el borde de los Pantanos de Moscagua. Toma el camino oriental desde la plaza del pueblo hasta la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, sigue la línea de cercas hacia el norte y luego baja la colina hacia el este hasta la casa de Eldo.\
\
'Si alguien sabrá qué le pasa a Gar, será él. ¡Estoy seguro!'","Sabueso enfermo","'¿Qué? ¿Gar está enfermo? ¡Vino de una de las camadas de mi Wanetta!\
\
'Mis propios perros a veces comen algo que no les sienta bien. Cuando pasa, tengo un remedio herbal que me enseñó mi abuelo y que siempre los mejora. Tengo casi todo lo necesario, pero me faltan semillas de hinojo para terminarlo como corresponde.\
\
'El hinojo crece en los Pantanos de Moscagua, pero es difícil de encontrar porque los niquebriques lo adoran. Puede que sea más fácil encontrar un niquebrique que aún tenga hinojo atrapado en sus pinzas que hallar una planta fresca. Trae las semillas y prepararé el remedio para Gar.'","Gar olfatea el remedio herbal y luego lo bebe poco a poco. Finalmente, termina la mezcla.\
\
Longo te mira expectante.","'¡Eh, tú! ¿Sabes algo sobre perros? Gar se siente mal desde ayer y no quiere probar bocado. Le traje agua fresca del pozo y ¡ni siquiera la mira!\
\
'¿Podrías ayudarme? Eldo Swatmidge sabe bastante sobre animales y quizá tenga idea de qué le pasa a Gar. Vive bastante al este del pueblo, casi en el borde de los Pantanos de Moscagua, y no creo que Gar aguante la caminata. Solo toma el camino al este desde el pueblo hasta la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, luego ve al norte desde allí y baja la colina hacia el este.\
\
'Eldo es un tipo algo raro, pero ama a los perros, así que no puede ser tan malo, ¿verdad? ¡Agradecería cualquier cosa que pueda hacer para ayudar a Gar!'","Longo Daegmund está junto a su perro, Gar, al lado del carro de Ferdibrand Tuk, al oeste de la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Longo espera ansioso para hablar contigo.","Recolecta semillas de hinojo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Semillas de hinojo recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1076]={"Derrota a Aklash","'Ve a la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y derrota a Aklash.'","'La información que recuperaste es invaluable, ${PLAYER}. Gracias a ella, ahora conocemos a muchos de los líderes trasgos atrincherados en la Ciudad de los Trasgos. El maestro Glóin quiere que encuentres y mates a Aklash.\
\
'Las notas de la carta sugieren que Aklash es el líder de los soldados del Gran Trasgo. Es probable que lo encuentres en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo.\
\
'La Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste, y la sala del trono se halla al final de los largos túneles de la ciudad. Encuéntralo, derrótalo y regresa conmigo.'","Aklash está en la sala del trono de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Tralli Buscagemas te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al líder de los soldados del Gran Trasgo dentro de la sala del trono.","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas en el campamento de Glóin","'Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Con la derrota de este soldado, hemos debilitado aún más a los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
'Cuanto más podamos mantener a este enemigo en estado de debilidad, más probabilidades tendremos de impedir que se unan a sus aliados en el oeste.'","Aklash, el líder de los soldados","La información obtenida de las cartas en Lengua Negra que recuperaste llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar a Aklash, el líder de los soldados de élite del Gran Trasgo.","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Entraste en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo y encontraste a Aklash. Tras un combate arduo, lo derrotaste. Ahora debes regresar con Tralli Buscagemas.","Aklash derrotado"},
[1078]={"Léoflad and her people have been massacred along the road to Aldburg, cutting short all hope of safety for the inhabitants of Entwade.","Buried people of Entwade (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Agelman is at your side or can be rallied to your side by sounding your horn.\
\
Agelman has interrupted you, calling you aside before you could finish burying Léoflad. You should speak to him and discover what he wants.","Talk to Agelman","'Stay your hand, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Alas for brave Léoflad, she must have been overwhelmed by their numbers. For both her honour and for Edric, she must be returned to Entwade.\
\
'I will handle this task myself, friend. Edric needs to see her, and he needs time to grieve for the lost, even if he thinks time short.'","'What horror... all of them, the old and young cut down.... They were innocent, ${PLAYER}, innocent and still the Uruks slew them all.'\
\
Agelman clasps his hand to his mouth, his eyes filling with tears.\
\
'I... I cannot bear to see my fellows like this. Entwade may yet stand, but, in truth, it has already fallen... they deserved so much better than this fate.\
\
'I shall not allow the Wargs of the White Hand to strip what remains of their dignity. Come then, let us bury them, and perhaps then they shall find the peace they so hoped for.'","Bury Léoflad","Bury people of Entwade (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The Entwade-slaying can be found in south-eastern Kingstead along the road through the forests of the Eastfold.\
\
Agelman has asked that you help him bury the victims of the White Hand attack to provide them some measure of peace.","Alas for the Fallen","'What are you doing, ${PLAYER}?'","Agelman calls out to you","Léoflad can be found amidst the wreckage along the road to the Eastfold in south-eastern Kingstead.\
\
You have aided Agelman in burying the people of Entwade, and have discovered Léoflad's body amidst the wreckage. You should bury her as well before speaking to Agelman."},
[1079]={"Aldburg Convenes","Thane Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Arcil has invited you to join him for dinner. He and Éothain will attempt to resolve their differences and determine a course of action to deal with the Orcs. You should talk to Arcil when you are prepared to enter the Mead Hall of Aldburg for dinner.","'Let us eat, ${PLAYER}!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This is a solo quest and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Talk to Arcil","'I must admit, Éothain provided a strong case for going after the White Hand Orcs, but I cannot in good conscience approve a course of action that leaves Aldburg defenceless.\
\
'I will leave it in your hands, ${PLAYER}. If you decide that  these new Orcs pose a greater threat, then come and speak with me again. If you decide to help Éothain against the White Hand, I will hold no ill will towards you.'","Thane Arcil has invited you to dinner, where he and Éothain will discuss the Orc-threat and how best to proceed.","Both Arcil and Éothain stated their case about which Orc-tribe poses the greatest threat.\
\
You should speak with Arcil and let him know your thoughts.","'We are about to take supper, and we would be honoured if you would join us. \
\
'Since Éothain and I are in disagreement on the issue of the Orcs, I will afford him the opportunity to speak his side, and I would like for you to be there to help us decide what we should do.'"},
[1081]={"You hear the calm, familiar slosh of ale within these barrels...","Barrel-racks can be found throughout the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Snállar has asked you to knock on various barrels of ale to try to expose the ale-thieves in Erebor.","'Greedy little burrowers, that lot! Well, that ought to teach them not to meddle with our ales....\
\
'And to think I'd considered requesting new barrels made of iron! Bah! It would turn my finest beers to swill!'","After discovering several suspiciously empty barrels of ale, Snállar hopes to uncover the source of the theft.","Talk to Snállar","Ale-thieves","Knock on barrels and drive out the ale-thieves (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","With a sudden crash, an ale-soaked cave-claw breaks out of one of the barrels!","'Have you a moment?\
\
'In just two days, I've lost nearly twelve barrels of ale to thieves. It's always the same! I find the barrel emptied with a great big hole bored into the bottom of it!\
\
'There's treachery afoot here, and I think those dratted cave-claws are to blame again. Always sticking their noses where they don't belong!\
\
'Knock on some of the barrels and give them a fright. That ought to drive them off!'","Snállar can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have driven off several ale-soaked cave-claws in the Hall Under the Mountain and should now return to Snállar."},
[1082]={"Alguien ha publicado una tarea para que se le entreguen porras de metal rotas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Tarea de Algraig: Porra de metal rota","Porras de metal rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Recoge porras de metal rotas (${NUMBER}/10)","Has entregado un número loable de porras de metal rotas.","Se busca: Porras de metal rotas tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Hombres de Enedwaith.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir porras de metal rotas.","Entrega las porras de metal rotas en una caja de recolección"},
[1083]={"Se busca: Orejas preciosas de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith.","Has entregado una valiosa colección de orejas preciosas.","Orejas preciosas recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Entrega las orejas preciosas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas preciosas.","Recoge orejas preciosas (${NUMBER}/10)","Tarea de Algraig: Oreja preciosa","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger las orejas preciosas de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."},
[1084]={"Tarea de Algraig: Piel preciosa","Pieles preciosas recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: Piel preciosa de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith.","Entrega las pieles preciosas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles preciosas.","Has entregado una valiosa colección de pieles preciosas.","Recoge pieles preciosas (${NUMBER}/10)","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles preciosas de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."},
[1085]={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir magníficas vainas de espada.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para entregar magníficas vainas de espada. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las magníficas vainas de espada en una caja de recolección","Recoge magníficas vainas de espada (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: Vainas de espada preciosas tomadas de los enemigos derrotados de los Hombres de Enedwaith.","Has entregado un número respetable de magníficas vainas de espada.","Magníficas vainas de espada recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Tarea de Algraig: Vaina de espada preciosa"},
[1086]={"Entrega las pieles desagradables a una caja de recolección","Tarea de Algraig: Piel desagradable","Se busca: Piel desagradable de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith. Es mejor que no hagas preguntas.","Has entregado un montón de pieles desagradables.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles desagradables.","Recoge piel desagradable (${NUMBER}/10)","Se busca: Piel desagradable de varias bestias que se pueden encontrar en Enedwaith. Las preguntas no serán respondidas.","Pieles desagradables recogidas (${NUMBER}/10)","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger piel desagradable de la fauna local. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa."},
[1087]={"Has recogido una jarra de Sidra añeja de las Estrellas","Todo menos la sidra","¡Regresa con la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas antes de que se acabe el tiempo!","La Posada del Poney Pisador se encuentra en Bree, al este de la Comarca.\
\
La Sidra añeja de las Estrellas debe ser comprada a Mantecona en el Poney Pisador.","Has recogido la Sidra añeja de las Estrellas","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]}! ¿También eres parte de la Liga de las Posadas? ¿Has oído hablar de su desafío? ¿Sí? ¡Genial! Necesitaría un poco de ayuda con eso, si tienes algo de tiempo para dedicar.\
\
'Verás, pensé que había probado todas las cervezas y vinos que se podían encontrar en Eriador. ¡Y tenía razón! Pero me olvidé de las sidras. ¡Fue un error tan tonto! Y lo que es peor, no tengo el dinero para pagar el viaje para conseguir la  \\qSidra Añeja de las Estrellas\\q que necesito.\
\
'Pareces ${PLAYERNAME:un viajero experimentado[m]|una viajera experimentada[f]}. Quizás si pasas por el Poney Pisador en Bree y tienes algo de plata para gastar, podrías comprar un poco de la \\qSidra Añeja de las Estrellas\\q? ¡Te estaría muy agradecido si lo hicieras!'","'¡Oh, maravilloso! ¡Maravilloso! ¡Tienes la sidra! ¡Estoy muy agradecido por tu ayuda en esto! ¡Contaré a todos los demás miembros de la Liga sobre tu generosidad!'","'¡Hola de nuevo! ¿De viaje otra vez? No olvides, si te encuentras en Bree y cerca del Poney Pisador, por favor, tráeme un poco de la \\qSidra Añeja de las Estrellas\\q.'","Lleva la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas a Dedalera Cavada","¡Se acabó el tiempo!","Recoge la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas en el Poney Pisador","Recoge una jarra de Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","'Dirígete a Bree si deseas recoger esa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas.'","'Aquí tengo una lista de solicitudes para ayudar a los miembros de la Liga de las Posadas que se encuentran lejos de casa sin el apoyo de sus hermanos amantes de la cerveza. Parece que extrañan sus bebidas favoritas, ¡o en algunos casos, ni siquiera las han probado!\
\
'Ahora, Dedalera Cavada es un buen ejemplo. Necesita Sidra añeja de las Estrellas para completar el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas; creo que es la única bebida que le queda por probar.\
\
'Si deseas llevarle un poco, se puede comprar en El Poney Pisador en Bree. Cebadilla Mantecona hace una excelente sidra.'","Dedalera Cavada se encuentra en Tejonera en la Comarca, al oeste de Bree.\
\
Dedalera Cavada te ha pedido que le recojas un poco de sidra \\qAñejada por las Estrellas\\q del Poney Pisador. Una vez que tengas la sidra, deberías llevársela a Dedalera."},
[1088]={"Has recogido la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas","¡Se te ha acabado el tiempo!","Dedalera Cavada se encuentra en Tejonera, en la Comarca, esperando que le entregues la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas.\
\
Deberías llevarle la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas —que en realidad es Sidra Abandonada— antes de que se acabe el tiempo.","Lleva la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas a Dedalera Cavada","'¿Quieres... probar la Sidra Abandonada? ¿Estás seguro? Alguien como tú no suele estar acostumbrado a bebidas así. Me sorprendería mucho que llegara a gustarte.'","Todo Menos la Buena Sidra","Recoge la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas en la Posada Abandonada","Se te ha encomendado entregar cosas desagradables a miembros necesitados de ayuda de la Liga de las Posadas, algo que solo haría la peor de las ${CLASS}.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Anlaf el Despojado se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Deberías recoger la falsa Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas —en realidad, Sidra Abandonada— de manos de Anlaf el Despojado.","'He recibido un tipo distinto de órdenes de Jónar, el jefe de esta asociación. Odia tanto a la Liga de las Posadas que me ha asignado una tarea muy diferente de la de mi vecino de la Liga. ¡Chist, que no nos oiga!\
\
'Dedalera Cavada ha probado todas las cervezas y vinos de la Liga de las Posadas, pero al parecer se ha olvidado de las sidras. Desea probar la Sidra Añeja de las Estrellas del Póney Pisador, pero creo que la sorprenderemos con algo muy distinto.\
\
'Ve a la Posada Abandonada y pídele a Anlaf el Despojado un poco de su repugnante Sidra Abandonada. Es una de las cosas más asquerosas del mundo, salvo quizá la Bazofia... o tal vez la Cerveza Abandonada. ¡Dedalera Cavada quedará terriblemente decepcionada!'","'¡Qué cara pondrá Dedalera Cavada cuando pruebe esa asquerosa mezcla!'","'¿Es… es esta la sidra? Huele bastante raro, incluso desde aquí. ¡Pero lo probaré! Soy el miembro más dedicado de la Liga de las Posadas.'\
\
Dedalera Cavada da un sorbo a la Sidra Abandonada y de inmediato hace una mueca.\
\
'¡Asquerosa! ¡Lo más repugnante que he probado jamás (salvo quizá la Bazofia que bebí en la Posada Abandonada)! Devuélvele esto de inmediato a Cebadilla Mantecona y dile que es pésimo haciendo sidra. ¡Haré que sus bebidas sean vetadas de la Liga de las Posadas!'"},
[1089]={"Collect willow boughs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Were you able to find everything?'","Clay can be found on the banks of the pond north west of Bree. Willow sprays can be collected near a pond south of Bree. Cut pine wood can be found outside of Bree. Fine lace can be procured from the tailor Maud Tatter in Bree.\
\
Rona Turner has asked you to collect clay, willow sprays, firewood, and fine lace.","Collected cut pine logs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected fine clay (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, do you like pottery? I'm afraid I haven't much for sale at the moment. I had to fire my assistant after he knocked over a huge rack of nearly cooled pots, cups, bowls... oh, I don't even know the extent of which was lost.\
\
'Forgive me for going on. Midsummer is such a busy time of year for orders and without my assistant.... say, if you happen to be free, I could make it worth your time!\
\
'I just need a few simple things. With your help, I could get so much more done. Now let me think... my assistant chopped wood for me, but I sent him away before he collected it. You'll find that he has felled pine trees about the area. Pine burns nice and hot! Oh! I had a special order for a set of dishes with willow leaves imprints. There's a lovely weeping willow south of the city, near the lake. Now, while you are out and about, I also have an order of lace that needs to be picked up from Maud Tatter.\
\
'Let me think, is that everything? Oh my, I very nearly forgot the most important thing! The clay! I harvest a lovely, rich clay from the pond north west of the city. If you could just run along and help me with those few things, I -- we can save so many happy couples' special day!'","Return to Rona Turner","Collect cut pine logs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the pottery materials to Rona Turner","Talk to Maud Tatter","'Good day to you! Ah, you have come for Rona's lace? I have it right here! Please do thank her for her business, would you?'","Collected willow boughs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","All Fired Up","'Marvellous! You haven't any idea how much this means to me! I will probably need more help until I find a new apprentice. Please do come see me again.'","The demand for woodfired pottery is especially high during the wedding season of Midsummer. Artisans are overwhelmed with orders and need help gathering materials for their fine crockery.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Rona Turner is located in Bree.\
\
Bring the materials to Rona Turner.","Collect fine clay (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1090]={"Locked door in Tungobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Turthoren the locksmith held spare keys to all the houses in Tungobel, until a half-troll stole them.","Turthoren the locksmith speaks to you in a hushed tone.\
\
'Ah you are not a Corsair. Good! I am afraid for my life but even more afraid for the future of my profession. You see, I make keys and locks for the whole village to protect the townspeople's homes from bandits. Some of the villagers lose their keys from time to time so I keep a spare for each home. That is, I had a spare key for each home until one of those monstrous beasts stole the keys from my shop! You've got to get those keys back for me and lock the doors so when the townsfolk return they know I looked after their homes. Please, ${RACE}, will you help me?'","Each home in Tungobel has an unlocked door.\
\
Lock each door in Tungobel.","Lock doors in Tungobel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","All Locked Up","Retrieve Turthoren's keys","Retrieved Turthoren's keys","Turthoren is near the village of Tungobel.\
\
Return the keys to Turthoren.","Turthoren's keys are on a half-troll in Tungobel.\
\
Retrieve the keys for Turthoren.","Return the keys to Turthoren","'Oh, you are indeed a hero. I thought that I'd never be able to return to Tungobel. Now that I have my keys back, I can leave for safety, then return to my work once this corsair threat is taken care of.\
\
'No, I'm not worried about the Corsairs. They try this every once in a while. These large half-trolls in their ranks frighten me though. They wield a sword as well as any man.'"},
[1091]={"Batalla total","Lleva la lucha a los orcos en su campamento en Sar-kidul.","Tu misión es llevar la lucha a los Orcos en Sar-kidul y eliminarlos.","Encuentra y derrota a Madmurúk","Derrota a los Orcos en Sar-kidul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra y derrota a Madmurúk en Sar-kidul.","'¡Has hecho bien en llevar la lucha a los Orcos aquí! Deberíamos regresar a Ub Nishir.'","Orcos derrotados en Sar-kidul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Madmurúk ha emergido para defender Sar-kidul!","Madmurúk derrotado"},
[1092]={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Estabilidad en el frente occidental","'Juuum, otro pequeño como amigo. Más conversaciones como esta y podría olvidar cómo hablar la lengua de los árboles...'","'Juuum, te pareces más a los hombres que visten de verde que a los altos elfos o a los que visten de lobo. Me gustan los que visten de verde. Son mis amigos.\
\
'Haz saber a los montaraces que ya no estoy cansado. Estoy lleno de energía y no descansaré hasta que el oeste de su lago esté lleno de naturaleza pacífica de nuevo.'","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir.\
\
Orchalwë se alegrará de saber que las orillas occidentales de Evendim están a salvo.","La nube oscura sobre las orillas occidentales del Lago del Crepúsculo se ha disipado y el ánimo de Ramalarga está por las nubes.","'Los Ents son en verdad criaturas muy curiosas... tan antiguos y, sin embargo, sabemos tan poco de ellos... Me alegra que hayas tenido el placer no solo de conocer a Ramalarga, sino de ayudarlo. En los tiempos oscuros que se avecinan, los Ents podrían resultar aliados muy valiosos.\
\
'Ahora, es momento de dirigir nuestra atención hacia el sur y hacia la ciudad de mis antepasados.'"},
[1094]={"Burgthryth está desconsolada por la destrucción de las mejores cuerdas de su laúd a manos de un dientes de sable particularmente agresivo y con poco oído musical.","Burgthryth te ha pedido que le traigas las tripas del kilpa-kita, Laulu-vihâja, con las que hará nuevas cuerdas para su laúd.\
\
Laulu-vihâja se encuentra en Kissa-sari, al suroeste de Jänis-leiri.","'Siento causarte tantos problemas, ${PLAYER}, pero necesitaría tu ayuda con una cosa más antes de salir a buscar al resto de mi comunidad. Verás, mientras tú estabas fuera intentando recuperar mis partituras, decidí intentarlo yo misma. Desafortunadamente, mientras viajaba por las orillas del río al suroeste, me encontré cara a cara con el mayor kilpa-kita que he visto aquí hasta ahora... ¡y parecía hambriento!\
\
'Bueno, por abreviar, ¿sabes que dicen que la música amansa a las bestias? ¡Ja! ¡Pues no! ¡Ese horrible gato apenas me dejó tocar el primer verso antes de arrancar las cuerdas de mi preciado laúd! Estaba tan enfadada que podría haberlo dejado inconsciente con mi laúd justo allí mismo... pero entonces necesitaría un nuevo laúd y no solo un nuevo juego de cuerdas, así que preferí salir corriendo.\
\
'En cuanto a las cuerdas... ¿podrías encontrar a ese dientes de sable y arrastrar su miserable cadáver hasta aquí? Nunca he usado cuerdas de tripas de gato antes, ¡pero creo que es el momento perfecto para probarlas! Los Lossoth de por aquí dicen que han intentado dar caza a este gato antes sin mucha suerte... Lo llaman Laulu-vihâja... supuestamente tiene una guarida en esa isla del Lune.'","Es repugnante...","Lleva las tripas a Burgthryth en Jänis-leiri","Bien encordado","Habiendo recuperado un montón de tripas del mismo kilpa-kita que destrozó el laúd de Burgthryth, deberías llevárselo lo antes posible.\
\
Burgthryth se encuentra en Jänis-leiri.","Tripas de kilpa-kita encontradas","'¿Has encontrado a Laulu-vihâja ya? ¡Quiero las tripas de ese gato para mi laúd!'","'¿Todavía no has encontrado a esa maldita bestia? Oh, me enfada tanto pensar en él vagando por ahí, esperando para saltar sobre algún otro pobre e inocente juglar...'","Derrota a Laulu-vihâja y recoge sus tripas","'¿Le tienes? ¡Maravilloso! Eso le enseñará a ese estúpido gato a despreciar mi talento. Espero que suene bien. En fin, no queda otra que encordarlo y ver cómo suena...\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Tendré que irme pronto para intentar encontrar al resto de mi comunidad, donde sea que se hayan perdido en este horrible lugar. ¡Espero volver a verte algún día!'"},
[1095]={"Khôltekh has asked that you return any valuables you see in Deshûkh, the Blood Market to him, so that he may return them to the families from which they were stolen. Deshûkh is located in Dil-irmíz, south-east of Mekab-kuphâr.","'It's not only our people these scoundrels have captured, it's also our treasure. Raiding parties along the coast of the Cape of Umbar have made off with countless caches, spoils of this shadow war we are fighting with those in Umbar-môkh, the Undercity.\
\
'That same smuggler's market where the Umbari nobles were taken - Deshûkh, the Blood Market  - it is likely to have many of these misbegotten treasures as well. While these are certainly not so precious as our citizens' lives, coin is still precious. There is much to rebuild here in Umbar, and many families who have pled with us to have their treasures returned to them.\
\
'You would be doing a great service to us by returning any treasure you find in Deshûkh. Will you lend us your aid?'","Return to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, the Hall of the Kindred.","Khôltekh has asked that you return any valuables you see in Deshûkh.","Recover treasure caches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Khôltekh in the Hall of the Kindred","'As I said, this coin is not as precious as lives, but it will surely help many rebuild theirs. You have my thanks.'","All That Glitters","Recovered treasure caches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1097]={"'Why have you brought me Randgar's cloak? Whatever concerns you, please, speak your mind.'\
\
You describe to Inhild the scene you witnessed when you returned to Randgar's farm. She begins to quietly sob.\
\
'Oh, no, it cannot be true. Poor Randgar, my love. Why did he not flee? I begged him not to stay on my behalf. I know that he stayed so that we might be together, but it is now doubtful that I will ever look upon him again.\
\
'${PLAYER}, I must ask you for one final favour. You must take me to Randgar's farm, so that I may bid good-bye to him in person. I will know no peace until I see these things for myself. Please, speak with my father inside our home. Ask that he allow you to escort me to Randgar's farmstead.'","'You return. I trust that Inhild has returned safely as well? Stay a moment and share with me your visit to the belated Randgar's home.'","Hwitmon has allowed you to escort Inhild to the farm to say farewell","Escort Inhild to Randgar's farm to say good-bye","Speak to Hwitmon","All that Remains","Randgar's farm lies south of Cliving, along the road to the east.\
\
Inhild has been allowed to visit Randgar's farm in order to say farewell to the man she loved.","Inhild's distress over Randgar has given her an opportunity to visit his farm and to say farewell to her lost love.","'Inhild yet wastes her thoughts on that foolish Randgar? He is but a worthless farm-boy! A woman of her standing should be courted by a wealthy noble or brave warrior.'\
\
You explain to Hwitmon the events at Randgar's farm and request to escort Inhild there, so that she may know peace.\
\
'I shed no tears for Randgar... his fate is a result of his own foolish actions. I will grant Inhild my blessing to leave if it helps her to forget about her silly affections, but you must promise to keep her safe.'","Convince Hwitmon to allow Inhild to visit Randgar's farm","Hwitmon resides at his estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving, with his daughter.\
\
Inhild would like her father's permission to visit Randgar's farm one last time to see what yet remains and to say farewell.","Hwitmon resides at his estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving.\
\
Inhild and Randgar have asked that Hwitmon not be told the truth, as he would be happiest to believe that his daughter is with a wealthy man in Edoras.","'Let us go out at once, ${PLAYER}, before my father changes his mind on this matter. Lead the way.'"},
[1099]={"'De acuerdo, mientras Noll y yo ponemos la rueda en el carro, hay una última cosa que me gustaría pedirte. Vuelve con Elsie, en Puente de Caballetes y dile que todo anda bien por aquí.\
\
'En cuanto el carro esté arreglado, Noll y yo iremos a talar un par de árboles más y llevaremos la carga de vuelta a la ciudad. ¡No podríamos haberlo hecho sin tu ayuda, por supuesto¡ ¡Gracias!\
\
'Ahora, date prisa... ¡No te quedes ahí esperando a los orcos!'","Todo va bien","'¡Espero que Mattie y Noll se pongan en marcha de vuelta a Puente de Caballetes pronto!","'Gracias por la rueda. ¡Noll y yo la tendremos lista en un santiamén!'","'¡Me alegra tanto saber que Mattie está a salvo!'","'Con tanto orco rondando, no es seguro estar por aquí fuera. ¡Gracias por encontrar esa rueda!'","Buscando en el campamento orco, encontraste una rueda para el carro de Mattie Bosquerudo. Aunque la rueda es algo pequeña, debería de servir para llevar el carro y un cargamento de madera de vuelta a Puente de Caballetes.","Elsie Bosquerudo está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Mientras Mattie y Noll arreglan el carro y lo cargan con la madera que han recogido, Mattie te ha pedido que vuelvas a Puente de Caballetes y le digas a su mujer que está a salvo.","'¿Mattie y Noll están sanos y salvos? ¡Oh, bendito seas! Son las mejores noticias que oigo desde hace días. ¡Me temía lo peor, pero me alegra oir que mis cuitas han sido en vano!\
\
¡Sólo espero que se den prisa y que vuelvan a Puente de Caballetes! No creo que vaya a poder dormir hasta que estén de vuelta.'","'¡Estaré mucho más tranquilo cuando vuelva a Puente de Caballetes con esta madera!'","'Qué bien que encontraras esa rueda. Odiaría quedarme aquí atrapado mucho más tiempo.'","'Creo que estaremos bien aquí. Noll y yo deberíamos poder poner la rueda sin demasiados problemas.\
\
'¡Todo lo que te pido es que bajes a Puente de Caballetes y le digas a Elsie que estamos bien!"},
[1100]={"Longo está junto al pozo en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Hiciste lo que Cancióndesauce indicó. Dile a Longo Daegmund que el pozo debería ser seguro para beber nuevamente.","'¡Me alegra que nadie haya enfermado! Me siento mal por Gar, claro, pero ya sabes a qué me refiero.'","El pozo de Entibo está al norte y al oeste del Manantial de Aguas Plateadas.\
\
Cancióndesauce te dijo que regresaras el cubo de agua al pozo de Entibo.","'Bien, has traído las flores que necesitaba. Los males de los Hombres contaminaron esta agua con veneno. El poder de la naturaleza la hará pura una vez más.\
\
'Ahora lleva este cubo de vuelta a Entibo y vierte su contenido en el pozo. El agua conservará sus propiedades curativas y eliminará cualquier resto de veneno.\
\
'Ten cuidado. Estas tierras son salvajes y hogar de muchas bestias peligrosas.'","'¡El agua sabe deliciosa ahora! Y tenemos que agradecerte a ti y a Cancióndesauce.'","'De alguna manera, mi Gar resolvió el misterio del pozo envenenado. ¡Buen chico, Gar!'","'Pocos recuerdan el Árbol Amarillo de antaño. El Maestro lo recuerda, pero no viene por aquí muy a menudo.'","'El Árbol Amarillo solía ser un lugar de paz, pero los tiempos han cambiado y ya no lo es.'","'Debemos vigilar el pozo y asegurarnos de que esos bandidos no lo envenenen otra vez. ¡Estoy seguro de que fueron ellos!'","Cancióndesauce ha creado un remedio con las flores que le llevaste.","'¿Piensas quedarte ahí de pie todo el día? Creo que tienes una tarea que completar.'","'Lleva el agua al pozo en Entibo'","'¿Después de todo ese esfuerzo, simplemente viertes el agua sucia de nuevo en el pozo? No lo entiendo...'\
\
Longo huele el agua del pozo y luego toma un sorbo.\
\
'¡El agua está dulce! Lirio siempre dijo que podíamos confiar en Cancióndesauce, y parece que tenía razón. ¡Avisaré a todos que el pozo es seguro para beber otra vez! ¡Gracias, ${PLAYER}!'","'Me alegra ayudar a la buena gente de Entibo.'","'Me pregunto cómo se envenenó el pozo en primer lugar... ¡Debieron ser esos malditos Montebruno!'","Habla con Longo Daegmund junto al pozo del pueblo de Entibo","Bien está lo que bien acaba","Recoge el cubo"},
[1101]={"Allies and Enemies","Talk to Haul at Echad Naeglanc","Echad Naeglanc lies to the south and east of Bledhun's camp.\
\
Bledhun has asked you to warn his allies regarding the evil ones who dwell in the Bonevales.","The wights of the Bonevales and the Dievlig pose a great threat to all the clans of Dunland.","'Only a few hours ago, Echad Naeglanc was attacked by the Dievlig. These foul vermin took my friends captive, but I was able to fight them off in the end.'","'Seek out the Ranger-encampment of Echad Naeglanc.'","'The wights and the movements of the Dievlig pose a growing threat to the clans of Dunland. Several of our allies are located at Echad Naeglanc, the camp of a northern Duvodiad like yourself, on the southern border of the Bonevales...will you bring word to them and warn them of the danger that the evil ones pose?\
\
'Travel south along the road, then turn due east and travel up the path to Echad Naeglanc.'"},
[1102]={"Los enanos que se dirigieron desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera hasta la Guardia Orca parecen haber colocado trampas disuasorias para sus enemigos, pero ya no funcionan.\
\
Sin duda sería de gran ayuda para los enanos que defienden el puesto avanzado en los Filones del Cuernorrojo que estas trampas volvieran a estar operativas.","Has armado las trampas destinadas a frenar el avance de los Ghâsh-hai en el sur de Zelem-melek.\
\
Aunque los enanos no lo sepan, les has prestado un gran servicio.","Arma cuidadosamente las trampas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aliados de Mordor","Completado","Los enanos que se dirigieron desde la Sala Vigesimoprimera hasta la Guardia Orca parecen haber colocado trampas disuasorias para sus enemigos, pero ya no funcionan.","Has armado una trampa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las trampas se encuentran en las salas del sur de Zelem-melek, al oeste y al norte de la Guardia Orca. Los enanos las colocaron cerca de Gabil-mamach y Budkhul-tharâkh.\
\
Deberías armar las trampas que han dejado de funcionar para ayudar a hacer los pasajes más seguros frente a los enemigos de Khazad-dûm."},
[1107]={"${PLAYERNAME:Aliado[m]|Aliada[f]} de los Ikorbâni","Your standing among the Ikorbâni earns you a gift. Return to Kildûg at Iridír to claim your reward.","Your efforts to assist the Ikorbâni are noted among the people. To recognize your efforts, the leaders of the Shagâni at Iridír wish to honour you with a gift and thanks.","Reach Ally tier with the Ikorbâni","Visit Kildûg at Iridír to claim a gift","'I am pleased that you are such a staunch supporter of our people. For too long we suffered and lost much of who we were as a people.\
\
'Thanks to you and your efforts our culture will return. Please accept this gift.\
\
'If you would like to see what else we offer speak with Nêkhur.'","You have honoured your word to assist the Ikorbâni in their efforts to restore their lands. You should return to Kildûg at Iridír to receive a reward for your continued assistance."},
[1109]={"'You are as undeterred as our eldest stone-lords below. High praise again, friend. You have raised our status in Mûr Ghala, and shown skill in words and work alike.\
\
'Again, I offer recompense and more. Take this acid, forged to free crystal from stone. These gems, of little worth to Elves or Men, hold value below, where light is rare and every spark prized.\
\
'You may take the tinctures, or the knowledge to craft your own. The choice is yours—both are earned.'","${PLAYERNAME:Aliado[m]|Aliada[f]} de los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh","In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the Dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed. Among the adventurous dwarves who dared leave the deep halls, your name and effort gain heft. Return to the quartermaster to see new wares awaiting those proven.","Reach Ally standing with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh","In the broken land of An Shêru, your efforts to assist the dwarves of Jiret-menêsh have not gone unnoticed.","Speak with Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh","You stand by your agreement with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh and assist in the recovery of the broken land. You should return to Quartermaster Semanísi to see what acclaim your deeds have wrought."},
[1111]={"Search for Círgon in Egalmoth's Green in the Third Circle","Egalmoth's Green can be found to the north in the Third Circle.\
\
You were unable to find Círgon at the Baths and should now search Egalmoth's Green.","Talk to Círgon","The Baths of Belecthor can be found to the north in the Fourth Circle.\
\
Mílien has asked you to seek out her son, Círgon, at the Baths of Belecthor near their home or below in Egalmoth's Green.","After her husband left Minas Tirith to aid in the war, Mílien has grown increasingly concerned by her son's behaviour.","You see a young boy standing in Egalmoth's Green...","Círgon is not here. Perhaps he is in Egalmoth's Green below...","Alone in the City","Search for Círgon near the Baths of Belecthor in the Fourth Circle","'Mother sent you, didn't she?\
\
'She doesn't need to worry about me, you know. I just come down here to think about father and my family... and how things used to be. I don't want to talk about that right now.\
\
'Oh, I was just about to leave to sail my ships! Would you like to come along?'","'Do you have a moment, ${PLAYER}? \
\
'Forgive me if I am too direct, but I have heard your name spoken among the people since your arrival in Minas Tirith and I hoped you might aid me with a personal matter.\
\
'My son, Círgon, has not been himself. My husband has gone to war and Círgon will not say it, but I know it tears at him. He has spent much time alone over the past few weeks, and does not even speak to his friends. He spends every morning down at the Baths sailing the ships he and Círhir built together. That, or he wanders Egalmoth's Green and sits alone in the dark of the trees.\
\
'Is this how a child should cope? It does not seem so to me, and I worry for him. We all feel the loss of our loved ones and he must understand that we are together in our sorrows.\
\
'Please, go find him, and tell him to return to me. I have prepared supper and I cannot allow Círgon to sacrifice another meal to his sadness.'"},
[1112]={"'¿Grimbriar no pudo enviar a nadie más?\
\
'¡Ay de mí y de los míos! Tenemos muchos problemas aquí, y realmente espero que puedas ayudar como el Vigilante Jefe cree que puedes.'","A lo largo del Gran Camino del Este","El campamento de Adso se encuentra al oeste, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, entre la puerta de Bree y Los Gamos.\
\
El Vigilante Grimbriar te envió para ayudar a Adso Henoloma a resolver los problemas que el hobbit tiene actualmente con los bandidos del sur.","Habla con Adso Henoloma en su campamento","'Encontrarás el campamento de Adso al este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, entre Bree y Los Gamos. Apresúrate... el problema que enfrenta el hobbit y sus trabajadores requiere atención inmediata, y no puedo enviar hombres para su causa.'","El Vigilante Grimbriar te envió a investigar las denuncias de más actividad de sureños a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Un hobbit allí, Adso Henoloma, pidió ayuda contra ladrones y matones.","'Tomaré en cuenta el consejo de mis otros Vigilantes con sumo cuidado. Debes entender, sin embargo, que los Montaraces son brutos por derecho propio y han sido durante mucho tiempo una amenaza en nuestras fronteras. Pregunta en Puente de Caballetes y en las tierras de cultivo de las Quebradas del Norte, y verás la misma respuesta sobre los Montaraces. Ni uno solo de ellos es digno de confianza.\
\
'Como dije, hay otros dentro de las Tierras de Bree que necesitan ayuda y tú has demostrado ser alguien muy valioso y más que capaz. Quiero que visites a uno de ellos. Adso Henoloma es un hobbit que está construyendo una posada a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, entre Bree y Los Gamos. Ha enviado un mensaje diciendo que los bandidos están robando sus materiales y amenazando la vida de sus trabajadores. Si puedes, por favor visítalo y ve qué se puede hacer. Seguiré pensando en un curso de acción alternativo.\
\
'Lo encontrarás al oeste, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, al sur de esta cabaña, entre Bree y Los Gamos.'"},
[1113]={"Defeat corrupted bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ucornos corruptos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated corrupted bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Meet up with Oroniel","Aguasombrías derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat corrupted boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Along the Rhachló","Derrota a los ucornos corruptos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated corrupted boars (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota Aguasombrías (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should patrol along the river Rhachló, looking out for any beasts corrupted by its waters.","Defeat corrupted wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Oroniel fears the corruption along the river Rhachló might be more widespread.","'${PLAYER}, I shall bring this poor soul back to Felegoth. I am certain he will recover under a healer's care.\
\
'Will you survey more of the river's length, keeping an eye out for animals that might have been affected by the river as well? The effect of the waters on some beasts is not sleep... but madness. I shall meet you again, further upstream, as soon as I am able.'","Defeated corrupted wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Oroniel has returned and can be found further south along the banks of the Rhachló.\
\
You should reconvene with Oroniel and discuss how next to proceed.","'The sleeping Elf is in good care, though he has not yet wakened. What news have you?'\
\
Oroniel listens closely as you tell her.\
\
'It is as I feared then. The waters' corruption grows stronger and affects the surrounding land. We must continue upstream.'"},
[1114]={"Mosco Fondolodoso está en Ost Guruth, al noroeste de Harloeg.\
\
Ahora que has enfrentado y dado muerte al Encharcado, regresa con Mosco Fondolodoso y cuéntale tu éxito.","Derrota al Encharcado","'Es bueno que Sadreda te haya enviado, . Necesito ${PLAYERNAME:un[m]|una[f]} Vigilante fuerte como tú.\
\
'Al sur de aquí se extiende el pantano de Harloeg. ¿Quizás ya estés ${PLAYERNAME:familiarizado[m]|familiarizada[f]} con sus moradores?\
\
'He oído rumores de aventureros aterrados acerca de una criatura innombrable que habita allí. Al parecer, puede encontrarse si te acercas a un antiguo altar en las ruinas de Harloeg. Ve y enfréntate a esta criatura, y luego regresa conmigo.'","A lo largo de la torre de guardia","'El Encharcado puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Harloeg.'","El Encharcado ha sido derrotado","Mosco Fondolodoso está preocupado por la defensa de Ost Guruth y te ha pedido investigar rumores sobre una criatura vil al sur.","El Encharcado puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Harloeg, al sureste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Mosco Fondolodoso te ha pedido que te encargues de una criatura Sin Nombre que, según los rumores, acecha en el sur de Harloeg. Mosco mencionó que probablemente estará cerca de un viejo altar de piedra.","Encuentra el lugar donde mora el Encharcado","Hallado el lugar donde mora el Encharcado","Regresa con Mosco Fondolodoso","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! La confianza de Sadreda en ti estaba bien puesta. Los Vigilantes como tú siempre serán bien recibidos allí donde vivan los buenos pueblos de la Tierra Media.\
\
'Tienes mi agradecimiento, y el de todos aquí en Ost Guruth, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Hay una última tarea que debo pedirte antes de que regreses con Sadreda.'"},
[1115]={"'${PLAYER}! I am glad you and Gimli are here with us. It has been a bit... overwhelming.\
\
'We will continue to aid Durin's Folk in their efforts to rebuild Erebor and heal the lands surrounding it, but I would like to speak to the King Under the Mountain. I am grateful for the aid that you and Gimli have provided my folk, but I wish to express my thanks to a King who is worthy of his title.\
\
'Will you meet me before his throne?'","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has thanked King Thorin III for his mercy and offered the services of the Stout-axes to Durin's Folk.","Ambassador Sparkorth of the Stout-axes wishes to thank King Thorin III and pledge his people to the service of Durin's Folk.","'Hail, King Thorin III! Hail, King Under the Mountain!'\
\
Ambassador Spakorth bows deeply before King Thorin III.\
\
'I am Spakorth of the Stout-axes. Once I was counselor to Váskmun Greytooth, the former King of my folk, but his madness and greed led him from reason to ruin. We are a people without a leader, and though I now speak for my folk, I do not desire to lead them. I ask that of you, King Thorin.\
\
'Servitude is still so fresh in our minds. We have always served the greater powers of Mordor, and once again, we are bereft of the guiding hand of a King. I offer my people to you... to serve Durin's Folk for the kindness you have shown us.\
\
'The Stout-axes shall be true friends to Durin's Folk. I promise you this!'","Talk to King Thorin III","'Your words are appreciated, Spakorth of the Stout-axes.\
\
'Durin's Folk are honoured to have you and your kin among us, and do not take my request for aid to mean that the Stout-axes will once again serve at the will of an oppressor. You are our friends and our guests, and I will not allow any to say otherwise.\
\
'What you have endured is now a matter of the past. I bear no judgment against you or your kin for the crimes of your King and those he turned to his will. We of Durin's Folk have endured many hardships as well, and when the time is right, I shall tell you of them.\
\
'Now, I must turn my attention to Erebor and to restoring the Kingdoms of the North.'","Ambassador to the King","Talk to Ambassador Spakorth before King Thorin III's throne","Ambassador Spakorth can be found before King Thorin III's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Ambassador Spakorth has asked you to accompany him to address King Thorin in Erebor."},
[1116]={"'The time has come for a covert mission. I'm sending you behind enemy lines, soldier. The Orcs have supplies to help repair some of their damaged siege equipment. I'm sure you understand we can't let that happen.\
\
'Use some stealth when you're out there. Destroying those supply crates will weaken their efforts to take the city from us.'","Edenos has tasked you with destroying the enemies supplies in order to weaken their efforts to take the city.","'You have done much for the Gondorian army. We will take back this city!'","Enemy supplies can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should destroy enemy supplies.","Destroyed enemy supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Edenos is at the Palace of Eldacar.\
\
You should speak to Edenos.","Speak with Edenos","Ambush The Inventory","Destroy enemy supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1128]={"'You have done what I could not ask of you. Your help and humility are beyond reckoning, ${PLAYER}!'","Has recogido leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Many are our needs, but food and warmth are first among them. There is good wood among the trees and a blue berry we have found that is good for eating, but we cannot seem to gather either.\
\
'I would not beg your help in such menial tasks... but any of these things you happened to gather would be gratefully received!'","Bayas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The camps of the Easterling refugees are in the hills east of Dale.\
\
You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.","The Easterling refugee encampments need more food and firewood than they can gather.","Enkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale.\
\
You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.","Recoge leña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Among the Refugees: Hunger and Cold","Bring the supplies to Enkárvo","Collect berries  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1130]={"'The wolves will fall back into the deep trees and not bother us, at least for a spell. Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'","'Please, defeat some of the wolves beyond our camps so that they will not dare to come so close.'","You should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.","Lobos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Among the Refugees: Wolves at Bay","Return to Komúsi","Wolves still attack the Easterling refugees when they stray from their camps.","'Though the pack leader is gone, wolves still harry us when we wander too far from our camps. If you would fell some more of them, ${PLAYER}, you will scare the rest away... at least for a time.'","You should return to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, in the hills east of Dale.","Derrotar lobos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1131]={"Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","'Not every person who held out against the Corsair siege was an upstanding person. Many were in fact thieves and brigands who banded together in the face of a larger threat.\
\
'Ever since the city was retaken, they've done nothing but harass, threaten, and harm anyone that crosses their path.\
\
'Because they've been encroaching so deeply into the city, I'm wondering if you might be able to send them a message that we will not be pushed around.'","Defeat city toughs and scoundrels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The ruffians can be found in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should defeat the ruffians who are harbouring Lorvegil.","Defeated city toughs and scoundrels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT - Not Used","A band of thieves has taken over one of the districts of Pelargir, and Thandor is requesting assistance in their removal.","'I must say that you handled yourself well against a pretty dirty sort of outlaws. Most of my men wouldn't dare to cross their path.\
\
'Although they will likely regroup once our host has departed, this should keep the streets a little safer in the short-term.'","Among the Thieves","Talk to Thandor"},
[1132]={"Everything seems to be in order here","Not everything seems to be in order here","You should inventory the supplies and rations in Loeglond.","Take inventory of provisions (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Lorndúr sent you? Did he say he thought I was out of my wits? I tell you, there is a thief - though I have nothing to prove my convictions, as of yet. If only I had time to make a count of provisions. Though trade is stopped, somehow my work goes on. \
\
'Will you lend me a hand in counting supplies? It's hardly work suited for an adventurer like yourself... but it may lead us to that thief.'","'Now this is interesting. No common provisions were taken. They are the first thing a petty Lake-town thief would steal. \
\
'But sundry items are indeed missing, so my suspicions were no lapse of wits. Foresters' axes, rope, lumber, chisels? What do these have in common? Their value is little. They are but tools of our common labour. Strange, indeed!'","'While it is my task to oversee trade in Loeglond, it is all too much for one Elf to handle. I have delegated some tasks to Sírithon. He oversees the inventory and storing of provisions within Loeglond's bounds. \
\
'He has become increasingly agitated of late, convinced that a thief moves somehow undetected among us. I can hardly see how. No Wood-elf could be a thief! Any dwarf or Man would be watched closely enough, after Sírithon's talk of thieves, if not before!\
\
'Would you speak with Sírithon and see if you can put his troubled mind to rest, one way or another?'","Talk to Sírithon","You should talk to Sírithon, who can be found in Loeglond.","One of the raft-elves of Loeglond has become convinced a thief is somehow stealing from their supplies.","Take inventory of supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sírithon can be found at Loeglond.\
\
You should speak with Sírithon about the various missing supplies.","An Absence of Supply"},
[1133]={"Get Zerlúk to resume his account","'This is the tale, ${RACE}, and may it...rot your innards slowly. If you are a friend to he who...decorated this glade, it will...bring you no comfort.'\
\
Zerlúk bares his teeth in a grin.\
\
'I was with Uglúk's company of Isengarders, and my orders...were to capture halflings. \\qAlive, unspoiled, and unsearched,\\q it was. I asked no questions, and no one with sense would have either. Orders was orders.\
\
'We found...two of the little worms! They bit, they did, and stabbed at us with sharp knives. Killed some of us, not far from here, but some of the boys picked them up...they struggled, but they had no strength. We made it...to this glade, when....'\
\
Zerlúk's body is wracked by another fit of coughing.","'This warrior had friends with him...but they arrived too late to save him. Another Man...an Elf...and a dwarf. They were preparing to carry the warrior away when....'\
\
Zerlúk grins.\
\
'When Uglúk's boys circled around and slew them all. The Elf loosed all of his arrows...see them all around...and the dwarf killed many, but it was no use. They joined their friend...in death.\
\
'That is my tale...now leave me...to die. I am...content.'","Once his coughing subsides, Zerlúk continues with his account.\
\
'He came charging out of the trees, a man possessed, his sword...his sword whirling around him in a wide arc. We had to...had to fight. He killed many of us, and we had to retreat. We doubled back on him as he made his way down the hill, and in the company of... many archers...many archers....'\
\
Zerlúk's laughter bubbles out of him noisily.\
\
'He gave me this gash across my belly, and I fell here...I pretended to be dead. The warrior did not last much longer than that. He was still...alive...when his friends arrived...but....'\
\
Zerlúk's breath has gone ragged, but he still has enough life to look up at you slyly.","Zerlúk is in the Dead Orc Glade, in the middle of giving you his account of what happened there.","Zerlúk is telling you his account of what happened at the Dead Orc Glade.","An Account"},
[1134]={"Un informe detallado","'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Creo que tu relato sobre los orcos Durub será suficiente para convencer al necio del capataz de la Sala Vigesimoprimera que es demasiado pronto para bajar la guardia.\
\
'¡Espero que tus noticias respalden los informes de Reinn!'","'¿Otra vez tú? Te doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYER}. ¿Tuviste un viaje agradable hasta Zelem-melek?'\
\
Le hablas sobre el peligroso campamento orco que has encontrado, y las aterradoras aventuras de Dómárr. ¿Reinn no ha vuelto para entregar su informe?\
\
'Yo... eso es muy extraño. No, no he visto a Reinn desde que se fue contigo.'","Reinn todavía no ha regresado...","El capataz Mögr está en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Mögr a la Sala Vigesimoprimera y hacerle cambiar su opinión sobre Zelem-melek.","Vuelve a ver a Mögr para entregarle el informe completo sobre Zelem-melek","Has averiguado mucho sobre los peligros ocultos en Zelem-melek, y deberías llevar un informe completo a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.","'¡Los orcos se baten en retirada! Les llevará algo de tiempo antes de que se reagrupen de nuevo."},
[1135]={"'¡Cerveza! ¡La has encontrado! ¡Me alegra tanto que no se haya roto ni haya sido robada como las demás! Este sí que es un gran día. A partir de hoy serás ${PLAYERNAME:aclamado como un héroe[m]|aclamada como un heroína[f]}, .\
\
'Si este año no se hubiera celebrado la degustación, me imagino que me habrían echado del pueblo en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.'","Recoge el tonel de cerveza","'¡Esos bandidos no merecen nuestra cerveza del festival! Espero que no hayan conseguido llevársela toda a sus campamentos. Ni siquiera sabrían apreciar una buena cerveza.'","Una Tradición Cervecera en Peligro","'Marcamos el paso de cada invierno con un gran banquete y la celebración de Yule. Además de asar muchas patas de jabalí, el festival suele incluir una degustación de algunas de las mejores cervezas de todas las Tierras de Bree.\
\
'Ay, debo corregirme... en realidad, este año no habrá degustación. El carro que transportaba los toneles desde las colinas del oeste fue atacado por bandidos justo a las afueras de la ciudad. El conductor logró regresar sano y salvo, pero todos los barriles se perdieron. ¡Estos bandidos han ido demasiado lejos esta vez! Demasiado lejos.\
\
'¿Crees que podrías ir a recoger lo que quede de esos toneles por mí? Dijo que lo atacaron mientras cabalgaba por el Camino Verde, cerca de la Obra de los Espinar, justo después de pasar una granja. Si no me equivoco, encontrarás lo que busco en esa dirección.'","Los Hombres de Bree celebran tradicionalmente el festival de Yule con un gran festín de jabalí y cerveza.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Lleva el tonel de cerveza a Wim Trigales","Wim Trigales se encuentra en los terrenos del Festival de Bree.\
\
Wim Trigales estará encantado de recibir el tonel de cerveza destinado a la degustación del festival de Yule.","Tonel de cerveza recogido","Los toneles de cerveza perdidos pueden encontrarse al suroeste de los terrenos del Festival de Bree, probablemente cerca del Camino Verde, no lejos de la granja de Espinar.\
\
Wim Trigales te pidió que recuperaras un tonel de cerveza para la degustación anual del festival de Yule."},
[1136]={"Preocupado por la mención de Skorgrím por parte del Señor del Trueno y por los informes de enanos hostiles ocupando una fortaleza en las Montañas Nubladas, Elrond te pide que hables con Glóin para solicitar que enanos y Elfos trabajen juntos contra las fuerzas de Angmar.","'¡Ho! Así que al fin los Elfos se dignan a notar nuestras preocupaciones, ahora que casi hemos pagado nosotros mismos el precio por los Duramano.\
\
'Aun así, no debería ser tan precipitado. Es cierto que no ha habido verdadera amistad entre nuestros pueblos últimamente, pero si no nos unimos contra el verdadero Enemigo, sin duda seremos partidos por sus negras espadas.\
\
'Bien, agradezco tus palabras y las del Maestro Elrond, y ciertamente me reuniré con él para discutir nuestros planes para enfrentar a esos Angmarim que han causado tantos problemas a ambas casas.'","'Por favor, ve con Glóin y háblale en mi nombre.'","Una alianza con los enanos","'Creo que ha llegado el momento —de hecho, hace mucho que debió llegar— en que Elfos y enanos enfrenten juntos al enemigo en Angmar. En nuestro consejo anterior, discutimos... otros asuntos... y Angmar no era nuestra principal preocupación.\
\
'Hasta ahora, los Elfos no hemos prestado demasiada atención a los Duramano, considerándolos un problema que los enanos debían resolver. Pero ahora vemos que Skorgrím es un sirviente de Angmar, y que ha incitado a los gigantes de las Montañas Nubladas contra nosotros. Es hora de reconsiderar.\
\
'Por favor, ve con Glóin y háblale en mi nombre, pidiéndole que se una nuevamente al consejo contra nuestros enemigos.'","Glóin está en el campamento montañoso de los enanos al norte de Rivendel.\
\
Elrond te ha pedido que hables con Glóin sobre un nuevo consejo contra Angmar."},
[1137]={"Escort the wounded Elf to safety","An Ally in Need","'One of our wounded companions made his way back here earlier, claiming that an unfamiliar ${RACE} helped him escape from great peril.\
\
'I believe we have you to thank for this, ${PLAYER}? Well done. Every warrior you save will stand by our side when we strive against the darkness ahead.'","Aid the fallen Malledhrim warrior in his escape from the war-torn fortifications of Gathbúrz, back towards Thangúlhad.","You have rescued the wounded Elf","One of the Malledhrim has been wounded, and fallen behind enemy lines. While the valiant warrior can still move, he can fight only weakly and requires your aid to escape from enemy territory.","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should inform Handelen of the aid you lent to the wounded Elf-warrior.","'You have come to help? I have tried to avoid the Orcs for as long as I can, but I cannot move swiftly.\
\
'If you can give me a hand, we may be able to fight our way out of here! I fear, though, that I will be of little help, for I am weak.'","Talk to Handelen in Thangúlhad","'Quickly, let us be away before they find us!'"},
[1138]={"The trail of the Silent One's blood leads deeper into Rath Cail.\
\
Legolas has spotted an Orc with a similar stature and bearing fleeing deeper into Rath Cail. You should follow the trail of Orkish blood and see where it leads.","Legolas can be found in the Silent Haunt.\
\
You and Legolas have tracked the Silent One to what appears to be his refuge in Lhingris. The Silent One is nowhere to be found, but curious items have been laid in the cave.","'${PLAYER}, while you were gone I spied an Orc with a similar stature and bearing to your description of the Silent One.\
\
'The Silent One must have met some foe on the road, for his arm was wounded. He left behind him a sparse trail of blood as he fled deeper into Rath Cail. I do not believe he thought himself watched by any other than the Orcs and creatures of Lhingris, so the advantage is ours.\
\
'You said he had piled the bodies of his kin as an offering to the spiders? If he has some arrangement with Shelob or her children, he could be a very useful Orc!\
\
'Let us follow his Orkish blood and see if it leads us to him!'","You and Legolas have found a strange cave where Orkish bones are piled and picked clean...","An Ambusher Ambushed","The trail of blood leads deeper into Rath Cail!","Talk to Legolas in the Silent Haunt","Legolas spotted a wounded Orc of a similar stature and bearing to the Silent One travelling southward deeper into Rath Cail.","'It appears the Silent One is disliked amongst the Orcs for a greater reason than his queer appearance. I think the Silent One has a taste for Orc-flesh!\
\
'Ah, but what strange trinkets for an Orc to hoard....'\
\
Legolas kneels before the armour and cloak piled in the Silent One's cave.\
\
'Wait a moment, ${PLAYER}. There is a very familiar hair caught in this armour!'","Follow the trail of the Silent One's blood deeper into Rath Cail"},
[1139]={"La Bóveda de Durin se encuentra directamente al sur del pequeño campamento en Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes encontrar la Bóveda de Durin y ver si es tan prometedora como su nombre sugiere.","Swerthir está en el pequeño campamento de enanos en Lamab-dûm, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar a Swerthir y contarle lo que has aprendido sobre el estado actual de la Bóveda de Durin.","'Según mi mapa, , la Bóveda de Durin se encuentra directamente al sur de aquí. El problema es que mi grupo se niega a explorarla. Quieren ir directamente al Mirador de la Gran Excavación y no desviarse del camino.\
\
'Me encantaría saber qué hay en la Bóveda, pero no me atrevo a separarme de mi grupo. ¿Podrías ir a echar un vistazo, ${PLAYERNAME:buen[m]|buena[f]} ?'","Swerthir escucha en silencio mientras le explicas el estado actual de la Bóveda de Durin, no solo vacía, sino en ruinas.\
\
'Es una noticia triste, ${PLAYER}. Me imagino que esta es solo la primera de muchas decepciones mientras recorremos Moria. Tal vez nunca se restaure por completo, pero... me gustaría pensar que esta expedición puede forjar una nueva mina. Diferente, pero buena.'","Una esperanza antigua","No hay nada aquí más que polvo y temblores de la tierra","Busca reliquias en la Bóveda de Durin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa a Swerthir en Lamab-dûm","Swerthir está fascinado por la Bóveda de Durin al sur, pero le preocupa separarse de su grupo."},
[1140]={"Una Antigua Historia de Maldad","Para reconstruir la Llave del Túmulo, primero deberás buscar a los hermanos gemelos que poseen el primer fragmento. El segundo yace con un engendro; vivo desde tiempos que escapan a nuestro conteo. Estos son apenas dos fragmentos de un todo mayor.","Has adquirido la mitad derecha de la Llave del Túmulo.","Naerandir te ha dicho que conoce la historia de Othrongroth, el Gran Túmulo, pero que la realidad del lugar tal como existe ahora debe ser velada bajo el esplendor de la leyenda, para que el temor cauteloso no se convierta en terror absoluto.","'Destruir el mal que habita en el Gran Túmulo no será tarea fácil. Mantén la mente clara y a tus amigos cerca.'","Lee el libro de Naerandir para orientarte","Ensambla la llave en la Forja del Túmulo","El Gran Túmulo se encuentra en la cima de la colina, más allá del pequeño campamento. El primer fragmento de la llave está custodiado por dos demacrados en el laberinto del Gran Túmulo. El segundo fragmento lo posee un Señor Demacrado en otra parte del Gran Túmulo.\
\
Naerandir te pidió que entres al Gran Túmulo, Orthongroth, para purgar la tumba del mal. Te entregó un libro para ayudarte en tu aventura.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La primera mitad de la llave se encuentra en la instancia del Gran Túmulo — Laberinto, mientras que la segunda mitad está en la instancia del Gran Túmulo — Thadur.</rgb>","Has adquirido la mitad izquierda de la Llave del Túmulo.","Una forja yace frente a una gran puerta dentro de los Túmulos. Es allí donde la llave deberá ser reforjada. No requerirá habilidad, pero sí tiempo.\
\
Consulta el libro de Naerandir si alguna vez te confundes sobre cómo reforjar la llave.","Habiendo obtenido los dos fragmentos de la llave, deberás buscar la forja.\
\
No necesitarás la habilidad de forjar armas, herramientas ni cotas de malla. La llave desea ser restaurada como fue concebida, para asegurar que los Muertos permanezcan en su sueño. Pero los Muertos que habitan dentro harán lo posible para impedir que la llave sea restaurada.\
\
Cuando el martillo golpee el yunque, comenzará tu prueba... Ruega a los Valar haber traído amigos leales y firmes que te acompañen hasta el final.","Consulta el libro de Naerandir para ayuda","Has recibido la Llave del Gran Túmulo","Más allá de los túneles, cargados de niebla y polvo, por escaleras ruinosas construidas en una era anterior a la nuestra, yace una puerta. Esa puerta conduce al lugar de descanso final de un gran líder de los Hombres, muerto hace mucho tiempo, y a una poderosa carcasa reclamada por las fuerzas leales al Rey Brujo.\
\
Fue para protegerlo que los artesanos forjaron la llave antes de su tumba. Una gran puerta, replicada varias veces, para sellar a los muertos fuera del alcance del mal. El mal, al parecer, resultó demasiado potente para que el mero metal pudiera resistirlo. Sin embargo, algo de poder debe permanecer, pues la llave está partida de tal forma que su refundición no requiere habilidades de artesano, sino que debe ser restaurada en la forja donde fue creada.\
\
Busca esa forja al pie de las escaleras ruinosas, en una fosa frente a la gran puerta.","Obtén la mitad derecha de la Llave del Túmulo","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:viajero[m]|viajera[f]}! Vine a estos túmulos para investigar una historia... ¿deseas escucharla? ¿Has oído hablar de Othrongroth, el Gran Túmulo? Se encuentra justo en la cima de esta colina, un lugar de espanto en las tierras de Bree.\
\
'Pero no siempre fue así, y quizás no deba seguir siéndolo. Cosas malignas se agitan en las Quebradas de los Túmulos y amenazan con transformar el temor cauteloso en terror absoluto. Quizás te interese restaurar la paz en las Quebradas de los Túmulos. A cambio, te incluiré en mi relato sobre este Gran Túmulo.\
\
'Solo necesitarás unas pocas cosas para aventurarte en lo profundo de estas salas y acabar con el mal que se agita en su corazón. Primero, necesitarás amigos, y varios, pues los enemigos que ahora se alzan en esas salas son mucho más poderosos que cualquier otro que camine por estas tierras. Luego, resolución y coraje, pues el miedo que estas criaturas proyectarán sobre ti es digno de leyenda. Por último, mis notas... ellas te indicarán qué hacer a continuación.'","Obtén la mitad izquierda de la Llave del Túmulo"},
[1141]={"Derrota a Thaurlach","Has derrotado a Thaurlach","'¿Thaurlach ha muerto? Deberías ir y proclamar estas noticias al mundo exterior.'","Iorelen se encuentra en su campamento.\
\
Has matado a Thaurlach y deberías contarle a Iorelen tus hazañas.","'¿Qué es esto que me dices, ${PLAYER}? ¿El Balrog Thaurlach ha sido derrotado? Eso es una esperanza que no nos atrevimos a soñar. Tu nombre será registrado en la historia de los Elfos mientras el tiempo dure.\
\
'Toma esto como recompensa por tu intrépido coraje.'","'Tu nombre será recordado por los Elfos por tus hechos, ${PLAYER}.'","Eimyr, el jefe de los Eldgang, se dio cuenta de la locura de sus acciones y ha decidido enfrentarse al mal ancestral que se encuentra en los salones de Nûrz Gâashu.","Una amenaza antigua","'Ve a Gorthban y ayuda al Elfo Glathlírel.'","'El que todo lo ve mintió a los Eldgangs. Ya no escucharemos sus palabras malvadas.\
\
'Durante muchos siglos, sufrimos la crueldad de Thaurlach, un Balrog del Gran Enemigo, y luchamos contra él. Cuando los magos azules llegaron con el Elfo Glathlírel y encadenaron a Thaurlach, nuestro pueblo se alegró y ayudó a vigilarlo. Ahora el que todo lo ve quiere liberar a Thaurlach y usarlo para sus propios fines malvados.\
\
'Ve a Gorthban y ayuda a Glathlírel, que sigue aquí vigilando la prisión de Thaurlach. Ella sabrá qué hacer.'","Glathlírel se encuentra vigilante fuera de Gorthban.\
\
Eimyr te ha indicado que busques a Glathlírel y la ayudes contra Thaurlach, un Balrog de Morgoth."},
[1142]={"This looks like the second fishing spot","An Angler's Advice","Catch a fish at the third spot","¡Has atrapado un pez!","You caught a fish at each of the three locations Zildug recommended. You should return to Iridír and show your catch to the fisherman.","Return to Zildug in Iridír","Catch a fish at the first spot","Find the second fishing spot","Catch a fish at the second spot","You have found the third fishing spot Zildug described. You should throw the old bait and hook and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","Find the third fishing spot","This looks like the third fishing spot","You have found the second fishing spot Zildug described. You should cast a line and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","Zildug has shared with you the secret locations of his favourite fishing spots.","The first fishing spot is on a bridge crossing a stream east of Arwáth. You should go there and try catching a fish.","'You have been such a help to me, ${PLAYER}. I will show my appreciation by sharing with you where my new favourite fishing spots are! You know how to fish, yes? They are a secret, so do not tell anyone else. If you go fishing there, come back and show me what you caught. I would be very interested to see!\
\
'The first location is on a bridge in a nice, shady spot! You will find it crossing the stream east of Arwáth, the haunted grove. The second fishing spot is south along the same stream, and is also a bridge in a nice, cool, shady place! The third is a fishing dock on the Ikorbân, and is very far to the east. If you continue to follow the main road past the Wrackwade, you will eventually come by it. It does not have shade though, so bring a big hat!'","You have found the first fishing spot Zildug described. You should equip your fishing rod and see if it is as good a place to fish as Zildug says.","The third fishing spot is a dock on the Ikorbân, far to the south-east past the Wrackwade. You should go there and try catching a fish.","The second fishing spot is south along the same stream as the first. You should go there and try catching a fish.","Find the first fishing spot","This looks like the first fishing spot","'${PLAYER}! You return! Níkhu, look at those lovely fish! I am very impressed. You are an excellent fisher. Did you enjoy the spots? Ambarûl is a beautiful land full of beautiful things to eat.'"},
[1143]={"'Here, I will begin. Tell me, friend. When two men meet to speak, does one say a thing - and then both go off without another word? No, no, no. \
\
'Ah, but first, this will not do. I must get up. Will you help me?'","Help Kurtil up","DNT FLAG F","'Up here, you may look down on the Land of Making and Labour. Land of muddy marching. Land of swords made and swords raised. Look below and you will see. The shape is like a sword-gash, is it not? A tale is whispered among my kind: that Xayal Zangin, the Resplendant one, fought here, in this place, with the fire giant Zalim Atash, and their fighting broke the world. Many such tales are there among my kind.'\
\
He laughs.\
\
'Who can say what happened long ago? Not you or I? For who should remember. We have only tellings, and tellings tatter. Tatter and wear to dust. But now you must tell to me what flags it was you saw.'\
\
You describe each symbol you saw, drawing in the barren dirt when necessary, and the Nurnhoth slave nods gravely.","'When two men speak, one talks and then the other. Back and forth. So it is when we speak with flags. Then only those with eyes can hear. The Captain of the Pit, our lord and taskmaster, he has no such eyes. Nor his enforcers. Nor his sorcerers. Nor even his spies! They hear not when the flags speak. Only we forge-workers do.'\
\
Kurtil delves in his wandering patter into the meanings of the flags: how one describes the nature of the topic; another whether past, present, or future; a third whether a certainty, a possibility, a warning, or a wondering, and so forth. All in all, the flags are far more subtle and complex than Barathron took them to be.\
\
'And now, let us seek out the second speech, the answering. We should look, I think, east of here and south, by the road up to Mornaur Forge. You will go and look. And when you have seen, there I will be upon the upward road.'","The slave Kurtil is lying on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should help Kurtil up off the ground.","Find Kurtil up the road","DNT FLAG C","The slave Kurtil stands on the southern edge of the Udûn basin, up atop a wooden structure.\
\
You should talk to Kurtil some more.","'We will learn the reply to the first speaking. Seek it east and south, near the road that leads upward to Mornaur Forge.'","Talk to Kurtil","The Nurnhoth slave Kurtil has promised to unravel the secrets of the signal flags, if he can be trusted. Will he reveal the truth of a meeting among the dwellers of Udûn?","DNT FLAG 1","You should search for more signal flags south of the Udûn basin, on the road that leads up toward Mornaur.","Find more signal flags (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","An Answer Unspoken","DNT FLAG E","Kurtil greets you with a mischievous twinkle in his eye","The slave comes up unsteadily with a groan, but seems steady enough once up","Found another signal flag (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Now that you have inspected more signal flags, you should look for Kurtil southward on the road that leads to Mornaur.","DNT FLAG D","DNT FLAG B"},
[1144]={"Survey the ruins of Bâr Aroth in Ithilien","Mílgamel can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle).\
\
Galathir has given his apprentice, Mílgamel, a daunting task, and he has asked that you aid her in completing it.","Survey the Houses of Healing in Osgiliath","Talk to Mílgamel in the House of Remedies","'Oh, I almost didn't hear you over the roaring water!\
\
'In all my days, I have never crossed the Great River... and I wanted to spend some time looking upon it before you arrived. All that lies ahead is known to me only through distant gazes, travellers' tales, and old maps.\
\
'I know it as a land of striking beauty, even at a distance, but I know that there is an unseen danger lurking within it - else the Rangers would have naught to do but rest. \
\
'Ah, but rest does not come easy these days...\
\
'My brother was gravely wounded in the battle, and I tended to him in the Houses of Healing after he was taken from the Fields. I have never felt so powerless in my life, ${PLAYER}. Master Galathir and the lady Ioreth helped ease his pain, but his wounds were too many and too great. He lasted the night, but by dawn death had claimed him.\
\
'I have kept his blade in my keeping, and I shall wield it if ever the need arises...'\
\
Mílgamel pauses for a moment and stares into the rushing waters below.\
\
'In addition to list of herbs, Master Galathir has given me a strict list of locations to direct my survey... perhaps some of them are familiar to you?'\
\
Mílgamel hands you the list. The list mentions the old Houses of Healing in Osgiliath, the ruins of Bâr Aroth and Aelin Veren as well as the island fortress of Cair Andros in Ithilien, and mostly troublingly, the road into Imlad Morgul. At the end, it makes a note that the Rangers have been made aware of Mílgamel's passage into Ithilien and shall make arrangements at Henneth Annûn.\
\
'Ah, so you do know them! Let us get started then, shall we?'","Habla con Mílgamel","Escort Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn","'Excuse me, what is it that you want? I'm quite busy enough in my studies and have little time to speak.'\
\
You introduce yourself to Mílgamel and inform her that you are to be her guide for Galathir's task.\
\
'Oh! I am so sorry... I've been a mite overwhelmed by Galathir's demands as of late. He is a wise teacher, but his tasks are often far more daunting than he thinks them. Perhaps he has forgotten what it was like to be a novice...\
\
'He has charged me with surveying our lands in the aftermath of the battle. I have taken careful note of the twenty-three leaves, flowers, and roots he wishes me to search for... but I can think only of what I shall see in the ruins upon the Anduin, in lost Ithilien, and beyond! I must calm myself. I can see Master Galathir frowning at me even now. I must stay true to my task!\
\
'My survey is to begin in Osgiliath, but it shall stretch far beyond it. If you are to be my guide, I ask that you meet me near the old bridge in Osgiliath. I can ride that far, but I would prefer to do my survey on foot.'","Survey the ruins of Aelin Veren in Ithilien","Talk to Galathir in the House of Remedies","Survey the island fortress of Cair Andros","Mílgamel can be found on the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle).\
\
You have found Mílgamel and should now speak to her about her plans for surveying Ithilien.","'Not in all my days have I seen such gorgeous lands, ${PLAYER}! I have heard much of Ithilien, but the tales all fall short in conveying its true beauty. I am proud to report that I have identified many of the herbs Master Galathir seeks... but I could not help take note of the many, many strange plants I had never before set eyes upon. Some stirred memories of drawings I had seen in musty tomes within the Old Archives, and I cannot help but wonder what powers some of these might possess... but I can see Master Galathir frowning down at these foolish thoughts of mine!\
\
'I hope the Rangers do not mind my brief company here in their... cave. I don't mean to disparage their choice of refuge, but it is a cave.\
\
'Yet, I can't deny there's a homely warmth to it... perhaps I'll take a few notes about Henneth Annûn for my own keeping.'","An Apprentice's Guide to Ithilien","Meet Mílgamel near the remains of the Great Bridge in Osgiliath (After-battle)","Talk to Mílgamel in Osgiliath (After-battle)","Mílgamel can be found along the central causeway in Osgiliath (After-battle).\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to meet her in Osgiliath before embarking on her survey of Ithilien.","Galathir can be found in the House of Remedies within the Masters' Tier of Minas Tirith (After-battle).\
\
Ioreth has asked you to speak with Galathir for she fears he might mislead a young apprentice in his tutelage.","'Do not misunderstand me, ${PLAYER}. Galathir still possesses great skill as a healer, but he has lost sight of his shortcomings. In my long years in Minas Tirith and Imloth Melui, I have never found a shortage of new skills to learn and new draughts and tinctures to use in my work, from new trial and old lore alike. But Galathir has grown reliant on his own concoctions for his patients, and where one ill is healed another often takes its place.\
\
'He has taken a new apprentice - a young woman by the name of Mílgamel. The poor girl has no idea that she might receive such misguided instruction! It is one matter for a certain draught or salve to seem the clear choice, and quite another entirely for it to truly be so. Indeed, there are many uses for Everworth, Trueleaf, Snagbane, Blushblade, Settlegang...'\
\
Recalling that you have a certain urgency to your task, Ioreth trails off and pauses briefly.\
\
'I have heard tell that Mílgamel shall soon make for Ithilien. Perhaps you would accompany her on your own journey back to the king's side, and while you do, help her see all she has to learn there, and not only that which Galathir has pre-ordained she should see. For they say that place was once the garden of all Gondor, and what forgotten herbs and herblore may await there, just as when I told Mithrandir of the old saying that the hands of the king... ah, but I see I am needed.\
\
'Talk to Galathir and convince him of your worth in this task, and then speak to her. We shall make a great healer of her yet!'","You have found Mílgamel and she appears to be admiring the ruined city from the causeway...","Mílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to aid her in surveying the greater lands of Ithilien. You should bring her to each location she mentioned and confer with her once there.","'What do you want? Can you not see there are still many near to death and in need of tending? Even my healers are taking ill from lack of rest!\
\
'If idle chatter is your wish, begone. If you have need of my ear, speak!'\
\
You tell Galathir of your desire to accompany Mílgamel on her survey of Ithilien.\
\
'So you have heard I am sending her off, have you? No matter. You know of her task? Certain herb-stores vital to my most trusty medicines dwindle near to nothing. If these can be found where herbalists long dared not tread, then she must make a thorough harvest. Mind you! I do not wish Mílgamel distracted by any strange roots and leaves we have no use for and which might prove harmful in the extreme! \
\
'You will find Mílgamel in the House of Remedies ready to ride to Ithilien. She knows her course, ${CLASS}...so keep her from harm. I cannot afford the loss of another healer.\
\
'Now leave me!'","Mílgamel can be found at Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have escorted Mílgamel to Henneth Annûn and should now speak to her about what is to be done next.","Mílgamel can be found at your side or summoned by horn.\
\
Mílgamel has finished her initial survey and has asked to be escorted to Henneth Annûn. You should speak to her once you arrive at Henneth Annûn.","Fearful of a young apprentice being miseducated by Galathir, Ioreth has asked you to join her on a daunting task.","Survey the roadway into Imlad Morgul","Talk to Mílgamel at Henneth Annûn","You have arrived at Henneth Annûn, and the cool glow of the cavern seems even more inviting than usual."},
[1145]={"'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Eso debería limitar la capacidad de la Mano Blanca para obtener información sobre nuestras fuerzas aquí... y sobre otras cosas que deberían permanecer ocultas.\
\
'Con sus números debilitados por tus esfuerzos, tenemos la oportunidad de asestar un golpe decisivo contra su precaria posición aquí en Eregion.'","'Un placer conocerte.\
\
'Sin duda habrás oído hablar de los numerosos espías de la Mano Blanca por estas tierras. Uno de los espías favoritos de Saruman son los crebain.\
\
'Nuestros exploradores informan de la presencia de un gran número de crebain en los límites septentrionales del valle, muy al este de Gwingris. Encuéntralos y libra a nuestro valle de su amenaza antes de que descubran algo que no deberían.'","Una gran bandada de crebain procedente de las Tierras Brunas ha descendido sobre Eregion, buscando señales del paso de la Compañía desde Rivendel.","Thaliondir está en Gwingris, muy al oeste de los nidos de craban.\
\
Debes regresar a Thaliondir con noticias de tu éxito.","'Se han avistado crebain al este. Nuestros exploradores informan de un gran número de estas aves a lo largo del borde norte del valle.'","Habla con Thaliondir en Gwingris","Los crebain pueden encontrarse en el valle muy al este de Gwingris.\
\
Thaliondir te ha pedido que vayas y derrotes a los craban espías de Saruman.","Crebain derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Un ejército de ojos","Derrota a los crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1146]={"Ningêna asked you to speak with the Khûdi envoy in the encampment. She cannot spare her time or any of her people to address the envoy's needs. You can find him not far from her location.","'Ningêna sent you?\
\
'Forgive me. My name is Sûkal, and I am here at the behest of my people. I am from Khûd Zagin. More properly, I am from the outpost Jirush, the 'Swords' Cross' along the 'Road of Riches.' My people have thrown off the yoke of oppression from our Ordâkhai masters in the south, but their retribution has been swift and terrible.\
\
'I see you are not from our lands. The times are dire, and the Ambarûli struggle with their own difficulties. We have been forced into hiding and seek help in ridding our land of our oppressors. If you would be an ally, take this coin and find Sigênik at Jirush. They will test your mettle and integrity.\
\
'I cannot promise wealth or power, and I pray your intentions are noble.\
\
'When the battle dins, cross the Wrackwade and follow the road south to Jirush. Be wary of Ordâkhai patrols. I thank you.'","Show the coin to Sigênik, Rebel Contact","Sûkal provided you a coin and a general direction to the road south over the Wrackwade to reach Jirush, and a man named Sigênik. Sigênik is a contact for the rebels in Khûd Zagin.","An Audience Not Given","As you reveal the coin to the man, he holds up a hand.\
\
'The first lesson you must learn is discretion. There is an appearance of freedom here, but ever watchful are the eyes of the Ordâkhai on the rise to the north-west.\
\
'We struggle for the future of our land and people. Our leaders are few, hidden, for their safety and their families. The few who remain here are vigilant in their watch and defence. You bear a gift we sent north to our cousins in Ambarûl. If they sent you here, then you shall be tested.\
\
'Prove your value and integrity, and we welcome your assistance. Do not, and suffer the fate of our enemies.'","Sûkal gave you a coin to present Sigênik in Jirush south across the Wrackwade","Speak with Sûkal","'I have neither patience nor time for beggars. Nor do I have resources to spare for anyone who comes asking for handouts or assistance. The Khûdi Rebels sent me a messenger whom my people must save from an Ordâkhai raiding party near the bridge, and the man still seeks an audience from me several days hence.\
\
'He is either a fool or desperate.'\
\
She sighs.\
\
'Perhaps a bit of both. I do not have the time or the resources to assist them. If you are as earnest as you seem, maybe you can help them. You will find him to the east near a hut.'","An envoy from Khûd Zagin crossed the Wrackwade looking for an audience with Ningêna. Ningêna has no time or resources to spare the envoy and asked you to intervene."},
[1147]={"Meet Tuhâl in Dale","'I am sorry, ${PLAYER}, but my courage fails me! This land; the cobblestone streets, the river flowing into the glittering lake below, the majesty of Erebor! I am overwhelmed by the beauty of this place! Please, will you speak to the King and Queen on my behalf? You are known to them, yes?'","The King has decided to set aside land for the Easterling refugees!\
\
You should discuss the good news with Tuhâl!","Talk to King Bard","Tuhâl is travelling to Dale to meet with Queen Erna and King Bard.\
\
You should meet Tuhâl in Dale.","With the Jangovar plot ended, the Easterling refugees need somewhere to go. You must seek an audience with King Bard and Queen Erna to solve their plight.","Queen Erna and King Bard can be found in Dale.\
\
You should talk to Queen Erna.","'Hello again, ${PLAYER}. You are always welcome in Dale. What can I do for you?'\
\
You tell Erna of the situation in the Ironfold: of how the Easterling refugees who are no longer under the rule of the Jangovar would like to stay in the village of Utterby, but need permission from the Kingdom of Dale. They have no home to return to, and few options left. Erna sees Tuhâl standing behind you, and studies his face carefully. She sees the desperation and exhaustion in his eyes. He carries a heavy burden.\
\
'I feel for their plight, ${PLAYER}. Whatever has happened in Rhûn, Dale will welcome those who come to us hospitably. However, there are Dalish families waiting to return to their homes in Utterby. It would be unjust, nay, impossible for us to simply hand over the village to the Easterlings. Unfortunately, we have already taken in many Dorwinion and Chayasír refugees here in Dale, and I am unsure we can accept any more. I will leave this decision to my son, the King.'","Talk to Tuhâl","'If Lord Náin cannot help us, we must make a plea to the King in Dale. Do you know this King Bard?'\
\
You tell Tuhâl about the young King Bard and his mother Queen Regent Erna.\
\
'A boy King? Interesting. Perhaps they will be more willing to hear my plea. Let us travel to Dale, and speak with this King and his mother. I will gather what refugees I can and meet you there.'","'I have listened well to your conversation with Moth-, I mean, the Queen Regent. As she said, we cannot justly offer Utterby to the refugees when there are Dale-folk waiting to return to their homes, but I also cannot bear to turn away those that need our aid. There must be a solution here....'\
\
You notice Queen Erna watching over her son, smiling proudly.\
\
'I have made my decision. Utterby will be returned to the Men and Women of Dale who used to call it home. We cannot support any more refugees here in the town of Dale, however, land in the hills west of here will be set aside for their use. They are welcome to stay in our lands so long as they obey our laws and keep the peace. We will provide aid to our friends from the east until they can establish themselves. That is the best we can do.'","An Audience with the Boy King","Talk to Queen Erna","Tuhâl looks to be on the verge of tears.\
\
'A new home in this beautiful land! The living will be rough, at least for a while, and much hard work lies ahead of us, but this is the hope my people needed! I will discuss the specifics with the King and Queen, and then return to the Ironfold to gather the refugees and spread the word.\
\
'I cannot thank you enough, ${PLAYER}. Had it not been for your kindness, we would either still be slaves to the Jangovar, or slain at the hands of the dwarves. I will make sure the Chayasír tell your story for years to come!'"},
[1148]={"'Puede que mi clan no confíe en ti, pero has demostrado ser ${PLAYERNAME:un aliado[m]|una aliada[f]} incondicional hasta ahora. ¿Vendrías conmigo a Thelgarth?'","Habla con Cariad","'¿Me equivoco al suponer que los montaraces te consideran ${PLAYERNAME:un amigo[m]|una amiga[f]}? Quizá entonces podrías ayudarme.\
\
'Tendríamos más posibilidades contra Saruman con la ayuda de los montaraces. Me... me resisto a acercarme a ellos solo, pero contigo, mi alocado plan podría ser factible.\
\
'Debería presentarte a Erlys; ella ha guiado a nuestro pueblo fuera de las Tierras Brunas con su sabiduría y astucia. Sin duda, tendrá su propia opinión al respecto.'","Una audiencia con los Cuan-lûth","'Ven, entremos'.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Esta es una instancia para un solo jugador y no puede completarse en grupo.</rgb>","Cariad desea presentarte a Erlys, la mujer que lidera a este grupo de refugiados dunlendinos.\
\
Te espera frente al Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Cariad te espera frente al Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Tú podrías ser la clave del plan de Cariad."},
[1150]={"Speak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow.","Khôltekh has taken you into his trust, for now. He's asked you to accompany him to his house to speak more about his plans for Umbar.","Speak with Khôltekh about Inîk Jewel-brow","Listen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh","Speak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh.","Speak with Khôltekh about his plans for the Umbar-môkh","Introduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room","Listen to Khôltekh explain his plans for the Umbar-môkh.","Listen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow","Listen to the conversation between Khôltekh and Inîk Jewel-brow.","Introduce yourself to the important-looking dwarf standing in Khôltekh's entry room.","'I intend to purge Umbar Baharbêl of its shadows, wherever they may hide. Will you help me, ${PLAYER}?’","An Audience with the Hall-father","'That went well. I expected much worse. Come with me.'"},
[1151]={"Una prueba","Colmillo Rojo Enjaulado derrotado","El huargo está retenido en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta.\
\
Valtteri, el líder de cazadores lossoth, te ha ordenado derrotar al huargo que su grupo ha capturado para ganarte el derecho a cazar con los Lossoth.","Derrota al Colmillo Rojo Enjaulado","Los ojos del huargo se abren de golpe mientras se alza sobre sus cuatro patas, listo para atacar.","'¿Está muerto? ¿Cómo es posible…? Claro, claro, hablaba en broma cuando dije que el Surmâja sería difícil de derrotar. Hasta un niño podría haber matado a una criatura tan enclenque.'","Los cazadores lossoth de Kauppa-kohta practican sus habilidades de caza con los huargos que capturan.","'¡Ja! Alguien de tu constitución sería ${PLAYERNAME:un gran cazador[m]|una gran cazadora[f]}… ¡el Surmâja jamás atacaría a una presa tan ligera!\
\
'Si algún día esperas cazar con nosotros, llevando nuestros carcajs, deberás demostrar que puedes sostener la mirada de la presa y no huir al primer atisbo de una bestia cruel como un Surmâja. Espero que tus luistin estén en buen estado… ¡cuando despierte a esta bestia, sin duda los pondrás a prueba!\
\
'Mata al Surmâja y ganarás el derecho a cazar con los Lumi-väki.'","Habla con Valtteri","Valtteri se encuentra en la parte norte de Kauppa-kohta, el puesto comercial lossoth.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado al huargo, deberías volver a hablar con Valtteri.","'Veamos si puedes estar a la altura incluso de un Surmâja tan mediocre como este.'"},
[1152]={"Willem Bigotes acepta a regañadientes no hacerle daño a Spalvi... por ahora","Encuentra a un topógrafo Duramano en algún lugar de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y hazte con sus mapas","Willem Bigotes bufa ante tu optimismo, pero a regañadientes agita sus orejas en señal de asentimiento. Ahora deberías volver con Spalvi y ver si ha averiguado algo útil del mapa que recuperaste.","Encuentra a Willem Bigotes en algún lugar del campamento de los Guaredain en la Fisura de Erforgh","Encuentra una de las entradas a la Ciudad de los Trasgos, en las Montañas Nubladas","'Me siento muy mal porque Bingo se haya perdido por mi culpa, ${PLAYER}. Nuestra huida de Gabilazan fue apresurada, y me siento afortunado por no haber tropezado con el mismo terreno inestable que Bingo. Él no tuvo tanta suerte, y sufrió una larga caída. Debe haber una profunda caverna allí abajo, y posiblemente una corriente subterránea.  Creo que oí un chapoteo poco después de que Bingo cayera, pero no estoy seguro del todo.\
\
'Estas cavernas bajo las montañas pueden ser bastante extensas. Skorgrím Duramano encargó a algunos enanos trazar mapas de las cavernas de las Montañas Nubladas. Nunca volvieron de la Ciudad de los Trasgos hasta donde yo sé, pero los encontráramos sus mapas podrían decirnos si hay túeneles que pudieran llevarnos hasta el lugar donde se encuentra Bingo.\
\
'Me reuniré contigo en el Paso Alto del Sur, lejos hacia el este, después de que hayas encontrado algunos mapas útiles del sistema de cuevas subterráneo.'","'Has encontrado al lince de Bingo, y ha regresado en son de paz. ¿Pero por qué me enseña los dientes?' pregunta Spalvi, repentinamente asustado.\
\
Le dices que Willem Bigotes no es la mascota de Bingo, sino más bien su amigo, libre de irse cuando quiera.\
\
'Supongo que debe ser eso, ${PLAYER}, porque de otro modo ya se habría ido hace mucho. ¡Mira este mapa que me has traído! Me temo que tengo noticias tanto malas como buenas.\
\
'Las buenas noticias es que según este mapa, hay un río subterráneo que fluye bajo las montañas y parece viajar una gran distancia hacia el sur. Podría ser que Bingo fuera arrastrado por la corriente a salvo. Las malas noticias, bueno...\
\
'Creo que deberíamos viajar hacia el campamento Barbiluengo en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste de las Montañas Nubladas para las malas noticias. Yo me quedaré fuera del campamento... no les digas que soy un Duramano, ya que temo que mi recepción no sea la mejor.'","Un autor ausente","Has llegado a una de las entradas secundarias de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Bingo Boffin cayó a una profunda cueva durante su huida de Gabilazan, y ahora Spalvi Duramano quiere ayudarte a rescatar al desventurado hobbit.","Le das a Spalvi el mapa y lo estudia brevemente antes de doblarlo de nuevo.\
\
'Lo revisaré más en detalle en un momento, ${PLAYER}, pero primero creo que debes saber esto. ¿cómo decías que se llamaba? ¿Willem algo? Me ha seguido aun a cierta distancia, y no me gusta cómo me miraba. Creo que me culpa por la desaparición de su dueño, y aunque no le falta razón, me preocupa que no entienda del todo que he cambiado de parecer y quiero hacer enmendar mi error.\
\
'Bueno, me siguió durante un rato y luego se alejó corriendo hacia el surete. ¿Crees que ha podido captar el rastro de Bingo? En cualquier caso, los Gauredain viven en la Fisura de Erforgh que se encuentra hacia allí, y no querría que le pasara nada malo.\
\
'¡No antes de que le asegures que soy un amigo, al menos!'","Willem Bigotes ha ido en busca de Bingo a la Fisura de Erforgh, en la esquina suroeste del Paso Alto del Sur, y Spalvi quiere que te asegures de que está bien.","'Skorgrím Duramano envió a un grupo de enanos para cartografiar las cavernas de las Montañas Nubladas. Nunca volvieron de la Ciudad de los Trasgos hasta donde yo sé, pero si encontraras sus mapas podrían decirnos si hay túneles que pudieran llevarnos a donde se encuentra Bingo.\
\
'Me reuniré contigo en el Paso Alto del Sur, lejos hacia el este, después de que hayas encontrado cualquier mapa útil del sistema subterráneo de cuevas.'","Los topógrafos Duramano enviados por Skorgrím Duramano nunca volieron de su misión de cartografiar los túneles de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Si puedes encontrar sus mapas, podrías conocer la distribución de las cavernas bajo las Montañas Nubladas en las que Bingo ha caído.","Willem Bigotes lloriquea lastimeramente, y puedes ver claramente su frustración por la ausencia de Bingo, y que su búsqueda en la Fisura de Erforgh no ha sido fructífera. Le aseguras que no abandonarás al hobbit. Él olfatea ruidosamente, poco convencido.\
\
Le hablas sosegadamente al lince, diciéndole que con tus esfuerzos, los de Spalvi y los suyos, encontraréis la caverna en la que ha caído Bingo y lo traeréis de vuelta.\
\
El lince bufa, pero a regañadientes agita sus orejas en señal de asentimiento. Ahora deberías volver con Spalvi y ver si ha averiguado algo útil del mapa que recuperaste.","'¡Mira este mapa que me has traído! Me temo que tengo noticias tanto malas como buenas.\
\
'Las buenas noticias es que según este mapa, hay un río subterráneo que fluye bajo las montañas y parece viajar una gran distancia hacia el sur. Podría ser que Bingo fuera arrastrado por la corriente a salvo. Las malas noticias, bueno...\
\
'Creo que deberíamos viajar hacia el campamento Barbiluengo en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste de las Montañas Nubladas para las malas noticias. Yo me quedaré fuera del campamento... no les digas que soy un Duramano, ya que temo que mi recepción no sea la mejor.'","Has llegado a la entrada principal de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Spalvi Duramano está en promontorio en la zona del Paso Alto del Sur en las Montañas Nubladas, al noroeste de la Fisura de Erforgh.","'Debes estarte preguntando por qué quise venir al campamento Barbiluengo, ${PLAYER}. Bueno, ya te conté las buenas noticias: que Bingo podría haber sobrevivido a la caída y haber sido arrastrado por la corriente de un río subterráneo. Ahora las malas noticias: si el río corre hacia el sur tanto como indica este mapa, podría haber sido llevado a las profundidades del antiguo reino de Khazad-dûm. Si es así, necesitaríamos buscar la ayuda de los Barbiluengos, ya que he oído rumores de que podrían estar intentando encontrar la entrada a ese lugar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Una nueva búsqueda' (Nivel recomendado: 48)</rgb>","Habla con Spalvi en el exterior del campamento de Glóin en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste","Habla con Spalvi en el Paso Alto del Sur","'Ese lince mascota de Bingo... ¿cómo decías que se llamaba? ¿Willem algo? Me ha seguido aun a cierta distancia, y no me gusta cómo me miraba. Creo que me culpa por la desaparición de su dueño, y aunque no le falta razón, me preocupa que no entienda del todo que he cambiado de parecer y quiero hacer enmendar mi error.\
\
'Bueno, me siguió durante un rato y luego se alejó corriendo hacia el surete. ¿Crees que ha podido captar el rastro de Bingo? En cualquier caso, los Gauredain viven en la Fisura de Erforgh que se encuentra hacia allí, y no querría que le pasara nada malo.'","Lleva el mapa de los túneles de la montaña a Spalvi en el Paso Alto del Sur","'Skorgrím Duramano encargó a algunos enanos trazar mapas de las cavernas de las Montañas Nubladas. Nunca volvieron de la Ciudad de los Trasgos hasta donde yo sé, pero los encontráramos sus mapas podrían decirnos si hay túeneles que pudieran llevarnos hasta el lugar donde se encuentra Bingo.\
\
'Me reuniré contigo en el Paso Alto del Sur, lejos hacia el este, después de que hayas encontrado algunos mapas útiles del sistema de cuevas subterráneo.'","Spalvi Duramano te ha dicho que se reuniría contigo en un promontorio en la zona del Paso Alto del Sur en las Montañas Nubladas una vez que hayas recuperado algunos mapas útiles de los topógrafos perdidos en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","Encuentras un mapa de los túneles de la montaña en el cuerpo del Duramano","Spalvi quería reunirse contigo en el exterior del campamento de Glóin en la zona de la Fuente del Bruinen Oeste de las Montañas Nubladas."},
[1153]={"Defeated Uruk wood-cutters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Quickbeam east of Isengard","'I like you, little ${RACE}. You are willing to raise a weapon to aid the forest, rather than cut it down. Alas, I do not see that we have thinned their numbers much. Hoom.\
\
'I must think upon this. We should not be too hasty, as I am often reminded.'","'Those thrice-accursed burárum, those Orcs, have slain virtually every tree within the Vale of Nan Curunír. Why I knew this one beech -- barely fifty years old mind you -- down by the river that they just... they just....\
\
'No. I shall not disturb you with the terrible details. Let us just say that I am in a mood to tear a few branches off of these burárum and see how they like it.\
\
'Perhaps you might help? Perhaps you would punish the Orcs for me?'","Having watched thousands of his beloved trees felled by the axes of the Uruks, Quickbeam has determined to punish them for their transgressions... but he dares not show himself until his unnamed kindred have decided what to do about Saruman.","Defeat Uruk wood-cutters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Uruk wood-cutters who have destroyed the trees in Nan Curunír can be found in the Vale below.\
\
Quickbeam has asked you to defeat the Uruk wood-cutters who destroyed the trees in Nan Curunír.","'Have you dealt with the Uruk-hai wood-cutters yet?'","Quickbeam is at his home on the north-eastern slopes above Nan Curunír.\
\
You should tell Quickbeam that you have driven away the Uruk wood-cutters for at least a short time.","An Axe to Grind"},
[1154]={"Tham Lumren se halla en el noreste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar a Thalathril en el campamento élfico de Tham Lumren.","¡Este debe de ser el campamento!","Thalathril está cerca de la tienda grande en el campamento élfico.\
\
Deberías hablar con ella.","'¡Daro! ¿Quién osa presentarse con tanta audacia en Tham Lumren?'\
\
Le muestras el informe al guardia.\
\
'Parece que Elladan confía en ti, al igual que Merileg, pero no te quitaremos la vista de encima, ${PLAYERNAME:extranjero[m]|extranjera[f]}. Puedes pasar. Hallarás a Thalathril cerca de la tienda grande'.","Tham Lumren se halla en el noreste del Ángulo.\
\
Merileg te ha pedido que lleves un informe a Tham Lumren, pero el camino está custodiado. Deberías hablar con los guardias para que te permitan entrar.","Habla con el guardia","Busca Tham Lumren","Una travesía hacia el este","Habla con Thalathril","'¿Quién eres? No te reconozco'.\
\
Le entregas el informe y ella lo examina.\
\
'Ya veo. Mentiría si dijera que tu ayuda no es bienvenida en estos momentos. Nos vendrá bien tu ayuda, ${PLAYERNAME:extranjero[m]|extranjera[f]}'.","'Tras leer la nota de Elladan y ver lo que has logrado aquí, estoy dispuesta a confiarte una tarea, si aceptas. Lleva este informe a Thalathril. Se encuentra en Tham Lumren, un campamento en la zona noreste de estas tierras. Tu ayuda me permitirá seguir con mi vigilancia aquí y, al mismo tiempo, proporcionarle la información que necesita. Es muy probable que ella también requiera tu asistencia'.","Aunque el acceso al Ángulo es difícil debido a los ríos que lo rodean, a los elfos de Rivendel les inquieta la creciente presencia de los siervos del Enemigo."},
[1155]={"Recolecta mineral de narfulz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Un brillo inquietante","Lleva el mineral a Svanr","'¡Qué descubrimiento tan impresionante! ¿Y estaba en los pisos destrozados, dices? Algo terrible pasó por aquí y sacudió los mismos cimientos de la tierra, por lo que parece... pero al menos algo bueno salió de eso.'","Has recolectado varias piezas raras de mineral como trofeo de tus aventuras en Nud-melek.","Mineral de narfulz recolectado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El mineral de narfulz se puede encontrar en el borde del abismo en el centro de Nud-melek.\
\
Deberías recolectar mineral de narfulz en Nud-melek.","Has descubierto un mineral altamente inusual en las grietas de Khurjezer, removido por la fuerza que destrozó el puente y los pisos alrededor del abismo.","Desde la oscuridad de la gran grieta en Nud-melek asoma un mineral de brillo inquietante, uno que has oído nombrar como 'Narfulz' por los enanos. Es probable que lo que haya destrozado el puente y los pisos aquí también haya removido el Narfulz.\
\
Sería prudente recolectar este raro mineral mientras estás aquí, ya que puede considerarse un trofeo de gran valor."},
[1156]={"'No es lo mejor que he hecho, ¿eh?\
\
'He oído tanto sobre ello que ahora estoy un poco dudoso de probarlo yo mismo! Bueno, prepararé un nuevo lote!\
\
'Espero que estés dispuesto a darle otra oportunidad pronto, ${PLAYER}.'","El fuerte aroma de la tarta de moras agudiza tus sentidos... ¡y tu apetito!","¿Qué clase de vil ilusión es esta? ¡Un terror repentino te invade y te sientes más alerta!","¿Qué han causado tantas botas descuidadas? ¡Un terror repentino te invade y te sientes más alerta!","Prueba un trago de Fognoggin","Halinard Bonce se encuentra en Wistmead.\
\
Has probado la Fognoggin de Halinard Bonce y la has encontrado bastante potente. Deberías regresar con Halinard Bonce.","La cerveza Fognoggin se puede encontrar en barriles con grifo en Wistmead.\
\
Halinard Bonce ha creado un brebaje casi infame y siempre cambiante conocido como Fognoggin. Deberías probar su receta más reciente.","No estás completamente ${PLAYERNAME:seguro[m]|segura[f]} de que eso fuera café, pero te sientes un poco mejor.","¡Vaya... qué hay en ese brebaje?","Ejercicio, agua fría o un susto repentino podrían ayudar a aliviar los efectos de la Fognoggin. ¿Quién sabe qué más podría ayudar a disiparla?\
\
Has probado la nueva receta de la Fognoggin y deberías intentar encontrar una manera de hacer pasar su potente efecto.","No se siente muy bien, pero hacer algunos saltos parece ayudar.","¡El agua fría y turbia del pantano parece ayudar!","¡Ay! Te das una bofetada en la mejilla, pero te sientes un poco mejor.","Habla con Halinard Bonce","Qué desagradable. Sin embargo, te sientes un poco mejor...","Intenta sacudir los efectos de la cerveza Fognoggin (${CURRENT}/6)","No te sientes muy bien, pero hacer algunas flexiones parece ayudar.","Una niebla inquietante","'¡Oye, ${PLAYER}! ¿Tienes un momento?\
\
'He recibido muchos comentarios sobre mis últimos mezclas de Fognoggin, y creo que finalmente lo he conseguido! Si fueras tan amable, prueba una muestra de mi nuevo y, con suerte, mejorado Fognoggin.\
\
'Una vez que hayas tenido tiempo suficiente para evaluar su sabor complejo, ¡dime qué piensas!\
\
'¡Espero haber conseguido el equilibrio correcto!'","Halinard Bonce ha ideado un brebaje de cerveza terriblemente potente, adecuado para el Festival de la Cosecha, pero sus esfuerzos han dejado a algunos de los asistentes al festival inquietos.","¿Podría ser? ¡El fantasma del fantasma del Viejo Took?!"},
[1158]={"You have delivered the 'egg' to Ezôti.\
\
Report back to Ezôti in the Upper Ward.","'What is it that makes finding good associates so difficult? Take for example one of my previous fellows, a man named Itho. I paid him quite a large sum to fetch me an egg, a single egg! One egg! And I have not had word from him in days. How hard can it be to retrieve a roc's egg?\
\
'I begin to think he ran off with my money, but would he dare? How could he dare such a thing? Now, a lesser man would fall into despair over this betrayal, if that is indeed what it is... but Ezôti is no lesser man, is he? The show must go on, as they say. To that end, I need you to find an egg-shaped rock, paint it to look like a roc's egg, and bring it back here. And no one needs to know! Look for one outside the city, beyond the Gate of Songs in the north, where no one will see what you are up to.'","'This is perfect! This looks exactly like a roc egg!\
\
'At least, I assume it does. I have never seen one myself. But I believe that it must look exactly like this... how could it not?'","Ezôti has asked you to find and paint a rock that looks reasonably like a roc egg.\
\
Search for a suitable rock outside the Gate of Songs in the north-eastern wall of Umbar Baharbêl.","You have delivered the 'egg'!","Pick up the 'egg' outside the north gate of Umbar Baharbêl","You have found the perfect sized rock. Now to paint it so it looks like a roc's egg.\
\
Paint the rock outside the gates of Umbar Baharbêl.","You have painted a rock to look like a roc's egg. It's time to deliver it back to Ezôti.\
\
Deliver the fake roc's egg to Ezôti in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","It looks just like the real thing!","An Egg! A Single Egg! One Egg!","This rock is the perfect size. Now you should paint it to look like an egg","Inspect rocks outside the city beyond the Gate of Songs (${CURRENT}/3)","This rock is too big","Talk to Ezôti","Paint the rock","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","This rock is too small","Inspect rocks outside the city beyond the Gate of Songs (2/3)","You have inspected some rocks that did not fit the requirement.\
\
Inspect one last rock outside the gates of Umbar Baharbêl."},
[1159]={"Has descubierto una empuñadura negra en la bolsa del cinturón de un espectro orco dentro del Tesoro Olvidado.","'¿Qué es esto que tienes aquí? No me gusta la sensación de esta cosa.\
\
'No es una hoja, no fue hecha por enanos... tampoco por Orcos, si mis ojos no me engañan. Esta hoja fue forjada en las forjas más oscuras de la Tierra Media, eso creo. Un Elfo puede saber más, pero no hay tiempo para enviarte por todo el mundo.\
\
'Me aventuraría a decir que esta es una de las hojas de las que se habla que hizo a los espectros lo que son. Si hay otras de estas hojas en Khazad-dûm, deberías tener mucho cuidado de evitarlas, no sea que te encuentres con un destino terrible.'","Donde la hoja debería encontrarse con la empuñadura, solo hay un espacio delgado donde una vez encajó una hoja. Esta empuñadura es pesada y está forjada en un hierro muy oscuro, no hecho por la mano de los enanos.\
\
Quizás Garthar, que se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo, pueda ayudarte a descubrir los medios siniestros por los cuales se hizo este objeto.","Habla con Garthar en el Descenso Profundo","Una hoja vacía","Garthar se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo.\
\
Garthar puede ser capaz de proporcionarte algún conocimiento sobre la extraña empuñadura que encontraste.","'Méfiate de estas armas oscuras, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[1161]={"An Empty Stomach","Baillas is in Fangorn Forest, hoping for news of an injured man who walked by him.\
\
You should find Baillas once more and ask the old Ent for help finding the Rohirrim.","This bush has been recently picked, but the berries look suspiciously inedible...","Search berry-bushes for signs of being picked (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Baillas to ask him for help","The injured man was evidently very hungry and may have been tempted to eat from the questionable berry-bushes surrounding his camp-site.","This food sack is empty... there is not a crumb in sight. It is clear that the injured man has not had access to any food for quite a while.\
\
He may have scrounged for food nearby before abandoning his dangerous little encampment. You should see if there is anything edible-looking nearby.","If the injured man hunted for food, it is likely that he did not look far from the camp.\
\
You should search north-east and south-east of the camp for anything edible the Rohirrim man may have found. It is likely he will still be hungry after his failed attempt at setting up camp.","You explain to Baillas that you have examined several berry-bushes, and many have been picked over recently, but it is unlikely that these berries are edible.\
\
If these have been eaten by the injured man, his situation may be more dire than what the Ent first beheld."},
[1162]={"'I am thankful the others had time to spare to speak with you, and I am sure you can aid them all. Landiach is a trusted advisor of Lord Duinhir and a friend to my family... if he believes you can aid us, I do not doubt him.\
\
'It is true that I have made... mistakes since taking stewardship of Blackroot Vale, but to appear weak or unwise would undo everything Duinhir hoped for me to embody in his stead.'","'These are dangerous times, ${PLAYER}, as I am certain you know well.\
\
'Long has it been since Gondor faced such a conflict, and should we fail now, I doubt there shall be any battle left to fight. Ever since Lord Duinhir, his sons, and our warriors rode east to Minas Tirith, we have stood nearly defenceless. For our own part, we have held the line... but it has not been without cost.\
\
'My guards know well what troubles face the vale, and I would ask that you speak to them. One as skilled as yourself would be a powerful ally, should you wish to aid us.'","Landiach can be found outside Lord Duinhir's home at the peak of Morlad.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","The people of Gondor have long enjoyed peace, but rumblings to the east and along the coast have thrust these people into war once more.","Belegant can be found on the second tier of Morlad by following the path that runs south-west.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","Malthellam can be found near the entrance of Morlad, outside his home.\
\
You have spoken to the guards of Morlad, and should now return to Malthellam.","Talk to Malthellam","'Greetings and well met, traveller. I did not expect any to visit during such times, much less enter the vale through the dark paths. I am Landiach, ward of Lord Duinhir and protector of Lady Rosfin.\
\
'As you have heard, troubles loom to the south and east, and we are too few to move against them. Acting on one would leave us defenceless against the other.\
\
'If you would lend us your might, perhaps we can begin to push back our foes after all. Please tell Malthellam I would have you fight on our behalf.'","Talk to Ecthel","DNT -- will not be seen","'I saw you arrive earlier, traveller, and I knew it only a matter of time before you came to me.\
\
'The old man is a wise advisor, but he is not as well suited to leadership. What few of us remain have held the lands west of the river Blackroot, but our archers have grown weary. Ever since the Orcs sacked Tingobel to the east, our troubles have only grown more dire.\
\
'Belegant seemed pleased by your arrival, so perhaps you should seek him above.'","Talk to Landiach","'Ah, you must be the traveller that arrived today. It is true that the vale faces many problems in recent days... some much more tangible than others.\
\
'Word from the south speaks of something stirring the beasts of the vale, but little else is known. I am unsure if he knows of your arrival, but I am certain Landiach would be pleased to speak with you on these matters as well.\
\
'If you have a moment, I have a more personal request of you.'","An End To Peace","Ecthel can be found near the entrance of Morlad in north-western Blackroot Vale.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to speak to the remaining guards of Morlad in hopes that you will be able to aid them.","Talk to Belegant"},
[1163]={"An End to Lending","Collected Déorun's hammer","'It is said that a farmer is only as effective as his tools, and I am sorely lacking many of the tools which I now require. I have need of many of the tools I have lent to my friends and neighbours, I forsee them being invaluable in the coming days.\
\
'Might you gather up many of the items I have loaned out, and return them to me? In particular, I am seeking my hammer, hay-fork, lantern, and an old bow. Speak to the other crofters around Faldham, and inquire about the items. These tools will be put to good use when the siege begins.'","'Déorun's hammer was loaned to me, but I cannot recall where I have placed it.\
\
'Ah yes, I remember now. I was using it on the barrels by the stable. I must thank Déorun for his generosity.'","Collected Déorun's lantern","Collect Déorun's loaned lantern","Déorun resides at his home at the southern end of Faldham, just oustide the mead hall.\
\
You have collected Déorun's many missing items, and may now return them to the anxious farmer.","'You are aiding Déorun, ${PLAYER}? You have reminded me, I am in possession of Déorun's hunting bow. Might you take it to him?\
\
'I hope he enjoys the improvements to it, the grip is more secure and the limbs should have a good flex to them. I was tuning it by the stables, just outside the mead hall.'","Collect Déorun's loaned hammer","'I would be happy to return Déorun's hay-fork, I appreciate his loaning it to me.\
\
'I last used it at Sahard's stable. If you are looking for it, I would start there.'","Crofter Déorun, has begun arrangements in anticipation for the expected attack on Faldham. In order to protect his home and family, he is in need of several items he has lent to his neighbours over the course of time.","Collected Déorun's hay-fork","Déorun's neighbours can be found within Faldham.\
\
Déorun has need of the items he has lent to the other people living around Faldham, including Haligmar, Enswith, Thurgyr, and Osin.","'Thank you for returning all of my loaned items. My tools will be put to good use when the time is right, and the assailants will learn the folly of underestimating a prepared crofter!'","Collected Déorun's bow","'Speaking with my neighbours may help you to track the loaned items. In particular, I would recommend speaking to Haligmar, Thurgyr, Osin, and Enswith. You should find them all about Faldham, busy with their own tasks.'","'Déorun loaned my husband his lantern, as a favour. You are more than welcome to take it, I last saw it laying near the windmill.'","Return the items to Déorun","Collect Déorun's loaned hay-fork","Collect Déorun's loaned hunting bow"},
[1164]={"Lleva las figurillas de madera de Tim Rastrojal a Tongannel","Has encontrado lo que queda de Tim Rastrojal, víctima de los Gauredain","'Gracias por esto, ${PLAYER}. Me alegra que hayas recuperado las figurillas de Tim Rastrojal de manos de los Gauredain, aunque hubiera querido que pudieras salvarlo de su cruel destino.'","Figurillas de madera recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Siguiendo la petición de Tongannel, viajaste hacia el sur en dirección a la Cresta de Acebeda, buscando al artesano Tim Rastrojal. Encontraste su carro destruido, una caja rota y vacía, y otros indicios de que fue atacado.","Rescata a Tim Rastrojal y recupera sus bienes","El Fin de la Empresa","Deberías buscar el campamento gauredain y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si aún vive, y recuperar sus bienes","Tongannel está en Echad Candelleth, el campamento élfico en Tâl Bruinen, al norte de Echad Gauradan.\
\
Has recuperado las figurillas de madera de Tim Rastrojal de los Gauredain que las robaron, pero Rastrojal fue asesinado. Deberías devolver los bienes a Tongannel.","Los Gauredain tienen su guarida en las colinas del suroeste de Tâl Bruinen, al sur de Eryn Singor.\
\
Por los restos, parece que los misteriosos Gauredain de los que habló Nestael cuando llegaste por primera vez a Echad Candelleth podrían ser responsables del ataque. Deberías buscar su campamento y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si aún vive, y recuperar sus bienes.","'¿Qué fue de Tim Rastrojal?'","Los Gauredain tienen su guarida en las colinas del suroeste de Tâl Bruinen, al sur de Eryn Singor.\
\
Por los restos, parece que los misteriosos Gauredain de los que habló Nestael cuando llegaste por primera vez a Echad Candelleth podrían ser responsables del ataque. Deberías buscar su campamento y rescatar a Tim Rastrojal, si lo han tomado prisionero, y recuperar sus bienes.","Recoge figurillas de madera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra a Tim Rastrojal"},
[1165]={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier encargo de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lothlórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","Habla con Glordirith en Imlad Lalaith","'Gracias por traerme noticias sobre Asmund, ${PLAYER}. Has hecho bien en poner sus acciones en mi conocimiento.\
\
'A partir de ahora vigilaremos de cerca a cualquiera que tenga tratos con Asmund el Cazador furtivo. Debes ser elogiado por tu servicio en defensa de los bosques de Lórien.'","'Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, ${PLAYER}, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin. ¡Háblale de las actividades de Asmund e ignora cualquier petición que ese enano te haya hecho!'","'No sé de qué hablasteis, pero mi corazón me dice que mi pueblo tiene razón al no permitir que Asmund cruce las fronteras de Lórien.\
\
'Te lo suplico, ${PLAYER}: no traiciones la confianza de mi pueblo. Sea lo que sea lo que Asmund te haya pedido, ignóralo. Ve en su lugar a Glordirith, amigo mío y protector de todo lo que habita en el Bosque de Oro. Celeborn le ha confiado este deber, y si le cuentas lo que Asmund te pidió, sé que serás recompensado.\
\
'Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.'"},
[1166]={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","Habla con Glordirith en Imlad Lalaith","'Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, ${PLAYER}, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin. ¡Cuéntale las actividades de Asmund e ignora cualquier petición que ese enano te haya hecho!'","'Gracias por traerme noticias sobre Asmund, ${PLAYER}. Has hecho bien en informarme de sus acciones, aunque sospecho que podrías haberlo hecho antes.\
\
A partir de ahora vigilaremos de cerca a cualquiera que tenga tratos con Asmund el Cazador furtivo. Tu servicio en defensa de los bosques de Lórien es digno de elogio, y tengo una pequeña recompensa para ti.'","'¿De qué hablaste con Asmund, ${PLAYER}? Me preocupan tus tratos con él; tiene una reputación poco recomendable.\
\
'Te lo suplico, ${PLAYER}: ignora cualquier encargo que te haya hecho y, en su lugar, informa de sus actividades a Glordirith, amigo mío y protector de todo cuanto habita en el Bosque de Oro. Celeborn le ha confiado esta tarea, y si le cuentas lo que Asmund te pidió, sé que serás recompensado.\
\
'Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.'","Glordirith está en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lothlórien."},
[1167]={"Al ayudar a Asmund, no has cumplido la petición de Limhendeth.","Limhendeth te ha suplicado que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que en su lugar informes de sus actividades a Glordirith en Lórien.","El fin de la caza furtiva","'${PLAYER}, te lo suplico: ¡no hagas lo que Asmund te ha pedido! Tiene mala reputación, y nada bueno saldrá de la tarea que te ha encomendado.\
\
Habla en su lugar con Glordirith, amigo mío y protector de todo lo que habita en el Bosque de Oro. Celeborn le ha confiado este deber, y si le cuentas lo que Asmund te pidió, sé que serás recompensado.\
\
Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.'","'Más vale tarde que nunca, ${PLAYER}. Asmund el Cazador furtivo y sus agentes ya no dañarán a los animales protegidos de Lórien; vigilaremos de cerca a sus asociados.\
\
Aun así recibirás una recompensa, aunque me cuesta perdonar lo tardío de tu mensaje.'","'Habla con Glordirith sobre tus tratos con Asmund, ${PLAYER}. Asmund tiene una reputación poco recomendable, pero aún estás a tiempo de evitar compartir su destino.\
\
Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin. No es demasiado tarde, ${PLAYER}.'","Glordirith se encuentra en el sureste de Lothlórien, en Imlad Lalaith en Egladil, a orillas del Anduin.\
\
Limhendeth te ha pedido que ignores cualquier petición de Asmund y que informes de sus actividades a Glordirith."},
[1168]={"Return the trophy to Caddabrand","Defeat Âmbal and collect a trophy from her","An End to Âmbal","Defeated Âmbal and collected a trophy from her","Âmbal's den can be found west of Caddbrand's camp.\
\
Caddabrand is hoping that by defeating the infamous matron, Âmbal, that you might gain fame and fortune, along with Caddabrand.","Caddabrand's camp lies to the east of Âmbal's den.\
\
Caddabrand awaits your return with the trophy at his camp.","'In order to truly make a name for yourself, you will need to go after a much more noteworthy kill... and I just happen to know of such prey: Âmbal the Wolf-mother. I have tracked her trail to the warrens west of here, but I will leave the rest to you.\
\
'Âmbal and her offspring have terrorized farmers and lone travellers for years. Were you to defeat her, you would surely gain recognition even among the nobles of Cliving.\
\
'Just by chance, I know someone who would pay dearly to have Âmbal mounted above his fireplace. Please bring back her head as a trophy... undamaged, if it is not much trouble.'","'This is a remarkable trophy! Your work speaks for itself, and you are indeed worthy of my trust. When I deliver this to my charitable associates, I shall proudly exclaim how the terror Âmbal was bravely bested by ${PLAYER}, Caddabrand's apprentice!\
\
'I am happy to give you this reward for the small part you played in removing this foe to many.'","Caddabrand has tracked a notorious wolf-matron to her den. He believes that taking a trophy from the beast will increase both profit and notoriety for the ones to complete the task."},
[1169]={"'Milonnen and my guards have spoken of strange happenings in Ost Anglebed, but I have yet to see any of them with my own eyes.\
\
'Still, I do not doubt the truth to their words, and I would ask that you investigate this further, ${PLAYER}. They have spoken of ill-crafted weaponry and fragile defences about town, but I am certain more troubles have visited Ost Anglebed since this morn.\
\
'Search thoroughly, and tell me of what you find.'","An Enemy Within","You have found a weapon rack stocked with only a few blunted blades...","Search Ost Anglebed for signs of treachery (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Nimithil can be found in the lowest section of Ost Anglebed with her guards.\
\
You have found a few pieces of concerning evidence in Ost Anglebed, and should return to Nimithil.","Ost Anglebed can be found in north-central Lebennin.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to search Ost Anglebed for signs of treachery from within the guard.","Talk to Nimithil","After hearing of many strange occurrences within Ost Anglebed from her guards, Nimithil has need of a discerning eye.","This barricade has been burned despite no attacks being made against Ost Anglebed...","'This is most disturbing, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'Someone in Ost Anglebed must be behind this, but who... I cannot be certain. We must soon speak to the Steward of this matter.'","The logs near the beacon of Anglebed have been doused..."},
[1170]={"An Ent in Search of Entwives","Return the Ent-draught to Gnarlstump","Pour the Ent-draught upon the ruined gardens of the Entwives","Gnarlstump, an Ent of Fangorn, has come to the desolation that was once the gardens of the Entwives, seeking signs which might point at the direction of their long-ago departure from the Brown Lands.","'Alas, nothing happened when you poured the draught upon the gardens? Hoom! That is disappointing. It means that the gardens are truly lost.\
\
'But wait, you say that you saw a flower among the desolation? That is something....'","'Hello there, Little One. My old eyes are not what they once were, hoom, but in these barren places, even I can see that you are not a creature to be feared. You may call me Norndos, or perhaps Gnarlstump, if it is easier for you. Ta-rum! I will not tell you my right name, and I do not expect yours.\
\
'I have come to this place because here were once the gardens of the Entwives. The land was ruined long ago, hom, and the gardens were lost. The Entwives went forth from this place, hoom-hom, never to be seen again. I desire to find the Entwives, if any still remain, and hope to find some sign of their passing.\
\
'Would you aid me? Take this Ent-draught and pour it upon the desolation of the gardens...if anything grows there, ta-run, it may help to identify who the gardens belonged to.'","The gardens of the Entwives lie within the cliffs to the south-east of Gnarlstump.\
\
Gnarlstump gave you an Ent-draught and asked you to pour it upon the ruined gardens of the Entwives.","Nothing happens when you pour the Ent-draught, but you do see a large, white flower growing in the garden","Nothing happens when you pour the Ent-draught","'Hoom-hom, make certain to pour the Ent-draught throughout the gardens.'","This looks like a good place to pour the Ent-draught","Gnarlstump is encamped to the north-west of the gardens of the Entwives.\
\
You should let Gnarlstump know what you did and did not discover among the gardens.","'Did you discover any sign which might help me?'","This would be a good place to pour the Ent-draught"},
[1171]={"Baradal suddenly stops and leaves the road","The village of Arhaim lies along the road in Duskenvale.\
\
You should travel to Duskenvale.","Travel south with Baradal","Continue to Arhaim","Baradal is standing by at the Beorning Watchpost between Duskenvale and the Gladden Fields.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","An Errand for Arwen","'I can see why you are so renowned, ${PLAYER}. Those Orcs stood little chance against you. Let us tarry no longer; the village of Arhaim should be near.'","Baradal has asked to travel with you to the village of Arhaim.\
\
You should take the road south with Baradal.","'Hail, traveller, might I ask.... Hold a moment. Are you ${PLAYER}? I am Baradal, house-carle to Lady Arwen. She has mentioned you many times, and it is good fortune to meet thus on the road. You are known to be a great friend to her family.\
\
'I am here at the behest of Lord Elrond. The wedding party will pass this way soon, and I am to make the way clear for Lady Arwen. She wishes to visit a location nearby, where her mother was taken by Orcs before she sailed to the Undying Lands. It is a delicate subject, but I feel you have earned the trust of Arwen's family.\
\
'Would you honour me by travelling by my side on this errand? I will explain more as we travel to the village south of here.'","Defeat Orc ambushers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcs lie in wait along the road to Arhaim.\
\
You should defeat the Orc ambushers.","Baradal has suddenly stopped along the road to Arhaim.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Talk to Baradal","'Come, let us travel together to the village of Arhaim, to the south. We have much to discuss along the way.'","Defeated Orc ambushers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have found Arhaim","Talk to Baradal to begin the journey","You can call Baradal to your side with Baradal's summoning horn.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","'This must be Arhaim. It is quite... primitive compared to the cities of the Eldar. The cities of Men are not all like this, correct? I am afraid I have little frame of reference. Most of my travelling has been between Imladris and Caras Galadhon with Lady Arwen, and not by this road.'\
\
You realize from her words that Baradal might be quite young for an Elf. You describe some of the grander cities of Men, including Minas Tirith and Edoras, that you have visited in your travels.\
\
'I see. I will travel to Minas Tirith myself in the coming days. I am looking forward to it. On to the task at hand. We need to speak to the Woodfolk here if we are to find where Lady Celebrían was taken. Let us hope they are open to speaking with outsiders.'","Baradal, house-carle to Lady Arwen, has been assigned a task in the wilds of Duskenvale. As you are a good friend of Arwen's family, she has asked for your assistance.","'Do you hear that, ${PLAYER}? The heavy breathing and scuffling feet of Orcs. I believe they lie in wait on the road just ahead, prepared to waylay any passersby. Unfortunately for them, today we are the ones passing by, and they will learn it to their sorrow! Let us hit them from the side, where they will not expect it.'\
\
She stretches and shakes her arms, warming them up for combat.\
\
'Ready when you are, friend.'"},
[1172]={"Find Golvorn","'Interesting. It seems that my servants have not been thorough enough in securing the slaves of late.\
\
'No matter, you have already saved me the trouble of sending them to hunt you down. But wait, you do not have the bearing of one who seeks escape. You have come to fight... me?\
\
'Truly? Well then, I imagine you will make a fine specimen for Saruman's experiments. I shall have to take care not to injure you too severely!'","Golvorn's captives are in the Orc-mines.\
\
You have defeated Golvorn, a strange and powerful Man who claims to have served Saruman in some fashion. What fate he intended for the slaves he took is unknown, but you can at least free them now.","An Evil Fate","Talk to Edhere in the Orc-mines","More slaves have disappeared of late. It seems that some mysterious Man has come through the deeper tunnels, and each time takes a few of the hardier slaves away with him. To what fate, no one can tell, but given the laughter of the Orcs and their deference to this figure, it must be an evil one, indeed.","Edhere is in the Orc-mines.\
\
You should return to Edhere and let him know that Golvorn's captives have been freed.","You have defeated Golvorn","'Good. I do not know whether they have escaped the cave or gone into hiding awaiting our own attempt, but either way we are now ready to make our escape.\
\
'We will talk with them later and see if we can determine what this Golvorn was up to, and whether he was truly in league with the Wizard Saruman.'","Release Golvorn's captives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Released Golvorn's captives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The missing prisoners and the Man who took them might be found somewhere in the Orc-mines.\
\
Edhere asked you to seek his missing companions and the Man who took them.","'There is something strange here, ${PLAYER}. While you were gone, one of my men and a few of the Dunlendings were taken away... not by the Orcs, but by a Man.\
\
'He wore strange raiments, marking him as a person of some station, but I do not know whom he served. He was looking for the strongest and healthiest of the men among us. For what purpose, I do not know.\
\
'They were taken away to the north, and the Orcs laughed cruelly as they left. You must find out where they were taken... and what fate could possibly be worse than to die in this dark pit.'","The prisoner seems to slip in and out of a daze as you cut him free, but he quickly recovers his senses once the bonds are removed."},
[1174]={"Gorgar's orders are often carried by Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.\
\
Sigvith has asked you to collect orders from the Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","An Excess of Orders","Deliver the orders to Sigvith","Collected Gorgar's orders from Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sigvith can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have collected a number of orders from the Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should deliver them to Sigvith.","The Orcs of Gundabad often carry orders on behalf of Gorgar the Ruthless and his lieutenants, but with many orders come many contradictions.","'${PLAYER}, is it? I am sorry to have kept Commander Glóin waiting, but what I have found here makes no sense to me!\
\
'I've been able to slip a few Orcs' orders away from them when they weren't looking, but they cannot all be written by Gorgar. There are contradictions throughout them... duplicate watches, vulnerable deployments, and unforced retreats. I do not know what to make of it!\
\
'Perhaps if you could collect some orders a bit more directly, we'd be able to figure out what Gorgar is up to!'","'Ah, good! Let me have a look at those....'\
\
Sigvith sifts through the orders you've collected a few times and then lets out a long sigh.\
\
'I'm afraid I'm no closer to understanding what Gorgar has planned than I was when I set out. There are too many contradictions, but maybe that's what Gorgar wants! If he's got something planned, what better way to keep us from discovering his plans?\
\
'Perhaps Commander Glóin can make some sense of these!'","Collect Gorgar's orders from Orcs at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1176]={"An Expected Delivery","Collect the weapon crate","The Hammerstead weapons have been crated and are ready for delivery.\
\
You should collect the weapon crate.","'This is all that is left after the Easterling attack? Lord Náin must act soon, before we are overwhelmed by these curs. Thank you for your assistance in this matter, ${PLAYER}.'","The weapons are ready to be taken to Járnfast","Talk to Hógur","Hógur is expecting this weapon shipment in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Hógur.","Although many weapons were stolen by the Easterlings, Grámi Hornhelm has asked you to deliver what weapons they can spare to Járnfast.","'Since you are heading to Járnfast, please take this crate of weapons with you. They were expecting a much larger convoy, but all we have to spare now are the ones you successfully recovered from the Easterlings. And of course, the dagger you smithed yourself. It will have to do. Bring them to Hógur, one of Lord Náin's advisors.'"},
[1177]={"'Has asestado un golpe mortal a los Ordâkhai aquí. ¡Rápido, debemos regresar a Urmâkh para difundir la noticia de tu triunfo!'","Destruye las máquinas de asedio y derrota a los Ordâkhai.","Destruye las maquinas de asedio Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Máquinas de asedio Ordâkhai destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Makóto Dôlo lanza un desafío, provocándote para que lo enfrentes en combate","Derrotaste a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra y derrota a Makóto Dôlo.","Los Ordâkhai en Ghât Lor están construyendo máquinas de asedio para hacer la guerra contra la Reina Mizâdi y el Renovado Hamât. Destruye las máquinas de asedio y derrota a cualquier Ordâkhai que se mueva contra ti.","Un asalto explosivo","Derrota a Makóto Dôlo","Encuentra y derrota a Makóto Dôlo"},
[1178]={"An Explosive Job","'Look, Hermáth! Mekhnet has returned to us! She said she's ready to be back on the field, but I told her she needed some rest first. She had to make her way up to us, after all!\
\
'Yes, I know I was supposed to be resting too, but I couldn't! I didn't want to see anyone get hurt again, and my anxiety kept me alert. But now... I can rest easier knowing the Orcs won't have as many bombs on-hand.'","'While you were gone, I discovered that the bombs' alchemical mixture uses bat droppings. The Orcs of Târ-kútoz have bats under their command... perhaps Thraunákh is closer than we thought.\
\
'For now, however -- the Orcs hide caches of bombs in the unclaimed territory to the west, between Ashmargathâl and Târ-kútoz. There are already scouts out looking for the caches. I tried to join them, but they told me to stay back here and rest....\
\
'Could you go in my stead? I trust that you're keen of eye and steady of hand. Dismantle and destroy any caches you come across.'","The Orcs hide bomb caches in the area between Ashmargathâl and Târ-kútoz.\
\
Lúka has requested that you safely destroy any caches you find.","Destroy bomb caches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Lúka","With the sapper-bomb's alchemical formula broken, it's time to destroy the Orcs' bomb caches.","Destroyed bomb caches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have scoured the area and destroyed all the bomb caches you could find.\
\
You should return to Ashmargathâl and give Lúka the update."},
[1179]={"'Estoy viajando al sur hacia las Montañas Blancas para ver los salones enanos allí, pero alguien en el camino me dijo que las rocas de este lugar tienen un brillo rojizo, y me hizo pensar en las Colinas de Hierro. Pensé que las vería por mí mismo, y si hay mineral valioso que encontrar aquí, quizás retrase mi viaje al sur y me quede un tiempo.\
\
'¡Si te reúnes conmigo al oeste del pueblo, apreciaría tanto la compañía como la ayuda!'","'¿Me ayudarás a recoger trozos de roca roja para estudiarlos más de cerca?'","Trozos de roca roja recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Sí, estas rocas tienen sin duda un brillo rojizo! Pero el verdadero valor está en su interior, lo garantizo.\
\
'¿Me ayudarás a recoger trozos de roca roja para estudiarlos más de cerca?'","'¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un viajero[m]|una viajera[f]}, como yo? Interesante.\
\
'Estoy viajando al sur hacia las Montañas Blancas para ver los salones enanos allí, pero alguien en el camino me dijo que las rocas de este lugar tienen un brillo rojizo, y me hizo pensar en las Colinas de Hierro. Pensé que las vería por mí mismo, y si hay mineral valioso que encontrar aquí, quizás retrase mi viaje al sur y me quede un tiempo.\
\
'¡Si te reúnes conmigo al oeste del pueblo, apreciaría tanto la compañía como la ayuda!'","Ojo para ese tipo de cosas","Habla con Gangur Lejavía al oeste del pueblo de Herne","'¡Ah, sí, estas rocas son notables! Ahora bien, todas estaban bastante cerca de la superficie, y la acción del viento y la lluvia hizo que se desprendieran de los peñascos más grandes. ¡Bien podría haber mineral valioso enterrado un poco más profundo!\
\
'Puede que tenga que quedarme aquí en Páramo Rojizo un poco más de tiempo, después de todo. Mi viaje tendrá que esperar, aunque el pueblo de Herne parece sombrío y lúgubre. ¿Por qué los materiales más valiosos nunca se encuentran en lugares alegres?\
\
'Me has ayudado, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¡Acepta esta recompensa y mi agradecimiento!'","Se pueden encontrar trozos de roca roja entre los afloramientos escarpados al oeste del pueblo de Herne.","Gangur Lejavía está esperando al oeste de Herne para que le muestres los trozos de roca que has recogido.","Gangur Lejavía se ha detenido en Herne solo por poco tiempo, pero si las rocas son interesantes podría convencerse de quedarse más tiempo.","Lleva los trozos de roca roja a Gangur Lejavía al oeste de Herne","Gangur Lejavía te pidió reunirte con él al oeste del pueblo de Herne, donde deseaba estudiar algunas de las curiosas rocas rojas que se encuentran allí.","Recoge trozos de roca roja al oeste de Herne (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1180]={"Summon and confront the Haradrim Captain of Lang Boha","Collected weapons of the enemy (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aras can be found just north of the Haradrim camp, Lang Boha.\
\
You should speak with Aras.","The Haradrim Captain steps out from the back of the room and beckons you to speak with him","Burn the provision tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Eye of Dolgimil has been defeated","The Captain of the Haradrim camp can be found in Lang Boha.\
\
Find and confront the Haradrim Captain.","Burned a provision tent (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Erchar can return to Linhir now or wait for me. I always respect his decision. At this time, I choose my own path.\
\
'We must remove the power behind the Corsair threat in Dor-en-Ernil before returning to Linhir. Aras has gone to scout the land east of our camp. Meet him on the northern border of Lang Boha. There you should find the leader of the one who killed many of my men. These were good people, ${PLAYER}. Avenge them as you would avenge your own kin.\
\
'May those who oppose you be blinded by your strength.'","Aras sends you into Lang Boha to decimate the Corsairs forces","'He called himself the Eye of Dolgimil? I fear then this Dolgimil is the true threat we seek. Perhaps we can look elsewhere for clues to Dolgimil's whereabouts.'","'${PLAYER}, I am glad to see you unharmed. There are enemies on patrol everywhere. I have scouted Lang Boha. I shall recount what I have seen....\
\
'There are four tents in the camp that are used for food storage. Burning them will indeed set them back on provisions.\
\
'The enemy has many weapons. Take the weapons from those you defeat and return to me with them. I shall dispose of them in the waters. The rusted weapons will be of no use to the Corsair forces. Take care to avoid the Half-trolls though, they will not part with their swords so easily.\
\
'Lastly, the one who led the ambush against Erchar and Herion is indeed the captain of this camp. I warn you though. He is a powerful man. Do not fall for his tricks!'","Herion sends you to the Haradrim camp, Lang Boha, to hinder the destructive powers of the Corsair forces.","Collect weapons of the enemy (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You dare try to destroy these forces? The flames only make me stronger.\
\
'All of Gondor will burn before we are victorious. Best that you run away before you meet a fate worse than death.\
\
'For I am the Eye of Dolgimil. Blinding me is but a scratch on his face!'","Speak with Aras at Lang Boha","Lang Boha can be found on the eastern shores of Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Enter Lang Boha and hinder the Corsair forces.","An Eye for an Eye"},
[1181]={"'You are here to help? Good. I trust Mansig, of course, but he did lead us into an ambush. He is my captain, and I will not forget it, but I have seen more of war than he has. He may have underestimated the Orc-threat here in the East Wall, but I will not.\
\
'I am something of an expert on Orcs and have fought some hundred of the creatures. They come in all shapes and sizes, and the sharp eye can distinguish other differences as well. To many of my people an Orc is an Orc, but I can see even the subtle differences.\
\
'I think we are dealing with several distinct tribes, ${PLAYER}. Defeat Orcs and Uruks in the woods of the East Wall and collect arrows from their quivers. By studying them, I can determine what tribes we are dealing with here in the East Wall.'","'Let me see the arrows that you have collected. Ah, yes, this is what I suspected.'\
\
Wilferth holds out a pair of the short arrows for you to inspect.\
\
'The length of the shaft is a clue to its origin. This arrow was designed to fly a short distance fairly accurately. It is of the type used by Orcs of Mordor and is primarily a skirmisher's arrow. It is well-suited to combat among the trees of the East Wall and would be less of a threat upon the plains of Rohan. The danger of the Orc that fires this arrow is the danger of surprise. If you know he is there, he will be less effective.'\
\
Wilferth presents to you a pair of much longer arrows.\
\
'These are more troubling. The length of the arrow tells me it is to be used with a much larger bow, drawn by a stronger arm. The Uruk that fires this arrow expects it to travel much further than those fired by his Orc-brothers. This is an arrow ideal for combat on the plains of my homeland, and I fear it was designed for that purpose.\
\
'The Orcs and Uruks in the East Wall are equipped for different purposes, ${PLAYER}. They possess different goals, but I can tell you one thing they share at least: they hate us and are all our enemies.'","Wilferth considers himself something of an expert on Orcs and thinks he knows something about the Orcs in the East Wall.","'¿No tienes nada para mí?'","Collected long arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Orcs and Uruks carry quivers of arrows. Even those who fight with their hands carry them, if not for their use then to resupply their archer brethren. Defeat these creatures throughout the East Wall and bring me some of their arrows for study.'","Defeat Orcs in the East Wall and collect short arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Uruks in the East Wall and collect long arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the arrows to Wilferth for inspection","An Eye for the Foe","Orcs and Uruks can be found throughout the East Wall, and even the warriors carry quivers of arrows.\
\
Wilferth has asked you to defeat Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall and to collect arrows from them for him to study.","Wilferth is at the Rohirrim-camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have collected several arrows from the Orcs and Uruks in the East Wall and should bring them to Wilferth for study.","Collected short arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1182]={"'Viste las marcas que dejó el rayo en las piedras rúnicas, ${PLAYER}; no puedo explicarlas, salvo decir que las palabras que usamos para describir ciertos sucesos, y las runas que usamos para describir esas palabras, no surgieron por accidente.\
\
'Hay poder incluso en la más pequeña de las palabras; un poder como el que contemplaste entre las nubes de la tormenta en la cima de Amon Sûl.\
\
'En el futuro serás más hábil para manejar este poder, ${PLAYER}. De hecho, ya eres mejor en ello, aunque quizás aún no te hayas dado cuenta.'","'¿Estás ${PLAYER:listo[m]|lista[f]} para mi lección, ${PLAYER}? Viajaremos al Amon Sûl y esperaremos a que surja una tormenta. Mi lección te espera en la cima.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión individual y no puede completarse con una Comunidad.</rgb>","'Las palabras tienen poder, ${PLAYER}. Nunca debes olvidarlo.'","Un Ojo en la Tormenta","'Una sola runa puede decir mucho.'","Habla con Techeryn y viaja a Amon Sûl para recibir su lección","Techeryn está fuera de la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
La Maestra Rúnica Techeryn ha accedido a revelar más misterios de las runas y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Techeryn está en la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Tu experiencia en Amon Sûl con Techeryn te ha enseñado más sobre la interacción entre las runas y el mundo natural. La Elfa espera hablar contigo sobre lo sucedido.","Para demostrar que eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Maestro Rúnico instruido[m]|una Maestra Rúnica instruida[f]} y capaz, debes disipar ciertos misterios del lenguaje y de la naturaleza.","Techeryn suele encontrarse fuera de la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Se te ha indicado hablar con Techeryn, una Elfa que puede darte mayor entendimiento sobre la relación entre runas y el mundo natural.","'Una Elfa llamada Techeryn viaja a veces a la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias. Ella podrá instruirte más acerca de la conexión entre las runas y el mundo natural.'","'Has dado tus primeros pasos en el largo camino de comprender el poder de las runas y el lenguaje, ${PLAYER}, pero los próximos no serán tan sencillos. Las runas pueden describir acciones y sucesos en el mundo y en la naturaleza, pero la naturaleza también puede afectar las palabras que la describen.\
\
'Una Elfa llamada Techeryn viaja a veces a la Posada Abandonada, en el borde occidental de las Tierras Solitarias. Ella podrá instruirte más acerca de la conexión entre estas cosas.'","'Puedo enseñarte más sobre la relación entre las runas y el mundo natural, ${PLAYER}, pero puede que no sea una lección sencilla.\
\
'Considera la furia de una tormenta en las montañas: arde y se agita, llena de ira. Ahora piensa en la runa que describe la tormenta. ¿Captura verdaderamente el significado de la tormenta? ¿Su enojo, o su movimiento?\
\
'Deja que la tormenta inscriba su poder en las runas que la describen, . Debes venir conmigo si deseas aprender esta lección. Háblame cuando estés ${PLAYER:listo[m]|lista[f]}.'","Habla con Techeryn en La Posada Abandonada"},
[1183]={"Patrol the fourth point in southern Gathbúrz","Handelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Handelen with the report of your patrol.","An Eye on the Enemy","Talk to Handelen at Thangúlhad","The first point is east of Thangúlhad. The second point is directly to the south-east of Thangúlhad. The third point is further south-east, near the gate of Dol Guldur. The fourth point is directly south of Thangúlhad.\
\
You should scout the waypoints of the patrol that Handelen has asked you to undertake and defeat any enemies that you might find there.","Handelen has informed you of Orc-patrols which wander throughout the southern reaches of Gathbúrz.","Patrol the first point in southern Gathbúrz","'There is still not much out there, I trust? So long as that road remains under our watch, the forces of Dol Guldur cannot mount an assault against us at Emyn Lûm, where the centre of our strength resides.'","'Our survival here depends upon performing routine patrols to sight the approach of the Enemy.'","Patrol the third point in southern Gathbúrz","Patrol the second point in southern Gathbúrz","You have scouted this area","'Are you willing to patrol southern Gathbúrz, ${PLAYER}? I know it looks pretty barren out here, but that is the main approach to the gate of Dol Guldur, and if a significant enemy force should slip by us, there we may pay dearly for it.\
\
'We must remain alert for any movement by the enemy. Return to me with your report when you have completed your patrol.'"},
[1184]={"Find the hidden store-room","The travelling merchant Labóni has lost a precious family heirloom to the ruffians of Umbar.","This is an exquisite pendant!","Labóni has asked you to investigate The Eastern Stores and retrieve his family heirloom.\
\
The Eastern Stores can be found on the east side of the Lower Ward in the Cistern.","You have found the Eastern Stores. The family heirloom must be hidden within.","'Ah there it is!\
\
'The raindrop is a priceless heirloom that our family has kept for generations. We come from a long line of merchants, and this raindrop was the first piece of jewellery ever purchased with our family's fortune.\
\
'I thank you from the bottom of my heart for returning such a precious artifact to me!'","You found The Eastern Stores and have obtained Khatrâxi, the Raindrop. You should return to Labóni.","This entrance is heavily guarded","'Please, if you have a moment!\
\
'I came here seeking a new venture, and while business has been somewhat doing well, I have lost something very precious!\
\
'It is something that is quite priceless: a family heirloom. Certainly it is not part of any merchandise I would be selling.\
\
'I have asked around and apparently the Corsairs keep their valuables in a place called the Eastern Stores, but this does not seem to be a place open for the public. It is not very heavily advertised....\
\
'I have managed to secure a lead, however. The entrance to this store-house should be on the eastern side of the Lower Ward, in the Cistern.'","An Heirloom Lost","Talk to Labóni","Find Khatrâxi, the Raindrop"},
[1185]={"Ilzhâna can be found at Tilmakhím on the western side of Tâkhdar.\
\
Return to Ilzhâna with news of your exploits.","Smugglers defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'So you return! Then you encountered no trouble persuading those brigands to depart? No, no, I do not recall asking you to slay any such fine business folk. But if you did, it cannot be helped, ah ha! How truly terrible such ruffians assaulted you, leaving you no choice but to fight back and end their own business ventures.\
\
'You are too good to this honest trader. Too good indeed! Take this with my eternal gratitude.'","Speak to Ilzhâna","An Honest Trade","'My honest and most helpful friend, might you lend a hand once again? Trade flows like heady wine now that you have returned my stolen crates! My good business, however, has attracted covetous gazes. You have no doubt seen ruffians and smugglers about. They are no business contacts or rivals of mine, I assure you! Certainly no friends of mine, nor yours! If you were to rid Tâkhdar of some small number, I am sure no one would miss them.'","'Have you convinced any of those smugglers to leave Tâkhdar, my favourite future customer? I am certain no harm shall befall you, what with those shiny weapons you bear!'","Defeat smugglers in Tâkhdar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ilzhâna, a cheerful but suspicious trader of unknown wares, has asked you to thin the number of smugglers, who she insists are not business rivals.","Smugglers can be found throughout Tâkhdar.\
\
Ilzhâna has asked you to thin the number of smugglers stalking Tâkhdar and interfering in her trade. She insists it's for the safety of the cellars, not because they are business rivals."},
[1186]={"Rhuwalhan Brehur is at his home in Upper Barnavon.\
\
Eres has asked you to speak with Rhuwalhan Brehur and convince him to release the hostages he took to force the men of the Boar-clan to work the mine.","Talk to Rhuwalhan at his home in Barnavon","Eres is in Lower Barnavon.\
\
You should return to Eres with news of Rhuwalhan's refusal and defeat.","'Please, duvodiad, if Gwilum thinks you may be able to help us, hear me out! Many of our folk have been taken by Rhuwalhan Brehur and held captive to force our men to labour in the mine... my own daughter among them!\
\
'If you would, go to Rhuwalhan Brehur's home in Upper Barnavon and parley with him. Perhaps if you tell him that the men are still working the mine, he will let the captives go.\
\
'Will you do this?'","An Honourable Exchange","The Ox-clan of Barnavon, allied with Saruman the White, holds the remnant of the Boar-clan in thralldom and oppression.","Talk to Eres in Barnavon","Defeated Rhuwalhan","'Rhuwalhan refused to release the captives? Curse his bones and may his spirit rot in whatever place of punishment he now dwells!'","'What? You want me to release the thralls? Do you think me a fool?\
\
'Duvodiad, you make me laugh. These dung-hill swine are less than the rats which feast upon the refuse.\
\
'If you will not go your way, you will never leave here!'"},
[1187]={"'Sí, ¿en qué puedo ayudarle?'","Descubriste un collar en uno de los semiorcos en el centro de las Tierras Solitarias. Quizás puedas preguntar a alguno de los Eglain si saben quién podría ser el verdadero dueño del collar.","Un pueblo sin honor","A primera vista, esto parece una pieza de joyería sin valor, pero al inspeccionarla más detenidamente descubriste una inscripción grabada en la parte posterior del colgante. \
\
'Te amaré por siempre y para siempre.\
\
- D'\
\
Debajo de esta inscripción está tallado el símbolo de los Eglain. Quizás algún miembro de los Eglain pueda ayudarte a encontrar al dueño de este collar?","Entrega el collar a su legítimo propietario","El rostro de Daegwalt se contrae brevemente en un gesto de angustia, antes de que reprima el dolor y esboce una sonrisa.\
\
'Este es de mi esposa. Se lo di antes de que viniéramos a vivir con los Eglain. Se perdió cuando ella fue alcanzada en Naerost. \
\
'Me has dado algo que no puedo recompensar de verdad, pero te daré algo que es importante para mí en un intento de pagarte.'","Mientras perseguías a los semiorcos, descubriste un collar que lleva una inscripción y la marca de los Eglain."},
[1188]={"An Ill Wind Blows","Talk to Thranduil","'It is my truest regret and sorrow that some of my people aided Karazgar in his plots.\
\
'Perhaps now they will understand their folly.... for we shall all suffer the consequences of their foolishness. They have drawn the ire of this Hrímil Frost-heart to our lands, and now I fear that Lake-town will again bear the most grievous wounds at the hands of her offspring. Instead of flames, we shall be frozen along with the waters of the Long Lake! We cannot rebuild our homes and resettle our people on the Lake every time a new foe comes to the North! Sooner or later, we shall run out of places to flee!\
\
'I will offer what I can to the folk of Dale and Erebor. We have plentiful stores of water and food to be shared, but I am afraid I cannot spare a single warrior. All of this business has riled the folk of Lake-town, and my guards are needed here to keep order.\
\
'I am sorry I cannot offer more, ${PLAYER}. We of Lake-town will prepare as best we can.'","Talk to King Thorin III","Talk to Dagrun","'Hah! Such trickery does not befit me now that I am King Under the Mountain, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'You have always been eager to help those in need, but we have peoples enough to prepare our defences and fill our stores, and they can handle such tasks.\
\
'As for you, my friend, you have become something of an emissary to the peoples of the North. I would ask that you inform Queen Erna, Master Dagrun, and King Thranduil of what we have learned. Our friendships must be held close in such times, and, at least in regard to the coming battle, there will be no secrets between us. Tell them what you have learned of the Herald of Winter, and tell them that Vethúg shall soon come to seek his misguided vengeance upon the peoples of the North. Urge them to do whatever they can to prepare for battle, and inform them that Erebor shall again welcome those who cannot fight into the safety of its halls.\
\
'When you have done as I have asked, return to me at once.'","'So the Herald of Winter was not the cold-drake in the rumour-monger's tale, but a different cold-drake named Hrímil Frost-heart? And now her spawn comes to set siege to the Dale-lands?\
\
Erna lets out a wry, desperate chuckle.\
\
'I shall have to have a word with King Thorin about this! I fail to see the difference between the rumours and our new circumstances....\
\
'All of Karazgar's plots have come to pass. I care not that he is wounded and lost. He has turned Hrímil's ire upon us, and we shall suffer her wrath in his stead. The young King shall face the same test as his namesake, but he is not ready to bear such a burden. Who can ever be truly ready to face such a challenge? What else can we do but prepare?\
\
'I shall rally every able warrior of Dale and send my people to the safety of Erebor when the time comes. It seems the arrows must be nocked once more....\
\
'Go on, ${PLAYER}! There is much to be done and little time to speak!'","After carefully collecting the pile of stone blocks, a nearby dwarf calls out to you...","'I knew well of the cold-drake that ravaged the Ered Mithrin, ${PLAYER}, but never have I known his name. Vethúg Wintermind... so he is the hated spawn of Hrímil Frost-heart!\
\
'Whether we are granted days, weeks, months, or mere hours to prepare remains unknown, but the King Under the Mountain speaks true -- Vethúg will come. We know little of Hrímil's forces and what Vethúg may bring to bear upon this realm, but it is clear from your vision that her hordes are not limited to dragon-kind. There is no ill will between us and Durin's Folk, but we have all battled and suffered greatly to repel the forces of the Enemy. Terrible wounds are still borne by my kin, and I cannot muster such a force as the one that repelled the Orcs and Easterlings before Erebor.\
\
'I shall send the warriors and archers I can to defend this realm, but I fear it will take more than our combined armies to overcome such a foe. Let us hope it is enough....'","Piles of stone blocks can be found in Erebor, logs can be found in the halls of Felegoth, crates of rations can be found throughout Dale, and barrels of water can be found in Lake-town.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to aid the peoples of the North in preparing for battle against Vethúg Wintermind.","Talk to Erna","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have mistaken King Thorin's jest for an actual task. You should return to King Thorin.","Erna can be found in Dale, Dagrun can be found in Lake-town, and Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
King Thorin III has asked you to deliver a message of warning to the other strongholds of the North and ask that they prepare their defences as best they can before Vethúg Wintermind strikes.","Collect piles of stone blocks in Erebor (0/10)\
Collect logs of wood in Eryn Lasgalen (0/10)\
Collect crates of rations in Dale (0/10)\
Collect barrels of water in Lake-town (0/10)","King Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have warned the leaders of the strongholds of the North to prepare for the coming of Vethúg Wintermind as King Thorin asked. You should return to King Thorin.","'I have thought long on what is to be done, ${PLAYER}. If Hrímil Frost-heart soon sends Vethúg and her hordes against us, we of Durin's Folk shall not shy from battle.\
\
'You see, Vethúg Wintermind was known to us long before Smaug. He drove my forefathers from Thikil-gundu and left it a frozen ruin. Such a fate will not befall Erebor!\
\
'We withstood the evils of Smaug and Bolg, and we shall withstand this!\
\
'You have done many great deeds for Durin's Folk, my friend. And here now is a task befitting such a warrior! I would ask that you travel the lands of the North, and gather the resources of each of its peoples. We shall have need to share them if the battle is to be won.\
\
'Swiftly now, ${PLAYER}!'","'So it is done? Good.\
\
'I will not allow Vethúg to displace Durin's Folk again, ${PLAYER}. We of the North battled together in unfriendly times and triumphed over Smaug and the armies of Bolg, but this time it shall be different. Durin's Folk, the Men of Dale, and the Elves of Eryn Lasgalen have no quarrels between them. There is no treasure to divide, no weregild withheld in stubbornness, and no treachery between us. We stand united against Vethúg Wintermind and so too shall we stand against Karazgar and Hrímil Frost-heart.\
\
'At last, the Dwarves of Durin's Folk shall have our vengeance... Vethúg will fall!'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'An Unexpected Summons'</rgb>","After stoking the ire of the Herald of Winter, Karazgar has fled the North. The peoples of Eryn Lasgalen, Erebor, and the Dale-lands must now prepare to face a new foe."},
[1189]={"Caron tiene una imaginación vívida, y puede imaginar cómo lucía Tharbad durante su apogeo.","'Esta fue una vez una ciudad impresionante, y un próspero centro de trueque. ¡Si cierro los ojos casi puedo verla! Siempre he tenido una imaginación vívida... podrías preguntarle a cualquiera que me conozca, y te dirán que es cierto!\
\
'¿Puedo pedirte que mates a los orcos que ahora se arrastran por Tharbad? Me gustaría hacer lo que pueda para restaurar la ciudad a como era, aunque sea imposible. También te pediría que escales la sección más al norte del Gran Puente que una vez atravesaba el río, y que <rgb=#00FF00>mires</rgb> sobre la ciudad. ¡Entonces podrás describirme lo que ves, y mi imaginación llenará el resto!'","Para el beneficio de Caron, miras sobre la ciudad inundada desde este punto de observación","'¿Hiciste lo que pudiste para limpiar de orcos Tharbad? Te lo agradezco, . Ahora, ¡cuéntame qué viste desde lo alto del Gran Puente!'\
\
Describes la vista a Caron lo mejor que puedes, y ella cierra los ojos, permitiendo que tus palabras fluyan sobre ella. Por fin los abre y sonríe.\
\
'¡Casi podía verla como era, hace tantos años: sin orcos en absoluto! La ciudad estaba llena de artesanos, y carretas avanzaban pesadamente por el puente, llevando mercancías a tierras lejanas. Era un próspero centro de trueque en aquel entonces. ¡Oh, haber vivido durante aquellos años! Mi imaginación tendrá que bastar.\
\
'Gracias por esto, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}. Toma esta recompensa, ¡aunque no se puede comparar con lo que tú me has dado!'","Encuentra la parte norte del Gran Puente para Caron","Habla con Caron en las riberas del río al poniente de Tharbad","Has derrotado orcos en Tharbad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una imaginación muy vívida","'¿Puedo pedirte que mates a los orcos que ahora se arrastran por Tharbad? Me gustaría hacer lo que pueda para restaurar la ciudad a como era, aunque sea imposible. También te pediría que escales la sección más al norte del Gran Puente que una vez atravesaba el río, y que <rgb=#00FF00>mires</rgb> sobre la ciudad. ¡Entonces podrás describirme lo que ves, y mi imaginación llenará el resto!'","Caron está al poniente de Tharbad, en las riberas del río.","Esta es la parte del Gran Puente desde la cual Caron quería que <rgb=#00FF00>miraras</rgb>","Caron te ha pedido que derrotes a los orcos, que no tienen lugar en Tharbad tal como fue una vez. También quiere que <rgb=#00FF00>mires</rgb> desde la parte norte del Gran Puente que aún permanece sobre el agua, y le digas lo que ves.","Derrota orcos en Tharbad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> sobre la ciudad inundada desde la parte norte del Gran Puente"},
[1190]={"Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Before you could learn much from Thrástan, the old dwarf appears to suffer from some unseen ailment. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Thrástan raises his hand to greet you, but remains silent. You ask Thrástan how he came to dwell within Mount Gundabad. After a long pause, he begins to speak, but his voice is gravelly and weak.\
\
'I... I do not remember.'\
\
You ask Thrástan if he was among the Haban’akkâ of Thráin during the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs. He shakes his head solemnly, but his face betrays a pained expression.\
\
'The memories... it is as if they are not mine. Even this name... I gave it to myself. It... was so... long ago....'","'I... am sorry. I wish I could... remember, but I... cannot. A chill... has taken... these old bones.'\
\
Thrástan shivers uncomfortably.\
\
'I have... been too long... from the Shaper's hearth.'","<rgb=#FF00FF>Hail</rgb> Thrástan and try to get his attention","Thrástan does not appear to notice your presence.\
\
He mumbles inaudibly to himself for a moment and then falls silent.","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan has become distraught in his attempt to answer your questions. You should try to calm Thrástan and urge him to continue trying to remember.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Calm</rgb> Thrástan and urge him to continue","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan has turned to look at you. You should talk to Thrástan.","Believing that no dwarf could have entered Mount Gundabad between the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs and the arrival of the Gabil'akkâ, Hermáth Stormhammer is determined to learn how Thrástan came to dwell in Gloomingtarn.","The old dwarf turns his head slowly and his gaze falls upon you","After a moment, Thrástan shakes his head uneasily","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After you and Hersegg discovered an old dwarf alone in the caverns of Gloomingtarn, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to talk to Thrástan and uncover how he came to dwell in Mount Gundabad. You should talk to Thrástan.","As he falls silent once more, Thrástan gazes toward Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan seems unaware of your presence. You should hail Thrástan and attempt to get his attention.","An Impossible Dwarf","Thrástan can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Thrástan does not appear to be able to answer your questions. You should talk to Thrástan.","'To my knowledge, there is not a single dwarf among the Gabil'akkâ named Thrástan!\
\
'You see, ${PLAYER}... unless Thrástan was with us before the Iron Crown captured him, it is nearly impossible that he should have found his way this deep into Mount Gundabad. Even when the Haban’akkâ breached the Mountain-home during the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs, we ventured no further than Máttugard. Even King Thráin deemed the Deepscrave too perilous to cross, and after all, Azog had yet to be slain!\
\
'Perhaps he entered in the years that followed, but to elude the Orcs as far as Zâram-mekhem on his own is beyond the skill—or luck—of any dwarf I have ever known! Or that he could have dwelt here since the time of Durin the Deathless? Impossible! Only Durin himself was so long-lived among the Dwarves!\
\
'I cannot make any sense of it, my friend. If he is truly of Durin's Folk, Thrástan must answer for himself!\
\
'Question Thrástan, ${PLAYER}, speak to him, and learn what you can!'","Talk to Thrástan","'What were you able to learn from Thrástan, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You tell Hermáth Stormhammer what little knowledge you gleaned from Thrástan's words. You mention that the dwarf appears to be suffering from a strange ailment, but you suspect that he wishes to travel to Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening.\
\
'Ah, I see. I am afraid I now only have more questions on my mind! As for the Shaper's hearth... could Thrástan be speaking of the White Stone Forge?'","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"},
[1191]={"Talk to Enkárvo","Pressing news has come to King Bard II.","An Incident in the Camps","You should speak to Enkárvo, the man of Dorwinion, in the refugee camp, across the river from Dale.","Talk to the messenger","Go with the messenger","The messenger stands before King Bard II, inside the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear the messenger's tidings.","'Come with me, then, ${CLASS}. I will lead you to where the incident was said to have happened, and take the swiftest path.'","Talk to Prince Bryn","'Here then, this is my home. Oh, not my true home in Dorwinion, which might be destroyed, for all that I know. But this is as much home as I have, and you are my guest. My hearth is yours, and here no harm shall befall you.\
\
'But you have come here for a purpose, and not for pleasantries! I have asked that you judge carefully what happened in the lower camp. Will you do so and hear me out?'","'Let us err on the side of overabundant caution in this matter. We have just heard how our people's sentiments toward the Easterlings seeking refuge are delicate, at best.\
\
'If some row between the refugees has broken out, or one has gone and attacked one of the Dale-folk, it must be swiftly dealt with.\
\
'I deem that we should dispatch our new friend, the ${CLASS}, to assist Athálrik in whatever way is needed.'","'M'lord. There has been an incident - an outbreak of violence of some sort in one of the refugee camps. I can say little else, I am afraid, but if 'tis true, the lives of Dale-folk may be imperiled this very moment.'","'I must think long on all you have told me, ${PLAYER}. But a messenger has come with grave and pressing news, to judge by his face.\
\
'Let us hear the tidings, then.'","'I am sure you will arrive and find Athálrik has already subdued whichever of the Easterlings have caused this stir.\
\
'But do go. Perhaps Mother and Bard will finally believe me!'","Talk to King Bard II","'I told you both, my sword-thegn is more than capable of handling the matter.'","'Athálrik? Now you have sent him and his fellows to go among the refuge-seekers, Bryn? Did you not even think to mention this to me or to Mother?\
\
'${PLAYER}, if the Queen Regent wishes you to go then I, too... wish it.'","'Even now, my sword-thegn Athálrik is patrolling the refugee encampments to ensure that no such violence or conspiracy can fester among the Easterlings. If there has been some incident, he will quell it.'","'Will you go with our messenger and see that no one comes to harm, ${PLAYER}? I have utmost faith in you.'","You should talk to the messenger who stands before King Bard II in the Great-keep in Dale, and learn where you must go to investigate the report of violence.","King Bard II, Queen Regent Erna, and Prince Bryn stand discussing the messenger's tidings in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear what King Bard II and his regent mother, Erna, have to say in response to Prince Bryn and the messenger.","Talk to Queen Regent Erna","'Word has come only that there was violence of some kind in one of the refugees' camps. I know nothing else, save that the matter is most urgent.'","King Bard II, Queen Regent Erna, and Prince Bryn stand discussing the messenger's tidings in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should hear what Prince Bryn has to say in response to the messenger."},
[1192]={"A Mundarico Hojarena le preocupa la cantidad de nerbyg que han empezado a aparecer por todo Barandalf y teme que las criaturas se estén preparando para formar un enjambre.","'Se pueden encontrar nerbyg de las arenas por todas las dunas que bordean la orilla oeste del río Brandivino, al norte de aquí.\
\
'¡Destruye a las viles criaturas antes de que formen un enjambre, ${PLAYER}!'","Un aumento de nerbyg","Nerbyg de las arenas derrotados en Barandalf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Mundarico Hojarena en Dwaling","Derrota a nerbyg de las arenas enormes en Barandalf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Es de esperar que los nerbyg de las arenas ya no puedan formar un enjambre durante algún tiempo.'","Se pueden encontrar nerbyg de las arenas en gran número en Barandalf, a ambos lados del camino que atraviesa las dunas de arena a lo largo del lado oeste del Brandivino.\
\
Mundarico Hojarena te ha pedido que derrotes a los nerbyg de las arenas en Barandalf antes de que formen un enjambre y traigan la destrucción en cualquier dirección que tomen.","Mundarico Hojarena está en Dwaling, al sur de Barandalf.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los nerbyg de las arenas que se han estado reproduciendo en Barandalf y deberías regresar a Mundarico Hojarena con la noticia de tus victorias.","Derrota a los nerbyg de las arenas en Barandalf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'He vivido aquí durante mucho tiempo, ${CLASS}, y he estudiado el comportamiento de muchas de las criaturas locales. ¡Escúchame, pues, cuando te digo que un gran peligro se está gestando entre las arenas de Barandalf!\
\
'Hablo de los nerbyg, viles insectos que ahora se pueden encontrar entre las dunas en gran número. Si no hacemos algo, y rápido, me temo que los nerbyg formarán un enjambre... y da igual si van hacia el norte o el sur, ¡pues hay buena gente en ambas direcciones!\
\
'¡Viaja al norte de Dwaling, a las arenas de Barandalf que bordean la orilla oeste del río Brandivino, y derrota a cualquier nerbyg de las arenas que encuentres!'","'¿Has destruido a algunos de los nerbyg de las arenas? Te lo agradezco, ${PLAYER}. Me has tranquilizado, y no puedo decir eso a menudo en estos días oscuros. Los nerbyg siempre serán un peligro, pero es de esperar que hayamos evitado que formen un enjambre.'","Nerbyg de las arenas enormes derrotados en Barandalf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las arenas de Barandalf siempre son peligrosas para quienes no están preparados.'"},
[1193]={"'¡Guau! ¡Nunca he visto un cangrejo de ese tamaño! Y para excavar un agujero en el barco, ¡qué garras tan enormes deben tener! Me han dado instrucciones de llevarte de regreso a Umbar Baharbêl, ahora que el Khâlbina está cerca del puerto. Hay otros asuntos urgentes para los que se te necesita.'","Derrota a los grandes cangrejos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Protege al Khâlbina y a su tripulación de las amenazas en su viaje a Jax Phanâl, en el Cabo de Umbar.","Derrota a los cazadores de cangrejos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Investiga la fuente de la perturbación bajo cubierta.","Una infestación de cangrejos","Fugas en la cubierta selladas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Investiga la fuente de la perturbación bajo cubierta","Cazadores de cangrejos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Sella las fugas y lucha contra los grandes cangrejos que han abordado!","Grandes cangrejos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Protege al Khâlbina y a su tripulación de los cangrejos que han abordado el barco!","¡Derrota a los dos grandes cangrejos!","¡Derrota a los grandes cangrejos!","Sella las fugas en la cubierta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1194]={"'¿Por qué sigues aquí? Si no te apresuras, te daré una buena patada en la rodilla, ¡y te lo pensarás dos veces antes de demostrar una ética de trabajo tan pobre otra vez!'","No fue muy amable, pero Jónar estará encantado","Habla con Laurel Sacovilla en el Patio de Frerin","Laurel Sacovilla te ha visto","No abandones la zona de degustación","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","La mesa de degustación está en el Patio de Frerin, justo al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes esperar a que Laurel Sackville, la reclutadora de la Liga de las Posadas, se aleje.","La degustación de la Liga de las Posadas tiene lugar en el Patio de Frerin, en el patio exterior sur de la Mansión de Thorin. Solo puedes hablar con la reclutadora cuando no está distraída por sus tareas.\
\
Deberías ir a la degustación de la Liga de las Posadas y ver qué puedes hacer para sabotearla. Jónar ha dejado claro que no quiere que se unan más enanos a la Liga de las Posadas mientras él siga respirando.","'¡Ja ja ja ja! ¡Oh, ja ja! ¡Jo jo jo! ¡Por todos los cielos, discúlpame! Mis ojos... cómo arden de lágrimas de deleite.\
\
'¡No hables! Déjame saborear este momento.'","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito de la Liga de las Posadas.","Escóndete detrás de los barriles cercanos hasta que Laurel Sackville se aleje","Has salido de la zona de degustación","'Si estás aquí para la degustación, ¡otra ronda comenzará en breve! Siéntate y ponte cómodo hasta que empecemos.\
\
'Las degustaciones se realizan cada pocos minutos.'","La mesa de degustación está en el Patio de Frerin, justo al sur de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Debes añadir bazofia a las muestras de degustación entre rondas. Seguro que nadie lo notará...","'¿Puedo ayudarte, oh gran ${PLAYERNAME:derrochador[m]|derrochadora[f]} de tiempo? Quédate holgazaneando un poco más; ¡insisto!'","Observa cómo se desarrollan los acontecimientos de la degustación","Bazofia añadida a las muestras de la Liga de las Posadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","No dejes que Laurel Sacovilla vea tu travesura","Queda poco tiempo: la próxima ronda de degustaciones comenzará pronto","¡La degustación ha comenzado!\
\
Observa cómo se desata el caos, porque Jónar querrá oír hablar de tu éxito.","Añade bazofia a las muestras de la Liga de las Posadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Este es un buen lugar para esconderse hasta que la reclutadora esté distraída","'¡Inútiles y mentecatos, cómo detesto a la Liga de las Posadas! Esa alimaña ha infestado la Mansión de Thorin y se ha extendido hasta el noble Patio de Frerin. ¡Hoy celebran una degustación de la Liga de las Posadas para reclutar más miembros!\
\
'Debes ir al Patio de Frerin de inmediato, ${PLAYER}, antes de que terminen de instalarse, y asegurarte de que este evento salga terriblemente mal. No habrá más enanos uniéndose a la Liga de las Posadas… ¡al menos no mientras yo esté presente!\
\
'¡Sal al Patio de Frerin y detén esa degustación de cerveza ahora mismo! Toma... llévate esta bazofia de la Posada Abandonada. Haz algo útil por una vez. ¡Me da igual qué, mientras sea efectivo!'","Jónar espera noticias de tus actos en la posada de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías contarle a Jónar tu cruel y maravillosa victoria contra la reclutadora de la degustación de la Liga de las Posadas.","Laurel Sacovilla está distraída","Un Desastre en la Liga de las Posadas"},
[1195]={"'¡Te debo mucho, mi capitán! ¡Me has hecho volver en mí!'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en Bree, llamada Hazel Kenton, que luchó contra los bandidos de la región cuando por primera vez se atrevieron a acercarse a los pueblos del bosque de Chet, y aun ahora mantiene el respeto de muchos guardias del pueblo. Creo que la capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo.\
\
'Ella suele estar de guardia en la Puerta Oeste de Bree, incluso cuando su propio deber ha terminado. Búscala y aprende de ella, ${PLAYER} — ¡en las Tierras de Bree necesitamos más capitanes como la capitana Kenton!'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en Bree, llamada Hazel Kenton, que luchó contra los bandidos de la región cuando se atrevieron a acercarse a los pueblos del bosque de Chet, y aún hoy mantiene el respeto de muchos guardias del pueblo. Espero que la capitana Kenton pueda enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo.\
\
'A menudo está de guardia en la Puerta Oeste de Bree, incluso cuando su propio deber ha terminado. Búscala y aprende de ella, ${PLAYER}; nosotros, en las Tierras de Bree, necesitamos más capitanes como la capitana Kenton.'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en la ciudad de Bree, al sureste, llamada Hazel Kenton, que ha combatido a los bandidos de esa región durante mucho tiempo. Aún hoy, se dice, dirige el respeto de muchos guardias de la ciudad en las Tierras de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo si hablas con ella.\
\
'La Puerta Oeste de Bree era su puesto cuando se tuvo noticia de ella por última vez. Busca a la capitana Kenton y descubre lo que puede enseñarte.'","Hazel Kenton, una capitana de gran renombre, se encuentra en la Puerta Oeste de la Ciudad de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Te han dicho que hables con la capitana Kenton si deseas mejorar tus habilidades.","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en la ciudad de Bree, muy al sur y al este, llamada Hazel Kenton, que ha luchado contra los bandidos de esa región desde hace mucho tiempo. Aún hoy, se dice, goza del respeto de muchos guardias de las Tierras de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo, si hablaras con ella.\
\
'La Puerta Oeste de Bree fue su puesto la última vez que oí hablar de ella. Busca a la capitana Kenton y ve qué puede enseñarte.'","La marca de un gran capitán es la habilidad de inspirar a otros a la grandeza, y su lealtad y amistad son las recompensas más verdaderas.","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida\
\
'Hay una capitana en la ciudad de Bree, al este, llamada Hazel Kenton, que ha combatido a los bandidos de esa región durante mucho tiempo. Incluso ahora, se dice, que inspira respeto entre muchos de los guardias de las Tierras de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo, si hablas con ella.\
\
'La Puerta Oeste de Bree era su puesto la última vez que supe de ella. Busca a la capitana Kenton y descubre qué es lo que puede enseñarte.'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
''Hay una capitana en Bree, llamada Hazel Kenton, que luchó contra los bandidos de la región cuando estos se atrevieron por primera vez a acercarse a las aldeas del bosque de Chet, y aun hoy cuenta con el respeto de muchos guardias de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte una o dos cosas sobre la verdadera naturaleza del liderazgo, creo yo.\
\
'A menudo monta guardia en la Puerta Oeste de Bree, incluso cuando su deber ha terminado. Búscala y aprende de ella, ${PLAYER} — todos en las Tierras de Bree podríamos beneficiarnos de tener más capitanes como la capitana Kenton.'","'Has hecho un trabajo excelente hoy, ${PLAYER}, y empiezo a ver en ti la chispa de un verdadero gran capitán.\
\
'Un capitán inspira a quienes le siguen a lograr grandes cosas, pero la lealtad otorgada a la ligera no es segura. Solo se alcanza a través de lazos de amistad ganados con esfuerzo. Hilton Harper te seguiría hasta la muerte después de esto, si llegara a ser necesario, porque le devolviste algo que había perdido: su fe en sí mismo. Hilton necesitaba un capitán que le mostrara la fuerza que pensaba perdida para siempre.\
\
'No desperdicies la lealtad de quienes creen en ti, ${PLAYER}, y serás, sin duda, un capitán digno.'","Insignia de Harper recogida","'Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un gran capitán[m]|una gran capitana[f]}, , y cuentas con la lealtad de muchos.'","Hilton Harper está en la obra de Espinar, al noroeste de Bree.\
\
Ahora que has recuperado la insignia robada, devolvérsela a Hilton Harper podría devolverle la confianza e inspirarlo a reincorporarse a la lucha contra los bandidos que amenazan los Campos de Bree.","'Has venido a prestar tu brazo para luchar contra los bandidos y tu voz para animar el espíritu decaído de nuestra gente, ¿no es así? Entonces eres más que ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido, Capitán[m]|bienvenida, Capitana[f]} , ¡y te saludo con alegría! Hay un asunto con el que te pediría ayuda, si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a brindarla.\
\
'Hilton Harper fue guardián de Bree durante algunos meses cuando comenzaron los problemas con los bandidos, y era un escudo entre ellos y la buena gente que habita las Tierras de Bree. Pero la mala fortuna se cebó con Harper en la forma de un formidable bribón de la Atalaya de los bandidos llamado Aldis Portavena: humilló a Harper y le arrebató su insignia. La vida de Harper fue perdonada, ¡pero no confundas la acción de Portavena con misericordia!\
\
'Harper quedó devastado y se ha entregado a la desesperanza y la tristeza. Encuentra la insignia perdida de Harper y devuélvesela en el taller de Espinar, al noroeste de Bree. La Atalaya de los bandidos está al norte de la Granja Vieja de Dulcésped, al oeste de Bree, y es probable que Aldis Portavena aún merodee por sus murallas. Necesitamos que Harper vuelva a luchar, . Si logras recuperar su insignia, podría inspirarlo a reincorporarse a la defensa de las Tierras de Bree, y serás verdaderamente un capitán de mérito.'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana aquí en Bree, llamada Hazel Kenton, que luchó contra los bandidos de la región cuando se atrevieron a acercarse a los pueblos del bosque de Chet, y aún hoy mantiene el respeto de muchos guardias del pueblo. Espero que la capitana Kenton pueda enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo.\
\
'A menudo está de guardia en la Puerta Oeste, incluso cuando su propio deber ha terminado. Búscala y aprende de ella, ${PLAYER}; en Bree necesitamos más capitanes como la capitana Kenton.'","'No tengo nada que decirte. ¿De qué sirve un capitán para un guardián que no puede luchar?'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en Bree, llamada Hazel Kenton, que luchó contra los bandidos de la región cuando estos se atrevieron por primera vez a acercarse a las aldeas del bosque de Chet, y aun hoy cuenta con el respeto de muchos guardias de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte una o dos cosas sobre la verdadera naturaleza del liderazgo, creo yo.\
\
'A menudo monta guardia en la Puerta Oeste de Bree, incluso cuando su deber ha terminado. Búscala y aprende de ella, ${PLAYER} — todos podríamos beneficiarnos de tener más capitanes como la capitana Kenton.'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parece perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en la ciudad de Bree, al oeste, llamada Hazel Kenton, que ha combatido a los bandidos de esa región durante mucho tiempo. Incluso ahora, se dice que inspira respeto entre muchos de los guardias de las Tierras de Bree. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la naturaleza del liderazgo si hablas con ella.\
\
'La Puerta Oeste de Bree era su puesto la última vez que supe de ella. Busca a la capitana Kenton y descubre qué es lo que puede enseñarte.'","Aldis Portavena ha sido visto en la Vigía de los bandidos, al norte de la Granja Vieja de Dulcésped, al oeste de Bree.Hilton Harper se encuentra en el campamento de obras de Espinar, al noroeste del pueblo.\
\
La Capitana Kenton te ha pedido que recuperes la insignia de Hilton Harper de manos de Aldis Portavena, el bribón que la robó.","Una inspiración para los hombres","'¡Lleva esa insignia a Hilton Harper de inmediato, y quizá logres devolverle su orgullo! Lo encontrarás en el lugar de trabajo de Espinar, al noroeste del pueblo.'","'Has crecido tanto en fuerza como en confianza, ${PLAYER}, pero aún no has alcanzado tu verdadero potencial. Debes aprender a inspirar a tus amigos incluso cuando toda esperanza parezca perdida, pues eres un faro contra la oscuridad.\
\
'Hay una capitana en la ciudad de Bree, muy al sur, llamada Hazel Kenton, que ha combatido durante mucho tiempo a los bandidos del bosque de Chet. Incluso ahora goza del respeto de muchos guardias de las Tierras de Bree y más allá. La capitana Kenton podría enseñarte algo sobre la verdadera naturaleza del liderazgo, si hablaras con ella.\
\
'La Puerta Oeste de Bree era su puesto la última vez que tuve noticias suyas. Busca a la capitana Kenton y ve qué puede enseñarte.'","'El bandido que tomó la insignia de Hilton Harper, y con ella su honor, es un hombre desagradable llamado Aldis Portavena. Búscalo detrás de los baluartes de la Torre del Bandido, al norte de la Antigua Granja Dulcésped, al o este de Bree.\
\
'Si logras devolverle a Harper la voluntad de luchar por el pueblo de las Tierras de Bree, serás un capitán realmente digno.'","'Busca a la capitana Kenton en la Puerta Oeste de la ciudad de Bree, pues puede enseñarte mucho.'","Recoge la insignia de Harper","'Déjame en paz. No estoy en condiciones de proteger a la gente de las Tierras de Bree, y no quiero hablar contigo. Solo quiero que me dejen solo.'","La capitana Kenton se encuentra en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.\
\
Hazel Kenton querrá saber que has logrado restaurar la voluntad de Hilton Harper de defender los Campos de Bree de aquellos que amenazan la paz.","Entrega la insignia de Harper a Hilton Harper","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Recuperaste mi insignia? Yo..... no sé qué decir, ${PLAYER}. Aldis Portavena fue tan cruel como cualquiera, y pensé que había arrebatado mi honor para siempre; me sentía perdido en la desesperación.\
\
'¡Pero me has mostrado que siempre hay esperanza! ¡Ya no me avergonzaré con la desesperación! ¡El pueblo de las Tierras de Bree debe ser defendido!'","'Los bandidos volverán a temernos, ahora que el fuego ha regresado a Harper.'"},
[1196]={"Defeat Khundolar Message-shouter (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Easterlings throughout the Brown Lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gamal has been charged with keeping an eye on the Easterling tribe that has secured a foothold in the Brown Lands, and he believes they draw inspiration from some new arrival in the area.","Defeated Khundolar Message-shouter (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The blood of the mearas courses through the veins of my Leoma.'","Gamal is in the Brown Lands, south of Etheburg.\
\
You have defeated some of the Khundolar Easterlings in the Brown Lands and should return now to Gamal.","Defeated Easterlings throughout the Brown Lands (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","An Inspiring Presence","'With the coin from this duty I will purchase Leoma, beautiful mare that she is.'","'I do not like this. The Khundolar are too near to Stangard. If this \\qKhoratón\\q continues to inspire their forces, it will not be long before they march on Stangard.'\
\
Gamal's lips form a thin line as he considers the garrison's chance of repelling such an Easterling invasion.\
\
'I thought of something while you were bringing justice to the Easterlings, ${PLAYER}. The word \\qKhoratón...\\q I think it is not a name. It has much in common with the word for \\qBlack Cloak.\\q But the Khundolar do not wear such things. Do you think they are inspired by a sorceror of some type?'\
\
You do not voice your guess to Gamal, but the word is loud inside your head: Nazgûl.","Easterlings can be found throughout the Brown Lands, and message-shouters can be found near their established foothold at Lashkarg.\
\
Gamal has asked you to defeat Easterlings throughout the Brown Lands, and also to defeat some of the message-shouters that use the name Khoratón.","'${PLAYER}, you say? I am Gamal, of Stangard. I have spied upon a camp of the Khundolar here in the Brown Lands. The Easterlings have been gathering in greater numbers for some time, but something recently has changed.\
\
'I know very little of their language, only bits and pieces. They speak a fragmented tongue, with some words I know and some all their own, but I think they speak of some new and powerful ally. \\qKhoratón,\\q they call this person that inspires them, but if that is a name or a description I do not know.\
\
'If you are of a mind to help me, defeat many of the Easterlings here in the Brown Lands, and also confront some of the Khundolar that shout messages about this Khoratón. If hearing that name inspires the Easterlings to rise up against my people, let us make them pay for using that name!'","'I took this post for coin. I wanted to buy a beautiful horse.'","'One day I will ride into battle with Leoma as my steed. One day!'","'Defeat the Khundolar here in the Brown Lands and learn what inspires them. I believe it is the name \\qKhoratón,\\q but I do not know what it means.\
\
'Unlike many of my brothers in Stangard, I have journeyed very far afield in search of adventure, ${PLAYER}. I walked in Isengard many years ago, and even spoke with Saruman the Wise. I have been to Gondor and seen the White City. There is much to learn from the peoples of distant lands.\
\
'But these Easterlings cannot be allowed to stay here. From this foothold they endanger Stangard and my people, and for that they should be pushed into the river.'"},
[1197]={"Asbaj-khîrfin can be found in the northern reaches of Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath at Asbaj-khîrfin.","Assist Varthmath with \\qExploring Vâr Nuchur\\q","A workbench can be found at Asbaj-khîrfin.\
\
At the workbench, you should test the samples you have acquired.","An Intersection of Insects","You find no traces of Orkish poisons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If there is one thing that I have learned from my time in Moria, it is that any place may feel safe, until it does not. If Máttugard is to be reclaimed, then I shall make sure it is safe for all those who join in entering this mountain city.\
\
'The Orcs and trolls do not venture to Máttugard often. In the absence of all, it would seem many creatures have made a home in the old halls and gardens of the Mighty Court. I am particularly concerned by the gredbyg that buzz around the old halls. They were more than just a nuisance in Moria and we should take care to do our part in dealing with these insects. There are two gredbyg hives that I would like to carefully explore in Máttugard. Will you join me?'","The adventurous Beorning, Varthmath, has accompanied the dwarves in their efforts to reclaim Gundabad.","Assist Varthmath with \\qExploring Brúvraum\\q","'You found no signs of poison? How very strange. If they are not poisoned, then something else upsets them, something more than us and the Orcs.'","'${PLAYER}, thank you for assisting me. I have noticed that the gredbyg here are more frenzied than I anticipated. I assumed our presence might put them into a bit of a frenzy, though there seems to be something else which aggravates them. I have heard that Orcs lurk within the lower reaches of Máttugard. Perhaps they are poisoning the gredbyg with some vile concoction. Let us test the hive samples that you have collected. Perhaps then, we will learn more.'","Varthmath can be found nearby at a workbench","Asbaj-khîrfin can be found in the northern reaches of Máttugard.\
\
You should travel to Asbaj-khîrfin.","Travel to Asbaj-khîrfin","Varthmath can be found at Maergrind, The Noble Gate of Máttugard.\
\
You should assist Varthmath with his expedition in Máttugard.","Talk to Varthmath at Asbaj-khîrfin","Test the grodbog hive samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1198]={"The chieftain of the Dragon-clan invaders can surely be found at the main house in the Herd-lands, looking down upon the farm from on high.\
\
You should kill the chieftain and steal the plans for the invasion of Trum Dreng by the Dragon-clan.","'Murig escaped? That is ill news, but no matter -- we cannot waste any more time here. We must bring this information to Lhan Tarren.\
\
'I have not yet met the Stag-clan of that town. They were my husband's people, not my own. We must rely upon your favour there to make sure this warning reaches them in time!'\
\
Blodwen hesitates.\
\
'They are the closest family I have now, yet I do not even know them. Will they turn me away, ${PLAYER}?'","Bring the map of the invasion route to Blodwen","'${PLAYER}, I owe you an apology. I asked you to leave me to die, but I see now that I must endeavour to help my late husband's clan. Lhan Tarren must be warned!\
\
'The chief of this invasion party has taken the farmhouse near here; I have seen the comings and goings of the Draig-lûth. Our best hope is to kill him, and learn what we can of the Dragon-clan's plan to invade.\
\
'I will wait for you here, ${PLAYER}. Be careful... the chief will be a strong man.'","An Invasion is Brewing","Blodwen awaits you in her hiding place near the river in the Herd-lands.\
\
You should return to Blodwen with the map you found and with the dire news that Murig has escaped you.","Collect plans for the invasion of Trum Dreng","'Please hurry, ${PLAYER}. You must search for some hint of their mission, or else Trum Dreng will surely be lost. The Dragon-clan is cruel -- they attack by night, when all good folk sleep.'","Murig has escaped, but you have collected a map of the invasion route","The looters you harassed all spoke of the likelihood of an invasion upon all of Trum Dreng. Such an invasion would end with the Stag-clan being driven out of Dunland once and for all."},
[1199]={"Ask Cynred why his jail-keys were on the floor of Stanric's home","You see something glinting on the floor of Stanric's home","Cynred glances from side to side with a look of panic on his face.\
\
'Sithric tells me I will be committing treason if I tell of what passed. You found the hint I left behind though: Stanric is not dead. Sithric is ordering him kept below.\
\
'The guards and I were ordered to lock him away, so we did. Sithric said he would have Stanric killed if I did not help, so I complied.\
\
'I will not stop you from righting this wrong. I cannot believe I ever trusted such a man as Sithric!'","Stanric's house is near the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should investigate Stanric's house, and do your best to keep beneath the notice of the residents of Stangard using what sneaking skill you can muster.","An Investigation","According to Cynred, Stanric is down below in the lock-house.\
\
You should find Stanric at once.","A key! It might unlock doors in the lock-house","Investigate Stanric's house","Investigate the glinting item","Cynred is at the lock-house in Stangard.\
\
You should find Cynred and ask him why his jail keys are in Stanric's home.","Avoid being spotted by unfriendly eyes","The circumstances of Stanric's death are certainly suspicious, so you decide to investigate further.","Cynred indicates that Stanric is detained within the lock-house, alive","You have been spotted by one of Sithric's men! You should make yourself scarce until the alarm has died down.","'${PLAYER}! I cannot believe you found me!'","Find Stanric in the lock-house","Something glints on the floor of Stanric's house in Stangard.\
\
You should investigate the glinting object more closely.","'The circumstances surrounding Stanric's death are most suspicious; do you not agree? You should investigate his house, near the Mead Hall.\
\
'If you see anything suspicious, you should by all means investigate further. Just...be careful not to be seen, ${PLAYER}. I worry that all of Stangard will be seeking your capture. You should move with as much stealth as you can muster.'"},
[1200]={"¡Se está celebrando la Feria Agrícola en Delagua por tiempo limitado!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando el evento con el que está asociada termine.</rgb>","Habla con la Pregonera del Festival, Caltha Tunelero, en la Feria Agrícola de Delagua","¡${PLAYERNAME:Querido[m]|querida[f]} ,\
\
Estás cordialmente  ${PLAYERNAME:invitado[m]|invitada[f]} a unirte a las celebraciones en Delagua de la Feria Agrícola anual!\
\
Este festival de finales de verano estará lleno de comida, diversión y mucho más. Si deseas viajar a la feria, el maestro de establos de Cavada Grande envía caballos hasta allí regularmente. ¡Espero que lo disfrutes!\
\
Cordialmente,\
Opal Buenavista","Caltha Tunelero, la Pregonera del Festival, se encuentra en Delagua mientras la Feria Agrícola se celebra.\
\
Habla con Caltha Tunelero para saber más sobre la Feria Agrícola.","'¡Hola! ¿Estás aquí por la Feria Agrícola? Te doy la bienvenida. ¡Espero poder responder a todas preguntas!'","Una invitación a la Feria Agrícola"},
[1201]={"An Invitation to the Festival","Many events are featured in the Yule Festival this year. Notable places to visit include: \
\
-The Thorin's Hall Inn \
-The Horsefields Festival Grounds (Bree)\
-The Party Tree (the Shire)\
-The Duillond Festival Area\
-The new Winter Region of Frostbluff \
\
This notice is meant to direct you to the new festival area.","You have been cordially invited to the Yule Festival celebration in the Frostbluff region, in the town of Winter-home.","Dear ${PLAYER},\
\
You are cordially invited to join our Yule Festival celebration in Winter-home. We have many events to suit your taste, whether you like eating contests, snowball-fights, the theatre, or simply helping folks around town.\
\
This notice is meant to introduce you to what the festival has to offer, especially our new celebration event.\
\
We hope to see you here soon, before we get snowed in!\
\
Albert Yule, the Town Crier","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Michel Delving","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Celondim","'Are you looking to go to Frostbluff, ${PLAYER}? I am ready to take you there! I hear there is a fine festival going on. Hopefully, the roads haven't been snowed out....'","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in West Bree","Talk to the new Festival Stable-master in Thorin's Hall"},
[1202]={"Una Invitación al Festival de la Cosecha","El Festival de la Cosecha de este otoño ha llegado una vez más, y has sido ${PLAYERNAME:invitado[m]|invitada[f]} formalmente a participar en los emocionantes eventos de este año.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento al que está asociada.</rgb>","'¿Ves la puerta? ¿La ves? ¿No es emocionante? Me pregunto qué habrá detrás.'","'¡Fuera! ¿Qué quieres?'","Puedes encontrar a Opal Buenavista en el Árbol de la Fiesta, en Hobbiton, un apacible pueblo de la Comarca.\
\
Deberías hablar con Opal Buenavista, quien te explicará los eventos del festival de este año.","Habla con Opal Buenavista en el Árbol de la Fiesta","${PLAYER:Querido[m]|Querida[f]} ${PLAYER},\
\
Esta es tu invitación al Festival de la Cosecha. Lleva esta nota a la Comarca, y te presentaré todos los excelentes y emocionantes eventos que se ofrecerán este año. (¡Y me aseguraré de mostrarte la emocionante nueva puerta que ha aparecido en el Árbol de la Fiesta!)\
\
Atentamente,\
\
  Opal Buenavista"},
[1203]={"¡El evento del pisoteo de musarañas es aquí!","Querido amigo:\
\
Hay muchos eventos de los que disfrutar durante el Festival de Primavera. Este mensaje tiene como fin guiarte hacia los Juegos de Primavera en Duillond y en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree.\
\
Tu recompensa será una guía de los eventos del festival, junto con un distintivo para que emprendas tu camino.","¡El evento del laberinto de setos es aquí!","Habla con Maengamiel en el jardín de Duillond","Has recibido una petición de ayuda de los elfos jardineros de Duillond.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu diario de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Habla con Gil Plover en el laberinto de setos en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree","¡Me alegra mucho que hayas venido! ¿Escucharás la historia de mis desdichas, mi ${PLAYERNAME:querido[m]|querida[f]} ?\
\
Las musarañas han atacado nuestro pobre jardín una vez más, haciendo que sea imposible terminar de cultivar nuestras amadas plantas. ¡Son de lo más persistentes!\
\
Me temo que las musarañas necesitarán un argumento de peso por parte de cualquiera que tenga un momento libre para ayudarnos...","¡Hola! ¿Estás aquí para correr entre los setos en esta hermosa primavera? Es una buena estación para ponerte a prueba con las muchas aventuras que se encuentran en el laberinto.","El laberinto de setos se encuentra en los Campos de los Caballos de Bree, y el evento del pisoteo de musarañas se encuentra en Duillond.\
\
Deberías visitar ambos eventos si deseas saber más sobre ellos.","Una invitación al Festival de Primavera"},
[1204]={"'¿Habéis venido para ayudarnos?'","Habla con Gísli Garrotefuerte en la Mansión de Thorin","Gísli Garrotefuerte se encuentra dentro de la nueva Arena del Festival, una sala de cerveza dentro de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Ve a ver a Gísli Garrotefuerte para que te explique los acontecimientos del festival de este año.","${PLAYER:Querido[m]|Querida[f]} ${PLAYER}:\
\
Aquí tienes tu invitación al Festival de Yule. Como de costumbre, estoy muy ocupada, pero hay nuevos eventos de los que podréis disfrutar. Llevad esta nota a Gisli Garrotefuerte en la Mansión de Thorin, ha solicitado toda la ayuda posible y os presentará  todos los apasionantes eventos que se ofrecen este año.\
\
Cordialmente,\
\
Opal Buenavista","Ya está aquí el Festival de Yule, has sido formalmente invitado a participar en los emocionantes eventos de este año.","Una invitación al Festival de Invierno","¡Hola, hola! Veo que has encontrado nuestra nueva sala de la cerveza y me alegra mucho, porque toda ayuda es bienvenida. ¡La gente viene de todas partes para robarme la cerveza! No es una cerveza cualquiera, es la más extraordinaria de toda la Tierra Media.\
\
'El problema es que nunca tienen suficiente y después de probarla intentan conseguir más. Me temo que no habrá suficiente para todos. Por favor, ¡dime que vas a ayudarme! Está en juego todo el festival.'"},
[1206]={"Óli todavía parece no estar convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo.","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Jónar te espera en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar con Jónar para darle la alentadora noticia de que lograste forzar a los enanos de la Liga de las Posadas a abandonar sus necias aspiraciones.","Convence a Kópur, de Noglond, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Grímar aún no está convencido; inténtalo una vez más","Kópur no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo","Una Iniciación Irritante","'¡Es una vergüenza!'","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin","'¡Sal al valle, ${PLAYER}, y humilla a quienes han traicionado a mi gente!'","¡Herluf es un necio testarudo! Inténtalo de nuevo","Grímar no parece convencido; inténtalo de nuevo","Óli aún no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo.","Convence a Herluf de Ojo de Aguja para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Óli puede encontrarse en la Mansión de Thorin, en la misma posada donde se halla el propio Jónar.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Eso pareció dar resultado","'¿Sabes cuántos enanos se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas? ¡Es una vergüenza! Ningún enano que se respete debería afiliarse a esa guilda de hobbits, si me preguntas.\
\
'Exijo que acoses a esos necios hasta que entren en razón y se unan a mi ilustre Asociación Cervecera, rompiendo todo vínculo con esos hobbits rechonchos y peludos de la Liga de las Posadas. ¡No te detengas hasta que vuelvan a ser razonables!\
\
'Vergonzoso. Vergonzoso, vergonzoso.'","'Es una afrenta que cualquier enano que se respete participe en una absurda liga de hobbits en lugar de en una verdadera alianza enana. Debes difundir la noticia de que nuestra alianza ha echado raíces, para que esos enanos traidores se libren de sus desatinos.'","Grímar, miembro de la Liga de las Posadas, puede encontrarse en Gondamon, en pleno corazón de Ered Luin.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","'¡Una vergüenza, te lo digo!'","'¡Me avergüenza ser un enano cuando semejantes traiciones abundan entre los míos!'","Herluf aún no está convencido; deberías intentarlo de nuevo","Convence a Óli, de la Mansión de Thorin, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","'Lo has hecho bien esta vez, mi joven aprendiz. Gracias a tus actos, el porvenir de la Liga de las Posadas se presenta sombrío. ¡Ya son cuatro los enanos que han dado la espalda a esos terribles hobbits y han abandonado su necedad de una vez por todas!'","Convénce a Grímar, de Gondamon, para que abandone la Liga de las Posadas","Kópur, miembro de la Liga de las Posadas, puede encontrarse en Noglond, en Ered Luin, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin, en el Valle de Thráin.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Herluf puede encontrarse en Ojo de Aguja, una aldea hobbit con muchos habitantes enanos, situada en el extremo noroeste de la Comarca.\
\
Jónar te ha exigido que te acerques a los enanos de la Mansión de Thorin que se han unido a la Liga de las Posadas y los acoses hasta que abandonen esa necedad y se unan, en su lugar, a la Asociación Cervecera.","Eso dio resultado","Kópur aún no está convencido; inténtalo una vez más"},
[1207]={"'El campamento de los Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir está lejos hacia el oeste, más allá del cruce de caminos.'","'Encontrarás a Calenglad en el campamento de Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, al oeste del camino que cruza Parth Aduial y el cruce de caminos de Canadiach.\
\
'Dile que no prescinda de ningún hombre para la lucha en los Campos de Fornost; es más importante salvaguardar los tesoros e historia de Annúminas.'","Calenglad está en el campamento de Montaraces en la isla de Tinnudir, al oeste del camino que cruza Parth Aduial y el cruce de caminos de Canadiach.\
\
Torogethir te ha pedido que lleves noticias a Calenglad de que sus esfuerzos en los Campos de Fornost van bien, y que Calenglad debe enfocarse en combatir a los saqueadores de tumbas que plagan Evendim.","Una isla en el lago","'Torogethir dice la verdad: los saqueadores de tumbas que plagan Evendim deben ser combatidos. No puedo prescindir de ningún hombre para los Campos de Fornost, a menos que la situación se vuelva más grave. ¡Solo una causa de fuerza mayor me haría abandonar Annúminas y dejarlas en manos de los saqueadores de tumbas!'","'Espera, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¿Vas hacia Evendim? Te pediría que llevaras un mensaje a Calenglad, un verdadero amigo mío. La lucha en los Campos de Fornost continúa, pero aguantamos... dile a Calenglad que no necesita enviar a ningún Montaraz en mi ayuda.\
\
'Calenglad está a cargo del campamento de Montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, lejos hacia el oeste siguiendo el camino que cruza Parth Aduial, y más allá de la encrucijada de Canadiach. Los Montaraces del Norte tienen un campamento en Tinnudir, justo en la orilla oriental del Lago Nenuial.\
\
'Los saqueadores de tumbas y otros Hombres desagradables plagan las costas de Evendim, ¡y preferiría que Calenglad dedicara sus fuerzas para combatirlos, en vez de dividir sus fuerzas y no poder preparar una defensa apropiada! ¡Ve, y que la buena fortuna te acompañe en Evendim!'","'¿Llevaste mi mensaje a Calenglad? ¡Me place oír eso!'","Torogethir te ha pedido que lleves noticias de sus esfuerzos en las Quebradas del Norte a Calenglad, un líder de los Montaraces."},
[1208]={"You have defeated many spying crebain.","You have defeated many spying crebain and thwarted the enemies' plans of learning your battle strategies.","Defeated creban (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","An Issue With Spying Wings","Completado","Cangoras has noticed increasing numbers of spying crebain on the Western side of Osgiliath that need to be dealt with.","Crebain can be found on the Western side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat crebain.","'Have you noticed, among the crows there are spying birds of the enemy? These crebain watch us with their beady little eyes. I know not who their master is but it surely is the enemy trying to get the upper hand.\
\
'You should defeat the crebain quickly before these birds report back to their master with information that could turn the tide of the battle.'","Derrota a los crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1209]={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Orchalwë está en Tinnudir, al sur de Rantost.\
\
Orchalwë quiere hablar contigo sobre lo que le depara el futuro a Evendim.","'Hemos hecho un buen trabajo aquí, y me alegra poder volver a casa y regresar al trabajo de verdad. Los pocos Montaraces con los que hablé antes de que se fueran fueron muy cordiales. Estaban emocionados por devolver estas reliquias a Tinnudir, pero también esperaban una relación más abierta y beneficiosa con Ost Forod... algo que sin duda vemos con buenos ojos.\
\
'Los Montaraces me dijeron que Orchalwë en Tinnudir quería hablar contigo. Creo que es para agradecerte tu ayuda y asistencia, pero sospecho que habrá más cosas que hacer.'","'Los saqueadores de tumbas no amenazarán más nuestra historia. Te agradezco enormemente tu trabajo para detenerlos. Sé que te enviamos inicialmente para restaurar el pacto con Ost Forod, pero que tú, y ellos, vayáis más allá y nos entreguéis Rantost... No hay palabras para expresar mi gratitud.'","'Deberías hablar con Orchalwë en Tinnudir.'","Un juramento renovado","Los Montaraces en Tinnudir querrán hablar contigo sobre Rantost, los saqueadores de tumbas y lo que viene a continuación."},
[1211]={"Orc-ambushers have frequently attacked travellers along the road west from Elthengels. Guthléod, a trader, hopes that confronting the ambushers directly might help to reduce the number of attacks along the roads.","Defeat Orc-ambushers south of the road to Elthengels (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Orc-ambushers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You did well to make it to our encampment alive. The roads grow more dangerous with each passing day, and Théoden King's response is to send fewer Riders to protect them!\
\
'It is of no surprise that fewer travellers have been attempting to reach our camp, and those who have dared it have been frequently ambushed by Orcs along the road to the east. If you might deal with these treacherous ambushers, we would all be in your debt.'","'You gave those Orcs just what they deserved. Well done! This should make things much easier on those who take the road from the east to our camp.'","Guthléod can be found at his tent at the trader's outpost, west of the village of Elthengels.\
\
You have defeated many of the Orc-ambushers and should inform Guthléod that his request has been fulfilled.","An Obstructive Foe","Orc-ambushers have been frequently seen south of the road leading west from Elthengels.\
\
Guthléod has asked you to assault the ambushers directly in the hopes of preventing more of their attacks on unwary travellers.","Return to Guthléod at the merchants' camp"},
[1213]={"Con la migración de orcos y trasgos hacia las Tierras Solitarias occidentales, los Eglain intentaron reavivar sus antiguas relaciones comerciales con un elfo de Rivendel, al este. Sin embargo, se encontraron con grandes bestias torpes en el Camino y no se atrevieron a seguir adelante.","Hay jabalíes que deambulan por todas partes al este, entre Ost Guruth y el Último Puente, y huargos que deambulan por la zona cercana a Ost Guruth, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Frideric reside en el bastión en ruinas de los Eglain de Ost Guruth, al norte del Gran Camino del Este, en las Tierras Solitarias.\
\
Frideric te ha pedido que le ayudes a reunir una ofrenda de paz constituida por ancas de jabalí y pieles de huargo para las extrañas criaturas que viven cerca del Último Puente, en el extremo oriental del Gran Camino del Este.","Ancas de jabalí recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega las pieles y las ancas a Frideric","Recoge pieles de huargo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge ancas de jabalí (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Sí, estas estarán bien. Llenarán nuestras reservas a tiempo y nos permitirán desprendernos de parte de la carne que ya hemos curado, y las pieles demostrarán que compartimos un enemigo común.\
\
'Ya hemos preparado la ofrenda, pero necesitábamos reponer nuestras existencias antes de seguir adelante.'","'Hay huargos por todas partes al sur, al oeste y al este de Ost Guruth. Los jabalíes están al este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este, hacia el Último Puente. Reúne la carne y las pieles y vuelve a verme.'","Pieles de huargo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una ofrenda de paz","'Nuestras rutas se cruzan de nuevo, ${PLAYER}. Hay un servicio que me gustaría pedirte, un favor que podría resultar peligroso. Nuestros intercambios no se limitaban exclusivamente a la ciudad de Bree, en el oeste. También hemos comerciado con un Elfo del este.\
\
'Cuando comenzaron las incursiones en el oeste, enviamos a algunos de los nuestros hacia el este para reavivar nuestro comercio con el Elfo, pero regresaron tras ver grandes criaturas que avanzaban pesadamente cerca del camino del este.\
\
'Las criaturas no atacaron y actuaron de manera inteligente. Espero reunir bienes para ofrecerles como promesa de paz. Si estás dispuesto, necesitaré carne de los jabalíes que deambulan por el este y pieles de los huargos cercanos.'"},
[1214]={"'Pequeño, no queremos hacer daño a nadie, y la paz es tuya. Déjanos con nuestros propios problemas. No son tuyos.'","Entrega las carnes saladas y las pieles al líder de las criaturas","Con la migración de orcos y trasgos hacia las Tierras Solitarias occidentales, los Eglain intentaron reavivar sus antiguas relaciones comerciales con un elfo de Rivendel, al este. Sin embargo, se encontraron con grandes bestias torpes en el Camino y no se atrevieron a seguir adelante.","El campamento de las criaturas se encuentra al sur del Gran Camino del Este, cerca de las Piedras Abatidas, al sureste de Ost Guruth.\
\
Frideric el Anciano te ha proporcionado una caja con carnes saladas y pieles para que las entregues como ofrenda de paz a las criaturas cercanas a las Piedras Abatidas.","'Hemos recogido carne salada y pieles de huargos. Nos gustaría ofrecerlas a las criaturas, con la esperanza de que no sean hostiles.\
\
'Te pido que tengas precaución, porque esto podría resultar muy peligroso. No sabemos qué son estas criaturas, pero sabemos que no son trolls. \
\
'Explora al sur del Gran Camino del Este, al sureste de aquí, cerca de las Piedras Abatidas. Deberías encontrar un modesto campamento allí. Busca a su líder y ofrécele estos objetos en nuestro nombre.'","'¿Qué es esto, pequeño extraño? Huele a carne y pieles. ¿Dices que es un regalo para los Jorthkyn?\
\
'Kekkonen acepta el regalo, pequeño, pero no podemos ofrecer nada a cambio. No podemos ayudar a nadie hasta que no tengamos más problemas. Nos han echado de nuestro hogar y debemos encontrar un lugar seguro donde vivir.'","'Sabemos que las criaturas se han hecho enemigos de los orcos y los huargos. Por eso esperamos que esta ofrenda les demuestre que no somos sus enemigos y que, en realidad, preferiríamos ser sus aliados. Los encontrarás cerca de las Piedras Abatidas, al sureste de Ost Guruth.'","Una ofrenda de paz, Segunda parte"},
[1215]={"Endunâm has asked you to collect beans found along the road travelling north-east to the old salt mines. He also needs pork loins from wild boars and fresh herbs, both from Shegdush far to the east.","Collect beans (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the ingredients to Endunâm in Iridír","Collected fresh herbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect fresh herbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected beans (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Lûkal, you are back! Have you the ingredients? Yes, there they are! Perfect!'\
\
You watch as Endunâm expertly prepares the ingredients and adds a sauce filled with spices, garlic, and onions. He puts the ingredients in a large cooking pot and places it in the oven. As it simmers, the smell is enticing and it starts to feel like it's been forever since you last ate.\
\
Endunâm finally takes the pot from the oven, inspects his handiwork, and gives it a taste.\
\
'Mmm. Quite good, but not exactly the same. I am getting closer though!  Here, have a bowl and I will give you some to take on the road. Thank you for your help lûkal, be safe in your travels!'","An Old Family Recipe","'I need some fresh herbs, beans, and meat from fen-wallowers. The sooner you get them, the sooner we can eat!'","Collected pork loins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Endunâm wants to recreate a dish his grandmother used to make but does not have all the ingredients he needs.","'Tell me lûkal, have you any interest in tasting Ambarûli cuisine? I am trying to recreate a dish my grandmother used to make, but I do not have all the ingredients. I will tell you what - if you bring me the ingredients, I will give you a plate! Then you can say you have had some of the best food in the world!'\
\
The man laughs heartily and grins.\
\
'What say you, friend? I need some snap beans. They grow on vines to the north-east along the road to the old salt mines. I will need loins from fen-wallowers. There are many of them far to the east in Shegdush. You can also find fresh herbs that I think will be perfect for this dish in Shegdush. The sooner you get them, the sooner we can eat!'","Collect pork loins from fen-wallowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have collected the meat, beans, and herbs for which Endunâm asked. You should bring the ingredients to him in Iridír."},
[1216]={"Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should speak with Thranduil about the failed trap.","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should bring the spider leg to Thranduil.","The Beorning takes a deep breath.\
\
'Ah... forgive me. My wits are returning. Grant me one more calming breath and I will tell my tale as it should be told. There. Now, then.\
\
'When the Elf-king closed off his realm, I was still within it, and therefore unable to return home. By good fortune I was in the company of these poor Elves, with whom I had traded many years and knew well. They kindly offered to lead me to Felegoth, where I might bide my time. \
\
'Thither we were going when, here on the path and without warning, spiders descended all about us! Me, they ignored - but fell upon each and every Elf with a strange and silent fury. \
\
'What I tell you is true. Look into my eyes. Look at the nature of their wounds. Come, we must go to Felegoth and tell the Elves of this!'","Collect corrupted sap from Huorns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Some spiders, at least, remain in Mirkwood, and they bear a grudge against the Elves.","An Old Hunch","Catch a spider","This looks like an ideal place for a trap","This is a good spot for the trap","'It did not work? Was I wrong in my suspicion? Let me think.\
\
'That is it. The sap was too pure. The forest becomes Green-leafed once more, and Mirkwood no longer. It will be the old, befouled sap they hunger for. Seek out corrupted Huorns, for their blood is a most vile sap. Then we shall learn if Iphantemel hides somewhere within these woods.'","Wait and watch the trap","Collected sap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The last place anyone saw spiders was near the caravan that was attacked.\
\
You should wait and watch the trap to see if any spiders come.","Lay a trap to catch one of Iphantemel's spawn","It is not long before you hear something approach!","The last place anyone saw spiders was near the caravan that was attacked.\
\
You should use the sap to lay a trap for the spiders.","You should collect sap from trees in Eryn Lasgalen that the Elves have already tapped for sap collection.","Collected corrupted sap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the spider leg to Thranduil","Collect sap from trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thranduil","'Mark the colouring upon this leg. Yes, they are strikingly like the markings upon Iphantemel. I am convinced this was indeed one of her brood. If the pure sap of cleansed trees does not sate them, they must be driven as much by hunger as by malice.'","The sap can be taken from corrupted Huorns throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should collect corrupted sap for a second attempt at laying a trap.","'Hállkell has told me his story. His face is an honest one and I do not suspect him of deceit. Rather, instead, I find myself recalling things far in the past. Yes, it was many years ago... a great spider, strong and cunning and filled with malice. Iphantemel we called her, and she was nearly my match. I was stung, and in return gave her a grievous wound. At that, she fled... and though I hunted her many years, I never more than glimpsed her. She was wily, as I have said, and laid many traps for me.\
\
'That was long ago, but such an ambush as Hállkell describes might well be her doing. Such malice against Elves and Elves alone I could also believe. And perhaps, due to the wound I dealt her, she was unable to flee with all the others of her wretched kind.\
\
'I know how we may test this hunch. Alone among the spiders of Mirkwood, Iphantemel and all her spawn crave the sap of trees, and drink it as you might water. Would you return to the wood and gather some sap? You will find taps here and there, set by my foresters. It is time that we laid a trap of our own.'","While the spider was too vicious for capture, its leg should provide Thranduil with clues","A good place for a trap might be closer to Felegoth, near the main road that runs through Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should use the corrupted sap to lay a trap for the spiders.","Set up another trap to catch a spider","Thranduil can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil about the attack on the Elves at the caravan.","The trap is set!","Perhaps there is some part of the trap which is incorrect"},
[1217]={"Lleva el pergamino restaurado y la crónica de batalla a Culang","'¿Has recuperado ya el tesoro?'","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","No has encontrado ningún tesoro, solo un viejo libro mohoso","Este fragmento de pergamino parece interesante, pero es ilegbile. Quizá en combinación con otros fragmentos, el documento original pueda ser restaurado.","Fragmentos de pergamino ajado recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Culang se encuentra en Tinnudir.\
\
No has encontrado ningún gran tesoro; parece que el viejo tesoro fue saqueado hace mucho. Pero has recuperado un viejo libro: una crónica de la Batalla de Fornost. Quizás Culang pueda tener algo de interés en él, junto con el pergamino que restauró para ti.","'Un hallazgo interesante. Siempre he disfrutado con los rompecabezas como este. Veamos. Este va aquí... ah, es fácil. ¡Terminado! Veamos qué dice.\
\
'¡Extraordinario! En Evendim abundan las leyendas de antiguos tesoros, muchos de ellos completamente falsos. Pero este pergamino... es obra de un hombre... un aventurero podríamos decir por respeto a los muertos... que rebuscaba en los Campos de Fornost hace mucho, tras la gran derrota del Rey Brujo. Parece que este hombre enterró sus hallazgos no muy lejos.\
\
'Desde tu punto de vista, este tesoro es legítimo... no debería haber razón para que nadie pudiera recuperarlo de forma no honorable si averiguaba su localización. Si quieres encontrar este tesoro, según el pergamino, se halla bajo un hito de piedra en Barad Rath, las ruinas al noreste de aquí.'","Recupera fragmentos de pergamino desvaídos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recupera fragmentos de pergamino ajado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has encontrado un interesante fragmento de pergamino. Por sí mismo es ilegible, pero quizá en combinación con otros fragmentos el pergamino original pueda ser restaurado.","Pergamino restaurado recibido","Fragamentos de pergamino desvaídos recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El viejo tesoro está enterrado bajo un hito de piedra, al noreste de Tinnudir en las ruinas de Barad Rath.\
\
Culang te ayudó a reconstruir el viejo pergamino y te dio buenasnoticias: no solo indica dónde se encuentra un viejo tesoro, sino que el tesoro puede ser recuperado honorablemente, ya que no hay registros de los dueños originales.","'¡Ay! Siento que no hayas encontrado un gran tesoro. Debió ser saqueado hace mucho. A decir verdad, un viejo libro como este es un tesoro para mí, aunque supongo que no tenía ningún valor para los saqueadores.\
\
'Tengo poco que ofrecerte para animarte, pero te daré lo que pueda por el libro y el pergamino.'","Tinnudir, una isla al oeste de Emyn Uial, podría ser la residencia de un maestro del saber que pueda ayudarte a restaurar el pergamino.\
\
Has encontrado todos los fragmentos del pergamino. Ahora todo lo que tienes que hacer es juntarlos.","'Una lástima que el alijo que encontraste no tuviera un tesoro, pero quizá el conocimiento que hallaste pruebe ser de gran valor.'","Los bandidos y saqueadores pueden encontrarse en muchos lugares del lago Evendim.\
\
Los bandidos y saqueadores de tumbas de Evendim podrían tener los fragmentos restantes del pergamino que encontraste.","Un viejo tesoro","Recupera el tesoro del antiguo alijo","Encuentra a alguien que te ayude a restaurar el pergamino a partir de sus fragmentos"},
[1218]={"Talk to Doron","'The day is ours, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I was not certain what we would face in those ruins, but it eases me to know that Ost Celebrant is once again in the hands of my people and our allies.\
\
'Your journey is far from over, but delight in this moment of peace.'","Doron can be summoned to your side by using your horn.","After searching the ruins of Ost Celebrant for signs of the Easterling invader, you have discovered a passageway under the fortress. Doron believes that this is where the Easterling has sought shelter.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","'This does not bode well, ${PLAYER}. We have scoured this fortress and the Easterling's whereabouts are still a mystery.\
\
'I know of a passage that leads down into the heart of Ost Celebrant, but I thought it crumbled with the passing of the years. If the tunnels still remain, the Easterling must surely be lurking under these ruins.\
\
'I can show you the way, but you must be ready for the danger we face. Gather your wits and make strong your resolve, we must depart now or risk losing all.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","An Omen from the East","'We must end this threat before it spreads further out of the East. Are you ready to depart?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Doron has brought you to the ruins of Ost Celebrant in search of the Easterling invader.\
\
Doron believes that the Easterling lurks somewhere in the tunnels below Ost Celebrant."},
[1219]={"'Puedes encontrar a Túbi en la cima de las escaleras, ${PLAYER}.'","'Ah, me alegra que alguien con habilidades de guerrero haya llegado. Me temo que este túnel me inquieta bastante, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Algunos enanos ya han salido bajo mi supervisión, pero aún no han regresado.'","Es hora de avanzar en la Moria desde la seguridad del Umbral de Durin.","'Has hecho mucho por nosotros, y ahora estoy seguro de que estás ansioso por avanzar en los túneles.\
\
'Túbi Puñogrueso está en la cima de las grandes escaleras justo allí, y creo que algunos enanos bajo su supervisión ya han comenzado a avanzar! Si estás interesado en hacer lo mismo, Túbi podría tener información que sería útil para tu viaje.'","Túbi Puñogrueso está en la cima de las grandes escaleras del Umbral de Durin.\
\
Debes subir las escaleras y encontrar a Túbi Puñogrueso.","Un túnel ominoso","Encuentra a Túbi Puñogrueso en la cima de las escaleras"},
[1221]={"Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja en busca de un hombre sospechoso","Hay informes de desapariciones recientes en Sormedân. Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja cercano para encontrar pistas sobre el culpable.","Se desploma, pero no hay cuerpo, nada más que tela en el suelo","Cae sin vida al suelo, rodeado de sus víctimas","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","'Esa persona no parece muy ordinaria. Me pregunto qué secretos estaba ocultando. Aún así, Jôrlar estará contento de que se haya ido, y estas desapariciones deberían detenerse. Regresemos a Zajâna con las buenas noticias.'","Escuchas su voz, riendo, más profundamente en el Cuerno de la Hoja","Alguien se acerca tranquilamente hacia ti","Derrota a este hombre de aspecto ordinario en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario","Un hombre ordinario","Investiga el Cuerno de la Hoja para encontrar al culpable de una serie de desapariciones recientes.","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario más profundamente en el Cuerno de la Hoja.","Persigue y derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario","Derrota al hombre de aspecto ordinario de nuevo"},
[1222]={"Uno de los semiorcos de Barad Morlas llevaba un collar ornamentado, deberías devolverlo a Ladenthir.","'Has hecho bien en traerme este tesoro. Es una reliquia de la Segunda Edad de este mundo, hecha por un herrero de los Noldor... su belleza no podría confundirse con la obra de ningún otro artesano.\
\
'Enviaré este tesoro a Rivendel. Tal vez allí, el Maestro Elrond pueda identificar al herrero exacto que lo creó, y los Elfos de su casa puedan limpiarlo y restaurarlo; aunque sin duda nunca recuperará su gloria completa después de su largo abandono y maltrato por los siervos de Saruman.'","Un Collar Ornamentado","Lleva el collar a Ladenthir en Echad Eregion","Este collar está cubierto de suciedad y mugre, pero brilla con un resplandor que se filtra a través de las manchas.\
\
Después de limpiar un poco la suciedad, puedes ver que se trata de un collar élfico hecho por una mano hábil. Deberías llevarlo a Ladenthir en Echad Eregion. Él podría arrojar más luz sobre su origen.","Ladenthir está en Echad Eregion, al sur de la Alta Acebeda.\
\
Debes llevar el collar a Ladenthir para una inspección más detallada.","'¿Sí? ¿Puedo ayudarte?'"},
[1223]={"'Who are you? I do not speak with wanderers of the wild... duvodiad!'","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
You should speak with Saeradan regarding his plans for the items you collected.","'Complete the tasks you have been set, ${PLAYER}, and I will have more for you to do.'","Complete Warmth for the Winter","Saeradan and several other Rangers have ventured into the Windfells as advance scouts for the Grey Company to help ensure that their purpose remains secret, but also to help provision the Company.","'I am not sure I like your wandering friends... Algraig indeed!'","An Outstretched Hand","Completed A Healing Hand","'Deliver the goods to the Algraig goatherds, ${PLAYER}... I believe they are our best hope for obtaining provisions.'","Complete Feathers for Friendship","The Algraig goatherds are at Gavar Cadlus, north-east of Echad Saeradan, along the foothills of the Misty Mountains.\
\
Saeradan asked you to deliver the herbs, pelts, and feathers you collected to the Algraig goatherds as a peace offering.","Deliver the peace offering to the Algraig goatherds at Gavar Cadlus","'What is this? Who are you? We do not know your kind... you are duvodiad to us! You speak on behalf of some wanderers of the wild? Algraig! That is an insult! Do you speak on behalf of our brothers of old? The clans of Dunland say we are Algraig... Outliers.\
\
'We are no lesser Men than they! You do not speak for the Others? Then perhaps I will forgive the insult, for your wanderers may not know our ways. Tell me what it is you wish of us.'","Complete A Healing Hand","Saeradan, Andreg, and Amlan are at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith.\
\
Saeradan has asked you to aid the Grey Company in their many tasks. He told you that he had a task for you, and that Amlan and Andreg might as well.","'They took offence at the name Algraig? Then we will say Uch-lûth from here on.'","'Well done, ${PLAYER}. The Algraig will hopefully find our offering of peace acceptable and grant trade with us through you as our agent.\
\
'Some distance to the north-east, along the foothills of the mountains, we noticed a camp of Algraig goatherds. Take these goods to their leader and present them to him with our request for trade.'","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","'We will hear you, but I promise nothing, Duvodiad.'","'Do you think the Uch-lûth will trade with us?'","Completed Warmth for the Winter","Completed Feathers for Friendship","'Hail, ${PLAYER}. It has been long since you and I worked together to hinder the efforts of the traitor Saruman in Bree. Chief Watcher Grimbriar still does not comprehend the significance of what we have done.\
\
'But never mind that now... we have other matters to discuss. You know already that we go to the aid of our chieftain Aragorn in the South, but we travel through hostile lands and must secure our route. Besides that, we will need provisions. This will require the good will of the Algraig, the Dunlending clans which have migrated into this region.\
\
'Will you help us? I have a task in mind for you, and I believe Amlan and Andreg may as well.'"},
[1224]={"'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. Your services have been invaluable.'","'${PLAYER}, I must thank you for your efforts on our behalf. With the agreement of Grufudh, we shall continue to supply his people with pelts, feathers, and herbs in exchange for provisions.\
\
'Will you take this new delivery to Grufudh at Gavar Cadlus? When you have delivered the goods, return to me, and I will reward you as I may.'","'These goods are much welcomed, Duvodiad, though I am still not sure I trust these wild-wanderers.\
\
'Return now to your friend with our thanks. Assure him that we will make good on our promises.'","'Take the goods to Grufudh... hopefully, he will prepare more supplies for our Company.'","'Take our thanks to your wild friends.'","Grufudh is at Gavar Cadlus, north-east of Echad Saeradan.\
\
Saeradan has asked you to deliver more pelts, feathers, and herbs to Grufudh the goatherd.","An Outstretched Hand -- Repeatable","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Grufudh of the Uch-lûth has agreed to trade with the Grey Company in exchange for medicines and goods.","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith, south-west of Gavar Cadlus.\
\
Grufudh told you to return to Saeradan with the thanks of his people and assurance that supplies will be sent.","'Have your friends chosen not to trade with us?'","Bring the pelts, feathers, and herbs to Grufudh at Gavar Cadlus"},
[1225]={"'Excuse me -- have you seen my younger brother Orthor? He has brown hair, wears red... no? I swear I've searched for him everywhere!\
\
'Oh, I hope he's not upset with me. Just earlier, I scolded him for playing so many pranks on everyone, especially poor old Mildir.\
\
'I'll keep looking around Ost Lontir but... could you please make sure he isn't at the beacon? If he isn't here or there, I don't know what I'll do...'","Cenedel has asked you to check Amon Lontir and see whether Orthor is there.\
\
Amon Lontir is located just outside of Ost Lontir.","An Overdue Apology","Look for Orthor at Amon Lontir","Talk to Orthor","'This letter is... completely illegible.'\
\
The man cracks a slight smile.\
\
'Thank you for delivering this very important message. I suppose I'll have to go up to the beacon myself to ask Orthor what he wrote. Worry not; I'll make sure to let Cenedel know of his whereabouts.'","A young boy named Orthor has disappeared from Ost Lontir.","You have found Orthor at Amon Lontir.\
\
You should talk to him.","'I'm not upset!'\
\
The boy's puffy, red eyes tell you otherwise.\
\
'I'm sorry, I didn't mean to yell. And I didn't mean to make Cenedel worry.\
\
'I was just... writing a letter to Mr. Mildir. I wanted to say sorry. But he might think I'm trying to bother him. Or that I'm trying to play more pranks.\
\
'Please, could you go back and give my letter to him? It's very important.'","Talk to Mildir at Ost Lontir","This boy matches Cenedel's description of Orthor!","Orthor has asked you to deliver an apology note to Mildir.\
\
Mildir can be found in Ost Lontir."},
[1227]={"Baldthorne, the blacksmith, requires help filling the rather large orders he has undertaken for weapons and armour.","An Overwhelming Order","Return the weapons and armour-pieces to Baldthorne","Baldthorne is awaiting the reclaimed weapons and armour at his smith in Elthengels.\
\
You have reclaimed the weapons and armour pieces, once taken by the Orcs from Rohirrim.","Reclaim Rohirrim armour-pieces from the Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'These pieces of steel are still in fine condition! May they serve their new owners better than their last. To think the Orcs would claim these as trophies from the dead angers me.\
\
'These weapons belong in the hands of our people... thank you for helping me put them there. Thanks to you, I will have the orders ready soon.'","'Helmets, spears, shields, pauldrons, greaves... I will never finish these orders! Elthengel's guards and its garrison have both placed urgent orders for a great deal of weapons and armour pieces. Never has my skill or speed with a smithing hammer been questioned, but this task is too great even for me!\
\
'I have a plan that may resolve this issue, if you would be willing to aid me. I have heard that some of the Orcs besieging the Norcrofts are known to collect swords and armour pieces from our Riders as trophies of their kills. If some of these items were reclaimed, I could include them in the shipments to the garrison. What say you? Are you up to this task?'","Orcs can be found scavenging in the fields around Elthengels.\
\
Baldthorne has asked you to recover any Rohirrim weapons or armour-pieces from the Orcs, to help him supply the guards and garrison.","Reclaimed Rohirrim armour-pieces from the Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reclaimed Rohirrim weapons from the Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reclaim Rohirrim weapons from the Orcs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1228]={"Bowstaves are scattered about the worksite.\
\
Wunne has asked you to help craft spears. You should collect many bowstaves. Once you collect them, they can be used from your inventory to craft spears.","'If I do not finish, I shudder to think what they will do to me....'","Crafted spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Craft the staves you collect into spears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","An Overwhelming Supply of Spears","'So many staves, so many staves! All of these staves you see must be turned into spears... in fact, they should have been turned into spears hours ago!\
\
'I do not know what to do. Do you know how to craft spears, duvodiad? I would certainly appreciate the help. I worry about what the Overseer will do to me if I fail....'","Wunne can be found at the fourth worksite in Galtrev.\
\
You should bring the spears you made to Wunne so that she can deliver them to Flint Ironheart.","'I cannot believe it, ${PLAYER}! You have put me ahead for today's workload. Thank you -- I cannot express the trouble I would have been in had this supply of spears not been delivered to the overseer.'","Bring the spears you crafted to Wunne","An absurd number of spears must be made before the day's end, but Wunne only has two hands. There is no way she can finish the task on her own."},
[1229]={"Entierra a los enanos caídos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Fuelles y yunque, esto es inaceptable! \
\
'Los cuerpos de nuestros hermanos no pueden seguir alimentando a estas criaturas. Pondremos fin a esto, o que se marchite mi barba.\
\
'El primer paso es asegurar el tratamiento respetuoso de esos cuerpos. Debemos permitir que regresen a la piedra de nuestra amada Khazad-dûm. Por favor, ve a enterrarlos, luego regresa a verme.'","Los enanos caídos han sido enterrados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Nökkvi en el Refugio Sombrío","'Ve a Mazam-dûm, en la orilla este del lago, y entierra a los caídos, de modo que estas bestias sinnombre no puedan seguir alimentándose de ellos.'","'Ah, es un día muy triste, ${PLAYER}, cuando un enano debe preocuparse de que sus restos sean comidos, en lugar de ser enterrados con el respeto y los discursos conmemorativos adecuados.\
\
'Levantemos una jarra por los caídos... ¡serán vengados!'","Nökkvi se horrorizó al descubrir que los Sinnombre se han estado alimentando de los cadáveres de los enanos y siente que se debe poner fin a esta profanación.","Nökkvi se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Debes regresar a Nökkvi para contarle sobre los entierros que realizaste.","Encontraste cadáveres de enanos en un lugar llamado Mazam-dûm, en la orilla este del lago que baña las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Nökkvi te ha pedido que entierres los cadáveres de enanos que encontraste.","Una dieta inaceptable"},
[1230]={"'My good ${RACE}, you returned with some quality hides. Those were large bears, if those hides are any evidence.\
\
'I may keep the largest among them for a bear-rug in my new home, if we ever make it there....'","Bears are hunting in the Roaring Hills to the south of the road where Oter and Stithwulf are camped.\
\
Stithwulf asked you to hunt the bears and bring back any unblemished hides that you are able to collect.","Stithwulf is at his camp in the Stonedeans, north of the Roaring Hills.\
\
Stithwulf would like to thank you for ensuring the safety of their camp and returning with hides.","'We left Woodhurst and we will not look back. I expected someone to follow us, but my scouting has only revealed tracks of bears...many of them. The Roaring Hills to the south appears to be a favoured hunting ground. However, I will gladly deal with bears over backstabbing Deansmen!\
\
'Bears can be dangerous, though, and these were not small. One might ravage our waggon or hurt us badly if it got too close. Also, we could always use a few extra hides. Could I ask you to keep them away from our camp and gather any hides you leave intact? We could always use them for blankets or trade.'","Place the bear-hides on the waggon","Return to Stithwulf","An Unbearable Road","Defeat bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pieles de oso recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta pieles de oso (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Placed the bear-hides on the waggon","Stithwulf and Oter's camp lies to the north of the Roaring Hills.\
\
Stithwulf asked you to bring any intact hides back to his camp to help bolster supplies for the long road.","Oter and Stithwulf will soon be leaving the Stonedeans. They camp along the road in relative safety while deciding where next to go and prepare by gathering supplies before they depart."},
[1231]={"'She ran away without a word to me? Foolish girl... when will she realize that Thrymm is gone?\
\
'I beg you, convince her to come back. I wish to speak with her. I am no stranger to grief, and I know that she must face hers.\
\
'She should try to help those who yet live.'","'She is gone then? So be it. I am afraid you must carry the weight of Wildermore on your shoulders alone from now on, good ${RACE}.\
\
'I am afraid we must put aside the search for answers on how Núrzum uses the stone. It is more important that we get word to Byre Tor that they must evacuate. I will not suffer the deaths of more of my people.'","'So now we see what Saruman is about! An evil cursed stone, bringing winter with it wherever it goes. Núrzum brings it to and fro across the lands to destroy everything in his wake.\
\
'Will you try to learn more about how Núrzum uses this stone, loyal ${CLASS}? If you do that, I can send Cyneberg to see how the northern city of Byre Tor has made out....'","Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Gárwig.","Cyneberg ran off to ready herself for a journey to the High Knolls to search for Thrymm.\
\
You should search for Cyneberg in Forlaw.","An Uncertain Fate","Cyneberg refuses to go to Byre Tor; she wishes instead to search the High Knolls for Thrymm","'I am sorry to worry Gárwig, but I'll not come back. I will not abandon Thrymm while he needs our help.\
\
'Gárwig will thank me when I return Thrymm to him, and together we shall drive away Núrzum!'","Gárwig would like you to see how Byre Tor fares, for to lose another city would be devastating for Wildermore.","'No, ${PLAYER}! I cannot be distracted this time. I will search for Thrymm, for our hope lies with him. You saw how Núrzum weakened for a moment at the blowing of the horn.\
\
'You must go to Byre Tor yourself. I will search for Thrymm. If I see anything of the stone you seek, I will send word to you.'","Cyneberg continues to swear that Thrymm is alive, and waiting for aid","Gárwig wants Cyneberg to confront her loss","Tell Cyneberg that Gárwig wishes her to search Byre Tor","Tell Gárwig of Cyneberg's denial","Try to convince Cyneberg to return to Gárwig, and accept her grief","Tell Gárwig that Cyneberg will not obey","Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should return to Gárwig.","Cyneberg has come to Lornsettle, the Mead Hall of Forlaw.\
\
You should speak with Cyneberg."},
[1232]={"Talk to the baker of Cliving","Giselmon can be found at her estate in the western section of Cliving.\
\
You may inform Giselmon that the vendors were pleased to help her send portions of her orders to be donated to the needy.","'Welcome! Have you come for something fresh? I have a lot of good things for sale, stranger! Oh, you are here about Giselmon's order? Yes, I am working hastily on assembling everything.'\
\
You explain that Giselmon has asked for a portion of her order be sent as charity to the poor.\
\
'That is quite noble of her... I will have it done right away!'","The baker has set aside food for the refugees","The butcher has set aside food for the refugees","Talk to the cheese-maker of Cliving","The cheese-maker has set aside food for the refugees","Giselmon has purchased large quantities of food in order to host a banquet, in the hopes of increasing her popularity. Isenyd has taken exception to this cause and has demanded that the food be donated to the refugee farmers who have been victims of the Orc-attacks.","'Thank you for the thoughtful suggestion, ${PLAYER}. You have saved me from making a terrible mistake. I have heard nothing but praise and admiration for my charitable efforts! I would not have guessed that such acts would be noticed and appreciated by others.\
\
'Please accept this as a token of my appreciation.'","'May I help you? I am busy with preparations for an important banquet.'\
\
You attempt to convince Giselmon that giving to charity will increase her popularity among the nobles, more so than her feast.\
\
'Well, I had not considered this. Oh dear, you are quite right. When others speak of me, they should be commenting on my kindness and generosity! Time is short... will you help me? Please speak to the butcher, cheese-maker, and baker of Cliving. Ask them to give much of the food intended for the banquet to Isenyd's collection instead.'","'The finest cheese in all of the Norcrofts for sale here! May I help you?'\
\
You explain that Giselmon wishes to donate a portion of food to charity.\
\
'Giselmon has had a change of heart? What a kind woman! I will be sure to send a portion of fine cheeses to be donated on her behalf.'","Giselmon can be found at her estate in the western section of Cliving.\
\
Isenyd has asked you to convince Giselmon that hosting a banquet in times of great turmoil would be distasteful and cause her to lose popularity.","Talk to the butcher of Cliving","Talk to Giselmon in Cliving","The vendors can be found at their individual stands in the marketplace, west of the central fountain in Cliving.\
\
Giselmon has asked you to speak with the food-vendors in Cliving, in order to divert a large portion of her purchases to help those in need.","'Greetings, my name is Isenyd. My home is here in Cliving, but many of the people who now occupy our city are wayward farmers who have been forced from their homes and have taken refuge within the city walls. I have asked my neighbours to donate food and shelter to those who have fled and left behind their belongings.\
\
'Many have given to the cause, but Giselmon is ignoring my pleas. She plans to host a large feast in honour of Reeve Athelward, an action she hopes will increase her own renown, as she values her opinion in others above all else. There are people in dire need of rations and she intends to foolishly host banquets for the wealthy.\
\
'Giselmon refuses to listen to me. She believes that I am jealous of her high esteem, and considers my request as a tactic to undermine her affairs. Perhaps you might sway her decision. Suggest to her that the nobles would view a banquet to be distasteful, and that a charitable donation would be viewed more favourably among her peers.'","'More orders from Giselmon?'\
\
You inform the butcher that Giselmon would like to donate a portion of her original purchase to the refugees.\
\
'If she wishes to be charitable, I would be glad to help her. I will set aside a nice lot of fresh meat to be collected for that poor lot of farmers.'","Convince Giselmon to donate food to the refugees","An Uncharitable Feast"},
[1234]={"'¿Algo de suerte?'","Pesca la pequeña y empapada bota","'¡Gracias!'\
\
Maggo toma la bota todavía empapada y la coloca en el pie de su muñeca.\
\
'Sr. Piestanque dice que ha encontrado una piedra mágica. No sabe lo que hace, solo que lo sabrás cuando llegue el momento.'","Pesca para buscar la bota perdida en el estanque cercano.","Una captura poco convencional","Devuelve la bota a Maggo Bonce","Has atrapado la pequeña y empapada bota","Maggo Bonce sujeta una vieja muñeca raída y te llama la atención a una bota que le falta.\
\
'Perdone, pero mi amigo el Sr. Piestanque ha perdido uno de sus zapatos en la charca. ¿Podrías recuperarlo? Dice que te recompensará generosamente por tus esfuerzos.\
\
'¡Creo que la veo brillar bajo el agua!'","Maggo Bonce está cerca del estanque al sureste de Nobotella.\
\
Entrega la bota a Maggo Bonce.","Tienes la misión de capturar la más esquiva de las presas: ¿una bota de juguete?"},
[1235]={"'Veo que ya nos entendemos, ${PLAYER}.'","Nekhtan estaba disgustado porque te eligieran a ti para participar en el Clúcath contra los Trév Duvárdain, viéndolo como una oportunidad perdida de llevar a cabo su venganza.","Un entendimiento","'¿Qué quieres, ? ¿Has vuelto para jactarte de que fuiste ${PLAYER:escogido[m]|escogida[f]} para luchar en el Clúcath contra los Trév Duvárdain? ¡La venganza para la que he entrenado durante tanto tiempo me ha sido arrebatada!\
\
'Lo siento. Sé que la elección es la correcta, aunque sea duro para mí. Es la costumbre de mi gente que el guerrero más fuerte es quien debe asumir este papel y has probado tu maestría. Debo anteponer las necesidades de los Trév Gállorg a mi propia venganza.\
\
'Dile a Raith, que se encuentra cerca del trono de Crannog, que he encontrado la calma. Ve al Clúcath con mi bendición, mi ${PLAYER:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'","'He dejado atrás la ira, ${PLAYER}. Nunca más te guardaré rencor. Dale estas noticias a Raith: que estoy satisfecho con la elección del contendiente escogido por Crannog para el Clúcath.\
\
'Encontrarás a Raith cerca del trono de Crannog, en Aughaire.'","'Lamento mi comportamiento, ${PLAYER}. Estaba equivocado.'","'¿Te has propuesto hacer las paces con Nekthan? Eso está bien, . Aunque antes lo dudaba, ahora lo tengo claro: Crannog tenía razón al darte este Fém. Eres verdaderamente un ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de los Trév Gállorg.","Raith is at Crannog's ruling-seat, west of the centre island of Aughaire.\
\
Nekhtan has told you that he is satisfied: you have proven to be worthy of taking his place in Clúcath against the Trév Duvárdain."},
[1236]={"'Did you experience anything strange while you explored the sites?'\
\
You recount what you saw at each of the locations Cerdic pointed out, and he seems to be quite relieved.\
\
'It was not all in my head, then? Good, ${PLAYER}. Thank you for setting my mind at ease! Whatever it was that instilled in me such uncommon fear may have moved on, but it is good to see it still had an effect on those sites! I knew I was no coward!'\
\
The word \\qNazgûl\\q dances at the forefront of your mind. If Cerdic knew the truth of what came so near to him he would not be so shamed by the fear that filled him.","Loose stones crunch underfoot, but you do not feel anything out of the ordinary","Cerdic is at the watch-post on the road in Parth Celebrant.\
\
You have investigated the sites Cerdic told you about, and should now return to him.","Examine debris by the crumbling corner in Ost Celebrant","Cerdic went to some other of the battlefield sites you did not search, but he was overcome by a powerful feeling of uneasiness.","'What does it mean? I am no coward, ${PLAYER}. Something strange is happening at those sites I visited, and I want you to see if you experience anything similar.'","The crumbling corner, the grassy river-overlook, and the stone bridge can be found in Parth Celebrant.\
\
Cerdic went searching some more locations of the ancient battlefield, and experienced strange sensations at some of them. He has marked them on your map and wants you to see what is happening at these sites.","The river rushes past far beneath you, but you feel nothing out of the ordinary","You feel nothing unusual by the bridge. Your prey did not travel this way.","Examine debris by the stone bridge","Examine debris by the grassy place overlooking the fast-flowing river","An Uneasy Feeling","'${PLAYER}, you have returned! I was just thinking about you, and wondering if you ever found what it was you were seeking. After you left, I went searching on my own, and... well...'\
\
Cerdic is having some trouble meeting your eyes.\
\
'I am not a coward, ${PLAYER}. I have stood unblinking before a shrieking mass of goblins, and not given way before a charging warband of Khundolar Easterlings. And I have even stood my ground when my wife was in one of her tempers! Well... mostly stood my ground.\
\
'But at certain sites on the battlefield, my courage was quite drained away. I felt uneasy, and everything seemed to get cold.\
\
'Will you go to some of these sites? I will mark them on your map. Look at the rubble of a crumbling corner in Ost Celebrant, a grassy ledge overlooking the fast-flowing river, and by one of the stone bridges over the river. I want to know what is happening out there, ${PLAYER}. I am ashamed to have felt that way. There must be a reason!'"},
[1237]={"Talk to Arvellon","Arvellon can be found at the southern entrance to Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have urged the folk to seek shelter in Tumladen and should now return to Arvellon.","Urged folk in Glaniath to seek refuge in Tumladen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'I cannot say I'm surprised that many of them ignored your advice to seek shelter... they have paid me no mind either since the skies went dark.\
\
'Still... I thank you for trying on my behalf. I only wish to see my people safely through this war, but it remains their choice to make.'","An Uneasy Peace","Urge folk in Glaniath to seek refuge in Tumladen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'I have been trying for days now to convince the people to leave... to seek shelter in Tumladen.\
\
'It is a great and fortified shelter for our people, one of a few in Gondor, and the brother to one that lies within the lands of Rohan. It is more than able to house all of the people of Lebennin and beyond, and its walls would keep us from the growing war in Gondor.\
\
'My folk are headstrong, traveller. They think that since Pelargir has been reclaimed and no foes have come to our doors that we are safe. I do not think it so!\
\
'Would you speak to them for me? Urge them to reconsider before it is too late!'","Arvellon's folk can be found throughout Glaniath in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Arvellon has asked you to convince his people to seek refuge in Tumladen.","The people of Glaniath have remained relatively sheltered from the horrors of war, but it is unclear how long this peace will last."},
[1238]={"'Date prisa, habla con Simbi en la sala Vigesimoprimera. ¡No podemos permitir que el Guardián mate a más de los nuestros!'","Habla con Simbi en la sala Vigesimoprimera","'¿Qué noticias traes? ¿Volverán a girar nuestras grandes ruedas?'\
\
Relatas tu historia de lo que has visto dentro de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
'¡No! ¿Cuántos más deben caer antes de que esa bestia deje de molestarnos? Esto es... un giro desafortunado. No tenemos los números para hacer un asalto contra la bestia todavía, pero quizás con el tiempo lo tengamos. Tú y tus aliados podrían ser capaces de darle un golpe final, pero siento que aún no están preparados.\
\
'La expedición debe continuar - llegará el momento de vengarnos de esta bestia. Por ahora, debemos recuperar Zelem-melek.'","Un flujo desigual","Kaldi desea que regreses con Simbi para informarle del regreso del Guardián.","Simbi se encuentra en la sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Kaldi desea que lleves noticias del regreso del Guardián a la expedición.","'Esto es una mala noticia, ${PLAYER}. El terrible monstruo que nos atacó fuera de la Puerta Oeste ha hecho su guarida aquí, entre las Obras Hidráulicas.\
\
Debes regresar a Simbi en la sala Vigesimoprimera de inmediato, e informarle de nuestra situación. Hemos tenido muchos éxitos aquí en las Obras Hidráulicas, pero este terror podría destruir todo por lo que hemos trabajado.\
\
Informaré a Indrith y Ansurr de tu paso. ¡Ve con rapidez!'"},
[1240]={"An Unexpected Connexion","'Wainriders? They have not been a threat to Gondor, much less seen at all, for hundreds of years now. Perhaps this spirit has mistaken the Easterlings for their old ancestors, else I cannot say. To have silently watched for so long, it is possible he has lost his understanding of the passing peoples and creatures of these lands.'\
\
Artamir's face still betrays his fear, but you sense a renewed resolve rising within him.\
\
'Fate and chance drove me to the Dead Marshes, and now they have guided me thus. I... I shall resist them no longer. I may not be the man this spirit seeks, but his knowledge of these lands and our enemies may be turned to our benefit. I... I believe I know this spirit's identity, my friend, but more questions still linger... and answers seem unlikely unless he and I speak alone.'","Talk to the accursed warrior at Tham Durlan","Artamir can be found at Tham Durlan in south-western Dagorlad.\
\
You have had a strange encounter with a shade of Gondor and should now tell Artamir about what you have seen and heard.","'You say a spirit of some kind knew my name, ${PLAYER}? That he called out for an Artamir?\
\
'I have had quite enough dealings with spirits for my liking, I'll have you know. There must be some mistake...\
\
'You see, it is common in Gondor to honour our ancestors by bestowing their names upon our children, and even within Minas Tirith, I know no fewer than two others bearing my name. If I am recalling correctly, I even once told you of old King Ondoher's son named Artamir.\
\
'No, no. That man cannot be me, my friend. How long has this spirit lingered in the Wastes? How many have fallen since he met his own end?'\
\
Artamir begins to trail off as a look of horror appears on his face.\
\
'D-do not move, ${PLAYER}!'","Artamir can be found at Tham Durlan in Dagorlad.\
\
The accursed warrior has not spoken to you since his arrival, but offered Artamir a grim warning. You should talk with Artamir about what is to be done.","As the shade wanders Ondoher's Folly, it wails names that seem both familiar and unknown all at once.","His words still fresh in your memory, the shade floats silently before you.\
\
The shade wailed the name Artamir, and spoke as if Artamir were his brother. Without pausing to consider the absurdity of what you are about to speak, you tell the shade that a man named Artamir is among your company in the ruins to the south.\
\
A puzzled expression washes over the shade's face, and his gaze swiftly shifts to meet your own. However, before speaking a word, he vanishes.","The accursed warrior has appeared at Tham Durlan in Dagorlad.\
\
You have told Artamir of the strange connexion between him and the accursed warrior, and now the shade has appeared at his side. You should try to uncover the shade's purpose in coming to Tham Durlan.","The shade stares at you, but remains silent.\
\
After a moment, he turns to Artamir and begins to speak.","Talk to Artamir","The accursed warrior has appeared beside Artamir and stares intently at the lore-master","Talk to Artamir at Tham Durlan"},
[1241]={"Half-orcs can be found on the crofts surrounding Garsfeld.","Defeat Half-orcs in the fields of Garsfeld (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","An Unexpected Crop","Talk to Gísil","'I am glad you have returned, ${PLAYER}. The half-orcs will taste revenge for the destruction they have wrought.\
\
You have the thanks of Garsfeld, but as always, there is more to be done!'","Gísil can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.","Garsfeld has recently been harried by an invading force of Half-orcs. Gísil wishes you to drive them off and reclaim the crofts directly outside of town.","Defeated Half-orcs in the fields of Garsfeld (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'My son's heart is in the right place. The half-orcs have sacked most of our fields, and lurk just outside town. We have held them on the fields, but we will soon find ourselves surrounded.\
\
'If you could take the fight to them, we might be able to start pushing back towards their camp to the north-east.\
\
'Travel to the crofts just outside town, you will find the half-orcs there...or if you don't, they will certainly find you. Go with care.'"},
[1242]={"You're unable to read the majority of the messy scratch on the note but manage to discern that the goblins hail from Súlstrok, to the west of Umbar Baharbêl. They are here in an attempt to stage a rescue of their leader, Shakfut Slit-throat, who has gone to the arena to fight as a gladiator.","You have located the camp Nashôn described, but he was mistaken. This is not a camp for children.","Elimina trasgos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Umbar Baharbêl is a rough city that has seen more than its fair share of war and loss. Sail-haven residents have reported petty crimes committed by small, shadowy figures spotted lurking near sewer entrances late at night. I believe that at the western end of Ilmabiri, there is an encampment of the city's homeless children. People have been referring to them as Mâtrikhai, the Unseen Ones.\
\
'Foetid, dank sewers are no place for a child. Would you mind scouting the encampment out and seeing how they fare? I'm not sure we would be prepared to move them immediately, but we may be able to re-direct some supplies in the meantime.'","Investigate the goblin camp","'Goblins!?  Are you quite sure they were not children?'\
\
You explain that you fought some, and found a note that explains their presence.\
\
'This is very unexpected, to say the least. Thank you for discovering this. I will pass the information along to my Captain.'","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. While investigating the camp, you have spotted a note indicating that they have recently come from Súlstrok to attempt to rescue their leader, Shakfut Slit-throat, from the fighting pits of the arena.","Find the camp Nashôn described","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. You should look around the camp for clues explaining why they are here.","You spot a note","An Unexpected Encounter","Nashôn has asked you to investigate an area of Ilmabiri beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. There have been reports that lead him to believe that there is an encampment of homeless children there and he is concerned for their welfare.","Talk to Nashôn","You have discovered a camp of goblins inside Ilmabiri. While investigating the camp, you have spotted a note.","trasgos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Read the note","Travel to the western areas of Ilmabiri and locate the camp of homeless children.","This does not appear to be a camp of children"},
[1243]={"A dwarf named Grímyr has asked to speak with you privately about some urgent matter.","'${PLAYER}, you stand before me accused of the murder of Grímyr of Durin's Folk. My guard discovered you standing over his body, weapon in hand! You would already be clapped in irons if they had not also found this....'\
\
He pulls a small object from a pouch and shows it to you: a small, perfectly round stone, darker than the deepest cave, blacker than night. As you look into it, something within the stone pulls at your mind, bidding you to look deeper. This stone is known to you. Thorin quickly puts it back into the pouch.\
\
'Indeed. This is the Secret Stone. I had ordered it to be moved from its place and hidden once more, but Grímyr must have discovered its location and stolen it away. You are a hero of Durin's Folk, ${PLAYER}, and in my eyes you are innocent of any wrong-doing; do we not know how this stone can affect the mind? But it is clear to me now that the stone cannot be kept safely in Erebor.'","'Come, friend. Let us speak in private.'","'Well met, friend. Tell me, are you ${PLAYER}? I have heard much about you from King Thorin! I admit I had been hoping to meet you in person. There is something... secret... about which I must ask. Come, let us move somewhere a little more private.'","Attend the 'Secret Meeting'","An Unexpected Request","Grímyr would like to speak with you privately.\
\
You should speak with him to attend the 'Secret Meeting'.","You have been accused of murder!\
\
You should talk to King Thorin.","Talk to King Thorin"},
[1244]={"'Good fortune has graced me this day. I expected never to be free of those so-called Nink-hai! However, there is a thought that gnaws at me deeply.\
\
'The others have told me that Lanbert had not sent you to search me out, nor had any other. Did he not become alarmed when I failed to return from scouting duty? Bolder do the Orcs become with each passing day, and still he considers them not a threat! Perhaps Odda was right... nay, forget my words. It is not our concern.\
\
'I am truly grateful for being rescued. My thanks to you, ${PLAYER}.'","An Unexpected Rescue","Release Magla from his bonds","A captured member of the Rohirrim is in need of rescue from the Orcs.","'I cannot break free from these bonds without help. Please, untie the rope from around this pole, before more of them return!'","'Oh, how good it is to see you, stranger! Was it my Sergeant, Lanbert, who sent you?\
\
'For now, it matters not. You must free me! Hurry, before more of them return.'","Magla has fled back to the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan.\
\
Magla is awaiting your return at camp. He has something to discuss with you.","Magla has been released from captivity","Magla remains captured in the southern Wailing Hills.\
\
Magla has asked you to release him from his bonds, so that he may escape the Orcs.","Talk to Magla at the Cuthstan-camp"},
[1246]={"The Ungoledain are defeated and have fled, but you are not quite out of the woods just yet.","Habla con Radagast","'Th... th... thank you, ${PLAYER}. I see now what a fool's errand I was on, alone and without protection from the spider-folks' poisons.\
\
'I... I am not well. Not feeling well. I fear none of my folk have the art to treat this poison. Will you go back to Radagast and ask what he c... could do for me?'","'${RACE}, we have successfully driven the Ungoledain from Thornholt. That is as good a reason to celebrate as any, however I cannot bring myself to so much as look at those honey cakes, while Vaskorn is ill. I feel quite ill myself with remorse.\
\
'Could you go check on him, and see if there is any improvement in his condition?'","Threkmóth asked you to check on Vaskorn's condition.","Talk to Vaskorn","Threkmóth can be found in Skoghús, in the south of Thornholt.\
\
Vaskorn is not feeling well. You should return to Threkmóth and update him.","An Unexpected Story","Radagast can be found in the north of the Thornholt woods.\
\
With Vaskorn's condition not improving, Radagast should be notified in case there is something he can do for the Beorning.","'Spider-folk, poison, honey cakes? What kind of madness is this? You think I want to go in Thornholt now? I trust you less than that wizard after this tale you have spun. \
\
'I'll simply have to convince some other poor drak to go and gather that wood. It's as simple as that.'","'I am quite relieved to hear that the Ungoledain have fled Thornholt. I might hope we shall not see their faces again, but I fear that is too much to ask. \
\
'I may have an idea of how to heal the sickened Beorning. I will stop by myself and visit. You have done more than enough for the Beornings of Skoghús, and all the beasts of this wood, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Oh, and if you should cross that peculiar dwarf in your travels, tell him he may gather wood from the forest's edge, I certainly won't turn him into a toadstool or any sort of animal.'","Talk to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld","You should return to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and tell him what took place in the woods.","Talk to Threkmóth","'Worse rather than better? It is as I feared. I do hope the brown wizard can help him.'"},
[1247]={"King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You travelled to Ravenhill and witnessed the return of the raven-chief, Arcah. King Thorin pledged to honour the old ways of friendship between Durin's Folk and the ravens of the North, and in return, Arcah sent her ravens to spy upon the plots of Karazgar and Vethúg Wintermind.","King Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
King Thorin III has received an urgent summons from Dís, the Keeper of Ravenhill, and has asked you to accompany him to Ravenhill. You should talk to King Thorin III when you are prepared.","Talk to King Thorin III","'Patience will serve us well, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Arcah possesses the wisdom of Roäc -- of this, I am certain. Her ravens are fewer in number, but their eyes remain keen in matters of spying. With their aid, we might sooner learn the truth of the visions you were granted.\
\
'Why has Vethúg not yet come to Erebor? What does Karazgar seek in Dol Guldur? And how has he travelled so many miles in so short a time?\
\
'We have sent the ravens forth, and we must now wait upon the tidings of their return.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Next week: 'The Lady and the Mirror'</rgb>","'Let us depart for Ravenhill, ${PLAYER}.'","As the North awaits the coming of Vethúg Wintermind, King Thorin III has received an urgent and unexpected summons from Ravenhill.","An Unexpected Summons","'It has been quiet of late, ${PLAYER}, but it brings me no comfort.\
\
'Vethúg Wintermind will come. He may arrive this very day, on the morrow, or perhaps months shall pass before at last he reveals himself. For that reason, I have spent many nights in wakefulness pondering the fate of Thikil-gundu in the Grey Mountains. Is that the fate that shall befall Erebor? Will the folk of Dale and Eryn Lasgalen soon know all too well the cold that overtook us in the North?\
\
'It does me no good to dwell on such thoughts, and indeed, there are more pressing matters this day.\
\
'Dís, the Keeper of Ravenhill and sister of Thorin Oakenshield, sent me an urgent summons requesting my presence at Ravenhill. It is a strange request, I think. There is no ill will between the ravens and Durin's Folk, but we have grown distant since the days of Roäc the raven-chief. His descendants are not known to me, and I do not think any in this realm have seen a raven of his stock in many years.\
\
'I would ask that you accompany me to Ravenhill, ${PLAYER}. If we have need to return swiftly to Erebor, we shall ride together.'"},
[1248]={"An Unfair Exchange","Rook is atop his avanc to the west of Snowbourn in the Sutcrofts.","Rook is furious that he is stranded on the fields of Rohan with no means to travel East. He believes your war-steed would be a proper replacement for his avanc.","'...'","'It is dead, you say? Well, that is rather beside the point, is it not?\
\
'I must travel east to finally gain all of the knowledge I need to become a Wizard!\
\
'And you... you will not stand in my way!'","Search Rook's avanc","Rook may have left some of his trappings on his avanc.","Rook is looking increasingly agitated. It appears that he has finally realized that his avanc has met its end.\
\
'You... you did this! But no matter, we can make a trade!\
\
'I will take that beautiful war-steed of yours, and you can have this avanc!'","Talk to Rook"},
[1250]={"An Unfortunate Man","Talk to Gronu at his camp","'On the northern face of this mountain, the surviving member of an Uch-lûth hunting-party has camped in a small grove of trees. His party was attacked by the vicious Draig-lûth, which make their camp in the Lich Bluffs. We have attempted to send one of our men to assist him, but he resists any offer of aid.  \
\
'Will you go speak with him and discover what aid you may render him? His name is Gronu.\
\
'Travel to the northern foot of the mountain. Gronu's camp is just south of the river, in a small grove of trees.'","Gronu's camp is just south of the river, in a small grove of trees, north of Harndirion.\
\
Culang has asked you to seek out the wounded hunter Gronu, who may need assistance.","The lone survivor of a vicious attack has made a small camp on the northern face of the hill beneath Harndirion.","'I am concerned that Gronu might not be able to make it back to Lhanuch alone.'","'A duvodiad...what a sorry day when I must rely on a duvodiad to assist me.  However, it seems I have no choice.\
\
'My name is Gronu, and I was a member of a hunting party that was ambushed by the cursed Draig-lûth of Dunland.'"},
[1253]={"'¿Has encontrado ya a mi heraldo? ¡Estoy bastante preocupado por ese joven idiota!'","Un héroe sin heraldo","Reginald Guardián no solo se ha separado de su comunidad, sino que también parece haber perdido a su heraldo. Ambos se separaron durante una batalla contra los Angmarim en la cornisa de hielo al borde de la bahía de Forochel, al sureste de Sûri-kylä. Reginald espera que alguien más familiarizado con las tierras de Forochel pueda ayudarlo a encontrar a su heraldo perdido.","Has encontrado al heraldo perdido de Reginald Guardián","Encuentra al heraldo perdido de Reginald Guardián","'¡Gracias al cielo, estás aquí! Me preguntaba si alguien me encontraría aquí antes de que me congelara hasta morir.\
\
'¿Réginald te envía? No está contigo, ¿verdad?'","'¡Ah! Es bueno ver una cara del sur en esta tierra tan dura. Los lugareños son gente bastante decente, pero no son los más amigables con los extraños, si sabes a lo que me refiero. ¿Quizás podrías ayudar a un compatriota que lo necesita? Verás, ¡mi joven y excelente heraldo ha desaparecido! Hace varios días, los dos nos separamos de nuestra excelente comunidad durante una batalla que tuvo lugar al sur. Después, mi heraldo y yo nos dirigimos más al norte, con la esperanza de reagruparnos aquí en Sûri-kylä... Desafortunadamente, nos topamos con una patrulla de viles Angmarim en nuestro camino hacia aquí.\
\
'Bueno, aunque luché valientemente, mi heraldo de alguna manera logró perderse en la confusión de la batalla... ya sabes cómo son los heraldos, sin sentido de la orientación... De todos modos, estoy seguro de que logró escapar, pero desde entonces no he visto ningún signo de mi fiel compañero.\
\
'Conozco esta región muy poco y te estaría muy agradecido si pudieras ayudarme a encontrar a mi heraldo. No puedo salir en busca del resto de mi comunidad hasta que lo tenga a salvo conmigo otra vez.'","El heraldo de Reginald se perdió en algún lugar de la cornisa de hielo, al sureste de Sûri-kylä, en el extremo este de la bahía de Forochel. Reginald Guardián se encuentra en Sûri-kylä, al noroeste de la cornisa de hielo.\
\
Reginald Guardián te ha pedido que busques a su heraldo y se lo lleves de vuelta a Sûri-kylä."},
[1254]={"'I am not the sort of man to ask for help, ${PLAYER}, but you earned my respect in Lothgobel, and you are now the closest thing to a friend that I have left.\
\
'It is Hebil. He heard about what happened in Lothgobel, and took it upon himself to punish me for forsaking our ways. He... he slaughtered all of my men while I scouted ahead for a town to pillage.\
\
'He has challenged me to battle, and means to kill me. I want revenge! It is not enough to kill him in a fair battle between two captains, you see. I want him to be bested once and for all by you... the outsider, who threatens our way.'","'${PLAYER}! Someone has come looking for you. Apparently there is a Corsair standing at the front gate, calling out for you. He does not approach, and he has no men with him. Would you like us to drive him away?'\
\
You assure Laindir that you can deal with this threat yourself. You should head to the main gate, and see who is looking for you.","Jajax wants to avenge his men, who were slaughtered by Hebil","It is Jajax alone who calls for you","Jajax has come to the gate of Calembel looking for you, and his presence has alarmed the Gondorians.","Answer the summons from the Corsair at the gate","An Unlikely Plea","The Havens of Belfalas can be found by following the road south-west from Lamedon.\
\
You should travel to the Havens of Belfalas.","Jajax is at the gate of Calembel.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","See what Jajax wants","The site of Hebil's massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should go with Jajax to the site where Hebil slaughtered Jajax's men.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","The site of Hebil's massacre is south-west of Calembel.\
\
You should help Jajax avenge his men against Hebil.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.</rgb>","The Corsair seeking you is at the main gate of Calembel in Lamedon.\
\
You should answer the summons of the Corsair, and find out what he wants.","Completado","Meet Jajax at the site of Hebil's massacre","Hebil was merciless. Not one of Jajax's men was left alive...","Help Jajax avenge his men"},
[1255]={"Brifard is located at the camp-site to the south-east of Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Brifard with news of your success.","'I know not why these wolves have taken to preying on our men, but it must be stopped. Everyone must be kept safe, and more importantly, I cannot return to Stangard with more blood on my hands.\
\
'Their den is to the east along the shore of the Great River. May fortune be with you... I desire not to explain another loss.'","Brifard is worried that the wolves have acquired a taste for Man-flesh.","'Good, you made it back alive. Not that I doubted your resolve, but the Pit has claimed many a creature.\
\
'Now that the way is cleared, I have another task for you.'","Lobos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Brifard has advised you to hunt down wolves in the nearby wolf-den to the north-east. This particular wolf-den has been nicknamed 'The Murderous Pit' by the Rohirrim of Stangard.\
\
Brifard wants you to cull the wolf-pack in response to their violence.","Talk to Brifard","An Unnatural Hunger","Derrotar lobos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1256]={"Cíllan is concerned by the strange threatening behaviour of the brigands","The farmer whose lands were looted can be found west of Langhold, not far from the north gate.\
\
You should speak with the farmer and hear out the story of what befell him.","Find the brigand camp","'I see that you have some skill at fighting child-brigands. How would you like to try your hand at the real thing, eh, stranger? Why play at fighting when there are real enemies to be cowed?\
\
'Brigands have raided a farm to the west of here, and the poor farmer has lost everything. If you want to be useful as your reputation bids, you should go and deal with the team of bandits who did this.'","Show the letter to Cíllan","Question the farmer about the attack","Eastmund has asked for a message of grievances to be brought to Thane Utred of Langhold.\
\
You should go to Thane Utred at once and deliver the message, and warn him of the forbidding brigand presence near Langhold.","You are unnerved by the sight of so many foes near Langhold","Bring Eastmund's message to the Thane","The farmer indicated that the small band of attackers may have gone south-west","Utred reads the letter with a scowl.\
\
'Fool Eastmund! He dares offer me terms of peace if I give up Langhold and the northern Wold to his brigand scum!\
\
'I will not send my folk away, and I will rally my riders and deal with the brigands at once. They should have been thankful for exile...it was a pardon. I will not be so forgiving next time.'","The leader of the brigands in the northern Wold seems overly confident despite the recent banishment of his people.","Cíllan looks over the letter with sharp eyes.\
\
'Really, Utred, I do not think you should make light of this threat. They have never poised themselves to attack our town -- only to harry our lands, and steal from the farmers.\
\
'I do not like Eastmund's language, and I think we should heed ${PLAYER}'s words of warning! We should prepare to defend ourselves.'","'Ah! Someone to help me. I am glad the city watch sent a strong-looking ${CLASS} to aid me.\
\
'The brigands came just before dawn and ransacked my farm, and beat me.\
\
'There were only four, maybe five of them that did the dirty work. Brigands would not dare return to the northern Wold in any great number, so long as Utred is Thane. I did not make out which way they ran...perhaps south-west?'","See if Utred heeds the warning after receiving his wife's counsel","Eastmund has yielded, and asked that a message be delivered to the Thane","'Defend ourselves? They will never attack us. Why not, you ask? Because we will oust them first, as we always do.\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, for your diligence, but you are to leave those brigands to me. If you wish to be of service, you may perform the patrol of the River Watch.'","Eastmund's Lair is along the western edge of the northern Wold.","'We have every right to be here. Do you think you can just harass my folk, stranger, because some power-crazed Thane told you to? I will stand up for my folk!'","Cíllan stands near the Thane in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should show Cíllan the letter.","The foes amassed near Langhold appear to be very organized.\
\
You should seek the leader of this rabble and encourage him to return with his unruly followers to exile.","Confront the leader of the brigands about the group's aggressive positioning","Utred is in the Mead Hall in Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Thane Utred now that Cíllan has said her piece.","The Thane refuses to abandon Langhold over a brigand threat","'If you are in need of employ, there are some real brigands in need of banishment. Soldiers grown do not waste time with children's games that mimic the deeds of Men.'","An Unnerving Display of Confidence"},
[1257]={"The anonymous note asserts Gísling is a traitor to the Sutcrofts! You must show it to Fastred immediately","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
You have found an anonymous note that asserts Gísling is a traitor to the Sutcrofts and warns Fastred himself to not trust his Thane's son.","Gísling worries that his presence in Snowbourn is not wanted, and asks that you aid Fastred in any way you can.","Talk to Fastred","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling bade you return to Fastred with his response.","'What is this you have brought me?'\
\
Fastred's face sinks and then tightens in distress as he reads the note.\
\
'This... this doesn't make any sense. Gísling is the son of my most trusted Thane. Could he really be behind such a plot?\
\
'Go to Gísling at once. I wish to know what he would say to such accusations.'","'Aye, I am well aware of Gísling's efforts in the past. Such a note troubles me greatly, though, and in these dark times, I cannot be too careful about those I allow within Snowbourn. \
\
'I fear that inaction is the greater of two evils in this situation, but I have many things to consider. Gísling may speak true or he may not - I will take action as I see fit to protect my people.'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. It is good that you have returned.\
\
'While you were aiding the people of Snowbourn, a man came to me and spoke of a deeply troubling matter. He claimed that an agent of the Enemy had taken root among my people - a most serious accusation to be certain. I shall not allow my people to be brought to ruin by anything, especially not a foolish defector.\
\
'He claimed to have seen this spy poisoning food-stores about town, and lurking about the oven to the east of the Mead Hall. Start your search there, and report your findings to me.'","As you approach the oven, a crumpled note catches your eye","Fastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling worries that his father's actions have hurt his station within the Sutcrofts and asks that you aid Fastred further as a gesture of good will.","The note can be found on a stool next to the oven in central Snowbourn.\
\
You have not found anyone acting suspiciously, but a hastily-scrawled note near the oven catches your eye.","'How can you believe this, ${PLAYER}? My father and I have fought tirelessly for the safety of the Sutcrofts and for the good of Rohan. Why would I throw such labours away so brashly?\
\
'Someone is trying to pit Fastred against us, I am certain of it. I know not who, but the Reeve has not been himself since the death of his father, Dagred. I think him vulnerable to such deceptions, though he will protest.\
\
'We need to be very cautious in our approach to this, ${PLAYER}. Return to Fastred and tell him what I have said. I can only hope that my years of service loyal to Dagred and the King can speak for me.'","The oven can be found in central Snowbourn to the east of the Mead Hall.\
\
Fastred has sent you in search of information about a potential threat to Snowbourn. Fastred mentioned that your search should begin near the oven as the spy has been tampering with food.","Gísling can be found in the northern part of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred wishes to hear Gísling's thoughts on the note you discovered.","'${PLAYER}, if you have a moment, I must speak to you.\
\
'We have aided Reeve Fastred in every manner I can think of, but perhaps there is more yet to be done here. I cannot help but feel that my presence here has been less than welcome - perhaps Fastred thinks ill of my father and me for further burdening this settlement.\
\
'Speak to Fastred, and see if we can aid him in any other task. I would not wish my years of service to be tainted by a decision that had to be made.'","An Unnerving Message","Search central Snowbourn for evidence of a spy","Talk to Gísling in Snowbourn","Examine the crumpled note near the oven"},
[1258]={"Defeat the White Hand pillagers at each farmstead","An Unpleasant Host","Defeated the White Hand pillagers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The abandoned farmsteads can be found south of Cliving, west of the road.\
\
Each farmstead has been occupied by a single White Hand pillager, who has recruited others to help defile the lands.","White Hand Orcs have taken to occupying and desecrating the once-peaceful farmsteads of the noble crofters of Cliving.\
\
The strongest among the Orc-infantry have taken to claiming each structure as their own personal habitat.","Captain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Garmund will be most appreciative of your efforts to remove the White Hand Orcs from the occupied farmhouses.","'These pillagers are a grim indication of what the Orcs intend to accomplish. They have defiled the deserted homes of the crofters; it is a fine deed you have done in removing their presence.'","Talk to Captain Garmund outside of Cliving","White Hand Orcs have taken to occupying and desecrating the once-peaceful farmsteads of the noble crofters of Cliving.","Defeat the White Hand pillagers at each farmstead (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[1259]={"El campamento de los gigantes está en Amon Môth, al suroeste de las Agujas Altas.\
\
Lithuifin te ha pedido verter su mezcla en el guiso de los gigantes.","Vertiste la mezcla de Lithuifin en el caldero del guiso de los gigantes","Habla con Lithuifin en las Agujas Altas","Una comida desagradable","Vierte la mezcla de Lithuifin en el caldero del guiso de los gigantes","Lithuifin está en las Agujas Altas, al noreste de Amon Môth.\
\
Debes regresar con Lithuifin y hacer tu informe.","'Los gigantes recordarán esta comida...'","'Los gigantes suelen reunirse cada día para una gran comida cerca del extremo sur de su campamento, donde han colocado un enorme caldero de guiso.\
\
'Tu objetivo es muy simple: acércate con sigilo al caldero en medio de ellos y vierte esto en su comida, luego escapa antes de que te pisen.\
\
'Si puedes quedarte cerca, puede que lo que ocurra después te resulte bastante entretenido.'","'Creyeron durante mucho tiempo que estos bosques estaban encantados, y ahora creo que aprovecharán esta oportunidad para marcharse.'","El elfo Lithuifin está preocupado por los gigantes que han estado arruinando el bosque."},
[1260]={"This Orc has been webbed and devoured by the spiders of Lhingris...","After arriving in Lhingris, Legolas has discovered a number of slain Orcs and fears that Ungwetári's children have begun to overrun the Ephel Dúath.","Slain Orcs can be found on the road to Durthang, slightly to the north and west of the ruined encampment.\
\
Legolas has asked you to examine the slain Orcs along the road to Lhingris to discover if Ungwetári has set her children upon the Orcs of Mordor.","Legolas can be found at the ruined encampment along the road to Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
While spiders have slain many of the Orcs in Lhingris, it appears that some Orcs have begun to fight amongst themselves as well. You should return to Legolas.","Talk to Legolas at the ruined encampment","An Unrelenting Hunger","This Orc was slain by arrows, and a shield of Udûn rests beside him...","'This bodes ill, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'We have barely stepped into the lands of Lhingris and no sooner have we found the vile webs of Ungwetári's children. Indeed, I am reminded of the darkest days of Mirkwood....'\
\
Legolas looks at the fallen Orcs.\
\
'If the spiders no longer fear the Orcs, I doubt they shall remain in the shadows of Lhingris much longer. Their prey is plentiful, and no longer guarded by the might of the Dark Lord.\
\
'I cannot discern whence these Orcs came for their armour is ruined and wreathed in webs, but to know it may help us learn how they found their way to Lhingris.\
\
'I shall work to free these from their webs and uncover their heraldry, but would you examine the slain Orcs on the road? Perhaps some have met with a less gruesome fate....'","'It seems that the Orcs have begun to fight amongst themselves, but I wonder why Orcs of Udûn and of Durthang would flee into this land?\
\
'To flee into a land beset by hungering foes with allegiance to none...it is unwise, to say the least.'","Examine the uneaten Orc on the road to Durthang","The uneaten Orc can be found beneath an archway on the road to Durthang, slightly to the north and west of the ruined encampment.\
\
You have examined the slain Orcs near Legolas's encampment, but you have noticed one who does not appear to have been devoured.","Examine slain Orcs on the road to Durthang (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1261]={"Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar below Dâr Laja.\
\
Find Baziphâr and scold him for hiding below the city.","'Here I am, just as I have promised you to tell my wife... it is near enough, is it not?\
\
'My wife... I cannot join her inside the Din of Arms! The owner and I have a.... misunderstanding. Tell her I will be at home. No, I swear! I will be at home. I need to... lie down.'","Hanâth is waiting at The Din of Arms in the Tor-gardens, in the western side of Umbar Baharbêl.\
\
Hanâth will surely be grateful to hear her husband has returned home.","Search for Baziphâr below Dâr Laja in Tâkhdar","Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar, below Dâr Laja.\
\
Find Baziphâr and scold him for hiding below the city.","Baziphâr is still hiding in Tâkhdar below Dâr Laja.","'I will go home once I see you have spoken to my wife. I do not want you to send hounds after me if you fear I have vanished. But please do not take too long. My head hurts.'","Scold Baziphâr and convince him to return home","'Are we drinking one last time together? No? You said my wife is... hm. You and I are friends, but we will not be if you tell me to go home. The scolding I shall receive! No, no, I cannot bear it.\
\
'But you are right, of course. No, I need no assistance. I will... err, find my way there myself, yes. Do not help me! I will be... elsewhere, ho ho!'","Speak with Baziphâr","You chide Baziphâr for avoiding his responsibilities","'Baziphâr is at our house? You are certain? He has promised? I am so glad to hear. Thank you for returning my troublesome man home to me. I know he is a handful, but he is my handful. I should go home now to tend to his no-doubt-aching head, and remind him to stop harassing customers and businesses! Who does that, anyway?'","Baziphâr is likely still hiding in Tâkhdar, below Dâr Laja.\
\
Baziphâr has agreed to return home, but you have a sneaking suspicion he needs to be scolded into compliance.","Baziphâr? Baziphâr!","'My husband has still not returned home! You cannot trust a word that faithless man says. I am sure he is still drinking in this city's underbelly!'","'You have found my husband? He has not yet arrived. Perhaps his drunken self has gotten lost? Please hurry! I miss that besotted fool and I do not wish him robbed further blind!'","Speak with Hanâth","An Unsavoury Character"},
[1262]={"Faenhilith está en Echad Eregion, al suroeste de Pembar.\
\
Debes regresar a Faenhilith con noticias de tu victoria sobre Fauldush.","Sopla el cuerno de convocatoria y derrota al líder de los semiorcos","El cuerno de convocatoria se encuentra en la entrada sur de las ruinas de Pembar, al noreste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Faenhilith te ha pedido que regreses a Pembar y uses el cuerno de convocatoria orco para desafiar al líder de los semiorcos.","Has recuperado muchas reliquias y baratijas de los semiorcos en Pembar, pero Faenhilith sigue siendo cauteloso.","'¿Qué dices? ¿Estos semiorcos tenían a su cabeza a una especie de Orco que nunca antes habías visto?\
\
'Yo tampoco he oído hablar de los Uruk-hai. Solo puede ser el producto de algún otro agente del enemigo que aún no se nos ha revelado.\
\
'Apreciamos tus esfuerzos, ${PLAYER}, pero temo que cosas más terribles están por venir...'","Has derrotado a Fauldush","'Incluso entre esa raza despreciable, hay orgullo. Si soplas en el cuerno de convocatoria en Pembar, el líder de los semiorcos seguramente responderá a tu desafío.'","Una Mano Invisible","'${PLAYER}, aunque estos semiorcos tienen una astucia mucho mayor que la de los Orcos comunes, no tienen la capacidad de mantener la disciplina. Son codiciosos e indisciplinados.\
\
'Temo que haya un líder poderoso entre ellos, que es completamente leal a la voluntad de Saruman. Los semiorcos no se desanimarán en su tarea mientras este líder viva. Debo pedirte que regreses a Pembar y saques a este líder de sus escondites.\
\
'En Pembar, dentro de la entrada sur de las ruinas, al noreste de aquí, hay un cuerno de convocatoria. Aunque es una idea desagradable, sopla en el cuerno... el líder sin duda responderá a tu desafío.'","'No me gusta tu descripción de los Uruk-hai, ${PLAYER}. Solo sirve para demostrar lo lejos que ha caído Saruman el Blanco...'","Habla con Faenhilith en Echad Eregion"},
[1265]={"El Frontero Cornizuelo está en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
El Frontero Cornizuelo ha reclamado la carta y la bolsa del jefe de correos Ganapié. Debes hablar con el Frontero Cornizuelo.","'Lo que esperaba... el Jefe no se ha ocupado de esta. ¡Sin sello no hay entrega! ¿Aunque solo sea una carta? También debo llevársela al Jefe, incluso si son solo un puñado de palabrerías.'\
\
El Frontero Cornizuelo frunce el ceño y una mueca de desprecio se dibuja en la comisura de su boca.\
\
'No te preocupes, me aseguraré de devolver la bolsa al Servicio Postal Rápido.'","'¿No te has enterado, cartero? ¡Hay nuevas reglas! Por orden del Oficial en Jefe, todo el correo está sujeto a inspección antes de ser entregado... ¡especialmente a la Comarca Allende!\
\
'Entrégame esa bolsa, y yo decidiré si es merecedora del tiempo del Jefe.'","'Has vuelto antes de lo que esperaba, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué ha pasado?'\
\
Le hablas al jefe de correos Ganapié sobre el Frontero que encontraste en la Puerta de los Juncos. Le informas también que alguien apodado como \\qOficial en Jefe\\q ha estado ordenando a los Fronteros que inspeccionen el correo e interfieran con el Servicio Postal Rápido.\
\
'¡¿Oficial en Jefe?! ¡Tal título no existe! ¡Antes yo me proclamaría \\qSeñor del Correo\\q! Hay un Primer Oficial, sí, pero nunca ha sido del tipo que impone más reglas. De hecho, que yo sepa pasa la mayoría del tiempo jugando unos hoyos en el Agujero del Agujero Municipal. ¡No, esto es obra de algún advenedizo metiéndose en asuntos que no le incumben!\
\
'¿Cornizuelo, era? ¡Dile al Alcalde lo que te ha dicho ese Frontero y asegúrate de que pone todo en orden para el Servicio Postal Rápido!'","Habla con el jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande","Habla con el Frontero Cornizuelo en la Puerta de los Juncos","'¿Sí? ¿Puedo ayudarte?'\
\
Informas al Alcalde Will Pieblanco de las preocupaciones del jefe de correos Ganapié y el llamado \\qOficial en Jefe\\q interfiriendo con el Servicio Postal Rápido. Le dices que el jefe de corresos ha insisitido en que el servicio a la Comarca Allende sea restaurado y libre de cualquier inspección ilegal.\
\
'¡Pero si ese título no existe! Ah, el jefe de correos también ha dicho eso, ¿no? Me pregunto si esto tiene algo que ver con ese advenedizo de Hobitton... ¡una verdadera molestia, ese tipo!\
\
'Si me das un momento para pensar, creo que puedo resolver ese problema para satisfacer al jefe de correos.'","Espera a que el Frontero Cornizuelo termine su inspección","'Entrega esa bolsa a Nobotella en la ruta habitual a través de la Puerta de los Junocos como el jefe de correos te ha pedido y llegaremos al fondo de esto, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Ten cuidado de que ningún entrometido te moleste en tu travesía... el tiempo corre en nuestra contra, después de todo. ¡Oh, y no dejes que la bolsa se moje!'","'Si el jefe de correos Ganapié quiere que hagas la ruta habitual a Nobotella, tendrás que seguir el camino hacia el norte a través del pantano a Ojo de Aguja y luego continuar al noroeste hasta la Puerta de Rushock. Una vez la cruces, estarás en en el camino a Nobotella. El cartero Cavada siempre está en el Servicio Postal Rápido, así que le encontrarás fácilmente. ¡Ah, que ya os conocéis!\
\
'Es un trecho, pero una ruta bastante sencilla. ¡Oh, y mantente alerta por si hay hobbits entrometidos!\
\
'Te deseo la mejor de las suertes, ${PLAYER}. ¡Espero que eljefe de correos sea capaz de aclarar todo esto!'","Una aguja inehebrable","El Frontero Cornizuelo se encuentra en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
Mientras intentabas completar la ruta a Nobotella, te ha detenido el Frontero Cornizuelo en la Puerta de los Juncos. Debes hablar con el Frontero Cornizuelo.","Habla con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco en Cavada Grande","El Alcalde Will Pieblanco se encuentra fuera del Agujero del Agujero Municipal, en Cavada Grande.\
\
Tras saber que hay alguien proclamando ser el \\qOficial en Jefe\\q ha estado interfiriendo con el Servicio Postal Rápido, el jefe de correos Ganapié ha insistido en que hables con el Alcalde Will Pieblanco. Debes hablar con el Alcalde Will Pieablanco.","Te vio un hobbit entrometido","Con un bufido, el Frontero Cornizuelo desliza la carta en su bolsillo y toma la bolsa","Con el correo para la Comarca Allende bajo la vigilancia del jefe de correos Ganapié en Cavada Grande, te preparas para llevar a cabo una prueba de la ruta del Servicio Postal Rápido a Nobotella, según las indicaciones del jefe de correos.","El jefe de correos Ganapié se encuentra fuera del Servicio Postal Rápido en Cavada Grande.\
\
La carta del jefe de correos fue confiscadapor el Frontero Cornizuelo en represnetación del Oficial en Jefe. Debes volver con el jefe de correos Ganapié y decirle lo que ha pasado.","<rgb=#FF0000>Evita a los hobbits entrometidos</rgb>","Recoge la bolsa 'llena' de la mesa del cartero Dospiés","El Frontero Cornizuelo está en la Puerta de los Juncos, justo al noroeste de Ojo de Aguja, en la Comarca.\
\
El Frontero Cornizuelo te ha pedido inspeccionar el contenido de la bolsa que estás llevando a Nobotella. Debes esperar a que el Frontero Cornizuelo termine su inspección.","La ruta a Nobotella empieza en El Cruce, continúa hacia Ojo de Aguja y pasa a través de la Puerta de los Juncos a la Comarca Allende.\
\
Has preparado una bolsa que contiene la carta del jefe de correos Ganapié para ser llevada en la ruta del Servicio Postal Rápido a Nobotella. Debes recoger la bolsa 'llena' de la mesa del cartero Dospiés y llevarla por la ruta a Nobotella por el camino de la Puerta de los Juncos."},
[1266]={"The stranger is located in western Sutcrofts along the shore by the Entwade.","'Greetings! I am Rook, a Wizard of Dunland.\
\
'While I would not normally stoop to asking for aid, it seems my avanc has grown tired on our journey eastward to learn of more magics from the Easterlings.\
\
'If you would help me, I would be happy to reward you with the finest of treasures. By the way, stranger, you look familiar... have we met?'","You have discovered a peculiar man who appears to be riding an avanc. You should speak with him.","An Unusual Migration","Talk to the stranger","A strange man sits atop an avanc in the distance - you should speak to him, for surely he is an interesting fellow.","You have come across a most peculiar sight - a strange man appears to be riding an avanc eastward."},
[1268]={"El hongo emana un olor penetrante y nauseabundo","Has descubierto tres grupos de hongos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek. Lamentablemente, se ha extendido una plaga en Moria; ni siquiera los hermosos árboles de piedra están a salvo ahora.\
\
Te preguntas qué ha despertado las esporas y las ha hecho subir incluso a estos pasillos secos...","Svanr ha detectado un olor extraño durante su meditación ante los Árboles de Piedra de la Segunda Sala.","El olor es abrumador aquí","Un olor malsano","El olor se desprende del borde sur del patio en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes examinar la tercera fuente del olor.","'He viajado hasta aquí para contemplar los magníficos árboles de piedra, pero encuentro mi meditación perturbada por indicios de un olor extraño. Es fugaz, pero su fuente debe ser poderosa en una sala tan amplia, con corrientes de aire y techos altos.\
\
¿Encontrarás la fuente del olor? Odiaría ver incluso este bosque de piedra contaminado por los males que se han infiltrado en Moria.'","El olor se desprende del borde sur del patio en Nud-melek.\
\
Debes examinar la segunda fuente del olor.","Encuentra la segunda fuente del olor","El olor parece venir de la zona sur del gran patio arbolado de Nud-melek.\
\
Svanr quiere que investigues el olor que ocasionalmente aparece para perturbar su homenaje silencioso.","Has descubierto tres grupos de hongos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.","Completado","Encuentra la primera fuente del olor","Encuentra la tercera fuente del olor"},
[1269]={"'Núrzum... Brúndoron... as one? Can such things be? What twisted magic could have wrought such a monster? Such things defy nature.... I am grateful that abomination has strode from the forest, but if he returns, our numbers are few and our choices... fewer.\
\
'But what of the Orcs? All of the havoc you have found... so much of it remains because of Núrzum's assault. His Orc allies simply cannot match his destruction.\
\
'Their roadway... I wonder what has become of it, especially to the north-west whence their kind first came? Search the roadway and follow it to its end.... I am curious what remains of their force.\
\
'For my part, I will travel to meet you outside the southern edge of their camp. I doubt they will notice me among the other trees nearby....'","An Uphill Battle","The Orc-roadway continues to the north and west.\
\
Having discovered a few Orc-stragglers, but no larger force, you should continue following the road deeper into the Balewood.","Signs of a battle litter the road here with a slain Huorn looming over its kills","You have discovered a few stragglers burning wood-trolls, but a larger force is absent","The Orc-roadway continues to the west.\
\
You have discovered the grim remains of a fight between the denizens of the Balewood and the White Hand. You should continue up the path to the west.","Talk to Barallas outside Drû Vádokan","You have come across the White Hand's holdings in the Balewood... a grim camp of Orcs built atop Brúndoron's shattered roots","Barallas believes the Orcs are losing their foothold in Balewood and wants you to scout along the Orc-roadway to the north-west.","Search the Orc-roadway for signs of the White Hand","The Orc-roadway can be found to the west of Barallas and the other Ents.\
\
Barallas has asked that you return to the Orc-roadway and see if the White Hand still holds firm control of the path.","'Not only are they still here... but they build their terrible structures atop Brúndoron's remains....\
\
'These monsters know nothing but destruction... and spite our kin and these lands at every turn.\
\
'Hoom. Can we sit idly by as they continue to tear apart our home?'","The Orc-roadway through the Balewood continues up the hill to the west.\
\
The roadway is strangely clear here, but you should investigate the gruff voices you hear further up the hill.","Follow the Orc-roadway to the north-west","Follow the Orc-roadway further into north-west Balewood","The roadway is largely empty here, but you can hear raucous Orcs further up the hill","Follow the Orc-roadway further up the hill","Barallas can be found to the south of Drû Vádokan.\
\
Barallas and the other Ents will be curious to learn what you have discovered along the roadway. Barallas has travelled to meet you near the White Hand camp."},
[1270]={"Las tribus orcas están movidas y motivadas por fuertes líderes. La tribu de la Mano Blanca es dirigida por un fuerte estratega militar, mientras que la tribu de Moria es liderada por un capataz centrado en extrar hasta el último trozo de mineral de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.","Los líderes de los orcos se encuentran en algún lugar de los campamentos de su respectiva tribu.","Derrota al capataz de Moria","'Derrotar a los líderes de las tribus orcas cercanas mantendrá en secreto mi posición un poco más. Te doy las gracias por ello.\
\
'Tu hazaña seguro que provoca la anarquía entre los orcos restantes. ¡El reinado de los orcos en esta parte del Cuerno Rojo podría llegar a su fin de una vez por todas!'","Encuentra el campamento de Knakk","Capataz de Moria derrotado","Knakk se encuentra en la plataforma elevada justo al norte del campamento de los orcos de la Mano Blanca, en el camino hacia la Gran Escalera.\
\
Se ha mantenido oculto de los orcos hasta ahora, pero sus exploradores han estado a punto de encontrarle en alguna ocasión. Estará feliz de saber que van a estar menos organizados durante un tiempo gracias a ti.","'Hemos averiguado que estas tribus de orcos son diferentes, y esto debe ser por sus líderes. Las tribus de Moria no se centran mucho en los asuntos militares. Su ejército está extendido por todo Moria y más allá, y los que están por aquí solo están centrados en la explotación minera. Diría que su líder es un violento capataz.\
\
'La Mano Blanca parece ser superior en táctica, y han tomado la mayoría de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Están expulsando a la tribu de Moria del Cuerno Rojo sorprendentemente rápido. El líder de la Mano Blanca debe ser un individuo con una brillante mente táctica.'","Derrota al estratega de la Mano Blanca","El reinado de la anarquía","Estratega de la Mano Blanca derrotado"},
[1271]={"Tumularios ancestrales","Los tumularios ancestrales se pueden encontrar en el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Derrota a tumularios ancestrales (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tumularios ancestrales derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se han alzado muertos ancestrales en el Gran Túmulo."},
[1273]={"Prende fuego a los viejos cadáveres amortajados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los viejos cadáveres se pueden encontrar por todo el Laberinto del Gran Túmulo.","Viejos cadáveres amortajados quemados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Llamas antiguas","Los viejos cadáveres dentro del Laberinto del Gran Túmulo deben arder en llamas, no sea que vuelvan a levantarse."},
[1274]={"Los muertos ancestrales se han alzado en el Gran Túmulo.","Enciende los braseros antiguos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Braseros antiguos encendidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los braseros antiguos se pueden encontrar en el ala inundada del Gran Túmulo.\
\
Debes encender los braseros antiguos del Gran Túmulo.","Llamas antiguas"},
[1275]={"'Tuve suerte de que Zaudru no estuviera cerca cuando caí en su cueva, ¡pues de otro modo no estaría aquí para contarlo!'","'Caí desde gran altura dentro de la caverna, ${PLAYER}, y mi caída se detuvo contra una placa de hielo... ¡Tuve suerte de que fuera tan gruesa! Las arañas de ese lugar...\
\
'No quiero hablar de ello. Lo siento.'","'Greip no habla con gusto de su aventura en las cavernas infestadas de arañas.'","tli Matarañas está en la aldea de Archet, en las Tierras de Bree, muy al oeste de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Sigrun y Greip han descubierto que una plaga maligna de arañas ha echado raíces en las cavernas bajo Helegrod, y su reina es conocida por Atli Matarañas.","'Atli Matarañas se encontró una vez con la miserable Zaudru, y aquel encuentro casi fue el último de su vida.'","'Ha ocurrido algo muy extraño, ${PLAYER}. Volví al lugar donde Greip cayó a través de la nieve —él se negó a acompañarme, pero yo quería ver si había algo más— y el agujero ha desaparecido, sellado por una gruesa capa de telarañas.\
\
'No debemos subestimar a estas arañas, ${PLAYER}. Descubrieron nuestra intrusión y no les agradó; no permitirán otra.'","Antiguos Enemigos del Matarañas","'Las arañas sellaron el agujero en el que caí. Estoy agradecido... no quisiera que volviera a ocurrir.'","'Has venido hasta mí por caminos largos y cansados, . ¿Qué asunto te trae aquí con tanta urgencia? Veo en tu rostro que no puede tratarse de algo menor.\
\
'¿Qué dices? No esperaba oír el nombre \\qZaudru\\q de nuevo en mi vida, . Es una reina cruel y miserable entre las de su especie, y solo nos enfrentamos una vez... aunque ese recuerdo es terrible. No puede permitirse que continúe acechando las cavernas bajo Helegrod, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} , pues con el paso de los años sin medida saldrá con su prole a cubrir toda la Tierra Media con sus engendros.\
\
'Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a alzarte en armas contra esta vil enemiga, dímelo. Si no, apártate de mi vista, cobarde.'","Los exploradores de Glóin han descubierto que una prole venenosa de arañas y su vil reina se ocultan ahora bajo Helegrod.","'El orgullo de Helegrod siempre han sido sus imponentes salas, que se extienden durante muchos kilómetros en lo profundo de las montañas, pero Greip y yo hemos descubierto que alguien —o mejor dicho, algo— ha estado añadiendo aún más a su extensión.\
\
'Mientras explorábamos cerca de los muros de Helegrod, la nieve cedió y Greip cayó en una caverna helada, un enorme espacio hueco bajo las montañas. Regresé a nuestro campamento para conseguir suficiente cuerda para sacarlo de allí. Me moví tan rápido como pude, pero en los pocos momentos que estuve ausente, Greip escuchó el asqueroso lenguaje de las arañas y comprendió dónde había caído. Cuando lo subí de nuevo a la superficie, me relató su breve aventura en la oscuridad: un relato de telas y voces malignas.\
\
'Una prole maligna de arañas ha echado raíces en las cavernas bajo Helegrod, ${PLAYER}, y el nombre de su reina es funesto: \\qZaudru,\\q la llaman, y conozco a alguien que ya se ha enfrentado a ella. Busca a Atli Matarañas en las Tierras de Bree, en la aldea de Archet, pues estará muy interesado en oír sobre la plaga de arañas que supura bajo Helegrod.'"},
[1276]={"'¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de Fonn? ¡Qué bien que me hayas encontrado, porque necesito tu ayuda!'","Guarida antigua","Encontraste a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog","Busca a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog","La cueva de Gorthorog está en Malenhad, al este de Aughaire.\
\
Fonn te ha pedido que explores una cueva en Malenhad a la que se ha visto viajar a Gertheryg.","'Temo que algo le haya pasado a Bethad en esa cueva de Gorthorog. Te pediría que vayas allí y lo busques.'","Bethad está en la cueva de Gorthorog en Malenhad, al este de Aughaire.\
\
A petición de Fonn, buscaste a Bethad en la cueva de Gorthorog. Lo has encontrado, pero parece herido.","Fonn ha sabido que se ha visto a Gertheryg viajando a una cueva en Malenhad. Ha enviado a un explorador para investigar, pero no ha regresado.","'Los Gertheryg son algunos de los esbirros más terribles de Angmar. Grandes criaturas similares a trolls, son astutos, hábiles con armas y armaduras, y no les afecta la luz del Sol como a otros trolls.\
\
Hemos observado grupos de Gertheryg moviéndose de un lado a otro desde una cueva infestada de sierpes en el vil Malenhad. Envié a un explorador, Bethad, para averiguar lo que pudiera sobre el lugar, pero no ha regresado y temo lo peor.\
\
Por favor, ve y explora la cueva, quizás puedas encontrar a Bethad dentro. Temo que sería muy imprudente explorar esta cueva solo, así que deberías ir con los aliados que puedas reunir.'"},
[1277]={"Guarida antigua","Fonn te ha pedido que explores las cuevas de Ologfil en Malenhad, al norte de Tyrn Lhuig, para conocer el destino de Bethad, que estaba investigando la presencia de gorthorogs.","Habla con Fonn en Tyrn Lhuig y cuéntale sobre el rescate de Bethad.","'Los Gorthorogs son algunos de los esbirros más terribles de Angmar. Grandes criaturas parecidas a trolls, son astutos, hábiles con las armas y armaduras, y no se ven afectados por la luz del sol como otros trolls.\
\
'Hemos observado grupos de gertheryg moviéndose de un lado a otro desde una cueva infestada de sierpes llamada Ologfil en el vil Malenhad. Envié a un explorador, Bethad, para averiguar lo que pudiera sobre el lugar, pero no ha regresado, y temo lo peor.\
\
'Por favor, ve y explora la cueva, quizás puedas encontrar a Bethad dentro. Temo que sería muy imprudente explorar esta cueva en soledad, así que deberías ir con los aliados que puedas reunir.'","Habla con Fonn en Tyrn Lhuig","'Entonces, ¿Bethad fue capturado por un capitán gorthorog? Su falta de precaución está lejos de ser encomiable, pero es bueno saber que ahora está a salvo. Gracias a ti, ${PLAYERNAME:extranjero[m]|extranjera[f]}.'","Encuentra a Bethad en Ologfil","Fonn ha aprendido que se han visto Gertheryg viajando hacia la caverna de Ologfil en Malenhad. Ha enviado a un explorador para investigar, pero el explorador no ha regresado.","'Temo que algo le haya pasado a Bethad en Ologfil. te pido que vayas allí y lo busques.'"},
[1278]={"Encuentras una página hecha jirones enterrada entre los escombros","'Hay unas ruinas en la colina sobre la curva del río de las que recientemente descubrimos su propósito. Había un faro allí, lo creas o no, para guiar a los barcos mientras hacían la curva desde el lago hacia el Baranduin.\
\
'El guardián de esa llama tenía la tarea de registrar todos los naufragios y tragedias que presenciaba desde su puesto para que se pudieran enviar equipos de búsqueda para intentar recuperar lo que se perdía. Pero en los últimos días del reino, no podían estar demasiado enfocados en recuperar cosas.\
\
'Ve al faro para ver si puedes encontrar algún documento antiguo de esos registros. Si podemos conseguir alguna pista sobre dónde ocurrieron algunos de los naufragios, podríamos recuperar algunos objetos antiguos valiosos.'","El faro está en el extremo norte del Barandalf, al sureste del Coloso.\
\
Gaelnarthan te ha pedido que te aventures a las ruinas de un antiguo faro y encuentres cualquier resto de los registros que se guardaban allí.","El faro utilizado solía vigilar los barcos en la parte norte del Baranduin. El guardián tenía la tarea de mantener registros detallados de los naufragios y tragedias.","El antiguo registro","Gaelnarthan está en el Coloso, al noroeste de las ruinas del faro.\
\
Gaelnarthan estará ansioso por examinar la página que has encontrado.","Los escombros de aquí no contienen nada de valor","'¿Has podido encontrar una página? Me preocupaba que se hubieran perdido para siempre, al igual que el faro. Veamos qué podemos averiguar con esto...'","Busca entre los escombros del antiguo faro","Lleva lo que has encontrado a Gaelnarthan","'Busca en los escombros de lo que queda del faro. Seguramente debe quedar algo útil, aunque no sea más que un retazo.'"},
[1279]={"Las Ruinas Salvajes se encuentran al sur de Ost Galadh.\
\
Agorin te ha pedido que examines y recopiles los registros de los elfos silvanos de Ost Galadh que se encuentran en las Ruinas Salvajes.","Registros silvanos examinados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Examina registros silvanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah, así que tenía razón, quedaban algunos registros del antiguo asentamiento. No tengo tiempo para estudiarlos ahora, o Fuirgam se enfadará conmigo, pero te agradezco tu esfuerzo.\
\
'El propio Fuirgam vivió aquí, en Ost Galadh, antes de que quedara abandonado a merced del bosque. Ay, los recuerdos de quienes abandonaron este lugar parecen oscuros y difíciles, y aún no he encontrado a nadie que hable de ello con detalle, por lo que estas palabras grabadas en piedra son mi única ventana al pasado de este lugar.\
\
'Algún día encontraré a Fuirgam de un humor más comunicativo y conseguiré toda la historia, pero suele ser reservado, y podría pasar otra Era antes de que se la sonsaque. Eso suponiendo, claro está, que ninguno de nosotros se encuentre en Valinor antes de tiempo...'","Habla con Agorin en Ost Galadh","Agorin, la guardiana de los registros de los Malledhrim, te ha pedido que te adentres en las Ruinas Salvajes y recopiles información sobre los antiguos registros silvanos que se encuentran dispersos por las ruinas.","'¡Ojalá hubiera podido mostrarte este lugar cuando los Hombres y los enanos aún lo llamaban el Gran Bosque Verde! Era tan maravilloso y hermoso como cualquier ciudad construida por mis hermanos Elfos Silvanos, un fiel reflejo de la grandiosa Lórien en aquellos días.\
\
'Ahora es...\
\
'Ahora preferiría estar sola, por favor.'","Agorin se encuentra en Ost Galadh, al norte de las Ruinas Salvajes.\
\
Vuelve a ver a Agorin y cuéntale lo que has descubierto sobre los registros de los elfos silvanos que alguna vez habitaron este lugar.","Registros antiguos","'${PLAYER}, la próxima vez que recorras las ruinas de Ost Galadh, ¿podrías buscar placas o grabados antiguos que puedan quedar? Seguro que aún hay algunos, y mi esperanza es registrar su historia tal y como la conocíamos en los días previos a que dejáramos este lugar a merced de la naturaleza.\
\
'Esta puede ser mi última oportunidad de hacerlo antes de que nos retiremos a Lothlórien, y probablemente antes de que yo me dirija al lejano Oeste, pero mis deberes me obligan a permanecer en este campamento, ¡y no me atrevo a ir en contra de las órdenes de Fuirgam!\
\
'Te lo ruego... ¿podrías adentrarte en las ruinas y registrar cualquier grabado que encuentres en su interior? Serían de gran interés para mí y para mis compañeros eruditos, ¿y quién sabe cuándo o si alguna vez volveremos a verlas?'"},
[1280]={"Lanza plumas en Reodh Fuil","Coloca el pescado cerca de la bahía","'El ritual ha sido completado. Con suerte, aplacar a los espíritus nos traerá buena suerte. La necesitamos.'","Has colocado el pescado en la piedra del ritual","'Al comienzo de cada estación, hacemos ofrendas a los espíritus del viento y del agua. Desde que nuestra gente puede recordar hacemos estas ofrendas, y siempre han traído pescado y buen clima a nuestros asentamientos.\
\
'Recientemente no hemos tenido abundancia de pescado y las tormentas han sido repentinas y terribles. Esto debe ser debido a todos los extranjeros y a los Rauta-väki... ellos no realizan estas ofrendas, ¡y esto debe estar molestando a los espíritus!\
\
'¡Debes darte prisa! Toma este pescado ritual y colócalo en la piedra ritual que encontrarás en el extremo de la Bahía de Hielo que ahora han ocupado los Angmarim. Toma además esta bolsa de plumas y lánzalas al viento en Reodh Fuil, cerca del paso a Forodwaith, donde el viento sopla más fuerte.'","Jalmari está en Sûri-kylä, en el extremo norte de la Bahía de Hielo de Forochel.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Jalmari y contarle que has hecho lo que te pidió.","'Has honrado a los espíritus, ${PLAYER}.'","La piedra ritual está al sur, siguiendo la Bahía de Hielo, en las tierras ocupadas por los Angmarim. Reodh Fuil está al sureste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Jalmari te ha pedido que lances plumas al viento en Reodh Fuil y coloques el pescado cerca de la Bahía de Hielo en la piedra ritual que no ha sido en las tierras ahora invadidas por los Angmarim.","Rituales antiguos","Coloca el pescado en la piedra del ritual","'¿No has conseguido completar el ritual?'","'Completa los rituales, ${PLAYER}... ¡necesitamos la bendición de los espíritus!'","Los Lossoth tienen muchos antiguos ritos y rituales para apaciguar a los espíritus del cielo y el agua.","Habla con Jalmari","Plumas lanzadas al viento"},
[1281]={"Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al este de Rantost en Tyrn Fornech, en Evendim.\
\
Has recuperado muchas piezas de estatua, y ahora debes llevarlas de vuelta a Robin Sotopardo para ver si pertenecen a la estatua que busca reparar.","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}, muy bien! No parece que todos pertenezcan a la estatua que estoy intentando rehacer, pero creo que los suficientes sí que pertenecen a ella y tengo por donde empezar.\
\
'Podría ser una estatua de Elendil, ¿sabes? Me pregunto dónde estaba colocada. ¡Quizá algún día pueda estarlo de nuevo!\
\
'Se oyen rumores inquietantes por Ost Forod. Quédate, y te hablaré de ello.'","'¡Creo que lo que estoy restaurando es una estatua de Elendil!'","'Los saqueadores de tumbas que rondan por Tyrn Fornech podría estar llevando pequeños fragmentos de la estatua, y su campamento en Rantost, la isla hacia el oeste, podría albergar fragmentos más grandes. Uno o dos saqueadores podrían también tener fragmentos más grandes.\
\
'¡Si puedes recuperar los suficientes fragamentos, podría reconstruir la estatua! ¿No sería formidable?'","'Espero que los saqueadores que rondan por Tyrn Fornech lleven más piezas de esta estatua rota, ${PLAYER}. Si puedes recuperar más de estos fragmentos, podría ser capaz de reconstruirla. ¿No sería algo formidable? ¡Calenglad y el resto de los montaraces estarían muy complacidos!\
\
'Busca a los saqueadores en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech y recupera fragmentos de estatua de ellos, ${PLAYER}. Seguramente encuentres solo fragmentos pequeños en estos saqueadores, pero uno o dos podría llevar un fragmento más grande. Estos villanos también han estblecido una especie de campamento al oeste, en la isla de Rantost en el lago; podrías encontrar fragmentos más grandes allí.\
\
'Tráeme todos los fragmentos de estatua que puedas recuperar, y veré si puedo reconstruirla.'","Estatuas antiguas","Los saqueadores de Tyrn Fornech podrían llevar trozos pequeños de estatuas, mientras que trozos más grandes se encontrarían en su campamento de Rantost, la isla al oeste de Ost Forod.\
\
Robin Sotopardo ha sido inspirado por la estatua rota que recuperaste, con el sueño de restaurar la estatua completa y quiere que recuperes sus fragmentos.","'Me pregunto dónde estaría esta estatua en su día.'","Robin Sotopardo, animado por tu recuperación de la estatua rota que portaban los malogrados saqueadores que tuvo un encontronazo con unos osos en Nan Orngon, te ha encargado que recupes más de sus fragmentos.","'Todavía estoy esperando más piezas de la estatua, ${PLAYER}.'","Lleva los trozos de la estatua a Robin Sotopardo"},
[1282]={"Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.","It seems that Ghâr-buri-Bhâm has finished working with the Púkel-men statue fragments you gave him","Ward pieces can be found near Púkel-men statues in the Drúadan Forest.\
\
You should collect ward pieces for the Woses.","You hand the fragments to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm. His expression remains serious and he begins to tinker away with bits of stone.","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should bring the ward pieces to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm so that he can craft a new ward for the village.","Collect ward pieces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Okwô-kuryô protect us. Once Okwô-kuryô breaks, no longer watches over Drúedain. Drúedain can rebuild Okwô-kuryô. First we must make new heart for Okwô-kuryô. You get Okwô-kuryô fragments, bring them to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm. He make Okwô-kuryô heart.'","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should wait for Ghâr-buri-Bhâm to craft the ward.","Speak with Ghâr-buri-Bhâm","Collected ward piece (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","Bring the ward pieces to Ghâr-buri-Bhâm","Ancient Wards","Ghâr-buri-Bhâm is in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should speak with Ghâr-buri-Bhâm about the ward.","'Ghâr-buri-Bhâm has made a Okwô-kuryô heart. I see this. I have good words. Rhûd-pulo-Drât has returned to Drû Bhûta. The heart draws him a line to safety of the village.'","Ghân-buri-Ghân, chieftain of the Drúedain, asks of you to help collect ward fragments from Púkel-men statues so that the Woses may protect themselves from this new threat.","Wait for Ghâr-buri-Bhâm to craft the ward","The Wose looks up and hands you a mysterious object of intricate stonework. You are not sure how anyone could create something so detailed out of stone so quickly."},
[1285]={"Las reservas de comida de los trasgos se encuentran probablemente en Gazatmur, en el este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes destruir las reservas de comida de Gazatmur para desmantelar este campamento que sirve como fortaleza establecida para el enemigo.","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! Eso fue un paso clave para acabar con su presencia aquí. Ahora tendrán que buscar comida en otro lugar.'","Wigfast está en su escondite justo más allá de Gazatmur en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar con Wigfast.","Has destruido las reservas de comida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No puedo entender cómo puede haber tantos trasgos aquí, a menos que tengan un gran alijo de provisiones escondido en Gazatmur.\
\
'Si te encuentras con alguna reserva de comida, no dudes en destruirla por completo. Deberíamos disuadir a los trasgos de prolongar su estancia en la Gran Excavación.'","Destruye las reservas de comida en Gazatmur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las reservas de comida de los trasgos se encuentran en Gazatmur y les proporcionan sustento durante largos períodos.","'Gazatmur está justo allí, y estoy casi seguro de que hay una gran cantidad de comida acumulada en su interior.'","Regresa con Wigfast","¡Y no vuelvas!"},
[1286]={"Talk to Farasdúr near the Vineyards of Lothlórien","Farasdúr is near the Vineyards of Lórien, south of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Farasdúr and tell him the results of your patrol.","The banks here are clear of enemies","The river Anduin flows north of Egladil, deep and wide, providing protection against assaults from the East.","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (2/4)","Anduin Patrol","'Times such as these call for the skills of a hunter, though more often than not it is not wild beasts but the servants of the Enemy that we must pursue.\
\
'Of late, there have been a few reports of enemy scouts crossing the Anduin, attempting to find some entrance unwatched into Lothlórien. With many of our guards currently looking west to staunch the angry hosts emerging from Moria, it would be of considerable aid to us if you could take it upon yourself to run a patrol up the banks of the Anduin, from here to the northern extent of the forest, ensuring that nothing passes unseen.\
\
'When you have completed your patrol, return to me here.'","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (3/4)","The river Anduin runs northwards from the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
Farasdúr has asked you to patrol the banks of the Anduin and ensure that no enemy forces have gained a purchase on the west side of the river.","'${PLAYER}, I need you to finish your patrol of the Anduin, north of the Vineyards.'","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (0/4)","Patrol the banks of the Anduin (1/4)","'It gladdens me to hear that the banks of the Anduin remain clear.\
\
'So long as no spies are able to cross into Lothlórien, they will remain loath to dare any crossing in force, lest they lose all their strength to our defences -- which indeed they shall, should they prove so foolish!'"},
[1287]={"Germund can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have gathered a number of fish and should now deliver them to Germund.","Nets can be found along the eastern shores of the Anduin in Woodsedge.\
\
Germund has asked you to gather fish from nets along the Anduin.","Collect fish from nets along the Anduin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected fish from nets along the Anduin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well? What did you find?'\
\
You show Germund the fish you gathered from his nets.\
\
'Hah, 'twas just a bad day of fishing, I think! I'm sorry to have tasked you with such a small matter, ${PLAYER}, but I deem it most worthwhile, for it eased my mind considerably! I'll see to it myself at dawn on the morrow.'","The Woodmen of Hultvís often gather fish from the waters of the Great River, Anduin.","Deliver the fish to Germund in Hultvís","Anduin's Bounty","'${PLAYER}! Where you travel, good fortune seems to follow. Will you hear my plight?\
\
'Long have I cast my nets into Anduin, but never has its bounty been so meagre. It seems to me an omen... but of what?\
\
'Will you go down to the banks of the Great River and gather fish from my nets? If Anduin is generous to you, perhaps my concerns were for naught.'"},
[1290]={"Collected crude marked stone","Search for more such stones and try to determine their purpose within Anglach in Udûn.","Defeated Gúrflak the ancient fire grim.","The door you opened held a great fire grim within it!","You have found a small stone, carved to a specific shape and with strange, grotesque symbols etched upon it.","This door has four broad divots, almost like key-holes, on its surface","Try to determine the strange stones' purpose within Anglach in Udûn.","The strange stones you found look as if they will fit in the divots in this door","The door lifts, a blast of hot air issuing from beyond it","Anglach: Four to Open","Find a use for the strange stones","Locked by old magic behind a great door in the very roots of Anglach was the fire grim Gúrflak, whose ages-old pent up fury roils there no longer.","Defeat Gúrflak the fire grim","Defeated Gúrflak","Completado","Collect strange stones (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You have found a small stone, carved to a specific shape and with strange, grotesque symbols etched upon it. Are there others? And what is their purpose?"},
[1293]={"Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines can be found deep within Anglach.\
\
You should defeat Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines.","Candúr can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should return to Candúr and apprise him of your efforts.","'With Ongdrágh dealt with, the forces within Anglach will fall into disarray. I thank you for your assistance.'","Many foes await those who dare enter Anglach, the Great Foundry.","Defeat Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines","Talk to Candúr","Defeated Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines","Anglach: The Great Foundry","'There is no time to waste. The enemy's forces swell within Anglach. Are you prepared to depart?'","'Reports have come in that enemy forces are gathering within Anglach. Ongdrágh, Master of the Mines, has returned to rally the Captain of the Pit's remaining soldiers. They must be quelled before they become a greater threat to our mission.\
\
'When you are ready, I will direct you to Anglach.'"},
[1299]={"'Dos veces el Clúcath ha reclamado a seres queridos para mí: primero, mi padre Násan y ahora, Crannog. ¡No sufriré otra pérdida!\
\
'Estos impostores que todavía se llaman a sí mismos la Corona de Hierro se esconden detrás de las murallas de Carn Dûm. Sé que todavía quedan formas de entrar en la ciudad, y creo que Soltakh las conoce mejor de lo que quiere admitir.\
\
'Tanto Soltakh, El-Que-Es-Cambiado, como Crannog quizás lo nombró demasiado generosamente, fue una vez de los Trév Duvárdain, después de todo. Su Fém sigue sin cumplirse, y todavía tiene mucho que hacer para probarse a sí mismo ante los Trév Gállorg.\
\
'¡Si hay formas de entrar en la ciudad, debemos atacar a la Corona de Hierro antes de que su control sobre Angmar sea demasiado fuerte para ser roto!'","Nekhtan se encuentra en Bail Avarc en Angmar.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido que hables con Nekhtan sobre el reciente rito del Clúcath entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain. Deberías hablar con Nekhtan.","'No pienses mal de Nekhtan. Tiene razón, no he cumplido mi Fém.\
\
'Tampoco he olvidado al hombre que fui hace no tanto tiempo: Drostan de los Trév Duvárdain. Solo las acciones no pueden expiar mis palabras y acciones pasadas, y soy muy consciente de eso.\
\
'¡Sin embargo, digo que todavía hay valor que encontrar en la vida que una vez viví!'","Nekhtan se encuentra en Bail Avarc en Angmar.\
\
Nekhtan te ha contado la historia del rito del Clúcath entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain. Deberías hablar con Nekhtan.","Habla con Nekhtan y escucha su relato del rito del Clucath","'¿Quieres escuchar la historia?'","'¿Sí?'\
\
Le preguntas a Nekhtan qué ha sucedido en Angmar desde el regreso de la Corona de Hierro. Mencionas que Soltakh habló de otro Clucath, uno pedido por los Trev Duvardain.\
\
'Eso es cierto, ${PLAYER}. Pasaron muchas cosas después de que Soltakh viajara hacia el este, y aunque él no lo crea, no le reprocho su ausencia cuando regresó la Corona de Hierro.\
\
'Parece que fue hace mucho tiempo, pero por un tiempo Aughaire conoció la paz, o al menos eso pensábamos. La Corona de Hierro se había escondido en las sombras, pero desde las tinieblas, su mirada seguía fija en nosotros. Sentí algo, y siempre me sentí inquieto con la nueva forma de las cosas después de la caída del Falso Rey, pero no había peligro evidente. La Corona de Hierro se había ido. Carn Dûm fue abandonado, y los Angmarim se dirigieron hacia Bálach Iaran. Después de que cruzaran el Paso de Hierro, no volvimos a verlos y huyeron hacia el Este.\
\
'Cuando muchos de los Trev Duvardain regresaron del Este en el rastro de sus maestros en la Corona de Hierro, temí lo que podría suceder con Angmar. Y tenía razón!\
\
'No pasó mucho tiempo después de eso cuando los Trev Duvardain comenzaron a molestar nuevamente, y aunque no lo sabía entonces, todo lo que habíamos luchado por era a punto de ser quitado.'","Con el regreso de la Corona de Hierro y sus leales entre los ahora divididos Trev Duvardain en Carn Dûm, una paz frágil fue rota y los viejos enemigos de los Trev Gallorg buscaron nueva dominación sobre Angmar.","'¿Quieres saber qué le sucedió a Crannog, verdad? Pensé como tal.\
\
'Si ese es tu verdadero deseo, te lo contaré.'","Nekhtan se encuentra en Bail Avarc en Angmar.\
\
Nekhtan te ha contado la historia del destino que le sucedió a Crannog y los Trév Gállorg después de que la Corona de Hierro regresara a Carn Dûm. Deberías hablar con Nekhtan.","Habla con Soltakh en Bail Avarc","Nekhtan sacude la cabeza.\
\
'Con su victoria, Claghórd y los Trév Duvárdain habían ganado el derecho a gobernar los asuntos de las tribus de Angmar hasta que se convocara otro Clúcath. Pero Claghórd, guiado por la mano de la Corona de Hierro, tenía la intención de asegurarse de que eso nunca volviera a suceder. Después de unos días, Claghórd y los emisarios de la Corona de Hierro llegaron a Aughaire. Exigieron que cinco de nosotros fuéramos voluntariamente a Carn Dûm o la Corona de Hierro enviaría a sus sirvientes para quemar nuestro pueblo por la noche. Crannog les suplicó que tomaran a menos, y aunque no parecía agradar a los emisarios, Claghórd cedió, y solo pidió uno de los Trév Gállorg.\
\
'Temiendo lo que esperaba a nuestro pueblo en Carn Dûm, Crannog se ofreció a la Corona de Hierro para que otros pudieran ser perdonados.'\
\
La voz de Nekhtan tiembla.\
\
'El viejo tonto...\
\
'Su trato no sirvió de nada, porque los emisarios de la Corona de Hierro regresaron al día siguiente y ya no estaban tan ansiosos por negociar. Tomaron a más de nuestra gente cada día que pasaba, y pronto, muchos de nosotros huimos de Aughaire para que no nos encontraran a su regreso. Crannog nos había instado a refugiarnos en Bail Avarc, así que eso es lo que hicimos.\
\
'Cincuenta y ocho de los Trév Gállorg han sido capturados, y no hemos sabido nada de ninguno de ellos. Solo deseo que Crannog todavía estuviera aquí. Él sabría qué hacer...'","Nekhtan se ha ofrecido a contarte lo que sabe sobre el destino de Crannog después de su derrota en el Clúcath.","'Mucho ha cambiado desde la última vez que viniste a Angmar. En verdad, incluso a mis propios ojos, ha cambiado desde que regresé.\
\
'No hace mucho, Crannog me dio un Fém, un propósito, que me llevó hacia el este. Me avergüenza siquiera pensarlo, pero desearía no haberme ido nunca. Después de que Carn Dûm fuera abandonada, debía seguir a los restos de la Corona de Hierro hacia las tierras del Monte Gundabad. Muchos de los Trév Duvárdain viajaron con ellos, a pesar de las innumerables divisiones que habían surgido entre sus tribus y la Corona de Hierro después de que el Falso Rey fuera depuesto. La Corona de Hierro buscaba algo en las tierras de Câr Bronach, pero a medida que su búsqueda se volvía más desesperada, cada vez más Trév Duvárdain abandonaban la Corona de Hierro y huían hacia las colinas.\
\
'Fue allí donde los recibí, ni como amigo ni como enemigo, sino como alguien que también buscaba caminar por un nuevo camino. Les di refugio en Eiricháv, y durante un tiempo, parecía que pronto podríamos regresar a Angmar en amistad sin nada más que temer de la Corona de Hierro.\
\
'De hecho, escuché que la Suma Sacerdotisa de la Corona de Hierro, una mujer llamada Ásachal, había sido asesinada en las alturas de Tûr Fúar. Imagina mi sorpresa, entonces, cuando la vi liderar sus fuerzas fuera de las puertas de Agal Dûn algunos días después de eso.\
\
'Intenté seguirlos mientras cruzaban Bálach Iaran, pero me descubrieron. Logré matar a mis atacantes, pero una de sus flechas de ballesta me atravesó la espinilla. Solo con la ayuda de Aighrig pude regresar a Eiricháv y atender mis heridas. Aun así, no pude seguir a la Corona de Hierro hasta que pude estar nuevamente por mi cuenta.\
\
'Para cuando llegué a Aughaire, ya era demasiado tarde. Crannog no se encontraba por ningún lado, y aprendí por Nekhtan que se había convocado otro Clúcath entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain.\
\
'Lamentablemente, no puedo hablar sobre lo que no presencié. Si quieres saber lo que pasó, ¡mejor lo escuchas por Nekhtan!'","'El que fue Drostan conoce bien los secretos de la Corona de Hierro.'","Soltakh se encuentra en Bail Avarc en Angmar.\
\
Después de informarte que Crannog fue capturado por la Corona de Hierro, Nekhtan ha sugerido que Soltakh podría conocer caminos secretos para entrar en la ciudad de Carn Dûm. Deberías volver a hablar con Soltakh.","Escucha lo que Nekhtan sabe sobre el destino de Crannog","Angmar Renacido, Capítulo 1","Nekhtan puede encontrarse en Bail Avarc en Angmar.\
\
Nekhtan se ha ofrecido a contarte la historia del rito del Clúcath entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain. Deberías hablar con Nekhtan y escuchar su relato.","Habla con Nekhtan en Bail Avarc","'He hablado mucho y hecho muy poco. Nekhtan sabe lo que le sucedió a los Trév Gállorg durante el Clúcath.'"},
[1300]={"Angmar renacido, Capítulo 2","'¡Por favor, escúchame! ¡Te juro que no pretendo engañarte!'","Ayuda a Indagir con 'Remedios para las Enfermedades'","Habla con Soltakh en Bail Avarc","'Incluso con todo lo que sé de la Corona de Hierro, me cuesta creer lo que me has contado, ${PLAYER}.\
\
Me alegra saber que Oganuin no nos molestará más, pero si las creaciones de Aniochán sobrevivieron a él, temo que nuestro trabajo podría no haber terminado. ¡Especialmente si lo que Indagir robó de Thaurisgar cae en manos hostiles!\
\
Sin embargo, parece que no somos los únicos que se han estado colando en Carn Dûm. He oído que una compañía de los Trév Duvárdain se adentró en las profundidades de la ciudad para cazar a un hechicero de los Angmarim. Si eso es cierto, ¡parte de nuestro trabajo podría haberse hecho ya por nosotros!\
\
Me han dicho que Lágsaith ha estado contando esa historia a todos los que quieren escucharla. ¿Podrías hablar con ella y aprender lo que ha pasado?'","Soltakh se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Has ayudado a Rhúnelleth e Indagir con sus tareas en Sant Lhoer y Thaurisgar, para bien o para mal. Debes regresar a Bail Avarc y hablar con Soltakh.","'Deberías hablar con Lágsaith. Parece que parte de nuestro trabajo ya se ha hecho, ¡y por algunos de estos Trév Duvárdain nada menos!'","'Como muchos de los Trév Duvárdain, una vez viví en Carn Dûm. Antes de la caída del Falso Rey, incluso teníamos nuestro propio barrio en la ciudad.\
\
Cuando era Drostan, la Corona de Hierro me dio una pequeña casa. Es algo extraño recibir como regalo algo que fue robado a tus propios antepasados. ¡Lo tontos que éramos, y que demasiados de los que una vez llamé mis hermanos todavía son!'\
\
Soltakh hace una pausa por un momento, pareciendo calmarse.\
\
Aunque muchos de ellos han sido sellados, todavía existen varios caminos ocultos hacia Carn Dûm. Puedo marcarlos en tu mapa. Me han dicho que la Corona de Hierro se ha instalado en Sant Lhoer y Thaurisgar, pero dudo que tengan intención de quedarse en este último lugar. Después de todo, el viejo apotecario ya era una ruina peligrosa antes de que me expulsaran de los Trév Duvárdain.\
\
El Elfo Rhúnelleth y un hombre llamado Indagir están buscando ayuda para aventurarse en Carn Dûm. ¿Podrías hablar con ellos y ayudarlos si puedes?'","Soltakh se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Has escuchado la historia de Lágsaith sobre la lucha de los Trév Duvárdain contra la Corona de Hierro en Sagroth. Debes hablar con Soltakh.","Rhúnelleth e Indagir se encuentran en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido que ayudes a Rhúnelleth e Indagir en sus esfuerzos en Sant Lhoer y Thaurisgar, ya que esto hará avanzar la lucha contra la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm. Deberías ayudar a Rhúnelleth e Indagir.","Bajo la dirección de la aparentemente fallecida Gran Sacerdotisa de la Corona de Hierro, Ásachal, los sirvientes de la Corona de Hierro se han extendido por todo Carn Dûm, buscando un medio para recuperar parte de su antigua gloria en Sant Lhoer y Thaurisgar.","Finrúth se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Soltakh te ha pedido que hables con una mujer de los Trév Duvárdain llamada Finrúth, que vino a Bail Avarc en busca de refugio de la Corona de Hierro. Debes hablar con Finrúth.","'Necesitamos descubrir lo que la Corona de Hierro está haciendo en Sant Lhoer y Thaurisgar. ¡Si podemos ayudar a los demás en el curso de nuestros esfuerzos, mejor que mejor!'","Lágsaith se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Soltakh ha oído que una compañía de los Trév Duvárdain luchó contra la Corona de Hierro en las alcantarillas de Carn Dûm. Debes hablar con Lágsaith y enterarte de lo que ha sucedido.","Habla con Finrúth en Bail Avarc","Ayuda a Rhúnelleth con 'Hacia Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Emponzoñados'","'Bueno, ¿qué te pareció eso? Es toda una historia, pero no me sorprendería que los Angmarim se hundieran tan bajo.\
\
Mientras escuchabas el relato de Lágsaith, una mujer de los Trév Duvárdain llamada Finrúth llegó a Bail Avarc suplicando refugio de la Corona de Hierro y divagando sobre algo que ella llamaba \\qbódraillan\\q. Es de nuestro idioma, pero nunca lo he oído hablar. Significa algo parecido a \\qsiervos del juramento\\q, pero como dije, no sé qué pensar al respecto.\
\
Tan curioso como estoy por saber más, ella parecía enferma. Tal vez su viaje fuera de Carn Dûm no fue nada agradable. ¡Conociendo lo que sé de esa ciudad, no me sorprendería!\
\
Una vez que pude decirle algo, le pedí que descansara en la tienda de allá hasta que regresaras. ¿Podrías revisar a Finrúth y ver si puede explicar lo que ha pasado?'","Habla con Lágsaith y escucha su historia de 'La Guarida de los Alimañas'"},
[1301]={"'Debes escucharme... ¡antes de que sea demasiado tarde!\
\
'Esta tierra ha conocido demasiado dolor, y temo que días más oscuros se avecinan. Hablé con Soltakh y le advertí que la Corona de Hierro pretende convertirnos a todos en bódraillan. Puede que no me recuerde, pero yo lo recuerdo. Todos los Trév Duvárdain conocen a Drostan el exiliado... y a la que fue llamada Avair. No hablaré más de ella: sus hechos no han sido olvidados por los Trév Gállorg y dudo que los de su clase o la de Domongart encuentren bienvenida aquí entre ellos.\
\
'¿Sabes lo que quiero decir con bódraillan, ${PLAYERNAME:sureño[m]|sureña[f]}? Significa \\qsiervos del juramento\\q en la lengua de mi pueblo, pero es peor de lo que suena. Los Trév Gállorg capturados por la Corona de Hierro fueron los primeros... y sus mentes ya no les pertenecen. Pensé que eso era lo peor, pero luego nos llevaron a algunos de nosotros. No pasará mucho tiempo... hasta que el resto sea... llevado y... cambiado.'\
\
Finrúth parece estar exhausta, y se desploma contra las cajas cercanas.\
\
'No tuve tiempo de reunir muchas de mis pertenencias cuando huí de Carn Dûm y estoy cansada del viaje. ¿Podría... suplicarte un alimento y un poco de agua?'","Habla con Soltakh en Bail Avarc","Una comida abundante y un odre de agua se pueden encontrar en Bail Avarc.\
\
Antes de que Finrúth cuente la historia de cómo se volvió contra la Corona de Hierro, ha pedido agua y comida. Deberías recoger una comida abundante y un odre de agua para Finrúth.","Después de la caída de Mordirith y el abandono de Carn Dûm, los miembros de las tribus Trév Duvárdain se dividieron cada vez más, lo que llevó a muchos a abandonar la Corona de Hierro. Sin embargo, muchos permanecieron entre los Trév Duvárdain y, ya sea por ignorancia o por ceguera voluntaria ante la verdadera maldad de la Corona de Hierro, la siguieron hasta el Monte Gundabad.","Entrega la comida abundante y el odre de agua a Finrúth","Habla con Finrúth","Finrúth se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Finrúth ha ofrecido contarte la historia de cómo llegó a abandonar la Corona de Hierro y la verdadera naturaleza de los \\qbódraillan\\q que ahora habitan en Carn Dûm. Debes hablar con Finrúth.","'Durante demasiado tiempo, no me permití creer lo que sabía que era verdad, pero cuando vi lo que se convirtió en los bódraillan... Yo...'\
\
Finrúth se cubre el rostro con las manos por un momento.\
\
'Me avergüenza no haber abandonado la tribu cuando los demás lo hicieron. Tenía la esperanza de que la Corona de Hierro aún podría llevarnos a un futuro mejor, pero ahora veo que fui una tonta. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de los Trév Gállorg, ¿verdad? Los Trév Duvárdain no siempre fueron así, a pesar de lo que puedas pensar. Somos un pueblo fuerte, y como siempre hemos hecho, hicimos lo necesario para preservar nuestra tribu. Pero Claghórd y Domongart antes que él nos han traicionado a la Corona de Hierro por su propio beneficio, a amos que no se preocupan por nosotros.\
\
'Con ese maldito fragmento, la Alta Sacerdotisa Ásachal nos quitará todo. No habrá ni Trév Gállorg, ni Trév Duvárdain, ni siquiera la Corona de Hierro, solo los bódraillan y su terrible Reina Bruja. ¡Y ni siquiera recordaremos lo que hemos perdido!\
\
'Antes de irme de Carn Dûm, escuché que Crannog estaba siendo retenido en la torre del Rey Brujo, Gwathrenost, como la llaman. El jefe de los Trév Gállorg vive, pero apenas, y no creo que la Corona de Hierro tenga intención de liberarlo. Ha visto a su pueblo convertirse en bódraillan, y creo que es solo por alguna misericordia o crueldad del Gran Jefe Claghórd que se le ha perdonado ese destino. Quizás se haya convertido en uno de ellos para ahora, quizás no. Eso es todo lo que sé, ${PLAYERNAME:sureño[m]|sureña[f]}.\
\
'¡Solo espero que lo que te he contado pueda ayudar a poner fin a esto antes de que sea demasiado tarde!'","Finrúth se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Finrúth te ha contado la historia de cómo llegó a abandonar la Corona de Hierro y ahora conoces la verdadera naturaleza de los \\qbódraillan\\q que ahora habitan en Carn Dûm. Debes hablar con Finrúth.","Soltakh se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de Ephel Angren, en Angmar.\
\
Has escuchado el relato de Finrúth sobre el fragmento del poder de Tauressar y has aprendido que Crannog aún podría vivir dentro de Carn Dûm. Deberías hablar con Soltakh.","'Una piedra que puede doblar voluntades...\
\
'Durante mucho tiempo, se consideró una leyenda entre los Trév Gállorg, pero ¿que realmente exista? ¡Es impensable!'","Habla con Finrúth en Bail Avarc","'Escúchame, ${PLAYER}, y te contaré lo que sé sobre Tauressar y los bódraillan.'","Finrúth se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Has recogido una comida abundante y un odre de agua para Finrúth. Debes regresar a Finrúth.","'Tienes mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYERNAME:sureño[m]|sureña[f]}.'\
\
Finrúth come, quizás más rápido de lo que tú o ella misma esperaban. Entre bocados de costilla y patata, habla.\
\
'Debo admitir que dudé de los rumores de que los pueblos libres de Angmar habían comenzado a acoger a los desertores de los Trév Duvárdain. Sin embargo, cuando llegué, vi a otros de mi tribu aquí entre vosotros y supe que había encontrado refugio, al menos por el momento. ¡Nunca he estado más agradecida de haber estado equivocada!'\
\
Finrúth hace una pausa, colocando el plato en el suelo a su lado. Después de un momento, su comportamiento se agudiza.\
\
'¿Sabes por qué he venido? ¿Por qué de repente le daría la espalda a mi pueblo? No es que haya tenido un cambio de corazón. Los Trév Duvárdain fueron victoriosos en Clúcath y gobernar Angmar es nuestro derecho. Te digo que la Corona de Hierro quiere dejarnos de lado, ¡y que aquellos que lideran a los Trév Duvárdain están demasiado ansiosos por dejarlo hacer!\
\
'Vi cosas... cosas que no se suponía que debía ver cuando la Corona de Hierro viajó al Monte Gundabad. Bajo Tûr Fúar, la Agujalúgubre, vi una de las perdidas Piedras del Juramento de la leyenda: Tauressar. ¡Vi lo que les sucede a aquellos que juran sobre ella, quieran o no! Si no se detiene a la Corona de Hierro, todos nos convertiremos en bódraillan: esclavos del juramento. ¡Nuestras tribus no significarán nada para nosotros!\
\
'Si me escuchas, te contaré todo lo que sé. ¿Qué dices?'","Angmar renacido, Capítulo 3","Recoge una comida abundante para Finrúth","Recoge un odre de agua para Finrúth"},
[1302]={"Angmar renacido, Capítulo 4","'Bienvenido, ${PLAYER}. Me alegra verte de nuevo y en una circunstancia no tan terrible.'\
\
Crannog tose, todavía recuperándose claramente de su cautiverio.\
\
'No te preocupes por mí, amigo mío. Muchas de mis heridas sanarán con el tiempo, y aquellas que no lo hagan al menos serán calmadas por un buen festín. Después de que Mordirith fuera derrocado, deseé creer que la Corona de Hierro cayó con él. Pero eso rara vez sucede, ¿no es así? Siempre hay quienes se aferran al poder, reacios a enfrentar su propia debilidad.\
\
'Con tu ayuda, hemos desechado el último del triste legado de la Corona de Hierro. Después de tantos largos años, estamos libres del Rey Brujo y sus siervos.\
\
'Pero ahora, debemos decidir qué será de Angmar....'","Viaja a Gwathrenost, la ciudadela del Rey Brujo","'Si Finrúth habla con verdad, Crannog puede seguir vivo, pero a menos que destruyamos el fragmento de Tauressar, la lucha contra la Corona de Hierro está perdida.\
\
Incluso la mayor victoria podría ser inútil si la Piedra del Juramento puede ser usada contra nosotros. No hay otro camino: debemos atacar el corazón mismo de la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm. ¡El destino de nuestro pueblo, y de Angmar mismo, depende de nosotros!\
\
Ve y dile a Nekhtan lo que has aprendido. Cuando quieras, ¡partiremos hacia Gwathrenost!'","Crannog se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren, en Angmar.\
\
Has rescatado a Crannog de la Corona de Hierro y lo has escoltado de regreso a Bail Avarc. Habla con Crannog.","Soltakh se encuentra en Gwathrenost.\
\
Después de luchar por todo Gwathrenost, has encontrado a Crannog con vida, pero en mal estado. Debes hablar con Soltakh.","'¿Qué? ¡Jura que no me engañas!'\
\
Le dices a Nekhtan que Crannog puede seguir vivo en Gwathrenost.\
\
'No tienes que preguntarme. Si hay alguna esperanza de que Crannog siga vivo, no lo abandonaré.\
\
'¡Si vas a Gwathrenost, te seguiré!'","'¿Quién... quién está ahí? Por favor... ayúdame...'\
\
Crannog lucha por ver, sus sentidos debilitados por su cautiverio.\
\
'${PLAYER}... ¿puede ser? Tú... viniste...'","Gwathrenost, la ciudadela del Rey Brujo de Angmar, se encuentra en el corazón de Carn Dûm.\
\
Debes viajar a Gwathrenost y poner fin a los planes de la Corona de Hierro para usar el fragmento de Tauressar contra los pueblos libres del Norte.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Puedes avanzar esta misión en cualquier nivel de dificultad de la Incursión: 'Gwathrenost, la ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>","Crannog puede encontrarse en algún lugar en alto  de Gwathrenost, la ciudadela del Rey Brujo.\
\
Debes continuar tu búsqueda de Crannog mientras luchas contra la Corona de Hierro en Gwathrenost.","'Mi corazón se aligera con esperanza, incluso en un lugar tan oscuro... ¡Crannog vive!\
\
No puedo agradecerte lo suficiente, ${PLAYER}. Temía que llegáramos demasiado tarde para salvarlo. Sin embargo, no debemos olvidar lo que hemos venido a hacer aquí. La gran Sacerdotisa Ásachal y la Corona de Hierro deben ser detenidas. El fragmento de Tauressar debe ser destruido o cualquier victoria que ganemos hoy resonará hueca.'\
\
Soltakh hace un gesto a Nekhtan, y él devuelve un asentimiento conocedor.\
\
'No te preocupes por nosotros. Nekhtan y yo lo sacaremos de aquí.'","'¡Cuando quieras dirigirte a la antigua ciudadela del Rey Brujo, los Trev Gallorg lucharán a tu lado!'","Crannog puede encontrarse en algún lugar en alto de Gwathrenost.\
\
Has encontrado a Crannog con vida, pero gravemente maltratado por la Corona de Hierro. Debes hablar con Crannog.","Después de aprender que la Gran Sacerdotisa Asachal posee el poder de dominar las voluntades de los Trev Gallorg, los Trev Duvardain e incluso de aquellos entre la Corona de Hierro, los montañeses de Angmar planean un asedio desesperado sobre Gwathrenost, la antigua ciudadela del Rey Brujo.","Encuentra a Crannog en Gwathrenost","Soltakh se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Has triunfado sobre la Corona de Hierro, derrotando a la gran Sacerdotisa Ásachal y al gran Jefe Claghórd y destruyendo el fragmento de Tauressar. Debes regresar a Bail Avarc y hablar con Soltakh.","Destruye el fragmento de Tauressar","Habla con Soltakh en Bail Avarc","Habla con Crannog en Bail Avarc","Respirando débilmente, un Crannog demacrado yace de lado dentro de una jaula en las alturas de Gwathrenost","Habla con Crannog en Gwathrenost","'Eres {un verdadero amigo[m]|una verdadero amiga[f]} mío y de los Trév Gállorg. ¡La Corona de Hierro ha caído!'","Habla con Soltakh en Gwathrenost","'¡Qué alegría verte de nuevo, !\
\
Nekhtan y yo pudimos escoltar a Crannog fuera de Gwathrenost, pero lamento no haber podido ayudarte en la última lucha contra la Corona de Hierro. Sin embargo, no necesitas contarme tu éxito, ¡porque nadie en Angmar lo desconoce! Para cuando regresamos a Bail Avarc, escuché gritos celebrando que los bódraillan fueron liberados. ¡Arrojaron sus armas y salieron de Carn Dûm! Mis compañeros de ambas tribus, han regresado con sus familias y seres queridos, y parece que esta terrible pesadilla ha llegado a su fin.\
\
No puedo creerlo... ¡pero la Corona de Hierro ya no existe! ¡Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un verdadero amigo[m]|una verdadera amiga[f]} de los Trev Gallorg!'","Habla con Nekhtan en Bail Avarc","Nekhtan se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las laderas del Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Soltakh te ha dicho que te prepares para asediar Gwathrenost, la ciudadela del Rey Brujo. Debes hablar con Nekhtan e informarle de que Crannog aún vive antes de partir.","'¡Ve, habla con Nekhtan! ¡Debemos atacar antes de que sea demasiado tarde!'","El fragmento de Tauressar se encuentra en Tham Mornarcham, la cámara más alta dentro de Gwathrenost.\
\
Debes derrotar a la Gran Sacerdotisa Asachal y al gran Jefe Claghórd. También debes destruir el fragmento de Tauressar para que su poder malvado ya no pueda doblegar las voluntades de los pueblos libres del Norte.","¡Con el fragmento de la Piedra del Juramento de Rhudaur destrozado, su malvada garra está rota!"},
[1303]={"Crannog y Soltakh se encuentran en las afueras de Aughaire, en Angmar.\
\
Después de la reunión en Fail-á-Khro, Crannog y los Trév Gállorg han regresado a Aughaire. Debes encontrarte con ellos allí.","Reúnete con Crannog y Soltakh en las afueras de Aughaire","'¿No es hermoso? Si no me equivoco, el cielo parece más claro hoy que en los días de mi juventud.\
\
'Como te dije una vez, es el lugar de un jefe dirigir a su pueblo a hacer grandes cosas, incluso frente al peligro. Todavía quedan muchos pasos por recorrer en tu camino, pero para guiarte, te otorgo un nuevo Fém.'\
\
Crannog susurra en tu oído.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que lo cumplirás, ${PLAYER}. Si alguna vez tu camino te lleva de regreso a Iarandír, tendrás la bienvenida entre nosotros.\
\
'Es un nuevo día. Iarandír es nuestra tierra y nuestros destinos son nuestros propios!'","'Hace muchos años que los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain no han hablado más allá de sus deberes hacia los ritos de antaño. Quizás sea hora de que eso cambie...'\
\
Crannog parece reflexionar por un momento, y luego vuelve su atención hacia ti.\
\
'Enviemos un mensaje a todos los Trév Gállorg y Trév Duvárdain, sean marginados o no. Nos reuniremos en Fail-á-Khro una vez más, pero no para emprender los ritos de antaño. Durante demasiado tiempo las sombras de Angmar han arrojado una oscuridad entre nosotros, y es hora de que eso termine. Nos reuniremos para parlamentar y resolver lo que podamos con los Trév Duvárdain. Aunque el título de Gran Jefe ha quedado vacante, los Trév Duvárdain son la tribu gobernante y no llamaré a otro Clúcath después de todo lo que pasó. Si eligen o no escuchar mis palabras es su decisión, y sin importar la respuesta, la respetaré.\
\
'Pero no desperdiciaría el momento que se nos ha dado, ${PLAYER}. Angmar está al borde de su renacimiento, y serán nuestras manos las que lo moldeen, no las del Rey Brujo ni las de la Corona de Hierro.\
\
'Es hora de partir, ${PLAYER}. ¿No vendrás con nosotros?'","Con el fragmento de Tauressar destruido, los siervos del juramento liberados y los últimos vestigios de la Corona de Hierro llevados a la ruina, un nuevo día incierto, pero esperanzador, amanece en Angmar.","Crannog se encuentra en las afueras de Aughaire, en Angmar.\
\
Después de la reunión en Fail-á-Khro, Crannog y los Trév Gállorg han regresado a Aughaire. Debes hablar con Crannog.","Habla con Crannog","'¿Nos acompañarías a Fail-á-Khro? Es un largo viaje desde Bail Avarc, pero has llegado hasta aquí, ¿no es así?'","Soltakh se encuentra en las afueras de Aughaire, en Angmar.\
\
Después de la reunión en Fail-á-Khro, Crannog y los Trév Gállorg han regresado a Aughaire. Debes hablar con Soltakh.","Desde lo alto de un acantilado, Crannog y Soltakh contemplan Angmar","'¡Ahí estás, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Tanto ha sucedido, y es difícil hablar de todo ello. La Corona de Hierro está derrotada, nuestro pueblo es libre, y Iarandír es verdaderamente nuestra tierra una vez más.\
\
'Después de la reunión, ahora creo que podría encontrarse alguna medida de paz entre los Trév Gállorg y los Trév Duvárdain. No será perfecta, porque nada lo es, pero es el comienzo de algo nuevo, ¡y eso es suficiente!\
\
'Crannog me dijo hace mucho tiempo que sabría cuando hubiera cumplido mi Fém. Está hecho, y no podría haberlo hecho sin ti.'","Habla con Soltakh en las afueras de Aughaire","Habla con Crannog en las afueras de Aughaire","Crannog se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en las estribaciones de las Ephel Angren en Angmar.\
\
Crannog te ha pedido que lo acompañes a él y a los Trév Gállorg a Fail-á-Khro, donde espera parlamentar con los Trév Duvárdain. Debes hablar con Crannog cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para partir.","Angmar renacido, Capítulo 5"},
[1304]={"Viaja a Bail Avarc en Angmar","Bail Avarc se encuentra en Angmar, al sureste de Carn Dûm.\
\
Crannog te ha enviado una misiva solicitando tu ayuda en Bail Avarc, en Angmar. Deberías viajar a Bail Avarc.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc solo puede ser accedido inicialmente a través de rutas de maestros de establos. Bail Avarc puede ser alcanzado a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír, y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","'Es bueno verte, , pero me gustaría que nos hubiéramos encontrado de nuevo en días mejores.\
\
'Mucho ha cambiado en tu ausencia, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Me temo que nuestros problemas en Carn Dûm solo han empeorado desde que Crannog envió su mensaje.'","Crannog se puede encontrar en Bail Avarc.\
\
Has llegado a Bail Avarc y deberías buscar a Crannog.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc solo puede ser accedido inicialmente a través de rutas de maestros de establos. Bail Avarc puede ser alcanzado a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír, y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Habla con Soltakh en Bail Avarc","Has llegado a Bail Avarc y deberías buscar a Crannog","Soltakh te saluda con la mano, pero tiene una expresión sombría","Soltakh se puede encontrar en Bail Avarc.\
\
Has llegado a Bail Avarc. Aún no has encontrado Crannog, pero Soltakh desea hablar contigo. Deberías hablar con Soltakh.\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc solo puede ser accedido inicialmente a través de rutas de maestros de establos. Bail Avarc puede ser alcanzado a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír, y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Encuentra a Crannog en Bail Avarc","Aunque los Angmarim de la Corona de Hierro y sus aliados entre los Trév Duvárdain fueron dispersados de Carn Dûm después de la caída del Falso Rey, el jefe de los Trév Gállorg, Crannog, ha enviado un mensaje pidiendo tu ayuda en Bail Avarc, sugiriendo que todo no está bien en Angmar.","Angmar Renacido, Prólogo","\\q${PLAYERNAME:Mi amigo[m]|Mi amiga[f]},\
\
Después de que Carn Dûm fuera retomada de los sirvientes de la Corona de Hierro, yo y muchos otros creímos que huyeron hacia el este. Lamentablemente, parece que lo que los llevó allí no fue el miedo, sino la perspectiva de un regreso más pernicioso aún para conquistar Angmar. Ahora, los Angmarim de la Corona de Hierro que sirvieron al Falso Rey y las tribus de los Trév Duvárdain aún leales a ellos han reclamado la ciudad de Carn Dûm.\
\
Los Trév Gállorg no han olvidado la ayuda que ofreciste a nuestra"},
[1305]={"Lleva la bolsa a Gúrhebnir","El plan de Angmar","'Interesante. Me llevará algún tiempo revisar todo esto, ya que puedo sentir el mal en la mayoría de los documentos, y todo está escrito en la lengua del Enemigo.'","Al mirar dentro de la bolsa, ves varios documentos escritos en lengua negra. No puedes leer lo que dicen, pero crees que si los llevas a los Montaraces de Tinnudir, tal vez puedan traducirlos.","Tham Ornen ha sido ocupada por las fuerzas de Angmar. Se desconoce qué valor ven en las ruinas.","Los Montaraces se encuentran en Tinnudir, al suroeste de Tham Ornen.\
\
Uno de los Montaraces querrá examinar la bolsa y determinar qué significa su contenido."},
[1306]={"First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr is collecting seals found on the Chieftains of Angmar's army in the Ettenmoors.","'Five Chieftain's seals will earn you a Token of Valour, ${PLAYER}. Keep hunting the Enemy.'","Collected Chieftain seal","'Each Chieftain that falls strengthens our position, ${PLAYER}. You are a hero to all the Free Peoples. Seek Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig to earn greater recognition of your efforts in the Ettenmoors.'","The Chieftains of Angmar may be found among the Enemy in the Ettenmoors.\
\
Chieftains amongst Angmar's army bear seals that denote their station. Slay them and take their seals to earn recognition amongst the Free Peoples. First Marshal Sathryth has promised a reward for the seals you bring her.","Collect Chieftain's seal","Return Chieftain's seals to First Marshal Sathryth","Angmar's Chieftains","'You there, ${RACE}, I have task for you.\
\
'Chieftains command great numbers of the Enemy's forces, second only to the tyrants that lead the war-host.\
\
'Should you run afoul of these terrors, slay them and bring me their seals so that I might see you rewarded for their defeat.'"},
[1307]={"Talk to Gelbes","Rangers have come to the Ettenmoors to stand against the trolls sent from Angmar. They seek assistance with their patrols from the heroes of the Free Peoples.","'Take heart! The battle here is ours, and though the foe has breached the walls of Tirith Rhaw, we may yet hold back their tide. Listen well, for I have an offer that you must consider strongly, ${RACE}.\
\
'You are a proven warrior, a hero amongst the Free Peoples, and we ask this only of those who are willing. Lainedhel asked for assistance from the Rangers, and we have come to offer our aid. We have duties that need looking after elsewhere in Eriador, but if you are willing to stand there in our stead, we will come here to fight the foes from the North.\
\
'Think on this and speak to me when you have an answer to my request. I will wait here, friend.'","'What say you? Will you take up the duties of a Ranger to further assist the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors?'","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly while you patrolled Eriador in his stead. You should speak with Gelbes.","The Free Peoples have reclaimed Tirith Rhaw","Talk to Gelbes at Glân Vraig","'Your duty is done, and we have done much to further solidify the strength of the Free Peoples here in the Ettenmoors. You have our thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Gelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The Rangers will assist in retaking Tirith Rhaw, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they remain to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead.","You must not control Tirith Rhaw","Angmar's Control of Tirith Rhaw"},
[1309]={"'¿Son los hombres demacrados tan poderosos que no puedes vencerlos? Por favor, puede que sea la única manera de detener a las criaturas que dirigen.'","Los muertos de Angmar","Eriac te espera en el campamento de Eglain, en el extremo sur de Agamaur.\
\
Eriac te encomendó la tarea de matar a los hombres demacrados protectores, una tarea para la que demostraste estar a la altura. Deberías volver con Eriac para informarle de tu misión.","Los hombres demacrados protectores que dirigen a los tumularios pueden estar escondidos en las ruinas situadas en el extremo suroeste de Agamaur.\
\
Demuestra tu valor a Eriac. Te ha encomendado la tarea de encargarte de los hombres demacrados que lideran a los tumularios de Ivar con la esperanza de que se rompan las maldiciones que los atan.","'¡Muy bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! Solo puedo esperar que sea suficiente para deshacer el mal que se ha hecho aquí. Quizás se necesiten medidas más drásticas... ¿crees estar preparado para un desafío mayor?'","'Para demostrar que estás a la altura de ayudarnos a librarnos de los ejércitos que se están formando aquí. La extraña criatura Ivar tiene el poder de invocar espíritus malignos e infundir vida a los restos de los muertos, de los cuales este pantano no carece. No podemos permitir que esto ocurra. Este mal no puede crecer en poder.\
\
'En las regiones suroccidentales de Agamaur yacen muchas ruinas llenas de tumularios. ¡En esas ruinas deben esconderse los hombres demacrados que los mandan! Si matas a los hombres demacrados protectores, las maldiciones que atan a los tumularios podrían romperse.\
\
'No sé si esto tendrá éxito, pero no puede ser algo malo que criaturas como los hombres demacrados sean eliminadas del servicio del Enemigo.'","Has podido derrotar a varios de los aguasoscuras, pero el pantano corrupto no carece de agua. También hay otras amenazas que crecen en el pantano, como el ejército de tumularios que Ivar está formando."},
[1310]={"'Your efforts are welcomed, ${PLAYER}. Please take this with my thanks. Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig will recognize you for your efforts in the Ettenmoors should you visit him.'","Collected tracker's badges (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I need more of the tracker's badges before I can bestow a Token of Valour upon you, ${PLAYER}. Keep hunting the enemy down.'","Collect tracker's badges (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmar's Scouts","Return tracker's badges to First Marshal Sathryth","'Ho there, ${RACE}, lend me your ear!\
\
'There are many servants of Angmar scattered throughout the Ettenmoors. Search amongst their army for the tracker's badges. These can be found on the lowliest of their forces.\
\
'If you collect some of these badges and return them to me, you will be honoured with a commendation of valour.'","First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr is collecting badges taken from Angmar's weakest forces.","Trackers can be found among the Enemy in the Ettenmoors.\
\
Forces in the service to Angmar may each carry a seal of their station. Search among the enemy for these badges. First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr has promised a reward for the badges you bring her."},
[1311]={"First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr is collecting badges taken from Angmar's soldiers.","'Your efforts are heralded, ${PLAYER}. Take this with my thanks. Remember that Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig will recognize you for your efforts in the Ettenmoors should you visit him.'","'Have you been ignoring me, ${RACE}? I have need of your services.\
\
'Above the rank and file, the soldiers of Angmar act as lesser leaders of the Ongbûrz forces. These beasts are savage and cruel and capable of leading only small numbers before their tempers lead to bloodshed amongst their own kind.\
\
'Find these vile forces and bring me the patches that adorn their armour. I will reward you for ten such patches.'","Angmar's Soldiers","Return soldier's patches to First Marshal Sathryth","Collected soldier's patches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Soldiers in the service to Angmar may each carry a seal of their station. Search among the enemy for these badges. First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr has promised to reward you for the patches you bring her.","'I need more soldier's patches before I can bestow a Token of Valour upon you, ${PLAYER}. Keep hunting the Enemy.'","Collect soldier's patches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1312]={"'You there, ${RACE}, what are you doing? I need your assistance.\
\
'Beneath the chieftains of the Ongbûrz are the taskmasters who drive the host into a frenzy and force them to set upon our forces with sadistic glee.\
\
'Seek them out and take their honourifics. Return some of these honourifics to me, and I will see that you are justly rewarded.'","Angmar's Taskmasters","First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr is collecting badges taken from Angmar's taskmasters.","The taskmasters of Angmar can be found among the Enemy in the Ettenmoors.\
\
The taskmasters who drive the Angmarim war-host into a frenzy bear honourifics of their station. Collect these to earn commendation from the Army of the Free Peoples. First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr has promised to reward you for the taskmaster's honourifics you bring her.","Return taskmaster's honourifics to First Marshal Sathryth","'Your continued efforts fuel the strength that fills the arms and hearts of the Free Peoples. Thank you, ${PLAYER}. Visit Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig to earn greater recognition of your efforts in the Ettenmoors.'","Collect taskmaster's honourifics (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected taskmaster's honourifics(${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You need to bring me more of the taskmasters' honourifics to earn you a Token of Valour, ${PLAYER}. Keep hunting the Enemy.'"},
[1313]={"Collect a Tyrant's lash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Should you obtain one Tyrant's lash you will earn a Token of Valour, ${PLAYER}. Keep hunting the Enemy.'","Return Tyrant's lash to First Marshal Sathryth","Tyrants can be found among the Enemy in the Ettenmoors.\
\
Known by many names, the true leaders of Angmar's army are nothing more than tyrants, and the symbol of their station will earn you favour with the Free Peoples. First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr has promised to reward you for the Tyrant's lashes you bring her.","First Marshal Sathryth at Ost Ringdyr seeks the honourifics of the true leaders of Angmar's army, the Tyrant's lashes.","'With every victory we achieve against the Ongbûrz leaders, we not only claim the land where they stand, but also weaken the war-host of Angmar. Your involvement is a blessing, ${PLAYER}. Deliver this to Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig to earn greater recognition of your efforts in the Ettenmoors.'","'Pay attention, ${RACE}...I need your services.\
\
'At the head of the war-host of Angmar are the Tyrants who drive all others ahead of them. They are without fear and know only how to bring destruction to the world.\
\
'Should you defeat one of these terrors, return to me with the lash which is the symbol of his command, and you shall be rewarded.'","Collected a Tyrant's lash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmar's Tyrants"},
[1314]={"'The Angmarim have been studying the drakes and worms of Elderslade. The information they have gathered would be a great addition to my collection. The tower of Caivád Sâr is full of scholars and priests, from what the scouts report. If you happen to venture into that fell structure, I would appreciate you bringing back anything you find related to dragon-kin.'","The Angmarim in Elderslade have been gathering information on the local wildlife.","Angmarim Dragon Scrolls","'I wonder what secrets these Angmarim have uncovered.'","Lore scrolls can be found in Caivád Sâr, in western Elderslade.\
\
Lore-master Rúni has asked you to look for dragon-kin lore scrolls.","Return to Rúni","Gather dragon-kin lore scrolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You found something? Oh! Many things!'\
\
He takes the scrolls from you and immediately begins to pore over them. After a few moments, he realizes that you are still there.\
\
'Pardon me. I get so very excited over new things to study. These scrolls are fascinating and may hold secrets that could help our cause. Thank you again for your assistance!'","Gathered dragon-kin lore scrolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lore-master Rúni is at Zudramdân.\
\
You should bring the Angmarim dragon scrolls to Lore-master Rúni."},
[1315]={"'Al este y al norte, al pie de la colina en cuya cima se construyó Norsu-leiri hace mucho tiempo. Sospecho que allí es donde se encontrará el hechicero.'","El hechicero angmarim puede encontrarse al este y al norte del campamento de Mika.\
\
Busca cerca de Norsu-leiri al hechicero angmarim que está enseñando al Gauradan los ritos viles para ensorcelar mamuts.","'¡Que las bendiciones de los Espíritus del Hielo te acompañen! Gracias a tus actos, los orgullosos y poderosos norsu están ahora más a salvo.'","Hechicería angmarim","Norsu-hauta se encuentra al sur y al oeste del campamento del hechicero.\
\
Deberías regresar con Mika en Norsu-hauta y contarle tu victoria.","'Este hechicero de Angmarim se atreve a intentar corromper a nuestros norsu, utilizando a estúpidos Susi-väki como herramientas. Te sugiero que mires hacia el este, y un poco al norte, en las laderas de esas cumbres que se alzan justo al otro lado del camino. Apenas las visitamos, por lo que albergan muchas criaturas y väki indeseables.\
\
'¡Registra la zona cercana a Norsu-leiri! Debes encontrar al hechicero que está dando a los Susi-väki esas instrucciones corruptas y oscuras, y derrotarlo.'","Mika quiere que derrotes al hechicero angmarim que está intentando enseñar a los Gauredain a corromper mamuts."},
[1317]={"Kyrstig has asked you to defeat the Angmarim cultists in Akhaldarâg tombs.","Defeat Angmarim in Akhaldarâg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.","'Did you thin their numbers? Good! We may not be able to stop them by ourselves, but we must not allow these atrocities to continue!\
\
'The Angmarim will pay for this bold villainy!'","Defeated Angmarim in Akhaldarâg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmarim in Akhaldarâg","'We have to do something about these Angmarim cultists! They will raise every fallen dwarf in these tombs if we don't stop them... so stop them we must!'","Akhaldarâg is on the south-west side of the Pit of Stonejaws.","Talk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg"},
[1318]={"Talk to Afárr in Hagbuth","Angmarim can be found in south-west Clovengap.\
\
Gunvald has asked for you to defeat the Angmarim who are among the Wargs in south-west Clovengap.","'${PLAYER}, is it? I am Afárr. Welcome to Hagbuth. Not much to look at now, but we have driven the enemy soundly from this part of the tier.\
\
'Excellent work. It seems the tales about you are true.'","Defeat Angmarim in south-west Clovengap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmarim in Skarashulg","'I am glad to hear that you are helping Mother Amma with the Warg problem. My scouts report Angmarim among the upper tiers as well.\
\
'Do what you can to lessen their foothold among the forests of Clovengap and then report to Afárr in Hagbuth, across the river. He shall reward you for your time and efforts.'","Afárr is in Hagbuth, in the south-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Afárr you defeated the Angmarim.","Angmarim have been spotted skulking about the western tiers of Skarashulg, in Clovengap.","Defeated Angmarim in south-west Clovengap (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1319]={"El montaraz Angwedh, maestro armero de los Dúnedain, siempre está interesado en obtener cuero y pieles de las criaturas del Ángulo para confeccionar las protecciones de su pueblo.","Consigue cuero de avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue pieles de lobo o de huargo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue pieles de lince (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el cuero y las pieles a Angwedh en Tornhad","'Te pedí que me trajeras cuero y pieles de avanc, lobo y lince de los que se encuentran por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel. ¡Ten cuidado de no estropear demasiado las pieles que me traigas! Necesito que estén relativamente intactas para fabricar armaduras con la calidad adecuada para quienes han jurado lealtad a Aragorn, nuestro capitán'.","Angwedh, maestro armero","'Todo aquel que desee la amistad de los Dúnedain debe aceptar esta sencilla verdad: siempre hay más trabajo que manos para hacerlo. Si ofreces tu ayuda a un montaraz, ¡cuenta con que te tomará la palabra!\
\
'Me llamo Angwedh y soy el maestro armero de Tornhad. Los montaraces prefieren las armaduras medias hechas de cuero y pieles antes que las pesadas placas que visten los caballeros de otras tierras. Por tanto, esta es mi petición: tráeme cuero y pieles de avanc, lobo y lince de los que habitan por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel.\
\
'¡Ten cuidado de no estropear demasiado las pieles que me traigas! Necesito que estén relativamente intactas para fabricar armaduras con la calidad adecuada para quienes han jurado lealtad a Aragorn, nuestro capitán'.","Cuero de avanc recogido en el Ángulo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pieles de lince recogidas en el Ángulo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El montaraz Angwedh está en Tornhad.","'¡Esto servirá perfectamente, ! Te agradezco estas pieles en nombre de los dúnedain y te nombro ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de Tornhad'.","Se pueden encontrar lobos, linces y avancs por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Pieles de lobo recogidas en el Ángulo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1320]={"Animales atendidos","'Ve y hazle saber que estamos listos para el mercado.'","'Las ovejas y las gallinas han vuelto a sus corrales, los cerdos ya tienen su barro y las vacas están alimentadas. Me atrevería a decir que estamos listos para el mercado.\
\
'Hazme el favor; ve a informarle a Albin Cotonorte de que estamos preparados.'","Se ha cuidado de todos los animales y ya están listos para el mercado.","'¿Dices que los animales están listos? Puede que nos vaya bien este año.'","Albin Cotonorte está en el mercado agrícola de la Granja de Cotonorte.\
\
Albin Cotonorte se alegrará de saber que los animales están listos para el mercado.","Habla con Albin Cotonorte"},
[1321]={"You have delivered all requested crops to Annaben.\
\
You should talk to her.","Talk to Annaben","It's Annaben's job to collect the harvest from the Glaniath farmers, but the work has proven to be more than she expected.","Pick up a sack of crops from Mileth's home","Annaben's Delivery Service","Annaben has asked you to pick up a sack of crops from Lothwen's home.\
\
Her home in Glaniath is west of Annaben's waggon.","'Thank you, my dear. I'll be sending these crops to nearby towns that weren't as fortuitous as Glaniath was during the war. I'm sure the townsfolk will appreciate your hard work!'","'Oh, don't worry about me, dear. I'm just resting; these old bones protest when I don't take a break. Carrying these sacks to my waggon is exhausting work, and I've still got to deliver them!\
\
'All that's left are the harvests from Mileth and Lothwen; the sacks are ready to be collected outside their homes. If you are willing, would you bring those sacks to me?\
\
'How about you visit Mileth first? Her home is north-west from here.'","'How about you visit Mileth first? Her home is north-west from here.'","Pick up a sack of crops from Lothwen's home","Annaben has asked you to pick up a sack of crops from Mileth's home.\
\
Her home in Glaniath is north-west of Annaben's waggon.","'Lothwen's home is west from here. Just a bit more walking left to do!'"},
[1322]={"Juega las instancias de celebración de aniversario durante el Evento de Aniversario","¡Las instancias de celebración de aniversario han llegado! Juega las instancias de celebración de aniversario durante el Evento de Aniversario.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Puedes acceder a las instancias de celebración de aniversario desde el panel Unirse a instancia.</rgb>","¡Las instancias de celebración de aniversario han llegado! Juega las instancias de celebración de aniversario durante el Evento de Aniversario.","¡Las instancias de celebración de aniversario han llegado!"},
[1323]={"At the foot of a waterfall, surrounded by deadly avanc, you found Drambor's missing pack.\
\
You should bring the pack to Drambor in Calembel.","Annoyingly aggressive avanc have been causing issues along the banks of the rivers in Lamedon.","Near a crashing waterfall, you discovered Drambor's missing pack. You should pick up the pack before it gets chewed on any further. \
\
The pack is in Lamedon.","Drambor has asked you to search for his missing pack at one of the waterfalls between the beacons and Calembel.\
\
The waterfalls are in southern Lamedon.","'Pssst, ${PLAYER}. Can I talk to you?'\
\
You take a few steps to the side with Drambor so he can speak quietly to you.\
\
'Having father home has been really wonderful, but even though he left me in charge of Calembel when he went to war, I think he thinks I'm still just a little kid. I've been volunteering to bring messages from the city to the two beacons to show him how responsible I am, but...'\
\
He glances at his father Angbor and lowers his voice so much that you can barely hear him.\
\
'Well, you see, I was on my way back from the beacons with a bag full of missives for my father when I was attacked by some annoyingly aggressive avanc. I managed to get away, but they snatched my bag from me! I haven't told him yet that I've lost it, but maybe with your help I won't have to!\
\
'Can you look for it? Uhm, I admit I'm not sure I remember exactly where I lost it. There was a waterfall nearby! I remember that much! Listen, it was dark, all right? And I was running... anyhow, look for my pack near one of the waterfalls between here and the beacons. Oh, and if you can exact a vicious revenge upon those overgrown lizards, so much the better!'","Pick up the pack","Return to Drambor","'Oh, it's you!'\
\
He coughs to cover his loud voice and then whispers, 'Did you find it? Father is starting to wonder where the missives are!'\
\
You hand over the bite-ridden pack. Drambor's eyes widen when he sees the damage, and he hurriedly opens the pack's flap to peer inside. When he sees the missives within, he sighs dramatically, his shoulders sagging with relief.\
\
'They're intact! And not covered in avanc drool. Oh, thank you, thank you!'","There are avanc here, but no pack to be found","A rumpled pack lies here","Search for the missing pack","There are no avanc here, nor any missing packs","Avanc molestamente agresivo"},
[1324]={"You should let Drambor know that the riverways and roads are safer with fewer annoying avanc laying in wait to chomp on missing bags and traveller legs.\
\
Drambor is in Calembel.","'Thank you for taking care of those obnoxious lizards, my friend. Father is sure to be happy that I took matters into my own hands to deal with this issue.\
\
'Uhm, with your help of course, that is.'","Annoyingly Aggressive Avanc Must be Stopped!","Return to Drambor","Defeat annoyingly aggressive avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated annoyingly aggressive avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","River-avanc in Lamedon have grown overly bold, aggressive, and frankly, quite annoying.","Drambor has asked you to defeat annoyingly aggressive avanc along the rivers in southern Lamedon.","'Since you are heading in that direction anyhow, why don't you do us all a favour and put down as many of those annoying avanc as you can. Not only will I have my revenge, but it will make the waterways and roads safer for other travellers as well.'"},
[1325]={"Find the Lair of the Gloom-lord","Approach Múrgzot the Gloom-lord","Another Bad Plan","Find Múrgzot the Gloom-lord","Defeated Múrgzot the Gloom-lord","The Lair of the Gloom-lord can be found near Seregost, deep within Agarnaith.\
\
You should find the Lair of the Gloom-lord.","Viznak's first plan did not work out, but don't worry, he has more ideas.","Múrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\
\
You should defeat Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.","Múrgzot the Gloom-lord sleeps at the end of the cave","Viznak can be called with the goblin-caller.\
\
You should talk to Viznak.","Múrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found somewhere in the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\
\
You should find Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.","Defeat Múrgzot the Gloom-lord","Múrgzot the Gloom-lord can be found in the Lair of the Gloom-lord.\
\
You should approach Múrgzot the Gloom-lord.","Múrgzot the Gloom-lord wakes up and attacks!","Talk to Viznak","'Bats live in cave near Seregost. HUGE bats! Maybe if we can sneak up on them, we can ride 'em up over walls! I know there's even one big enough to carry you! Worth tryin', might be fun!'","'Ugh. Can't sneak up on bats, ears too good! Bats not very nice either. New plan!'"},
[1326]={"Áskell, en Gondamon, te dijo que uno de los miembros de la compañía de Gellir dejó atrás a un hermano suyo. Sigurdór, el hermano que quedó atrás, ha ido a Kheledúl buscando su propia venganza. Áskell te pidió que lo busques, pues el puerto ha sido invadido y su capataz ha sido desposeído y llevado a una torre en las afueras del puerto.","Habla con Sigurdór cerca de Kheledúl","'Debes apresurarte a Kheledúl para evitar que Sigurdór haga algo imprudente. Kheledúl está al este de aquí.'","'Aunque mi hermano ha sido vengado, temo que en mi pesar hablé demasiado claramente a un enano joven que ahora arriesga su propia vida para vengar a su hermano, miembro de la compañía de Gellir.\
\
'El enano, Sigurdór, fue hacia Kheledúl para vengar a su hermano, pero probablemente se encuentre en una torre en las afueras del puerto con el desposeído capataz del muelle, Svanr. Sigue el camino al este más allá de la cabaña de Thrasi, hacia la costa, y mantén los ojos abiertos por Sigurdór.\
\
'Ruego que no sea demasiado tarde para detener su locura.'","'Áskell me dijo que no fuera, pero no quise escuchar su advertencia. Mi hermano Arndór no era mucho mayor que yo, y sentí que debía vengarlo. Fracasé.\
\
'Los Duramano están demasiado arraigados en ese puerto para que un solo enano, más minero que guerrero, pueda expulsarlos. Tú, sin embargo, eres ${PLAYERNAME:un guerrero fuerte y vigoroso[m]|una guerrera fuerte y vigorosa[f]}, de lo contrario no estarías aquí...'","Sigurdór está en una torre a lo largo del camino a Kheledúl, al este de Gondamon.\
\
Áskell te pidió encontrar y detener a Sigurdór, un joven enano impulsivo, antes de que cometa una terrible locura.","La Pena de Otro Hermano"},
[1327]={"Since your prankish tactics worked so well to persuade the fishermen to leave, you have been asked to try the same ploy on the huntsmen from Stangard.","'A ${RACE} and not a spirit? You wanted to frighten us off, and I see the edge of the Dwimordene's haunted wood nearby. Perhaps you see us as trespassers.\
\
'We shall go, but only if you return our missing hunter to us. He has not been seen since daybreak, but would not have wandered far. Have you seen him?'","<rgb=#FF0000>Roar</rgb> at the leader of the Rohirrim hunter-camp","Wait a few moments","Wynmar is at his camp in Thinglad.\
\
You should tell Wynmar to stay put while you and Noriel search for his missing friend.","'You seem somewhat disconcerted, ${PLAYER}. Did your plan not go well? Was there trouble?'\
\
Noriel listens gravely as you tell her of the stubborn hunter Wynmar, and his fearlessness in the face of concern for his missing companion.\
\
'I see. Let me think a moment, my friend. They must leave, but I would not have them abandon their lost fellow.'","The Rohirrim leader of the hunters' camp is in the north-western woods of Thinglad.\
\
Since your tactics are not working against this stubborn Rohirrim, you should try speaking with him instead of trying to frighten him away.","'You again? Why do you return, ${RACE}?'\
\
Wynmar listens as you explain that he and his folk trespass in Thinglad, but the Elves wish to help them find their missing companion... on the condition that they do not wander from their camp.","It would seem that one of these men has gone missing, and his companions are concerned for his fate","This is a good place to hide","Tell Wynmar and his men to stay put","Talk to the leader of the men at the hunters' camp","The hunter is determined to stay put","'The ploy to frighten the fishermen worked rather well. I think we should use it again on the huntsmen and see if they scare as easily as their kinsmen.\
\
'Try once more to make these woods look haunted, so that the rumours will follow these Men back to Stangard and weaken their desire to come here for another generation. Good luck -- and try not to be spotted by the hunters.'","Another Gentle Nudge","<rgb=#FF0000>Whistle</rgb> at Wynmar, the leader of the Rohirrim hunter camp","Consult with Noriel at Haldirith","This hunter does not seem to want to leave...","The hunters' camp is a little to the north of Haldirith.\
\
You should try to frighten Wynmar, the leader of the hunters' camp.","Noriel wishes for you to bid the huntsmen stay and wait while the missing hunter is sought","Noriel is at the Elf-outpost of Haldirith.\
\
You should bring news of this twist in the plan to Noriel.","Wait a few moments before trying again.","This is a good hiding spot"},
[1328]={"Participa en actividades del Festival de Aniversario (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Vaya, eres una persona festiva! ¡Espero que te estés divirtiendo en el Festival de Aniversario!\
\
'Parece que lo estás pasando genial, así que quizás disfrutes de una de estas recompensas. ¡Aquí tienes!'\
\
'¡Vuelve mañana y tendré más recompensas para ti!'","'¡Te doy la bienvenida!\
\
'Si estás aquí para el Festival de Aniversario, te recomiendo que eches un vistazo y participes en muchas de las divertidas actividades que hay por aquí. ¡Y si no estás aquí para el Festival de Aniversario, quizás deberías estarlo!\
\
'Para aquellos que participen en muchas de nuestras actividades, podría haber una recompensa esperándote, así que ¡sal ahí!\
\
'Y recuerda, cuando enciendas fuegos artificiales, ¡la seguridad es lo primero!'","Todos los días hay algo que hacer para el Festival de Aniversario. Ven y únete a todos para celebrar otro año encantador y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival de Aniversario!'","Otro año encantador","Habla con Waldo Retumbo","Waldo Retumbo está emocionado de dar la bienvenida a los visitantes al Árbol de la Fiesta y los anima a participar en todas las actividades del festival.","Participaste en actividades del Festival de Aniversario (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Waldo Retumbo quiere agradecerte por tu participación en el Festival de Aniversario de hoy."},
[1329]={"Derrota a los zizani mordeadores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Busca a Zâwakhar, el Acaparador, y recupera los tesoros","Derrota a las reinas zizani (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los zizani excavadores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recupera tesoros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrotaste a Zâwakhar, el Acaparador","Busca cualquier señal del hombre extraño mientras recuperas el último tesoro que queda en Charganpâta.","Has derrotado a las reinas zizani (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los zizani y recupera los tesoros robados cerca de los estanques de Charganpâta.","Jôrlar ha recibido informes de un hombre extraño que parece vivir con los zizani en los estanques de Charganpâta. El hombre se ha vuelto violento últimamente, acosando a los aldeanos cercanos. Encuéntralo e intenta hablar con él para que entre en razón.","¡Escuchas un grito de rabia! ¡Zâwakhar ha estado coleccionando estos \\qtésoros\\q!","El tesoro de otro hombre","'Me alegra ver menos de los zizani. Son unas plagas masivas. Qué historia tan extraña cuentas sobre este Zâwakhar. Volvamos a Zajâna, y puedes contarle todo esto a Jôrlar.'"},
[1330]={"Otro asunto de importancia","${PLAYER},\
\
He tenido conocimiento de otro encargo importante del que deberías estar al tanto. Si estás ${PLAYER:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]}, tráeme esta carta a la sala de entrenamiento bajo la Puerta del Lodo, en Bree.\
\
Albra","Has recibido una carta de tu instructora en Bree en la que te pide que regreses a verla. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","'Nos encontramos otra vez. Es bueno verte. Hay un asunto que creo que podría resultarte interesante.'","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","Lleva la carta a Albra Bajoribera en Bree","Albra Bajoribera te envió una carta en la que solicita que la visites en la sala de entrenamiento de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Albra. Se la puede encontrar en la sala de entrenamiento de saqueadores bajo la Puerta del Lodo."},
[1331]={"Otro asunto de importancia","'Regresas sin perder un instante. Escucha bien, porque este desafío es otro que templará tus nervios como acero.'","Lleva la carta a Tralli en Bree","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Tralli te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites cerca de la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Tralli. Puede encontrarse cerca de la Cárcel de Bree.","${PLAYER},\
\
Aún queda trabajo por hacer. Devuélveme esta carta en Bree y te asignaré una tarea.\
\
Tralli"},
[1332]={"Otro asunto de importancia","Lleva la carta a Flambard Tuk","Flambard Tuk te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en Bree.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Flambard Tuk. Se encuentra cerca del Pabellón de Caza en Bree.","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","'Es bueno verte de nuevo. Tengo noticias sobre algo que creo que podría interesarte.'","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","${PLAYER},\
\
Me han llegado más noticias, y espero que quieras venir a verme para que podamos hablar de su importancia. Si lo deseas, búscame en Bree y te informaré de lo que debe hacerse.\
\
Flambard Tuk"},
[1333]={"Otro asunto de importancia","Dalton Willow te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en Bree.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Dalton Willow. Se encuentra en la Escalera de los Eruditos en Bree.","${PLAYER},\
\
Tengo otra tarea para ti. Regresa a la Escalera del Erudito y tal vez podamos sacar tu cabeza de las nubes y ponerla donde debe estar... en el estudio.\
\
Dalton Willow","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","'Excelente, has venido, y rápido. Temía que decidieras perseguir otra fantasía. Bueno, entonces escucha con atención, porque esto es importante.'","Lleva la carta a Dalton Willow en Bree","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."},
[1334]={"Has recibido una carta de tu entrenadora en Bree pidiéndote que regreses con ella. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","'Me alegra que hayas regresado. Espero que estés ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]} para este nuevo reto.'","Dawn Manzanadorada te envió una carta solicitando que la visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Dawn Manzanadorada. Se la puede encontrar en la Cárcel de Bree.","Otro asunto de importancia","${PLAYER},\
\
Necesito tus servicios de nuevo. Cuando tengas tiempo, vuelve a verme a Bree y me encargaré de que te informen de lo que implica este último encargo.\
\
Dawn Manzanadorada.","Lleva la carta a Dawn Manzanadorada en Bree","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'"},
[1335]={"Otro asunto de importancia","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree, en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","'¡Me alegra verte! Estaba seguro de que la fuerza de mis palabras te encontraría en buena forma y con disposición a aceptar lo que se presentara.'","Oggur te envió una carta solicitando que lo visites en la Prisión de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Oggur. Puedes encontrarlo en la Prisión de Bree.","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","Lleva la carta a Oggur en Bree","${PLAYER},\
\
Ha llegado el momento de demostrar tu temple empuñando el metal. Ven a Bree y encuéntrame en la Prisión de Bree; allí te diré más. Seré claro: el asunto al que me refiero es peligroso y pondrá a prueba tu valía como Luchador.\
\
Oggur"},
[1336]={"${PLAYER},\
\
Siempre hay más historias que contar, y da la casualidad de que hay otra en la que creo que te convertirás en parte importante. Búscame en el Poney Pisador y podremos hablar del asunto.\
\
Burt Nuevecuentos","Otro asunto de importancia","DNT - 'Players should never see this.'","Burt Nuevecuentos te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en el Poney Pisador en Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Burt Nuevecuentos en el Poney Pisador en Bree.","'Hola, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, es bueno verte. Ahora prepárate, porque hay algo que debe hacerse, y creo que estás tan ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]} como necesitas para ayudar.'","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Lleva la carta a Burt Nuevecuentos en Bree"},
[1337]={"Otro asunto de importancia","${PLAYER},\
\
Ha surgido un nuevo asunto que requiere la atención de alguien con tus habilidades. Búscame y te daré más información.\
\
Biarn","'Me alegra que hayas regresado. Ten en cuenta que esta tarea es más difícil que la última que te encomendé, pero no por ello es menos importante.'","Biarn te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que lo visites en la Escalera de los Eruditos de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Biarn dentro de la Escalera de los Eruditos en Bree.","Lleva la carta a Biarn en Bree","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","Has recibido una carta de tu entrenador en Bree en la que te pide que regreses para verlo. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte."},
[1338]={"${PLAYER},\
\
Tengo una tarea que requiere atención y enseguida pensé en ti. Preséntate en la cárcel de Bree y te explicaré lo que hay que hacer.\
\
Daisy Manzanadorada","Otro asunto de importancia","Has recibido una carta de tu instructora en Bree en la que te pide que regreses a verla. Al parecer, hay algo que desea enseñarte.","Daisy Manzanadorada te ha enviado una carta solicitando que la visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Daisy Manzanadorada dentro de la Cárcel de Bree.","-Es muy amable de tu parte venir. Este asunto merece atención, y creo que lograrás llevarlo a cabo.-","'Quienes juegan no deberían ver esto.'","Lleva la carta a Daisy Manzanadorada en Bree"},
[1339]={"Has recibido una carta de Brom Barbadehalcón, el entrenador de Luchador de Bree, en la que te pide que vayas a verlo.","Otro asunto de importancia","'Ahí estás. Por fin. Estaba empezando a aburrirme, y cuando me aburro... ¡la gente sale lastimada! Solo quienes se lo merecen, claro.\
\
'¡Como quienes me hacen esperar demasiado por algo, ${PLAYERNAME:Luchador[m]|Luchadora[f]}!'","Brom Barbadehalcón te envió una carta solicitando que lo visites en la Cárcel de Bree.\
\
Entrega la carta a Brom. Se lo puede encontrar en la Cárcel de Bree.","${PLAYER},\
\
Te estoy esperando en la Cárcel de Bree, para aprender más sobre el refinado arte de la lucha. Más te vale tener la preparación, porque mi tiempo es valioso: ¡podría estar pasándolo bebiendo... o peleando... o haciendo ambas cosas al mismo tiempo!\
\
Brom Barbadehalcón","Lleva la carta a Brom Barbadehalcón en la Cárcel de Bree"},
[1340]={"Otro asunto de importancia","Tarneth te ha enviado una carta pidiéndote que la visites en Tinnudir.\
\
Entrégale la carta a Tarneth. Se encuentra en Tinnudir, a orillas del lago Evendim.","${PLAYER},\
\
¿Has oído la leyenda del Ectheldur? Es conocida entre los Dúnedain, pero, por desgracia, también ha atraído la atención de saqueadores de tumbas y ladrones del Sur que buscan expoliar el legado de Annúminas. Si deseas ganarte el favor de los Dúnedain, o si simplemente te interesa la preservación de artefactos, ven a reunirte conmigo en Tinnudir, a orillas del lago Evendim.\
\
Tarneth","Has recibido una carta de Tarneth, una montaraz del Norte que vive en Tinnudir, en Evendim.","'¡Ah, debes de ser ${PLAYER}! ¿Recibiste mi carta?'\
\
Le entregas a Tarneth la carta que te envió, y ella le echa un vistazo antes de guardarla rápidamente.\
\
'¡Muy bien! Soy Tarneth, montaraz y antigua Marinera del Norte. Como mencioné en mi carta, los artefactos perdidos de Annúminas están bajo amenaza por parte de ladrones y saqueadores del Sur. Ahora que has venido, ¡trabajemos juntos para detenerlos!'","Lleva la carta a Tarneth en Tinnudir"},
[1341]={"Destruye los planes de asedio abandonados","Las máquinas de asedio se encuentran en el centro de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes encontrar y destruir las máquinas de asedio del enemigo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Compañía.</rgb>","Escuchas el golpeteo de martillos no lejos de aquí. Cuando los orcos se dignan a construir, es solo con un propósito: la guerra.\
\
Debes encontrar y neutralizar las máquinas de asedio, y parar su construcción de una vez por todas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una compañía.</rgb>","Los ingenieros de asedio se encuentran en el centro de Nan Wathren.\
\
Los orcos Tarkrîp no parecen los suficientemente astutos para haber construido las masquinas de asedio. Seguro que hay ingenieros sirviendo al enemigo, y estos inteligentes adversarios deben ser derrotados.","Ingeniero semiorco derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra y destruye máquinas de asedio","Máquinas de asedio destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los planes de asedio se encuentran en el centro de Nan Wathren, cerca de donde los ingenieros estaban.\
\
Los ingenieros semiorcos dejaron una colección de planes tras de sí para el asedio de Puente de Caballetes. Debes destruir los planes, lo que seguramente salvará muchas vidas inocentes.","Busca y encuentra máquinas de asedio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Tarkrîp de Nan Wathren han comenzado a construir máquinas de asedio para otro ataque a Puente de Caballetes.","Has hecho mucho hoy para asegurar Puente de Caballetes. Las máquinas de asedio Tarkrîp han sido desmanteladas, y los planes de ataque han sido frustrados.","Completado","Derrota al ingeniero de asedio Tarkrîp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has destruido los planes de un nuevo ataque a Puente de Caballetes","Otro asedio a Puente de Caballetes"},
[1342]={"Núrzum threw great boulders as a child would toss a ball","Search the outskirts of Dunfast for signs of the enemy","Examine signs of Núrzum (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Another strange landmark to mark Núrzum's prolonged presence","'I suspect that Núrzum and his forces were behind this, but I do not think he is still here, for the weather holds steady.\
\
'Dunfast has no Thane, no lords, no nobles, no great warriors to draw the enemy, yet something happened here. Our search for the people has been in vain thus far, but perhaps we can learn more of what happened to them.'","Cyneberg can be found in Dunfast.\
\
You should return to Cyneberg.","Return to Cyneberg","Signs of Núrzum's presence can be found at the ice-spire outside of Dunfast.\
\
You should examine signs of Núrzum's presence.","Núrzum looks to have pulled up strong old trees by their roots for no other reason but love of chaos","Another Strange Landmark","'Núrzum takes delight in chaos and despair. He came here not to hunt these people, but to terrify them.\
\
'He snapped trees and crushed stone, and laughed at the helpless peoples of Dunfast when they fled. At least, I hope that is how it happened. I believe they are alive somewhere.'","A sign of what drove away the people of Dunfast may be on the outskirts of town.\
\
You should search the outskirts of Dunfast for a sign of the forces of Isengard.","Cyneberg wants you to find out what made the inhabitants of Dunfast abandon their settlement and disappear into the wilds."},
[1343]={"Niko se encuentra en Jänis-leiri, al oeste siguiendo el camino desde Itä-ma.\
\
Deberías llevarle a Niko la carne de alce y las astas.","Astas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tu éxito al destruir las trampas de los Gauredain sin ahuyentar a las manadas de uros ha impresionado a Niko, el Maestro de la Caza.","'¿Y bien? ¿Acaso los sûri-hirvi de por aquí son demasiado para ti, Sivullinen?'","Carne recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge astas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Otro invierno escaso","'Quiero que caces sûri-hirvi. Deambulan por toda Itä-ma, así que no deberías tener dificultades para encontrarlos. Usamos sus astas para construir, como decoración e incluso como combustible; sí, el hueso y las astas arden si se aviva el fuego de la manera adecuada, y no es que aquí sobren los árboles para quemarlos libremente. La carne, cuando se congela, se sala, se ahúma o se seca al aire, puede durar una estación o más.'","Recoge carne (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me alegra que hayas ayudado a cazar los sûri-hirvi, pero no era una tarea imposible.'","Los alces deambulan por toda Itä-ma, tanto cerca como lejos de Jänis-leiri.\
\
Niko te ha pedido que caces alces y le lleves sus astas y su carne.","'Ah, excelente. Esto servirá perfectamente, Sivullinen.'","Lleva carne de alce y astas a Niko","'Como ya dije, mis otros cazadores están ocupados con otras tareas, y uno de ellos yace herido en Pynti-peldot, como si alguna vez nos asignaran suficientes cazadores para hacerlo todo, además. En fin, parece que se avecina otro invierno duro, y es mi deber asegurarme de que no acabe siendo insoportablemente escaso. Puedes ayudar con eso.\
\
'Quiero que caces sûri-hirvi. Deambulan por toda Itä-ma, así que no deberías tener problemas para encontrarlos. Usamos sus astas para construir, como decoración e incluso como combustible; sí, el hueso y las astas arden si se aviva el fuego de la manera adecuada, y no es que aquí abunden los árboles para quemarlos sin miramientos. La carne, cuando se congela, se sala, se ahúma o se seca al aire, puede durar una estación o más.\
\
'Tráeme muchas astas y trozos de carne. Les encontraremos utilidad.'"},
[1344]={"Collected climbing gear (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to Agátur","'You should speak with Agátur. He has studied many dwarf-maps, in which our surveyors have drawn the faults and crevices under many mountains.'","Collect climbing gear (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The dwarf Agátur may have the knowledge needed to follow Etterfang's lost trail.","Climbing gear can be found in Skarháld.\
\
You should collect climbing gear for the journey to Stormwall.","Agátur can be found in Skarháld.\
\
You should ask Agátur about under-maps of the Grey Mountains.","Another Way","'You are well prepared now, but I have grim news. Word has spread through the Zhélruka of the Stave that you seek. Except the words have been twisted and now many believe the entrance to Thafar-gathol lies within the Stormwall! Blast these Zhélruka! Five of their kin left Skarháld just moments ago.'","You should talk to Agátur in Skarháld.","'I am always happy speaking on the old under-mountain maps, ${PLAYER}. Only the most skilled of dwarf surveyors can make them. It takes great care and precision! If you can believe it, many such maps were made and kept from the distant days when Durin's Folk called these cold Grey Mountains our home. Indeed, I brought some with me, knowing they might be of use.\
\
'You wish to know of spider-paths that touch upon the Glimmerdeep? Let me see. Yes, there were many spider-tunnels beneath these peaks. However... the only ones to touch on Glimmerdeep cut straight across the mountain into Stormwall. You may be in luck! \
\
'Hum... yet do not judge your luck, perhaps, until you have found your way there and inside. Mountains shift and rocks fall, after centuries! You will want to take some climbing gear with you when you go.'"},
[1346]={"Talk to Brúngwath at Atburg","'You have returned the stolen relics to the Rohirrim? That is well. You have earned our allegiance, ${PLAYER}. When next we meet, we shall stand together against the foe!\
\
'Farewell.'","'I say, well done! This is wondrous news indeed. You have earned this reward.'","Eowils knows that Wynstan will be encouraged by Brúngwath's willingness to rejoin the battle against the Enemy.","Talk to Wynstan at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore","Answering the Summons","Wynstan is at Aculf's camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg.\
\
Eowils instructed you to return to Wynstan with the news that Brúngwath has pledged his allegiance to you.","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! You say that this Brúngwath bade you recover our relics to prove your honour and earn the allegiance of the Dead? You must return to the shade at once and let him know that you have fulfilled your oath and now require his!\
\
'To be rid of the spirits from this place will be a relief, but to have them put our enemies to flight will be of even greater value!\
\
'When you have done this, return to Wynstan...he will be encouraged by your news!'","Brúngwath awaits your return at Atburg, south-east of Aculf's camp in the Rushgore.\
\
Eowils instructed you to return to Brúngwath and assure him that you fulfilled your oath to him."},
[1347]={"'This is all my fault. I have a very good reason for having had Klátha stationed here, and it has naught to do with whether she can defend herself. However... well, I suppose I never shared with her that reason.\
\
'My friend, if you would help me once more, please tell Klátha that I am sorry, and if she will gaze towards the river, she will understand why I asked she be moved to this camp.\
\
'After you speak with her, come find me in the gardens below.'","Nósni is located in a garden north of Bazanmanar.\
\
You should talk to Nósni.","The fireworks are located in a garden north of Bazanmanar.\
\
You should light the fireworks.","Apologies in the Sky","Light the fireworks","'You again?'\
\
You give Klátha the message from Nósni.\
\
'Look towards the river? Hmm. I suppose I can do that. Not that it will matter, of course. But I suppose I can.'","Klátha's heart has turned against Nósni, but he's not ready to give up.","Talk to Nósni","'Hello, hello! Now the truth will out. You see, I know that Klátha's favourite thing is fireworks. I arranged to purchase special ones from Feredis of Minas Tirith herself!\
\
'I have been waiting for the right moment to set them alight for Klátha. I had her moved here so she wouldn't miss the display, but... well, the delivery was very late and... oh. I can of course see how she would think I was trying to protect her. It was supposed to be a surprise, but... well, I suppose things have dragged on with no real news from me. I was so focused on my plan that I lost sight of how confusing my actions must have been.\
\
'Well, will you help me light these fireworks? It may not be enough to redeem myself, but I have to try.'","Klátha is located in a camp north of Bazanmanar.\
\
Nósni has asked you to speak to Klátha once more.","Klátha is located in a camp north of Bazanmanar.\
\
Nósni has asked you to speak to Klátha for a final time.","'Oh, ${PLAYER}. That was spectacular! And probably the first time fireworks have ever graced these halls. If that did not win her love, at least may it grant me her forgiveness. Would... would you check on her for me? See whether I am allowed to speak with her again?'","'Welcome back, friend. Yes, yes. I saw the display. And one of the merchants came by to apologize to Nósni for the late shipment. Nósni had me moved here for the spectacular view, did he not? He has always been so thoughtful in his deeds, but foolish with the timeliness of his words.\
\
'Hmmm. They were quite the thing, weren't they. I suppose I might find it in my heart to forgive him.'","Talk to Klátha","Fireworks explode above the Forest Beneath the Mountain"},
[1348]={"Manzanas caídas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Finola y su horno se encuentran en Nobotella.\
\
Finola te ha pedido que uses su horno para cocinar un pastel de manzana y jabalí de Allende.","El Gran Plan de Adamanda Nortuk está casi listo para ser puesto en acción. Solo falta una pieza... del pastel.","Pastel de manzana y jabalí de Allende","Habla con Finola Mirtillo","Consigue carne de jabalí de Allende (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Apuesto a que te estás preguntando qué vamos a atrapar con esta red. ¡Te lo diré! Todavía no, eso sí. En primer lugar, tenemos que colocar en esta trampa el mejor cebo posible... ¡uno de los pasteles de carne de Finola Mirtilo!\
\
'Todo el mundo sabe que los mejores pasteles son los que prepara Finola Mirtilo con jabalí salvaje y manzanas. Necesito comprobar algo con nuestros Fronteros, así que mientras lo hago, consigue algo de carne de jabalí de Allende y algunas manzanas. Puedes recoger manzanas caídas cerca de los árboles de la gran granja de Campotieso. Al jabalí de Allende también le gusta las manzanas caídas, ¡así que seguro que hay también cerca de la granja! Lleva la carne y las manzanas a Finola Mirtilo y enconces reúnete conmigo en el camino ya con el pastel.'","Utiliza el horno para hacer un pastel","'¡Saludos! ¿Otro pastel para Diamante? Oh, ¿quiere un pastel de jabalí de Allende? ¡Muy bien, muy bien! ¡Pongámonos a trabajar! ¡Puedes usar mi horno y yo añadiré mi mezcla de especias secreta!'","Finola está en Nobotella.\
\
Llévale la carne de jabalí de Allende y las manzanas a Finola Mirtillo.","¡El olor de la carne especiada y las manzanas inunda el aire!","Vuelve con Diamante","Diamante Nortuk está en Nobotella.\
\
Lleva el pastel a Diamante.","Los jabalíes de Allende y las manzanas caídas se encuentran bajo los manzanos de la granja al norte de Campotieso.\
\
Rosalinda Nortuk te ha pedido que recolectes carne de jabalí de Allende y manzanas caídas.","Recoge manzanas caídas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Podría oler ese pastel a una milla de distancia! ¡Igual que debería hacerlo nuestra presa! ¡Buen trabajo!'"},
[1349]={"Recoge manzanas verdes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega las manzanas a Daisy Arenas en el puesto de venta","Recoge una manzana dorada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge manzanas rojas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La caja de manzanas se encuentra cerca del puesto de venta en Delagua.\
\
Busca las manzanas en la caja para completar el pedido de esta cliente.","Manzanas rojas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Manzana dorada recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una cliente del puesto ha pedido varias manzanas frescas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada.</rgb>","'¡Ahí estás! Gracias, ${PLAYER}, esa cliente se estaba impacientando. Ahora mismo le llevaré el pedido. Solo necesito una bolsa...'","Manzanas verdes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pedido de manzanas","'¡Manzanas, por favor! ¡Hola, necesito manzanas! Y unas cuantas, además. Ponte a trabajar de inmediato.\
\
'La caja está en alguna parte detrás del puesto. Vamos, muévete, que no tengo todo el día.'","Daisy Arenas está en Delagua, en la Comarca.\
\
Lleva las manzanas que has recogido a Daisy Arenas."},
[1350]={"Talk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon","Walnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Walnoth has gone to apprehend Eldora and will be taking her to the dungeon for holding until her crimes can be fully proven.","Walnoth has decided that the time has come to apprehend the person responsible for Cliving's crimes. That person could be Eldora, the cook's assistant.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Swithorne or Wigfugol.</rgb>","'So you believe Eldora to be the culprit? It is a shame to think that such a sweet girl could be responsible, but I understand your concerns. There were no witnesses to her whereabouts at the time of Malbéort's murder, and she had direct access to the kitchen where the poison phial was discovered.\
\
'I trust your decision on this matter. I shall go now to apprehend Eldora. Let us reconvene inside the dungeon's entrance, under the Mead Hall.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Swithorne or Wigfugol.</rgb>","Apprehending Eldora","'Eldora has admitted to nothing, but has come along quietly nonetheless. We will hold her here until more evidence can be gathered to either confirm her guilt or prove her innocence. Someone will be sent to take care of the injured soldier who was in her care.\
\
'This is a most reasonable decision, ${PLAYER}. Eldora's lack of supporting witnesses and access to the kitchen make her the most likely fit for these crimes. Her treacherous schemes will end here.'","'Despite your decision, I maintain my innocence, ${PLAYER}. Athelward will not allow a suspect to remain captive for long when no solid evidence can be gathered against them. Perhaps, in time, Walnoth will see the error in this hasty decision, and the true culprit will be revealed. The truth will be my ally.\
\
'I hope that Fréastan is well cared for until this matter is sorted out. His injuries will need proper treatment.'"},
[1351]={"Talk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon","Walnoth has decided that the time has come to apprehend the person responsible for Cliving's crimes. The evidence against Swithorne paints him as the most likely culprit.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Eldora or Wigfugol.</rgb>","'Swithorne came peacefully with me, when I explained things to him. We will hold Swithorne here as we gather more evidence...or until we receive his confession.\
\
'I believe you have made a wise decision, ${PLAYER}. Swithorne's motive and access to the kitchens make him a logical choice. No further harm shall come to the people of Cliving at his hands.'","'So you believe Swithorne to be the culprit? There is good reason to suspect him. Being one of Théodmar's Riders, he would have had access to the kitchen without arousing suspicion. His brother's death can be directly attributed to Athelward's orders to withdraw from Elthengels, and perhaps this motive has fuelled his attempt to poison the Reeve.\
\
'I trust your decision on this matter. I shall go to apprehend Swithorne now...meet us at the entrance to the dungeon, under the Mead Hall.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Eldora or Wigfugol.</rgb>","Walnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Walnoth has gone to apprehend Swithorne and will hold him at the dungeon until the matter can be fully resolved.","'I am not the one that should be held behind these bars, ${PLAYER}. It was a costly mistake to allow my dagger to slip from my possesion, but never would I use it against any of the people in Cliving...the very people I have sworn to protect.\
\
'I ask that you remember all that has transpired, and all that has been revealed in your search for the truth. I will wager that the criminal will act again, in time, and that justice will be upheld.'","Apprehending Swithorne"},
[1352]={"'So you believe Wigfugol to be the culprit? Yes, it cannot be understated that his grudge against Athelward gives him the strongest motive. Living alone at his estate, he has no witnesses for his whereabouts during these crimes. It takes little imagination to see how Wigfugol was the one responsible for this atrocity.\
\
'I trust your decision on this matter. I shall go now to apprehend Wigfugol and take him to a cell in the dungeon. Meet me inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Eldora or Swithorne.</rgb>","Walnoth has decided that the time has come to apprehend the person responsible for Cliving's crimes. The evidence indicates that Wigfugol may be the man responsible.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Only ONE suspect can be apprehended for these crimes. Accepting and completing this quest will not allow you to apprehend Eldora or Swithorne.</rgb>","Talk to Walnoth in the Mead Hall dungeon","'I am ashamed to be so disrespected by a simpleton guard and his outsider lackey. I understand that you are only completing the task that has been asked of you, but I wager that you will discover that the true villain remains free. Keep your wits about you if you remain in the city.\
\
'If disapproving of the Reeve's actions is my only crime, you will find that there are others who deserve to be locked up with me.'","Apprehending Wigfugol","Walnoth will be waiting for you inside the dungeon, under the Mead Hall of Cliving.\
\
Walnoth has gone to apprehend Wigfugol and will be taking him to the dungeon for holding until the crimes can be fully resolved.","'Wigfugol protested when I came for him, but eventually he relented and came along willingly. We will hold him here as we gather more evidence to prevent him from causing further harm.\
\
'Thinking on it now, I believe this was the best decision, ${PLAYER}. Wigfugol's disdain for the Reeve led him to this scheme of deception and murder. Athelward's life will be safer with Wigfugol locked away.'"},
[1354]={"Al mirar dentro de la tumba, ves un destello. Has encontrado el anillo de Arantar.","'Al ascender al trono, la Dama Azul entregaba un anillo a cada uno de los gobernantes de Annúminas. Esto simbolizaba su derecho a gobernar y también les identificaba ante quienes venían de fuera del reino.\
\
'Desde hace tiempo se rumorea que estos anillos también poseían algún tipo de poder adicional. No como los propios Anillos de Poder, claro está, sino algo diferente.\
\
'Creo que el anillo de Arantar aún puede estar en su tumba, y eso es lo que Angmar está buscando desesperadamente. A ver si tú lo encuentras primero.'","El anillo de Arantar","Cada uno de los gobernantes de Annúminas recibió un anillo único de manos de la Dama Azul.","Encuentra el anillo de Arantar","Lleva el anillo de Arantar a Nethrandir, en el Camino de los Reyes","'¡Tenemos que encontrar ese anillo antes de que lo haga Angmar!'","Haudh Arantar se encuentra al sur del campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Nethrandir te ha pedido que te adentres en Haudh Arantar y encuentres el anillo de Arantar antes de que lo haga Angmar.","Nethrandir se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
A Nethrandir le encantará saber que has encontrado el anillo de Arantar.","'Sí, efectivamente, este es el anillo de Arantar. Me encargaré de que lo envíen a Tinnudir de inmediato.'","El anillo no está aquí"},
[1357]={"Habla con Nimbellas en el campamento del Camino de los Reyes","'Hay mucho trabajo por delante y, si queremos tener éxito, debemos actuar rápido.'","El campamento del Camino de los Reyes custodia las tumbas de los antiguos gobernantes de los montaraces.","Nimbellas está en el campamento de los montaraces en el Camino de los Reyes, al sur de Tinnudir.","'Has hecho mucho por nosotros y me parece injusto pedirte más, pero debo hacerlo. Los saqueadores de tumbas que expulsamos de Rantost huyeron hacia el sur y ahora amenazan nuestra posición en el Camino de los Reyes. Allí es donde están enterrados los antiguos gobernantes de mi pueblo. Los que antes vigilaban Annúminas y Evendim desde lo alto, ahora duermen bajo tierra. Sus memorias deben ser honradas y recordadas, pero sus tumbas no deben ser perturbadas.\
\
'También me han llegado rumores y susurros sobre otra fuerza entre las ruinas. Creo que ya te has enfrentado a ellos en las haciendas al este de aquí. Temo que tengamos poco tiempo para averiguar sus motivos y derrotarlos antes de que sea tarde.\
\
'Dirígete al sur, al Camino de los Reyes. Allí, reúnete con Nimbellas en su campamento y averigua cómo puedes ayudar.'","'Ve al sur y mira qué ayuda puedes prestar.'","Arquitectos de la historia"},
[1358]={"Da caza a los huargos que hostigan a los viajeros en la Fuente oriental del Bruinen en las Montañas Nubladas.","'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Los huargos son ahora más cautos que antes.'","Vighar Trotasendas tiene su campamento en Alto Risco.\
\
Vighar estará complacido de oír que has disminuido la amenaza de los huargos que acechan en las Montañas Nubladas.","Huargos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cazadores árticos","'Los trasgos usan a los huargos para rastrear y cazar, y también para guardar las proximidades de los campamentos trasgos. Lo mejor es exterminarlos a todos. Búscalos lejos hacia el este, cerca de las crestas de Pinnath Fenui.'","'¡Me alegra que hayas tenido éxito en tu cacería, ${PLAYER}! Los huargos son una presa peligrosa, ¡y has terminado con muchos!'","'Los trasgos y los huargos son aliados cercanos, y un gran problema para nosotros.'","Los huargos acechan en los ventisqueros de las Montañas Nubladas, al norte y este de Rivendel, cerca de las crestas de Pinnath Fenui.\
\
Derrota a los huargos que acechan en las montañas.","Derrota huargos","'Los huargos de Pinnath Fenui han sido una gran preocupación desde que llegaron a este lugar.'","Derrota huargos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1359]={"'So much around here needs maintenance, and it is my job to keep it all working. I must tell you, I am tired. If you are willing to help, multiple hands will make the work quick. The gears, fires, and pullies are all just around here.'","Stoke the forge fires with the bellows (${NUMBER}/5)","Grease the gears (${NUMBER}/5)","Repair the pulleys (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ardour Reforged","Repaired the pulleys (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We did it, ${PLAYER}! The forges of Rakhatâb are at full strength again! At least for now. No telling how long it will last. For the moment though, let us enjoy our successes!'","Forge fires stoked (${NUMBER}/5)","You greased the gears, stoked the flames, and fixed the pulley system; time to return to Taphis and let her know what you have done.","'Our forges are almost back to full strength! The fires of the forges are a light for all of Umbar, and might be seen from as far away as Umbar Baharbêl itself! Can you help us finish the task and get these forges fully working again?\
\
'You will find forges throughout the outpost of Rakhatâb.'","Taphis asked that you assist in the maintenance of the forges to help get them back to working at full capacity. Forges can be found throughout Rakhatâb.","Gears greased (${NUMBER}/5)","Taphis has asked you to help get the forges ready to operate fully again."},
[1360]={"Make your way to the north from the dock along the shoreline and look for an ancient and enormous crab there. It is called Imkhâs the Cleaver. Defeat the crab and return it to Stúkha.","'Stalking the shore to the north and west, Imkhâs the Cleaver stalks and terrorizes travellers. Do not be deceived. Imkhâs is no ordinary foe. It is a crab of extraordinary size and strength. Many have fought the creature, and many have fallen or never returned.\
\
'Perhaps you will be the lucky one to retrieve the creature for me. Are you willing?'","Return Imkhâs the Cleaver to Stúkha at Jax Phanâl","Imkhâs the Cleaver stands before you prepared to fight.","Capture Imkhâs the Cleaver","Stúkha told you to search the beach for a particular crab, then subdue the crab and return it to him at his post in Jax Phanâl.","You have captured Imkhâs the Cleaver","'Do you fear the hunt ahead? If not, head out of the city to the west and hug the shoreline north in search of the great crab, Imkhâs. Defeat the creature and return it to me. Alive.'","You defeated Imkhâs. Collect the crab, which now hides in its shell, and return her to Stúkha at the crest of Jax Phanâl.","You defeated and collected Imkhâs the Cleaver","Find and challenge Imkhâs the Cleaver","Are You Strong Enough?","'This crab is Imkhâs? It looks pitiful. It must be sad that you defeated it. I would be also, should you ever best me in a battle. You have done as I asked and given me what I needed. Thank you, friend. This creature has a purpose. You will see. I will train it to be stronger than it is now, and it will entertain the masses in Umbar Baharbêl.'"},
[1363]={"Ejércitos del Sur","'Aunque los semiorcos ya no representan una amenaza para Echad Dúnann, temo que puedan intentar un asalto contra Echad Mirobel.\
\
'Mirobel lleva mucho tiempo en ruinas y ya está casi invadida; si tan solo una parte del ejército de semiorcos de Târ Stazg se uniera al asalto, los elfos de Echad Mirobel podrían ser arrasados.\
\
'Echad Mirobel se encuentra al oeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon. Ve y advierte a Gelirwen. Presta toda la ayuda que puedas en su defensa.'","'¿Un ataque desde Târ Stazg? Es una noticia verdaderamente sombría, ${CLASS}.\
\
'Hay que comenzar de inmediato los preparativos contra el asalto.'","Palanaer teme que los semiorcos no sean la única amenaza para Echad Mirobel.","Echad Mirobel está al oeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon.\
\
Se te ha pedido que adviertas a Echad Mirobel de la amenaza de los semiorcos.","'Echad Mirobel no debe caer en manos de los semiorcos.'","Habla con Gelirwen en Echad Mirobel","'Echad Mirobel está al oeste de Echad Dúnann a lo largo de la carretera Nan Sirannon.'"},
[1365]={"Collect armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected armour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The armour the smith spoke of is on the ground near him.\
\
You should collect the armour the smith spoke of.","'This is the best the smith could offer? It will have to do. You have my thanks, such as it is.'","Ulf has been tasked with ensuring the Riders' armour and weapons are in good repair.","'Mail? Were you not here when the army rode forth? I have a few suits to spare, but I would not sell them to my worst enemy, much less my countrymen.\
\
'Nevertheless, if they are determined, you can pick them up from the ground there.'","Talk to the smith","Bring the armour you collected to Ulf","Armour from the Smith","'${PLAYER}, I am seeing to the care of our arms, but our armour is damaged, and I have not the skill to patch it. Would you seek out the local smith and see if the army left any mail behind which we might use?'","Ulf is in Edoras.\
\
You should bring the armour you collected to Ulf at once.","The smith is in Edoras.\
\
Ulf asked you to seek out the local smith and learn if he has any mail to spare for the Riders Four.","'Was this all that you could find?'"},
[1366]={"Stíling se encuentra a las afueras de Gamil Filik.\
\
Deberías llevar la armadura a Stíling para que la examine.","Armadura de las profundidades","Stíling señaló que la armadura de los trasgos de Gamil Filik tiene un diseño inusual y le preocupa su origen.","'El diseño de la armadura de los trasgos me inquieta, ${PLAYER}. Es de mejor calidad de lo que cabría esperar que tuvieran... y, desde luego, de lo que podrían fabricar ellos mismos. Si a los trasgos les están suministrando armaduras y equipo desde algún otro lugar de Khazad-dûm, entonces creo que lo mejor es que averigüemos cuál es esa fuente y la eliminemos.\
\
'Sin embargo, no puedo estar seguro de mis temores a menos que tenga alguna de sus armaduras para examinarla. Para ello, me gustaría que recogieras algunas de esas armaduras de los trasgos mientras estés en Gamil Filik.'","Restos de armadura de trasgo recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'A ver si puedes conseguirme unas piezas de esa armadura de trasgo; tenemos que averiguar de dónde viene'.","'Ah, ya me temía que fuera así. Al observarlo más de cerca, no es ningún misterio de dónde proviene: estas armaduras incorporan antiguas piezas de metal enano y armaduras de hace mucho tiempo. La artesanía es tan exquisita que ni siquiera el paso de tantos años ha logrado destruirla.\
\
'Por desgracia, lo que el tiempo no ha podido arruinar, lo han hecho las manos malvadas de los herreros trasgo. Algunas de estas piezas deben de haber sido martilladas y reelaboradas una docena de veces a estas alturas, y las habrán llevado aún más trasgos a lo largo de los años desde que fueron saqueadas de los caídos o de antiguos arsenales ocultos. Me temo que ya no nos sirven de nada.\
\
'Solo sirven como otro recordatorio de las antiguas tragedias que sumieron en la oscuridad a la bella Khazad-dûm.'","Recoge restos de armadura de trasgo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva la armadura a Stíling","En Gamil Filik, al sureste del campamento de Descenso Profundo, hay trasgos.\
\
Stíling te ha pedido que recojas varias piezas de la armadura de los trasgos para que él las examine."},
[1367]={"Recovered the armour of Kin-strife warriors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recover the armour of Kin-strife warriors (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Armours of the Lost","The empty armours of Men who long ago fought in the Kin-strife now stalk the Erui. While their purpose remains unknown, their presence deeply unsettles friend and foe alike.","In the aftermath of your encounter with the Lone Lady, you have been assaulted by the Erui itself in the form of armours once worn by the Men who fought in the Kin-strife.\
\
While you cannot tell if these armours belonged to Gondorians who fought for King Eldacar or Castamir the Usurper, you decide to bear them away to the people of Lebennin if only to deprive the Lone Lady this unsettling power.\
\
Once you have recovered enough armours, perhaps Glassiel of Halach will know what should be done with them.","Glassiel can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many of the risen armours in the Erui, and should return the armour pieces you recovered to Glassiel.","Deliver the armour pieces to Glassiel in Halach","'I am saddened to know that the Lone Lady has grown so cruel in her rage, but these armours are of great import to the history of our people.\
\
'It is true that many of the Usurper's followers were left to rot in the waters of Erui alongside their master, but I never expected to see their armour pulled from the river-bed after so many centuries.\
\
'I shall see that these are given to Lord Sirgon of Pelargir when this conflict has ended. As ruler of the home of the Ship-kings, he may decide their final place of rest.'","Risen armours of fallen Kin-strife warriors can be found in the river Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have encountered armours given form by the waters of the Erui and should reclaim the armour pieces for the people of Gondor.","Recover the armour of Kin-strife warriors"},
[1368]={"Las pilas de armaduras se encuentran en la armería de Uzbad-bakân, en Zelem-melek.\
\
Deberías destruir las pilas de armaduras.","Pila de armadura destruida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Has destruido muchas de las armaduras almacenadas en Uzbad-bakân. En el futuro, los orcos de Zelem-melek serán más vulnerables.","La armería de Uzbad-bakân está llena de pilas de armaduras orcas que deberían ser destruidas.","Destruye las pilas de armaduras","La armería de Zelem-melek","Destruye las pilas de armaduras (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1369]={"Derrota a Mádathal el Guardián de la Muerte, el defensor del cuartel","Saboteador de armas","Derrota a Mádathal el Guardián de la Muerte, el defensor del cuartel.","Arcos destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrotaste a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destruye lanzas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dentro del cuartel de Emax Dûl, el enemigo ha acumulado equipo que puede usar para su ejército. Debemos buscar el equipo mientras es vulnerable y destruirlo.","Lanzas destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Con Mádathal el Guardián de la Muerte derrotado, y varias armas destruidas, nos has ayudado en nuestros esfuerzos dentro de Emax Dûl. Gracias.'","Mientras luchas contra los guardias dentro, destruye cualquier reserva de lanzas y arcos que puedas encontrar.","Derrotaste a Mádathal el Guardián de la Muerte, el defensor del cuartel","Destruye arcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1371]={"Army of One","Defeat the Terror within Barad Gúlaran","Find the terror called to service in the halls of Barad Gúlaran and put an end to it before the sorceresses can summon more of the beasts to Angmar's service.\
\
Brúnfair dispatched you to Barad Gúlaran to face and defeat the great evil the sorceresses call to the service of Angmar. This army must be destroyed before it grows too large for the few defenders of Eriador to face.","'If Amarthiel's words are true we must strike swiftly and concisely. We will not be given reprieve or quarter should we fail.\
\
'We must rely on others to assist us against this foe while we work with Golodir to determine our best course of pursuit. If the sorcerers within Barad Gúlaran succeed at calling forth the ancient evil they mean to control, we shall face a foe we do not have the numbers to defeat.\
\
'I ask you now, ${PLAYER}, to gather your fellows, enter the accursed halls of Barad Gúlaran, and face the Enemy called to the service of Angmar. I do not know how you will defeat this horror, I only know that you shall see great reward for your success.'","You have succeeded in defeating the terror within Barad Gúlaran. Return to Brúnfair and tell him of your victory.\
\
After a grueling battle, you successfully faced and slew the first Rogmul enslaved by the sorceresses of Barad Gúlaran.","'Eriador owes you a great debt. You are a true hero in this age.'","You have dispatched the Rogmul of Barad Gúlaran","Brúnfair called you to his aid to seek out and stop the creation of an army within the walls of Barad Gúlaran. With the discovery of Amarthiel's plan, the Council of the North has swiftly reacted to the newly discovered threat and wishes to dispatch those brave enough to face the enemies within the fortress.\
\
Their hope is that the army Amarthiel promised to summon can be stopped when there is but one such enemy to stop the destruction of Eriador.","'We cannot discount all you have done, ${PLAYER}. Your efforts have given Eriador another breath of life and returned hope.\
\
'I will send word south to Halbarad of your success and your name will be spoken of and written in the annals kept by the lore-masters of Esteldín. \
\
'You are well-deserved of this reward, my friend. Be safe in your journeys and know that we shall ever regard you as a hero for all your sacrifices.'","'Be swift and safe. Stand with your fellows and do not lose heart. The enemy you will face will be greater than any other you have seen. I think even the False King will pale against this enemy.'"},
[1373]={"'¡Bien! Eso debería bastar. La llave ya está arreglada.\
\
'Hace poco, uno de mis camaradas capturó e interrogó a un Duramano y averiguó que están siendo dirigidos por un enano realmente cruel llamado Arnmórth el Exigente. Es el Duramano más avaro desde Skorgrím: no piensa en nada que no sea el oro y cómo conservarlo. Te advierto que necesitarás ayuda para derrotarlo, porque es probable que esté bien protegido.\
\
'Ahora, toma esta llave, encuentra sus dependencias, abre esa puerta y dale su merecido. Y cuando termines, tráeme la llave de vuelta: cuando las Minas de Arrancahielo vuelvan a ser nuestras, querremos usar esa sala.'","Thórth ha reparado la llave dañada y quiere que reúnas aliados para encontrar y derrotar a Arnmórth el Exigente dentro de las Minas de Arrancahielo.","Encuentra el despacho interior de las Minas de Arrancahielo. Lleva aliados contigo.","'¿Dónde está la llave? ¿Por qué has vuelto aquí? ¡No me digas que esos barba finas te han hecho huir!'","Regresa junto a Thórth en Zigilgund con la llave e infórmale de tu derrota de Arnmórth el Exigente.","Has derrotado a Arnmórth el Exigente","${PLAYER}'¡Ja, excelente! ¡Apuesto a que Arnmórth ni siquiera supo qué fue lo que le golpeó!\
\
', siempre serás ${PLAYER:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} junto a los fuegos y a las mesas de las Minas de Arrancahielo… cuando vuelvan a ser nuestras. Te has ganado con creces una recompensa.'","Vuelve junto a Thórth","Arnmórth el Exigente","'Ve a encontrar las dependencias de Arnmórth el Exigente en las Minas de Arrancahielo y derrótalo. Ya he arreglado la llave, ¿a qué estás esperando?'","Derrota a Arnmórth el Exigente"},
[1375]={"'Word is spreading through town like a wildfire that Thrymm's war-steed just returned home. Can you go check out this horse for me?\
\
'I worry that this may raise false hopes, that will be washed away by the fact that Thrymm's war-steed cannot still live, as he does not. My people have suffered enough, and I do not want them disappointed by these harmful rumours.'","Inspect Thrymm's War-steed","The horse that just arrived in Forlaw can be found at the stables.","Speak with Cyneberg","Cyneberg is standing near the new horse, and seems convinced that this is indeed Thrymm's war-steed!","Arrival of Thrymm's War-steed","Gárwig awaits your return at Lornsettle, to hear word of whether this is really Thrymm's horse, or only a rumour to spread false hope among the people.","'This is Thrymm's war-steed, he has to be. I know him almost as well as I know my own. Thrymm must have sent his war-steed home to get help, and must be out there somewhere!\
\
'I need to go find Thrymm. There is nothing else I can do. After seeing this sign, I cannot just sit around here waiting!\
\
'But, this doesn't tell me where to find him. Going back to Scylfig would not be wise with Núrzum's troops everywhere. Maybe I should go west to Dunfast, and depending on what I find, I may head north from there....'","'So it is true, and Thrymm's steed returns without its rider. Though we buried only his belongings, a whisper of hope has been creeping through my thoughts since, and has tormented me day and night. The hope that perhaps he still lived, somewhere. But, the steed would not have returned home unless its rider was truly gone. I am convinced of this.\
\
'Cyneberg may see this differently, but I know the truth now. Follow her, keep her safe, and help her through these troubling times. I'm afraid that she will only find sadness in the end, just as I have.'","This appears to be Thrymm's war-steed, and is no rumour, as Gárwig suspected. You should speak with Cyneberg about this...","Return to Gárwig","While Cyneberg told the tale of Thrymm's last day in Forlaw, a rider-less horse of a Wildermore warrior arrived in Forlaw. Rumour is spreading through town that this horse might be Thrymm's!"},
[1376]={"'The Elves will fire their bows but take no part in making the arrows. They need them, but they turn to the dwarves to collect them. Very well, say I. \
\
'The Orcs and Uruks scattered throughout the Ettenmoors fight our forces, often breaking the blades of the fallen. These snapped blades can be melted down and made into arrowheads to use against the Orcs.\
\
'It's a fitting honour to use the blades of the fallen to slay our enemies, and so we will do so. Go into the Ettenmoors and collect these broken blades, return them to me so I can begin outfitting our troops.'","'The blades of our fallen brethren will be used to smite the Enemy who took them from us. Quickly now, let us arm our host as best we can.'","Collect shattered blades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected shattered blades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return the blades to Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen","'Aye, these will do nicely. I will set about crafting these sundered weapons into something more fitting to strike down the Enemy. You have well earned your thanks for this, ${PLAYER}.'","Arrowheads from Broken Blades","Reinforcing Tol Ascarnen requires tactics that are not often used in battle among the Free Peoples, but the forces from Angmar are nothing like the civilized peoples of Eriador and so they must be stopped quickly. Captain-General Makan has ordered that archers be stationed behind the safety of the walls at the tunnel entrance of Tol Ascarnen, where they will unleash arrows at all who attempt to assault the keep.","Orcs and Uruks throughout the Ettenmoors carry the shattered blades taken from the Free Peoples that they defeat.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr sent you into the Ettenmoors in search of shattered blades. He is making arrows to supply the Elves who will guard the front channel of Tol Ascarnen."},
[1377]={"Collect arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Were there no more arrows to be had?'","Hutha is in Edoras.\
\
You should bring the arrows you received from the fletcher to Hutha.","'Nearly all of my stock was sent with the army. I have a few remaining, but they are hunting arrows, not war arrows. Nevertheless, your archer friend is welcome to them.\
\
'You can find them over there on the ground.'","'${PLAYER}, it is well that you have come...we prepare to ride after Théoden King's army, but I am without arrows. We were ambushed by Orcs as we rode across Kingstead, and I was forced to spend my last few.\
\
'Will you seek out the local fletcher and see if he has any arrows to spare?'","The fletcher is in Edoras.\
\
Hutha asked you to seek out the fletcher and learn if he has any arrows to spare.","Hutha spent all of his arrows in a foray against Orcs as they rode across Kingstead.","The arrows the fletcher mentioned are on the ground near him.\
\
You should collect the arrows the fletcher mentioned.","Bring the arrows you collected to Hutha","Arrows for Hutha","'Hunting arrows, war arrows, it matters not...they will fly straight and true, and the enemy shall fall in defeat. Thank you, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to the fletcher"},
[1378]={"More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. The fletcher has requested that you bring her a crate of arrowheads from the arrowsmith.","Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to fetch the arrows she ordered from the fletcher.","Bring the arrows to Dalagín","Find the smithy","'You say you are here to retrieve arrows for the Dumûri? I will give them to you if you do me one favour. I am running low on arrowheads. I do not make them myself, they come from Gurtum, the arrowsmith who casts them in iron and sharpens them. Go to Gurtum and bring me a crate of arrowheads, and I will give you the arrows.'","Talk to Tínsha","'Ah, there are my arrowheads! Thank you for getting them for me. You may take that tub of arrows there to the Dumûri.'","This looks like the smithy","'It takes many arrows to remind the Ordâkhai that they do not want to come to Iridír. I have ordered additional arrows from Tínsha, the fletcher, but have not been able to spare anyone to get them. Would you mind? Tínsha is at the east end of the crafters' wharf.'","'Come to pick up for Tínsha, have you? There's a crate ready to go just there. Help yourself to it.'","'Go to Gurtum, the arrowsmith, and bring me a crate of arrowheads. Then I will give you the arrows.'","Talk to Gurtum","Carry the crate of arrowheads to Tínsha","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. The fletcher has given you leave to take the tub of arrows to the Dumûri captain, Dalagín. Dalagín is near the archers' towers on the west side of Iridír.","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. Tínsha has requested that you bring her a crate of arrowheads from Gurtum, the arrowsmith. The smithy can be found at the north end of the crafters' wharf.","Talk to Dalagín","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. The fletcher, Tínsha, can be found at the east end of the crafters' wharf.","'There you are, I was beginning to think you got lost. Thank you for bringing the arrows. We will put them to good use.'","Arrows for the Cause","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. Gurtum, the arrowsmith, has given you leave to take a crate of arrowheads to the fletcher. Tínsha. Tínsha is at the east end of the crafters' wharf.","'Go find Tínsha, the fletcher, and pick up the arrows I ordered.'","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. The fletcher has provided a tub of arrows that you brought to Dalagín. You should talk to her.","More arrows are needed for the defence of Iridír. The arrowsmith, Gurtum, has given you leave to take a crate of arrowheads to the fletcher, Tínsha."},
[1380]={"'You found no arrows lying about at Fállug? I can believe that! Go and look again.'","'These arrows will be of great use to the Malledhrim, but they will not be enough.\
\
'You have done as you were asked, and so you deserve this reward.'","Arrows of the Malledhrim","Spent Malledhrim arrows may be found around the ruins of Fállug, west of Amon Angened.\
\
Thindiel has asked you to recover spent Malledhrim arrows from the ruins of Fállug.","Collect spent arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thindiel is at the way-post atop Amon Angened, east of Fállug.\
\
You should bring the arrows you collected to Thindiel.","The Elves at the way-post atop Amon Angened provide supplies and provisions for the main force of the Malledhrim in the east.","Bring spent arrows to Thindiel atop Amon Angened","'${PLAYER}, I have a task for you. When our forces ravaged the Enemy in the Mirk-eaves, they left behind many spent arrows in their rush to press deeper into Southern Mirkwood. Now we have received word that the Malledhrim are suffering a shortage of arrows.\
\
'Would you go to the ruined Orc-camp of Fállug to the west and see if you can find any of these spent arrows? It matters not whether they are broken or whole... we can make use of any.\
\
'When you have collected a number of these arrows, bring them to me, and I will reward you.'","Collected spent arrows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bring me any arrows you can find at Fállug, ${PLAYER}. Our forces are running short.'"},
[1381]={"'Excellent work. I will set about crafting these arrows. Soon enough we will have the support of the Elves and be better able to fight off Angmar's assaults!'","Reinforcing Tol Ascarnen requires tactics that are not often used in battle among the Free Peoples, but the forces from Angmar are nothing like the civilized peoples of Eriador and so they must be stopped quickly. Captain-General Makan has ordered that archers be stationed behind the safety of the walls at the tunnel entrance of Tol Ascarnen, where they will unleash arrows at all who attempt to assault the keep.","Collect kindling (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Yes, we still need shafts for our arrows, and the best way to collect those is to find fallen branches and logs from the Grimwood. I know that another here wishes you to collect them for him as well. Aiding either of us is aiding the Free Peoples, but aiding me will enable us to strengthen our position here.\
\
'We need straight bits of wood to craft into arrow-shafts. Elves will be making their way here once we have enough arrows to support them. We need to hasten this task along, friend: Angmar will not rest. They will press us.\
\
'Get the kindling we need from the wood you find laying about the Ettenmoors, I will wager there is more of it near the woods of Hithlad and the Grimwood lumber-camp. Be quick so that we can supply our forces.'","Arrowshaft from Fallen Trees","'Be swift, for we need to call the archers to service soon, else we lose their firepower at the entrance and leave ourselves open to attack.'","Kindling can be found among the fallen logs, and other pieces of wood found throughout the Ettenmoors. You will find a greater concentration near the Grimwood lumber-yard within Hithlad.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr sent you into the Ettenmoors in search of wooden shafts or kindling. He is making arrows to supply the Elves who will guard the front channel of Tol Ascarnen.","Collected kindling (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return the wood to Sergeant-at-Arms Gautr at Tol Ascarnen"},
[1382]={"'Dannasen estará disgustado al saber que no puedo cumplir esta tarea. Las criaturas que hay más allá de estos muros me superan con creces.\
\
'Quizás, estos Hombres supongan un desafío menor para ti. ¿Aceptarías este reto y ayudarías a las sombras que han permanecido en estas tierras desde que fueron maldecidas?\
\
'Descubrirás que los Hombres, los Créoth, más allá de estos muros son más fuertes que cualquier otro, profundamente adoctrinados al servicio de la Doncella Roja. Si alguno porta los escudos de los que habla Dannasen, serán estos Hombres.'","Las sombras que vagan por estas tierras pantanosas fueron maldecidas para permanecer en la Tierra Media, sin hogar ni descanso, hasta que se redimieran o destruyeran a la Doncella Roja de Agamaur.","Recoge escudos de Arthedain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Estos emblemas me son familiares... Son los de Arthedain, los hombres más nobles que han pisado estas tierras.\
\
'Dannasen y los suyos eran, en su época, hombres del linaje más alto. Seguramente estarán encantados de recuperarlos, así que se los llevaré de inmediato.\
\
'Te estoy en deuda, ${PLAYER}.'","'Has devuelto el coraje a mi alma y a la comunidad de mis hermanos.'","'En tiempos pasados, Iarwain Ben-adar nos maldijo por nuestra inacción mientras la Doncella Roja se alejaba cada vez más de la dulce criatura que era para convertirse en la cosa corrupta que es ahora. Hasta que sea redimida o eliminada del mundo, estamos condenados a vagar por estos pantanos, sin esperanza de descanso.\
\
'Pero no tenemos esperanza. Ella es demasiado poderosa, o eso creen los hombres. Yo no creo que sea así. Debo encontrar una manera de restaurar su determinación. Uno de los Eglain, Hartrím, ha ido al lugar donde habita. Va a recuperar objetos perdidos mientras mis hermanos y yo luchábamos contra los Angmarim y los Montañeses del Rhudaur: nuestros escudos. Creo que todavía están en manos de los Montañeces que adoran a la Doncella Roja y de los bandidos que se han aliado con ellos.\
\
'Quizás tú podrías buscar a Hartrím en las afueras de Garth Agarwen y preguntarle cómo van sus esfuerzos.'","Lleva los escudos de Arthedain a Hartrím","'Ojalá mis viajes me hubieran fortalecido lo suficiente como para enfrentarme solo a estos enemigos. Pero no es así. Quizás tú y tus aliados podáis tener éxito donde yo he fracasado. ¿Me ayudarás?'","Los Montañeses del Rhudaur que sirven a la Doncella Roja y sus aliados, los bandidos, se encuentran en Garth Agarwen, la fortaleza de la Doncella Roja al noreste de Agamaur. Hartrím te espera fuera de las puertas de Garth Agarwen.\
\
Dannasen, una de las sombras de Arthedain maldecida por Iarwain Ben-adar, teme que los demás hayan perdido la determinación de romper su maldición, creyendo que la Doncella Roja es demasiado poderosa. Para fortalecer su determinación, Dannasen reclutó a Hartrím de los Eglain para que recogiera los escudos que perdieron frente a Rhudaur hace muchos años. Hartrím, demasiado débil para enfrentarse a estos enemigos, recurre a ti en busca de ayuda.","'¡El emblema del Reino del Norte! Me devuelve mi orgullo...'","'Quizás la Doncella Roja no es tan poderosa como pensábamos...'","Los hermanos perdidos de Arthedain","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Nos han devuelto los emblemas de Arthedain?'","Escudos de Arthedain recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡La Doncella Roja será restaurada o destruida!'","'Una vez fuimos hombres orgullosos. Ahora somos menos que el polvo de la tierra y vivimos tanto como él. Nuestro fracaso fue la inacción, y aun así seguimos en ese papel. Sin coraje, no somos nada.'","Habla con Hartrím en la entrada de Garth Agarwen","Dirígete a la entrada del área conocida como Garth Agarwen, al noreste del campamento de los Eglain, y habla con Hartrím.\
\
Dannasen te ha pedido que busques a Hartrím en la entrada de Garth Agarwen para descubrir si ha encontrado alguno de los escudos que usaban Dannasen y sus hermanos.","'Una vez fuimos hombres orgullosos. Ahora somos menos que el polvo de la tierra y vivimos tanto como él. Nuestro fracaso fue la inacción, y aun así seguimos en ese papel. Sin coraje, no somos nada.\
\
'Por favor, busca a Hartrím y ve cómo va su progreso.'"},
[1383]={"Recolecta cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta garras macabras de murciélago (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolectado baba pútrida de Helchgam","Artículos de Mando","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Dawn Stockard","Los Nerbyg se encuentra en el Malenhad Oriental en Angmar. Los murciélagos se pueden encontrar en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.\
\
Dawn Stockard te ha pedido que le traigas cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique y garras macabras de murciélago.","Recolecta caparazones chamuscados por el vapor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Garras macabras de murciélago recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Dawn Stockard","Recolectado cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿No tienes los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}?'","Dawn Stockard ha aceptado ayudarte a forjar un equipo digno de tu estatura como capitán.","'Puedes recolectar los cuernos del Nerbyg del Malenhad en Angmar. Las garras de murciélago que necesito se pueden obtener de murciélagos en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.'","Dawn Stockard está en el pueblo de Archet, al norte de Bree.\
\
Dawn Stockard espera que regreses con el último conjunto de componentes.","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Dawn Stockard","Recolectado casco con púas de Hogni","'Me alegra verte regresar sano y salvo de lo salvaje, ${PLAYER}, y haré uso de estos componentes mientras fabrico tu equipo.\
\
'Los próximos objetos que necesitaré son cuernos corroídos de Niquebriques Nerbyg del Malenhad Oriental en Angmar y garras macabras de murciélago, que se pueden encontrar en los murciélagos de Angmar y otros lugares terribles.'","Los Nerbyg se encuentra en el Malenhad Oriental en Angmar. Hogni Piernaspegadas puede encontrarse en Gabilazan en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Dawn Stockard te ha pedido que le traigas caparazones de norbog y el casco con púas de Hogni Piernaspegadas.","Helchgam se encuentra bajo la malvada ciudad de Carn Dûm en Angmar. Lagmâs se encuentra en Urugarth en Angmar.\
\
Dawn Stockard te ha pedido que le traigas la baba pútrida de Helchgam y una Insignia de Mando.","Dawn Stockard está en el pueblo de Archet, al norte de Bree.\
\
Dawn Stockard espera que regreses con el segundo conjunto de componentes.","'Puedo forjarte un equipo que haga justicia a las grandes hazañas que has realizado, ${PLAYER}, pero debo advertirte que no será fácil de terminar.\
\
'Debo pedirte que te pongas en gran peligro para obtener los materiales que necesito. Primero, tráeme los resistentes caparazones del Nerbyg que se arrastran entre las pozas del Malenhad en Angmar. También necesitaré el casco con púas del capitán Duramano Hogni Piernaspegadas, quien según el último reporte comandaba a los Duramano en la fortaleza de Gabilazan en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
'Tráeme estos objetos, y comenzaré mi trabajo.'","Recolecta casco con púas de Hogni","Dawn Stockard está en el pueblo de Archet, al norte de Bree.\
\
Dawn Stockard espera que regreses con el primer conjunto de componentes.","Recolectado Insignia de Mando","Recolecta Insignia de Mando","'¡Te saludo en victoria, ${PLAYER}, y te agradezco por estos componentes finales!\
\
'¿Ves el equipo que puedo forjar para ti con estas cosas que has traído? ¡Llévalo cuando vayamos a expulsar la sombra y traer la paz a los Pueblos Libres!'","'No tienes los componentes que te pedí'","'Puedes encontrar al Nerbyg en el Malenhad Oriental en Angmar, y a Hogni Piernaspegadas en Gabilazan en las Montañas Nubladas.'","'Helchgam habita en las cloacas fétidas bajo Carn Dûm, y Lagmâs lidera a los uruks de Urugarth, ambos en Angmar.'","Recolecta baba pútrida de Helchgam","'Te agradezco estos componentes, ${PLAYER}, pues me serán de gran ayuda para forjar tu equipo.\
\
'Aún quedan dos componentes, y debo decirte la verdad: este será tu mayor desafío. Debes recolectar la baba pútrida de Helchgam, el terror que habita bajo Carn Dûm en Angmar. También necesito una Insignia de Mando de los uruks Lagmâs en Urugarth.\
\
'Cuando hayas adquirido estos objetos, tráelos aquí a mí.'","Recolectado caparazones chamuscados por el vapor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1384]={"Recoge la piel de Zarpahelada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Muy bien hecho, ! Estos serán justo lo que necesita el equipo que estoy haciendo para ti, ese toque especial para que sea realmente único.\
\
'Solo necesito unas cosas más. Lamento decir que probablemente las encontrarás en Urugarth, y eso suena como un lugar terrible. Pero nada de qué preocuparse para ${PLAYERNAME:un saqueador[m]|una saqueadora[f]} tan hábil, ¿verdad?\
\
'Necesito una insignia de rango de trasgo del trasgo Akrúr, que custodia el camino hacia el gran dragonzuelo Lhugrien. También necesito una Insignia de Batalla de los campeones uruks Sorkrank y Burzfîl.'","Has recogido pieles de rascacueva brillantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Un trabajo realmente encomiable, ${PLAYER}! ¿Urugarth fue tan terrible como he escuchado? ¡No, no me lo digas! ¡Quiero poder dormir por la noche!\
\
'Déjame usar estos últimos componentes y... eso debería bastar.\
\
'Toma este equipo, ${PLAYER}, ¡espero que te sirva bien! ¡Los saqueadores debemos mantenernos unidos!'","Recolecta insignia de rango de Trasgo","Recoge Insignia de Batalla","'¿No tienes los objetos que necesito, ${PLAYER}? ¿No quieres esta pieza de equipo?'","Los dragonzuelos y rascacueva que llevan los componentes requeridos se pueden encontrar en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que le llevaras escamas de dragonzuelo y pieles de rascacueva para ayudarle en su tarea.","'${PLAYER}, necesitas un equipo que diga \\q¡Mírame! ¡Soy un saqueador!\\q Pensándolo bien, eso podría ser un poco contraproducente en nuestra línea de trabajo. ¡No importa! ¡Te mereces un buen equipo, y yo voy a hacer uno para ti! Tendrás que buscar los componentes que necesitaré, pero eso no debería ser un problema para un saqueador hábil como tú, ¿verdad?\
\
'La linaje de un objeto tiene gran poder, así que tenlo en cuenta mientras te presento una serie de tareas difíciles. En las Montañas Nubladas, vagan bestias de las nieves que gruñen. Reúne algo de su piel... He oído que se pueden encontrar cerca de la fuente del río Sonorona, pero no sé si es cierto. Además, hay un gran oso blanco que habita en la tierra de los gigantes de las Montañas Nubladas... tráeme también su piel.\
\
'Cuando hayas reunido estas cosas, vuelve a verme para más instrucciones.'","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","'Los dragonzuelos y rascacueva que necesitas cazar solo se pueden encontrar en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.'","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","'¡Excelente! ¡Estos servirán perfectamente!\
\
'Mientras tanto, necesito otro conjunto de materiales. Los dragonzuelos en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos tienen escamas extraordinariamente duras que serían ideales para la tarea. Además, ciertos rascacueva tienen pieles brillantes que serían deseables. Solo los dragonzuelos y rascacueva en lugares especialmente peligrosos, como Angmar y Moria, tendrán los componentes necesarios.\
\
'Cuando hayas reunido estas cosas, vuelve conmigo.'","Sterling Ganapié ha accedido a ayudarte a fabricar una pieza de equipo que refleje adecuadamente tu habilidad como saqueador.","'¿No tienes los componentes que necesito, ${PLAYER}?'","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Deberías llevar las escamas y las pieles que recogiste a Sterling Ganapié.","'¿No tienes los componentes que necesito, ${PLAYER}? Eso es bastante grosero, ¿no crees?'","Has recogido escamas de dragonzuelo inflexible (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Artículos de Astucia","Has recogido pieles de bestia de las nieves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Akrúr se puede encontrar guardando el camino hacia el gran dragonzuelo Lhugrien cerca de Urugarth en Angmar. Sorkrank y Burzfîl también se pueden encontrar en Urugarth.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que le llevaras una insignia de rango de trasgo y una insignia de batalla.","Recoge pieles de bestia de las nieves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Tanto las bestias de las nieves como Zarpahelada habitan en las Montañas Nubladas; las bestias de las nieves cerca de la Fuente del Bruinen y Zarpahelada en la tierra de los gigantes.'","Has recogido la piel de Zarpahelada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Deberías encontrar a Akrúr, Sorkrank y Burzfîl cerca o dentro de Urugarth.'","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Deberías llevar el último conjunto de componentes a Sterling Ganapié.","Recoge pieles de rascacueva brillantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las bestias de las nieves se pueden encontrar en la esquina noroeste de las Montañas Nubladas, cerca de la Fuente del Bruinen. Zarpahelada se puede encontrar en las Montañas Nubladas, en la tierra de los gigantes, en la esquina sureste.\
\
Sterling Ganapié te pidió que recogieras la piel de Zarpahelada batida por el viento y las pieles de las bestias de las nieves.","Recolectada insignia de rango de Trasgo","Insignia de Batalla recogida","Recoge escamas de dragonzuelo inflexible (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Sterling Ganapié","Sterling Ganapié está en Los Gamos, al oeste de Bree y al este del río Brandivino.\
\
Deberías llevar la piel y las pieles a Sterling Ganapié."},
[1385]={"Recolecta cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Zorrgolug merodea en Fasach-falroid, en Angmar. Los trasgos Tarkrîp habitan entre los campamentos de orcos de Malenhad, en Angmar.\
\
Fenton Marshley te pidió que le trajeras la piel enmarañada del Huargo Zorrgolug y los cascos Tarkrîp teñidos de azufre.","'Como te dije, puedes encontrar tanto Rascacuevas como nerbeglir en Angmar y otros lugares oscuros.'","Recoge Insignia de Batalla","'¡Regresas ${PLAYERNAME:victorioso[m]|victoriosa[f]}, ! Me alegra ver que traes contigo la piel enmarañada de Zorrgolug y los cascos de los Tarkrîp teñidos de azufre. ¡La historia de tus hazañas sigue creciendo!\
\
'Hay más componentes que buscar, . Ahora necesitaré las pieles brillantes de los Rascacuevas y los cuernos de los niquebriques que habitan en Angmar y otros lugares oscuros.'","Puedes encontrar a Mormoz y Azgoth en Carn Dûm, mientras que Sorkrank y Burzfîl sirven en Urugarth.\
\
Fenton te pidió que le trajeras una Runa de Dominio Alado y una Insignia de Batalla.","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","'Puedo hacerte una pieza de equipo digna de tu habilidad como ${PLAYERNAME:cazador[m]|cazadora[f]}, , pero con esta oferta te doy una advertencia: la historia de esta pieza será ardua y ganada con gran esfuerzo.\
\
'Necesitaré tiempo entre cada etapa del proceso, así que no me traigas todo de una vez. Primero necesitaré la piel enmarañada de Zorrgolug, un gran Huargo de Fasach-falroid, y cinco cascos Tarkrîp teñidos de azufre, afectados por el gran pantano de Malenhad. ¡Comienza tu cacería con confianza y termínala con triunfo!'","Recolectado cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fenton Marshley se encuentra en el Refugio de Caza, al este de Archet y al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Has recogido el segundo conjunto de componentes que Fenton Marshley te pidió.","'No has regresado con el segundo conjunto de componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}.'","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","'No me has traído los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}.'","Runa de Dominio Alado recogida","Recoge los cascos Tarkrîp teñidos de azufre (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cascos Tarkrîp teñidos de azufre recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Fenton Marshley","Fenton Marshley se encuentra en el Refugio de Caza, al este de Archet y al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Has recogido el último conjunto de componentes que Fenton Marshley te pidió.","Pieles brillantes de Rascacueva recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Puedes encontrar a Mormoz y Azgoth en Carn Dûm, mientras que Sorkrank y Burzfîl sirven en Urugarth.'","Fenton Marshley ha aceptado ayudarte a forjar una pieza de equipo digna de tu gran habilidad como ${PLAYERNAME:cazador[m]|cazadora[f]}.","'Te doy la bienvenida una vez más, ${PLAYER}, pues veo que has regresado con las pieles brillantes y los cuernos corroídos que te encargué obtener.\
\
'Queda el último conjunto de componentes, y obtenerlos no será fácil. ¡Pero no desesperes! Confío en que podrás recuperarlos, incluso desde las profundidades más oscuras de la sombra misma.\
\
'Ahora necesito una Runa de Dominio Alado, llevada por las merrevail Mormoz y Azgoth en Carn Dûm, y una Insignia de Batalla, en posesión de Sorkrank y Burzfîl en Urugarth.'","Artículos de Descubrimiento","Fenton Marshley se encuentra en el Refugio de Caza, al este de Archet y al norte de Bree, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Has recogido el primer conjunto de componentes que Fenton Marshley te pidió.","Recoge pieles brillantes de Rascacueva (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Piel enmarañada de Zorrgolug recogida","Los Rascacuevas y los nerbeglir habitan en Angmar y otros lugares oscuros.\
\
Fenton Marshley te pidió que le trajeras pieles brillantes de Rascacueva y cuernos corroídos de niquebriques.","'¿No tienes el primer conjunto de componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}? ¿Cómo puede ser?'","Insignia de Batalla recogida","Recolecta la Runa de Dominio Alado","'¡Emerges triunfante de la oscuridad, , y me alegra verlo!\
\
'Admiro tu destreza como ${PLAYERNAME:cazador, amigo mío[m]|cazadora, amiga mía[f]}. Lleva este pequeño símbolo con orgullo, pues lo has ganado con tu esfuerzo y dedicación.'","'Puedes encontrar al Huargo Zorrgolug merodeando en Fasach-falroid, en Angmar. Los trasgos Tarkrîp también se encuentran en Angmar, habitando entre los campamentos de orcos de Malenhad.'","Recoge la piel enmarañada de Zorrgolug"},
[1386]={"Entrega el último lote de materiales a Hunward en el Muelle de los Comerciantes","'Muy impresionante, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo luchador[m]|amiga luchadora[f]}. Realmente mereces la magnífica joya que he forjado para ti. ¡Que te proteja sin importar el número o la ferocidad de los enemigos a los que te enfrentes!\
\
'¿Por qué necesité que reunieras materiales tan variados? Ah, me estoy fabricando un nuevo par de botas. ¡Nunca subestimes un buen par de botas!\
\
'Disfruta la joya, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo luchador[m]|amiga luchadora[f]}, así como yo disfrutaré las botas que tu esfuerzo ha hecho posibles.'","'Te estás perdiendo algo.'","'Un verdadero Luchador conoce la importancia de una defensa sólida. Valora la fuerza y la vitalidad, pero también tu apariencia al combatir, pues cualquier cosa puede volverse una ventaja en medio de una pelea: incluso el destello de una joya puede distraer a tu enemigo en el momento más inoportuno.\
\
'Puedo forjarte una joya adecuada para tal fin, pero necesitaré que me consigas varios materiales: no solo para la fabricación, sino también para demostrar que los mereces. Es una tradición entre los Luchadores, amigo mío, y no quisiera romperla. ¡Después de todo, quienes se romperán serán nuestros enemigos!\
\
'Un bandido Duramano llamado Frostulf Nudillopartido se cree un Luchador y ha lanzado un desafío abierto a la gente del Bosque Salvaje: afirma que derrotará a cualquier oponente en combate singular, sin derramar una sola gota de su cerveza. Encuéntralo fuera de la puerta oeste de Cotfast y responde a su desafío. Tráeme su jarra y demuéstrame que eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Luchador digno[m]|una Luchadora digna[f]}, .\
\
'También necesitaré las botas de los bandidos del Bosque Salvaje. Solo el cuero de esas botas servirá.'","Botas de bandido del Bosque Salvaje recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Necesitaré mandíbulas de arañas como las que se encuentran en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos. También necesitaré gotas burbujeantes de las sanguijuelas de azufre que se arrastran por el pantano de Malenhad, en Angmar.'","Jarra de Frostulf recogida","Recoge gotas burbujeantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Te falta algo.'","Hunward te ha pedido que le lleves botas de bandido del Bosque Salvaje y la jarra de Frostulf.\
\
Se puede desafiar a Frostulf Nudillopartido fuera de la puerta oeste de Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje.","Recoge mandíbulas de araña moteada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hunward, en el Muelle de los Comerciantes del Bosque Salvaje, ha aceptado forjarte una joya para aumentar tu potencial como Luchador.","'¡Buen trabajo, ${PLAYER}! Seguro que le mostraste un par de cosas a Frostulf. Pero los próximos materiales serán más difíciles de conseguir, pues tendrás que viajar más lejos para obtenerlos.\
\
'Necesitaré mandíbulas de arañas como las que se encuentran en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos. También necesitaré gotas burbujeantes de las sanguijuelas de azufre que se arrastran por el pantano de Malenhad, en Angmar.'","Recoge la jarra de Frostulf","Recoge botas de bandido del Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega el primer lote de materiales a Hunward en el Muelle de los Comerciantes","Cuerno de Gorthorog con cenizas recolectado","Hunward se encuentra en el Muelle de los Comerciantes, en el Bosque Salvaje.","Se pueden encontrar arañas en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos. Las sanguijuelas de azufre se encuentran en Malenhad, en Angmar.\
\
Hunward te ha pedido que le lleves mandíbulas de araña moteada y gotas burbujeantes.","Mandíbulas de araña moteada recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Insignia de rango de trasgo recogida","Recolecta cuerno de Gorthorog con cenizas","Recoge una insignia de rango de trasgo","Entrega el segundo lote de materiales a Hunward en el Muelle de los Comerciantes","Gotas burbujeantes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Lo lograste! Estos materiales son repugnantes, pero necesarios. Las gotas servirán para tratar el cuero de las botas que me trajiste, y las tiras endurecidas ofrecerán una excelente defensa. Pero aún no has terminado, y esta siguiente tarea demostrará que eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Luchador realmente digno[m]|una Luchadora realmente digna[f]}.\
\
'Necesito un cuerno del gorthorog Tarlûg, que habita en Carn Dûm. También necesito una insignia de rango de los trasgos de Urugarth. ¡Demuestra que puedes enfrentarte a enemigos grandes y pequeños, y no temer a ninguno!'","'Un bandido Duramano llamado Frostulf Nudillopartido se cree un Luchador y ha lanzado un desafío abierto a la gente del Bosque Salvaje. Afirma que derrotará a cualquier oponente en combate singular sin derramar una sola gota de su cerveza. Encuéntralo fuera de la puerta oeste de Cotfast y responde a su desafío. Tráeme su jarra y demuestra que eres ${PLAYER:un Luchador digno[m]|una Luchadora digna[f]}, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'También necesitaré botas de bandido del Bosque Salvaje.'","Se puede encontrar a Tarlûg en Carn Dûm, en Angmar. Los trasgos se encuentran en Urugarth, en Angmar.\
\
Hunward te ha pedido que le lleves un cuerno de gorthorog ceniciento y una insignia de rango de trasgo.","Hunward se encuentra en el Muelle de los Comerciantes, en el Bosque Salvaje","'Ahora necesito un cuerno del gorthorog Tarlûg, que habita en Carn Dûm. También necesito una insignia de rango de los trasgos de Urugarth. ¡Demuestra que puedes enfrentarte a enemigos grandes y pequeños, y no temer a ninguno!'","Artículos de durabilidad"},
[1387]={"'Los dragonzuelos y rascacuevas de las variedades que buscas pueden encontrarse en Angmar y otros lugares malignos.'","'Puedo hacerte una pieza de equipo acorde a tu estatura como ${PLAYERNAME:guardián[m]|guardiana[f]}, , pero escucha mi advertencia: necesitaré varios componentes para su fabricación que te llevarán a tierras peligrosas y a grandes peligros.\
\
'¡Pero eres ${PLAYERNAME:un guardián[m]|una guardiana[f]}! ¡Seguramente no rehuirás tal desafío!\
\
'Los primeros objetos que necesito que recojas son el pellejo ceniciento del gran jabalí Grimgore en Fasach-larran, en Angmar, y las botas cubiertas de nieve de los Duramano en Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas.'","'Me maravilla tu valentía, , ¡pues nadie conoce mejor que yo la ferocidad de Lhugrien! También sé cuán reacio sería Athpukh a entregar su emblema.\
\
'Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un guardián poderoso[m]|una guardiana poderosa[f]}, , y es un honor conocerte. ¡Toma este equipo con mis respetos, de un guardián a otro!'","Botas de duramano cubiertas de nieve reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grimgore puede encontrarse en Fasach-larran, en Angmar. Los enanos Duramano pueden encontrarse en Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Wáli te pidió que le trajeras las botas de duramano cubiertas de nieve y el pellejo ceniciento de Grimgore.","Artículos de Fortaleza","'Lhugrien y Athpukh pueden encontrarse en Urugarth, ${PLAYER}.'","Lhugrien y Athpukh pueden encontrarse en Urugarth, en Angmar.\
\
Wáli te pidió que regresaras con una escama impecable de Lhugrien y un emblema de cuidador de huargos.","'Puedes encontrar al jabalí Grimgore en Fasach-larran, y los Duramano han acampado en Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas.'","Uñas incrustadas de gemas reunidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Escama impecable de Lhugrien reunida","'¿No has regresado con los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}?'","Los dragonzuelos y rascacuevas pueden encontrarse en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.\
\
Wáli te pidió que le trajeras escamas de dragonzuelo implacables y uñas incrustadas de gemas.","'No tienes los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}. ¿Por qué estás perdiendo mi tiempo?'","Pellejo ceniciento de Grimgore reunido","Wáli ha aceptado ayudarte a forjar una pieza de equipo digna de tu poder como ${PLAYERNAME:guardián[m]|guardiana[f]}.","Wáli está en el puesto de avanzada de Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de la ciudad enana de Gondamon.\
\
Wáli está esperando que regreses con el primer conjunto de componentes que te pidió.","Has recogido escamas de dragonzuelo inflexible (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wáli está en el puesto de avanzada de Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de la ciudad enana de Gondamon.\
\
Wáli está esperando que regreses con el segundo conjunto de componentes que te pidió.","'¡Estas botas me llenan de ira, ${PLAYER}, ira de que los Duramano hayan sido tan audaces como para arrebatar Gabilazan a mis parientes!\
\
'Has hecho bien en traerlas y en traer el pellejo ceniciento de Grimgore. ¡Ya no recorrerá los acantilados de Fasach-larran!\
\
'Si puedes reunir el siguiente conjunto de componentes con la misma rapidez, terminaré mi trabajo en muy poco tiempo. Lo siguiente que necesitaré son escamas de dragonzuelo implacables, como las que se encuentran en los dragonzuelos de Angmar y otros lugares traicioneros. También necesitaré las uñas incrustadas de gemas de los rascacuevas que se encuentran en Angmar y lugares similares.'","Reúne una escama impecable de Lhugrien","'¡Estas escamas parecen ser justo lo que necesito, ${PLAYER}, y estas uñas tienen justo el tipo de gemas adecuado! El equipo que haré para ti será sin duda algo especial, cuando cuenta con componentes como estos.\
\
'Quedan dos componentes: una escama impecable de Lhugrien y un emblema de cuidador de huargos. Si puedes recuperar estos objetos, verdaderamente serás contado entre los guardianes más poderosos. Ambos pueden encontrarse en Urugarth; el primero del dragonzuelo Lhugrien y el segundo del trasgo cuidador de huargos Athpukh.'","Reúne botas de duramano cubiertas de nieve (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wáli está en el puesto de avanzada de Noglond, al sur de la Mansión de Thorin y al oeste de la ciudad enana de Gondamon.\
\
Wáli está esperando que regreses con el último conjunto de componentes que te pidió.","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Wáli","Reúne uñas incrustadas de gemas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reúne el pellejo ceniciento de Grimgore","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Wáli","Recoge escamas de dragonzuelo inflexible (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge el símbolo del cuidador de huargos","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Wáli","'No tienes los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué estás haciendo?'"},
[1388]={"Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Baillindiel","Recolecta restos venerados de tumulario (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Baillindiel está en el puerto élfico de Celondim, en Ered Luin.\
