\
Baillindiel te pidió traerle un cuerno de Gorthorog con cenizas y una insignia de rango de Trasgo."},
[1389]={"Filamentos espirales de araña recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge colmillos curvados de avanc (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Escamas indoblegables de dragonzuelo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Aelindil se encuentra en Tornhad, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Aelindil en Tornhad ha accedido a ayudarte a forjar una pieza de joyería digna de tu reputación como ${PLAYERNAME:Marinero[m]|Marinera[f]}.","Entrega el conjunto final de materiales a Aelindil en Tornhad","Aelindil te ha pedido que le lleves varios colmillos curvados de avanc y el catalejo de Torcadáll.\
\
Torcadáll Ojosalvaje puede encontrarse en Thelgarth, en el Ángulo del Mitheithel. Hay avancs por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel.","Recoge un medallón de paso","Colmillos curvados de avanc recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Has hecho un buen trabajo, . Cada uno de estos materiales servirá para adornar la joya que estoy forjando para ti, pero aún necesito dos objetos más, y cada uno de ellos demostrará claramente tu valía como ${PLAYERNAME:Marinero[m]|Marinera[f]}.\
\
'Para el conjunto final de materiales, debes recoger un emblema ritual del uruk Morthrâng, quien reside en la fortaleza orca de Urugarth. Pero eso no es todo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}: también debes traerme un medallón de paso del uruk Urro, que habita dentro de los muros de Carn Dûm.\
\
'¡Solo entonces consideraré que tu tarea está completa!'","Medallón de paso recogido","Emblema ritual recogido","Catalejo de Torcadáll recogido","Recoge un emblema ritual","'Para el siguiente conjunto de materiales, necesitaré filamentos espirales de araña de las que se encuentran en Angmar y otras tierras peligrosas. También necesito varias escamas indoblegables de dragonzuelos de Angmar o del reino perdido de Moria.'","Recoge escamas indoblegables de dragonzuelo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Estoy realmente impresionado, !\
\
'Has cumplido admirablemente las tareas que te encomendé, y sin duda alguna has demostrado ser ${PLAYERNAME:merecedor[m]|merecedora[f]} de esta recompensa, tanto como ${PLAYERNAME:Marinero como protector[m]|Marinera como protectora[f]} de los Pueblos Libres de la Tierra Media. ¡Que esta hermosa joya te recuerde tu habilidad e ingenio como ${PLAYERNAME:Marinero[m]|Marinera[f]}!'","'Para tu primera tarea, necesito dos cosas, pero una de ellas requiere explicación adicional. He oído que un hombre de Angmar llamado Torcadáll Ojosalvaje se ha unido a los bandidos y semiorcos de Thelgarth. No sé por qué ha venido al Ángulo del Mitheithel, pero temo que es mala señal, pues hace mucho que el reino de Angmar no perturbaba estas tierras.\
\
'En su poder lleva un objeto curioso llamado catalejo, y se dice que otorga a su portador la vista de los elfos. No sé si busca reclutar nuevos aliados para servir a la Corona de Hierro o si anda tras alguna reliquia perdida en la guerra entre Angmar y Arnor. Sea como sea, es claro que Torcadáll no es bienvenido en el Ángulo, y su catalejo podría ser de gran utilidad para los Dúnedain. Por eso te pido que lo recuperes, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío.[m]|amiga mía.[f]}\
\
'Además, necesito varios colmillos curvados de avanc. Eso será una tarea más sencilla, seguramente, pues pueden encontrarse por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel.'","Pueden encontrarse arañas en Angmar y en otros lugares peligrosos. Los dragonzuelos y demás criaturas draconianas pueden encontrarse en Angmar y en Moria.\
\
Aelindil te ha pedido que le traigas filamentos espirales de araña y escamas indoblegables de dragonzuelo.","Entrega el segundo conjunto de materiales a Aelindil en Tornhad","Entrega el primer conjunto de materiales a Aelindil en Tornhad","Recupera el catalejo de Torcadáll","Artículos de ingenio","Recoge filamentos espirales de araña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Un Marinero debe esforzarse siempre por el equilibrio! Esto es cierto en los ríos y mares de la Tierra Media, y también en la forma en que uno se presenta. Las ropas sencillas son a menudo muy útiles a bordo de un barco, pero para un Marinero, usar una joya fina es una tradición muy antigua.\
\
'Puedo forjar para ti una joya adecuada para que compartas esa orgullosa tradición, pero primero debes traerme los materiales que busco.\
\
'Para tu primera tarea, necesito dos cosas, aunque una requiere más explicación. He oído que un hombre de Angmar llamado Torcadáll Ojosalvaje se ha unido a los bandidos y semiorcos en Thelgarth. No sé por qué ha venido al Ángulo del Mitheithel, pero temo que es mala señal, pues hace mucho que el reino de Angmar no perturbaba estas tierras. Lleva consigo un objeto curioso llamado catalejo, y se dice que otorga la vista de los elfos a quien lo porta. No sé si pretende reclutar nuevos aliados para la Corona de Hierro o busca alguna reliquia perdida hace mucho en la guerra entre Angmar y Arnor, pero no importa: está claro que Torcadáll no es bienvenido aquí, y su catalejo podría ser de gran utilidad para los Dúnedain. Por eso te pido que lo recuperes, mi amigo. Además, necesito varios colmillos curvados de avanc. Sin duda, será una tarea más sencilla, ya que se encuentran  por todo el Ángulo del Mitheithel.\
\
'Cuando termines esta tarea, deberás viajar más lejos, pues los materiales que necesitaré después no pueden encontrarse en el Ángulo.'","Urro puede encontrarse en Carn Dûm, en Angmar. Morthrâng se encuentra en Urugarth, también en Angmar.\
\
Aelindil te ha pedido que le traigas un medallón de paso y un emblema ritual.","'Para el conjunto final de materiales, debes recoger un emblema ritual del uruk Morthrâng, que reside en la fortaleza orca de Urugarth, pero eso no es todo, amigo mío. También debes traerme un medallón de paso del uruk Urro, que vive dentro de los muros de Carn Dûm. ¡Solo entonces consideraré tu tarea como terminada!'","'¡Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}! Me alegra saber que Torcadáll Ojosalvaje ya no causará problemas a los Dúnedain aquí en el Ángulo, y me complace que hayas podido recuperar su catalejo. ¡Qué herramienta tan curiosa! Y no te preocupes, esos colmillos de avanc aún tendrán su uso en mi diseño.\
\
'Para el siguiente conjunto de materiales, necesitaré filamentos espirales de araña de las que se encuentran en Angmar y en otras tierras peligrosas. También necesito varias escamas indoblegables de dragonzuelo de las criaturas draconianas de Angmar o del perdido reino de Moria.'"},
[1390]={"Recolecta restos venerados de tumulario (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Isdi","Recolectado baba pútrida de Helchgam","'Helchgam habita en las pozas bajo Carn Dûm, mientras que los trasgos custodian la torre de Urugarth, ambos en Angmar.'","Recolecta insignia de rango de Trasgo","'No tienes los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}.'","Recolectados restos venerados de tumulario (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge gotas burbujeantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Isdi ha aceptado confeccionarte una pieza de equipo que refleje la profundidad de tu conocimiento.","Grimgore vaga por Fasach-larran en Angmar. Los Corcur pueden encontrarse cerca de Helegrod en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Isdi te ha pedido que le traigas el pelaje enmarañado de Grimgore y varios emblemas desagradables de los Corcur.","Recoge emblemas desagradables de los Corcur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se recogieron emblemas desagradables de los Corcur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Helchgam habita en las pozas bajo Carn Dûm en Angmar. Los trasgos custodian la torre de Urugarth, también en Angmar.\
\
Isdi te ha pedido que le traigas algo de baba pútrida de Helchgam y una insignia de rango de trasgo.","'Me alegra verte regresar, ${PLAYER}, y con los componentes que pedí. Me serán de gran utilidad mientras confecciono tu equipo.\
\
'Ahora necesito algunos restos de los tumularios que vagan por Imlad Balchorth en Angmar y unas gotas burbujeantes de baba de las sanguijuelas sulfurosas de Malenhad, también en Angmar.'","'No tienes los componentes que te pedí. ¿Por qué es esto, ${PLAYER}?'","Isdi está en las ruinas de Edhelion, cerca de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Isdi está esperando que regreses con el primer conjunto de componentes.","Los tumularios pueden encontrarse en Imlad Balchorth en Angmar. Las sanguijuelas sulfurosas pueden encontrarse en Malenhad, en Angmar.\
\
Isdi te ha pedido que le traigas restos venerados de tumularios y gotas burbujeantes.","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Isdi","'Puedes encontrar tumularios en Imlad Balchorth en Angmar, ${PLAYER}, y sanguijuelas sulfurosas en Malenhad, también en Angmar.'","'Me maravilla tu éxito, ${PLAYER}, aunque no debería —he visto tus grandes hazañas y oído de tu sabiduría, pero aun así dudé. No soy tan sabia como creía.\
\
'Permíteme ahora presentarte este equipo que he confeccionado. ¡Que te sirva por mucho tiempo y con gran eficacia!'","'Puedes encontrar a Grimgore vagando por Fasach-larran en Angmar, ${PLAYER}, y a los Corcur acampados cerca de Helegrod en las Montañas Nubladas.'","Recoge el pelaje enmarañado de Grimgore","Isdi está en las ruinas de Edhelion, cerca de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Isdi está esperando que regreses con el segundo conjunto de componentes.","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Isdi","Se recogió el pelaje enmarañado de Grimgore","Recolecta baba pútrida de Helchgam","Recolectada insignia de rango de Trasgo","'Puedo confeccionarte una pieza de equipo que refleje la profundidad de tu conocimiento, , y que te ayude en tu continua búsqueda de sabiduría.\
\
'Sin embargo, necesitaré que consigas los componentes necesarios para fabricar este equipo. No temas al peligro, pues eres ${PLAYERNAME:un gran Sabio[m]|una gran Sabia[f]} y has superado todos los peligros para llegar hasta aquí. Eres lo suficientemente sabio como para sobrevivir a las pruebas que se avecinan.\
\
'Los primeros objetos que necesitaré son el pelaje enmarañado del gran jabalí Grimgore, que vaga por Fasach-larran en Angmar, y el emblema de la tribu Corcur de los montañeses acampados cerca de Helegrod en las Montañas Nubladas.'","'No tienes los componentes que estoy esperando.'","Artículos de misterio","'Te agradezco por estos objetos, . ¿Estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para reunir el último conjunto de cosas que necesitaré?\
\
'Espero que sí, porque serán muy difíciles de conseguir. Creo que estás a la altura del desafío, pero debes saber que te llevará al corazón mismo de la tierra de Angmar. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:sabio[m]|sabia[f]}, . Ahora también debes ser fuerte.\
\
'Lo que necesito es la baba pútrida de Helchgam, el horror que habita bajo Carn Dûm, y los emblemas de los trasgos que custodian la torre de Urugarth.'","Isdi está en las ruinas de Edhelion, cerca de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Isdi está esperando que regreses con el último conjunto de componentes.","Se recogieron gotas burbujeantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1391]={"Artículos de resiliencia","Recolecta cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta garras macabras de murciélago (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Te agradezco este nuevo lote de componentes, ${PLAYER:hermana[f]|hermano[m]}. Me han dicho que serán útiles para forjarte una buena pieza de equipo.\
\
'Quedan dos componentes, y parecen muy difíciles de obtener. Debes recoger la baba pútrida de Helchgam, el terror que mora bajo Carn Dûm, en Angmar. También necesito una Insignia de Mando del uruk Lagmâs, en Urugarth.\
\
'Cuando consigas estos objetos, tráelos aquí conmigo. ¡Me alegra no tener que ir a buscarlos yo!'","Recolecta caparazones chamuscados por el vapor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Garras macabras de murciélago recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Regresas ${PLAYERNAME:victorioso[m]|victoriosa[f]}! Con esto, mi amigo puede forjarte un equipo realmente útil, ¡y espero que lo uses para traer gloria a nuestra familia!'","Sterkist ha aceptado ayudarte a forjar una pieza de equipo de la que Grimbeorn estaría orgulloso.","Recolectado cuernos corroídos de Niquebrique (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolectado casco con púas de Hogni","Sterkist se encuentra en la Torre del Encuentro, en Rivendel.\
\
Has reunido varios objetos difíciles de conseguir que tu hermano insiste en que son necesarios para la creación de una pieza de equipo digna.","Encuentra la Insignia de Mando y la baba pútrida de Helchgam y llévaselas a Sterkist en Rivendel","Recolecta casco con púas de Hogni","Recolectado Insignia de Mando","Recolectado caparazones chamuscados por el vapor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta Insignia de Mando","Sterkist se encuentra en la Torre del Encuentro, en Rivendel.\
\
Has reunido el segundo lote de componentes difíciles de conseguir que tu hermano insiste en que son necesarios para la creación de una pieza de equipo digna.","Los norboglirs se encuentran en el este de Malenhad, en Angmar. Los murciélagos pueden encontrarse en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos.\
\
Sterkist dice que necesita cuernos corroídos de niquebriques y garras macabras de murciélago.","'He encontrado a alguien capaz de forjarte un equipo del que Grimbeorn se sentiría orgulloso, pero requiere componentes muy inusuales. No será fácil conseguirlos, ¡pero insiste en que son necesarios!\
\
'Tendrás que ponerte en peligro para obtener las piezas que necesitamos. Primero deberás reunir sólidas carapachas de los norboglirs que se mueven entre los estanques de Malenhad, en Angmar. También necesitaremos el casco con púas del capitán Duramano Hogni Cortajamón, que según los últimos informes comandaba a los Duramano en la fortaleza de Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas. Nuestra familia nunca ha sentido gran aprecio por los enanos, pero este en particular es vil y muy peligroso.\
\
'Regresa con estos objetos y veré qué más será necesario.'","'¿Encontraste esos objetos? Bien, bien, bien. ¡Te has convertido en ${PLAYERNAME:todo un aventurero[m]|toda una aventurera[f]}!\
\
'Los siguientes componentes que necesitamos, según mi amigo, son cuernos corroídos de niquebriques de los norboglirs del este de Malenhad, en Angmar, y garras macabras de murciélago, que se encuentran en Angmar y otros lugares terribles.'","Recolecta baba pútrida de Helchgam","Helchgam se encuentra bajo la ciudad malvada de Carn Dûm, en Angmar. Lagmâs se encuentra en Urugarth, en Angmar. Sterkist se encuentra en la Torre del Encuentro, en Rivendel.\
\
Tu hermano te ha pedido que consigas más componentes difíciles y se los lleves.","'Quedan dos componentes, y parecen muy difíciles de obtener. Debes recoger la baba pútrida de Helchgam, el terror que mora bajo Carn Dûm, en Angmar. También necesito una Insignia de Mando del uruk Lagmâs, en Urugarth.\
\
'Cuando consigas estos objetos, tráelos aquí conmigo. ¡Me alegra no tener que ir a buscarlos yo!'","Baba pútrida de Helchgam recogida","Los norboglirs se encuentran en el este de Malenhad, en Angmar. Hogni Cortajamón se encuentra en Gabilazan, en las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Sterkist dice que necesitará que le lleves carapachas de norboglir y el casco con púas de Hogni Cortajamón.","Devuelve los artículos a Sterkist en Rivendel."},
[1392]={"'¡Sabía que regresarías, ${PLAYER}, y con los componentes finales que necesito!\
\
Te entrego una pieza de equipo digna de tus habilidades, y con ella mi más profundo respeto.'","Gwesgylliel está en Lin Giliath en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Gwesgylliel está esperando a que regreses con el primer conjunto de componentes que ella pidió.","Bastón de conteo manchado de sangre recogido","Lleva el primer conjunto de componentes a Gwesgylliel","Recoge Insignia de Batalla","Artículos de Valor","Gwesgylliel está en Lin Giliath en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Gwesgylliel está esperando a que regreses con el último conjunto de componentes que necesita.","'La sierpe Raillug puede encontrarse en la esquina noreste de las Montañas Nubladas, mientras que los trasgos Tarkrîp se hallan entre los campamentos orcos de Malenhad en Angmar.'","Recoge gotas burbujeantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿No tienes los componentes que te pedí, ${PLAYER}?'","'¿No tienes los componentes que necesito, ${PLAYER}?'","Botas de Tarkrîp teñidas de azufre recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge la piel congelada de Raillug","Recoge el bastón de conteo manchado de sangre","Gwesgylliel ha accedido a ayudarte a fabricar una pieza de equipo digna de tu habilidad como campeón.","Mandíbulas moteadas de araña recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el segundo conjunto de componentes a Gwesgylliel","Recoge las mandíbulas moteadas de araña (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me alegra que hayas regresado, ${PLAYER}, pues significa que has derrotado a Raillug. Veo también que traes las botas de Tarkrîp que necesito.\
\
Mientras hago uso de estos objetos, deberías salir a recolectar el siguiente conjunto de componentes. Necesitaré mandíbulas de arañas como las que se encuentran en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos. También necesitaré gotas burbujeantes de las sanguijuelas de azufre que se arrastran por el pantano de Malenhad en Angmar.'","'Puedes encontrar a todos los orcos y uruks que mencioné en Urugarth.'","Recoge las botas de Tarkrîp teñidas de azufre (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gríshakrum, Kughûrz, Dafrim, Sorkrank y Burzfîl se pueden encontrar en Urugarth en Angmar.\
\
Gwesgylliel te pidió que regresaras con un bastón de conteo manchado de sangre y una Insignia de Batalla.","Gwesgylliel está en Lin Giliath en Meluinen, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Gwesgylliel está esperando a que regreses con el segundo conjunto de componentes que necesita.","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Solo queda un conjunto de componentes, y conseguirlos será tu mayor desafío.\
\
Necesito que obtengas uno de los palos de conteo manchados de sangre que los temibles orcos Gríshakrum, Kughûrz y Dafrim usan para registrar sus muertes. Además, necesito que consigas una Insignia de Batalla de los uruks Sorkrank y Burzfîl. Todos ellos pueden encontrarse en Urugarth.'","'Puedes encontrar las arañas que busco en Angmar y otros lugares peligrosos. Las sanguijuelas de azufre solo se encuentran en Malenhad en Angmar.'","'Puedo hacerte una pieza de equipo que será una valiosa adición a tu atuendo, , pero necesitaré una serie de componentes con los que fabricarla.\
\
'¡Muchos de estos objetos serán difíciles de conseguir, pero tú eres ${PLAYERNAME:un campeón[m]|una campeona[f]}! No dudo de tu valentía ni de tu dedicación y estoy seguro de que saldrás victorioso de esta tarea.\
\
'Los primeros objetos que necesito que recojas son la piel de la vil sierpe Raillug, que se puede encontrar en la esquina noreste de las Montañas Nubladas, y las botas teñidas de azufre de los trasgos Tarkrîp que habitan entre los campamentos orcos de Malenhad en Angmar.'","Insignia de Batalla recogida","Las arañas se pueden encontrar en Angmar y en otros lugares peligrosos. Las sanguijuelas de azufre se pueden encontrar en Malenhad en Angmar.\
\
Gwesgylliel te pidió que le trajeras mandíbulas de araña moteadas y gotas burbujeantes.","Lleva el último conjunto de componentes a Gwesgylliel","Raillug puede encontrarse en la esquina noroeste de las Montañas Nubladas. Los trasgos Tarkrîp se hallan entre los campamentos orcos de Malenhad en Angmar.\
\
Gwesgylliel te pidió que le trajeras la piel congelada de Raillug y las botas de Tarkrîp teñidas de azufre.","Se recogieron gotas burbujeantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1393]={"'Oh, ${PLAYER}, this is perfect! I can finally get to work. Painting scenes of Minas Tirith with ingredients gathered from the city itself.... I must say, I enjoy the idea.\
\
'Thank you for your hard work. Once I'm done, I'll paint myself a map so that I'll never get lost here again.'","Return to Borlach with his ingredients","'Flowers? Oh, this is for that young painter, isn't it? I met him some days ago while he was exploring the city, but he hasn't returned since. Here you go. Please tell him I said hello!'","Obtained clay","Obtained charcoal","'Charcoal from my burnt wood? Whatever for? Oh, no matter. Here, take it; I don't need it anyway.'","Obtain clay from a potter","Artistic Direction","Obtained flowers","Obtain charcoal from the chef Ciriel","Obtain flowers from the gardener Lebadar","Borlach waits for you on the Second Circle, near the entrance to the First Circle.\
\
You have gathered his ingredients and should let him create his paints.","On the Third Circle, Ciriel works at the ovens, and the potter next to the House of Craft. Lebadar may be on the Second Circle, at the base of the entryway to the Third Circle.\
\
Borlach has requested that you ask them for the following ingredients: charcoal, clay, and flowers, respectively.","'The festivities have been rather exciting, haven't they? It's been months since I've been able to produce a single painting, but this visit to Minas Tirith has finally given me inspiration!\
\
'Unfortunately, I can't put a brush to canvas until I obtain paint ingredients. The city is like a maze -- I've already lost my way six times. If I go wandering off again, I may not find my way back!\
\
'Perhaps you will have better luck. I've asked for directions... well, six times before. Seek out the chef Ciriel for charcoal, a potter from the House of Craft for clay, and the gardener Lebadar for flowers. The first two are on the Third Circle, and Lebadar is on the Second.'","'Clay, ya say? Well sure, I can get ya some. We've got plenty.'","Thanks to the festival, a painter has suddenly been struck by inspiration, but his poor sense of direction keeps him from acquiring paint ingredients.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>"},
[1394]={"Complete The Orkish Path","Talk to Arvaethor to dismiss him","Complete In Ethring's Defence","Arvaethor's Patrol","'Let us take back the Vale and push these Orcs into the mountains from whence they came! No longer will they pillage our trees and defile our waters.'","Complete White Mountain Plague","'I thank you for your aid in protecting the people of Ethring. Still, there is much to do.'","'Call me to your side when you wish to depart.'","Complete Vale of Shadow","Arvaethor is near the pillaged lumber camp in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Arvaethor.","Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated","Arvaethor has asked you to join him on his task of protecting the Vale","Arvaethor asks for assistance as he patrols the Vale and secures its safety.","This noble Arvaethor wishes to help you deal with the invasive White Mountain Orcs that descended upon Ringló Vale.\
\
You should complete a number of tasks in Ringló Vale, using the whistle to call your friend for help if you become separated.","Speak with Arvaethor","Complete Under the White Mountain"},
[1396]={"'Malthellam asks us to sequester ourselves and cease our hunts? I fear it shall not be difficult to abide his rule, for you see, the majority of our hunters have gone missing in the past few days.\
\
'I have heard nothing of the Dead, traveller, and I hope it stays that way. We have enough problems in Sardol as it stands.'","'This unsettles me greatly, ${PLAYER}. \
\
'The Dead have never ventured so far from the hill before, and I fear this is only the beginning of our troubles with them. I do not know what that cursed lot hope to accomplish, but I doubt it a boon to our people. \
\
'If you are passing through to Sardol as you said, please speak to my sister, Mellien, of the Dead. I can only hope they have not wandered so far away from their paths, or I fear something far worse than Orcs will befall the vale.'","Talk to Mellien","DNT -- will not be seen","Concerned by the emergence of the Dead in Blackroot Vale, Sarnir has asked you to investigate how far their influence has grown.","Mellien can be found in Sardol, to the south-west of Alagrant in Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sarnir is concerned that the Dead's influence might extend to the south and has asked you to aid the people of Sardol.","As The River Runs"},
[1397]={"'Mablung wishes for me to tell you of Faramir's daring assault? I shall tell it then, but until he is found, it shall have no ending.\
\
'We had crossed to the eastern side of the city to disrupt the Enemy's forces before they could rally again. We were outnumbered, but we held the eastern end of the north-bridge for a time... until the most vile of the Enemy's forces took notice of us.\
\
'A great, winged beast swooped down and swept a crowd of men aside, friend and foe alike, as if they were leaves amid the winds of a storm. Its wings blotted out the sun, and many of our number fled at once, but my captain and I held strong.\
\
'Faramir took a spear from one of the fallen and called the beast as it clawed at the dead. Before I could stop him, he charged at the beast and thrust the spear into its dark heart. What happened then is a blur to me, for it let loose a great cry and thrashed in a fury as my captain and I fled to the west.\
\
'We became separated on the bridge-rafts, and soon, forces of the Haradrim had cut me off from him completely. I was forced to retreat into the culverts, and that is where my story ends for now. Mablung seems to have a plan for you, and I would not deny him his chance to speak.\
\
'Let us see what our next move shall be!'","Forced into the tunnels under Osgiliath after a daring ploy by Faramir, the Rangers of Ithilien, led by Mablung, now hope to reunite with their lost captain.","'You should speak to Damrod at once, my friend.  With his own eyes, he saw the mighty blow Faramir dealt to the host of Minas Morgul and knows well of the chaos that followed.'","'${PLAYER}, now you know of our plight. Will you stay and aid us here? Or do you heed the call of another? If you stay, our search shall begin at once, else I shall have to proceed with caution... for too few men still stand among us, and to weaken our guard is to invite defeat.\
\
'If Faramir yet lives, I shall find my captain and have him lead his men to freedom beyond the Rammas Echor!'","Talk to Mablung","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have spoken to Damrod about Faramir's gambit, and should now speak to Mablung about searching for Faramir in the tunnels under Osgiliath.","Damrod can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to speak to Damrod about Faramir's daring attack that allowed many of their number to escape the city.","'Our captain, Faramir, is lost. All of our number became separated after he dealt a great blow to the Enemy's forces, and we only realized our loss after we regrouped here in the culverts.\
\
'To my dismay, I was unaware of Faramir's ploy. It must have been a plan he put into action swiftly, but such haste did not lessen its impact. I heard a great shriek in the distance, like the deafening sounding of a Mûmak's trunk, but shrill as the pitch of a bat's cry. No sooner had the forces of the Enemy rallied to its source, and we were overwhelmed. We scattered, leading the foes with us, but we all made for the western gates... for our escape.\
\
'I did not make it so far - great trolls blocked my advance, and I was forced to abandon my escape. I fled into the culverts and there I found the others. So it has been...\
\
'If Faramir made it beyond the western gates, he may yet live, but that is unknown to us all. Damrod, one of my most trusted men, saw first-hand the fury Faramir loosed upon the Enemy. While he knows little else of Faramir's fate, all must be told of our captain's valour... especially if it may be his last.'","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 1"},
[1398]={"The letter can be found at the make-shift camp-site in the sunken labyrinth beneath Osgiliath.\
\
You have discovered a small, empty camp-site in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath. You should take the note and examine it before pressing onward.","'The tidings you bear disturb me, ${PLAYER}. The letter you bear mentions that terrible wraith thrust a blade into his chest, but that he did not die - only his body began to wither. It then reads only of a man succumbing to madness, and I fear his mind can only have grown more twisted since its writing.\
\
'For Faramir to come to such an end would be devastating, and I fear that we must uncover this man's identity before our search can continue elsewhere. There are many ways out of these tunnels, but his flight cannot have taken him far from the culverts.'","The Ranger suddenly dashes away into the dark of the tunnels!","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 2","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have recovered a troubling letter and encountered a strange hooded Ranger in the sunken tunnels of Osgiliath. You should now return to Mablung.","Search further in the depths of Osgiliath","A mysterious Ranger stands near the gates...","'We must begin our search, ${PLAYER}, and I would have us begin here in the culverts where we can move beneath the notice of the Morgul-host above. It is possible that Faramir also fled into the tunnels as we did when the fighting erupted after he speared the fell-beast, but there are many places he may have sought refuge - and too few of us to spare from our posts.\
\
'Search the depths, but do not search alone. These tunnels wind far underneath the city as a vast, sunken labyrinth, and it is likely that some of the Enemy's forces have travelled down into the dark - unwittingly or not.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete the \\qSunken Labyrinth\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>","Desperate to learn of their lost captain's fate, Mablung and Damrod begin their search for Faramir in the winding tunnels beneath Osgiliath.","You have found an emptied camp-site with only a note left behind...","The Ranger is standing near the gate to Muzgásh's chamber in the sunken labyrinth.\
\
You have defeated Muzgásh, but now a strange Ranger stands near the gate to his chambers. You should approach the Ranger and attempt to speak to him.","'What news have you of your search, ${PLAYER}? There are many places where Faramir may have sought refuge in this sunken labyrinth, and I fear we shall not have time to search them all.'","The note is hastily-written and swiftly descends into madness and incoherence...","Faramir might be found somewhere within the sunken labyrinth beneath Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to search the depths of Osgiliath for Faramir, who may have fled into the tunnels in the wake of his attack on the fell-beast.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You must complete the \\qSunken Labyrinth\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>","Examine the note at the abandoned camp-site","Search for Faramir in the depths of Osgiliath","Deliver the note to Mablung and tell him of the mysterious Ranger","Approach the mysterious Ranger","Faramir might be found somewhere within the sunken labyrinth beneath Osgiliath.\
\
You have not yet found Faramir in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath, but you should continue your search deeper in the labyrinth."},
[1399]={"As you examine the shield, the Ranger darts out beneath the broken bridge and flees!","As you examine the horn, the Ranger appears and dashes across the nearby bridge-rafts","Return to Mablung and tell him of the Ranger's elusiveness","Signs of the Ranger's passing can likely be found in southern Osgiliath, especially around the wharfs and nearby ruins.\
\
Mablung has asked you to pursue the mysterious Ranger you encountered in the sunken tunnels of Osgiliath. By the way he took to escape, Mablung suggest searching the wharfs and the nearby ruins.","As you examine the necklace, the Ranger dashes up a nearby staircase!","Disturbed by the note you recovered and your sighting of a mysterious Ranger in the depths of Osgiliath, Mablung sends you to the streets above to track this elusive stranger.","Search Osgiliath for signs of the mysterious Ranger's passing","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have lost the trail of the mysterious Ranger, and should now report his elusiveness to Mablung.","'This man bears a grave wound, and yet eludes us at every turn... what force could empower a man so?\
\
'We must hasten our search, and work to corner this man - be he friend or turned foe.'","'You have told me much of this strange man, ${PLAYER}, but most troubling is your description of his clothing.\
\
'By your account, he bears a cloak that belonged to none but our captain, Faramir. If this man is Faramir, our cause is lost, and we should forge a new strategy to escape the city before dawn. However, if he is not - who would be so bold as to take up a mantle beyond his standing and elude the aid of his brethren?\
\
'Search the southern ways of the city, on both shores of the Anduin, for his path would lead him either to the camps of the Haradrim or the ruins of the armoury across the Orkish bridge-rafts. Track him, and capture him if you must - for we must learn of his identity!'","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 3"},
[1400]={"Deliver the remains of Faramir's cloak to Mablung","Garbed in the tattered remains of Faramir's cloak, the corrupted Ranger falls defeated!","'Lúmithil was a bold Ranger, and I am saddened that the Enemy twisted him into something so vile. His death shall be mourned, and, if I were to have my way, avenged! Sadly, a foe who bears no form does not make vengeance an easy task...\
\
'While I am glad that Faramir did not meet with such a fate, we are no closer to finding him, and I fear our trail has gone cold.\
\
'Allow me a moment to ponder our course of action, and I shall speak to you once more.'","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 4","After losing the trail of the mysterious Ranger, Mablung asks you and your fellows to search the ruined city and uncover his identity at any cost.","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have defeated the corrupted Ranger that bore Faramir's cloak. You should now return the cloak to Mablung.","The fallen Ranger can be found inside the Palace of Eldacar.\
\
You have defeated the corrupted Ranger bearing the cloak of Faramir and should now reclaim it for the Rangers of Ithilien.","You have recovered Faramir's cloak, but his whereabouts still remain unknown...","Reclaim Faramir's cloak from the fallen Ranger","Pursue and confront the mysterious Ranger","'I do not know what compels this man to flee at our approach, but it is clear that we must capture him before his madness can overtake him. His wound needs the care of a practiced healer, and yet he can still run as fast as any of our number. I fear that this bodes ill for us, ${PLAYER}, but I do not wish to abandon hope.\
\
'Whether he is friend or foe, I would have you subdue him for his mind is not his own. You must not lose his trail this time, or I fear we will never have another opportunity to learn of his identity.\
\
'Throughout your pursuit, he remained in the southern streets of the ruined city, so I would have you begin your search there once again. However, I suggest you bring your allies, for with them it may be easier to subdue this strange man and return to us in the culverts.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete \\qThe Ruined City\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>","The mysterious Ranger can be found somewhere within the ruined city of Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to search the ruined city for any sign of the mysterious Ranger you encountered in the sunken tunnels.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete \\qThe Ruined City\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>"},
[1401]={"The site where Faramir speared the great fell-beast can be found to the north-east of the Dome of Stars.\
\
In desperation, Mablung has asked you to search the site where Faramir speared a fell-beast in hopes of uncovering where he may have gone.","'It cannot be! Hope is lost, ${PLAYER}. None can stand against the servants of the Dark Lord... their might is limitless!\
\
'Even if this Nazgûl - this \\qBlack Blade\\q speaks true, how can we be assured that Faramir's fate will be any different than that of Lúmithil? Our captain may already serve the Dark Lord, if still he lives.'","The broken spear can be found near the ruined bridge to the north-east of the Dome of Stars.\
\
You have found the site as well as the broken spear that Faramir once wielded. You should examine the spear.","After pursuing and defeating the Ranger corrupted by a Morgul-blade, Faramir's trail is all but lost. As his hope begins to wane, Mablung sends you to the location where Faramir struck down a mighty fell-beast of Mordor.","You are filled with dread as a dark shadow passes over you!","Search the site where Faramir slew the fell-beast","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 5","The splintered remains of the spear that Faramir used to slay the fell-beast lay nearby...","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have encountered one of the Nazgûl, the Black Blade of Lebennin, who claims to hold Faramir captive atop the Dome of Stars. You should tell Mablung of this at once.","Examine Faramir's broken spear","Talk to Mablung of the Nazgûl's captive","'We are without direction, my friend. The trail is cold, and none that live know of Faramir's fate. Alas for poor Lúmithil... may he be at peace.\
\
'I have thought much on where our search might continue, and one thought has lingered in my mind. You have done much for us, but this may be too perilous a task to put upon you. Since our flight into the culverts, none of us have dared to return to the site where Faramir speared the great fell-beast. \
\
'I thought our course wise, and it may still be, but I must ask you to travel there, my friend. What became of the beast? Did it fall as we thought? Has some hidden insight to our captain's flight gone unnoticed? These thoughts trouble my mind, ${PLAYER}, and I cannot rest.\
\
'If you dare, travel far to the north-east, beyond the Dome of Stars... and search by the broken north-bridge. When you find Faramir's spear, you shall know you have found the site.'"},
[1402]={"Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have triumphed over the Black Blade of Lebennin if only for a moment, and learned of Faramir's fate. You should return to Mablung with this news.","Free Faramir from the Dome of Stars","'I know not if Faramir lives or if this is merely one of the Nazgûl's vile designs to draw the last of us from hiding. I cannot know, and it pains me to face such uncertainty without the guidance of our captain.\
\
'The Dome of Stars lies in the heart of the Enemy's forces and until they wrested control of the western city, it was there that the leaders of the host oversaw their cruel servants. It is still a place of great evil, and dread grips the entire isle on which it stands.\
\
'The Enemy has thrown down the western bridge to the Dome, so the only way into the structure is across the eastern bridge by Rómendacil's Square. The Enemy has heightened their guard near the culverts, so I can guide you to the western side of the Great Bridge safely, but no further.\
\
'Do not dare face the Black Blade alone, for you will need all the allies you can muster to stand against such evil. Faramir's fate may well rest in your hands, my friend. May your fellowship be the light to pierce these ashen skies...'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete \\qThe Dome of Stars\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>","Confront and defeat the Black Blade of Lebennin","'I cannot believe it! I felt a cold rush pass over the city as I looked to the Dome outside the culverts... could that have been his foul spirit sent away to the Land of Shadow?\
\
'You have done a truly great thing, my friend, but Faramir is not among your number.... Tell me, ${PLAYER}, what has become of my captain?'","'My captain is held prisoner by one of the Nazgûl... never has there been a darker day in my life.\
\
'I know the strength of Faramir's resolve well, but so too do I know the might of the Enemy. If he yet lives and the wraith speaks true, we must act swiftly!'","The Black Blade of Lebennin and his captive can be found atop the Dome of Stars.\
\
Mablung has asked you to free Fararmir from the Black Blade of Lebennin and attempt to banish his spirit before the coming battle.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete \\qThe Dome of Stars\\q instance to complete this quest.</rgb>","'You have come... seeking Faramir?\
\
Struggling to speak, Norhún's coughs are wet with blood.\
\
'He... is gone - gone from Osgiliath. We had made it to the western gates when the shadow... fell upon us. I threw myself in its path, and soon I was carried above by a terrible, winged beast. From the sky, I saw my captain escape... he passed along the Causeway and through the Rammas Echor before I lost sight of him.\
\
'Tell the others of his fate, for they must know that he still lives!\
\
'The wraith... he...'\
\
Norhún's breath slows, and is still.","One of the Nazgûl, the Black Blade of Lebennin, has revealed himself as Faramir's captor and now holds the captain of the South-rangers atop the Dome of Stars.","The Nazgûl's lies are revealed, for Norhún's noble sacrifice allowed Faramir to escape Osgiliath alive!","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 6","Talk to Mablung and tell him of Faramir's fate"},
[1403]={"'You slew the wraith? Is such a feat possible? The servants of the Dark Lord do not suffer defeat easily, my friend... but let us hope that we shall be free of his evil for a time.\
\
'Faramir has escaped beyond the Causeway Forts into the Pelennor Fields? This is a joyous turn, indeed, but I fear we must not forget the horrors looming above.\
\
'I sense the war shall soon reach a turning point, and I hope you will be among us at that critical hour.'","Talk to Mablung","'While Faramir lives, our hope shall not be broken!'","'Let none forget the sacrifice of Norhún!'","Damrod can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
Mablung has asked you to tell Damrod of Faramir's escape from Osgiliath.","Ashes and Stars, Chapter 7","'What has become of Faramir, ${PLAYER}? Were you too late to save him?'\
\
You tell Mablung of Norhún's sacrifice and his bravery in allowing Faramir to escape from the western gates of Osgiliath.\
\
'My captain lives yet! I shall rest easier knowing Faramir made it past the Gates of the Sun, even though his fate beyond remains unclear. Such a sacrifice... Norhún shall be hailed as a hero among my people, I swear it.'\
\
Mablung turns to Damrod and gestures for him to listen.\
\
'Damrod, have you heard this joyous news?'","Through Norhún's steadfast loyalty and sacrifice, Faramir was able to escape the western gates of Osgiliath. Their hope restored, Mablung and his men make ready for the journey ahead.","'We have struck a devastating blow, but the Morgul-host still threatens the White City!'","Talk to Damrod","'As merry a day as this may be, Damrod speaks true.\
\
'The might of the Morgul-host stands poised to spill forth into the Pelennor Fields and to the very walls of Minas Tirith. Through your efforts, we have slowed their advance, but the thousands that rally above cannot be stopped... not by us alone.\
\
'Take your leave, ${PLAYER}, and rest well after this victory... but be ready. For on the morrow, the war for Gondor shall truly begin!'","Mablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath.\
\
You have told Damrod of your successes in Osgiliath and should now speak to Mablung once more."},
[1409]={"Ashâmi completed her task at Tir Katar. Return to her home in Urmâkh and discuss her next steps.","Ashâmi greeted you when you arrived outside of the serval den near Urmâkh. She waits for you to say you are ready to assist in hunting the diseased serval, Kanagir.","Ashâmi was attacked by a serval and gravely wounded in her youth. She asks for your help against the diseased serval she is tasked to kill to prove herself to Numûru. The serval camp is east of Urmâkh.","Meet with Ashâmi near the serval den east of Urmâkh","'Let us use caution as we search for the beast, Kanagir. Something in this forest fills me with dread.'","Ashâmi is tasked with going to the a serval den to kill a diseased serval there. She asks you to meet her there to assist her.","Ashâmi's Challenge","'When Raphûz completes his task, we will speak with you.\
\
'Your help was invaluable today. I understand why Raphûz regards you so well and has such faith in you, ${PLAYER}.'","Complete Instance: Ashâmi's Challenge","Ashâmi's resolve is apparent.\
\
'I was ten when the serval attacked me. My father put the beast down immediately. My wounds became infected. I nearly died. My father wanted the wounds to heal on their own.\
\
'My mother took me to Lathagwid. It was only with her care I survived.\
\
'My fear of these cats is great. I think I shall need a bit of Raphûz's confidence. Maybe your help.\
\
'The serval's den is east of here, in central Imhûlar. Will you meet me there?'","Ashâmi signaled to you when you arrived at the den"},
[1410]={"Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Long ago, Durin the Deathless sealed away an evil being known as the Shadowed King. Driven by intense jealousy, he wears the face of the Father of the Longbeards and builds a kingdom deep beneath the earth; a twisted reflection of the dwarf hall above, a mockery of the grandness of Khazad-dûm. He must be defeated, or his demented visions may become reality.","Defeat the Shadowed King.","Talk to Frethi","Defeated the Shadowed King","Frethi is standing by inside Askâd-mazal.\
\
You should talk to Frethi","Use the Summoning Horn to call Frethi to your side.","'Look at this place, ${PLAYER}! It is a twisted copy of Rushdurinul, Durin's own throne-room. How is this even possible? How long has this been here?\
\
'Hmph, these questions will have to wait. We have been charged with defeating the Nameless, and I want to cut the beard off that charlatan King personally!'","Defeat the Shadowed King","Use the Summoning Horn to call Frethi","Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows -- Solo"},
[1414]={"Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Orcs, goblins, bats, and sapper-bomb crates can be found at Atrad-zarakh.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Atrad-zarakh. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","'The Haban'akkâ has need of your aid, my friend.\
\
'I have received word that our enemies have again rallied to Atrad-zarakh. If what I have heard is true, the Orcs have begun to tend the bats within the tower once more, and the goblins make ready to wield more of their crude bombs into battle. This cannot be borne!'\
\
'Let our enemies at Atrad-zarakh know the wrath of the Haban'akkâ!'","Defeat Orcs and goblins at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy crates of sapper-bombs at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Orcs and goblins at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated bats at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Upon the slopes of Bundushâthur at Atrad-zarakh, Orcs and goblins prepare sapper-bombs and tend the great-bats of Moria that they might overcome the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Azanulbizar.","Defeat bats at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Assault on Atrad-zarakh","You have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Atrad-zarakh.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh.","Destroyed crates of sapper-bombs at Atrad-zarakh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1417]={"Asalto a Dhúrstrok","Completed 'Assault on Dhúrstrok'","Dhúrstrok is located in the catwalks north-east of Aslíf. The catwalks can be reached through the lift.\
\
Múta will meet you inside Dhúrstrok.","Complete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter Assault on Dhúrstrok.","Náin's fate is in your hands.","'Náin's trapped behind a door with two locks. The goblin Mozrúk holds one key, and a troll named Gâdh-and-Shum holds the other.\
\
'Watch out when you're dealing with Mozrúk. He's one of those bat-riders -- got an arsenal of explosives he creates himself.\
\
'Gâdh-and-Shum is a mystery, but there are rumours of him dealing with magic. Even his own kind thinks there's something... unnatural with him.\
\
'They each work in separate wings of Dhúrstrok. I don't know what they're going to do with that dwarf, but you better act fast. He didn't look so well when I saw him.'","Talk to Múta","Shúkurz has returned with a wealth of information.\
\
You should talk to Múta and formulate a plan.","'You've done your part, Shúkurz. Féli will see to it that you and your party are escorted safely out of Gundabad.\
\
'${PLAYER}, it looks like we'll want a small group of people for this job -- rescuing Lord Náin will go faster. If you have allies who can rally to us quickly, bring them along; if not, we'll work together instead.\
\
'When you're ready, take the lift in the north-east all the way up to the catwalks. Find Dhúrstrok; I'll meet you there.'","Complete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty","You have rescued Náin and brought him back safely to Aslíf.\
\
You should talk to him.","Talk to Náin in Aslíf","Find Dhúrstrok","'I am in your debt, ${PLAYER}. I let anger overtake me and cloud my senses. It was unbefitting of me as a leader -- nay, as a dwarf. I selfishly put my own thirst for revenge above the concerns of the Gabil'akkâ.'\
\
He absentmindedly reaches for his beard before realizing that it's no longer there. A tired sigh escapes him.\
\
'At least I have paid dearly for my actions.'"},
[1418]={"Recoge el cuerno de invocación","Talk to Múta","Approach Náin","'His beard... it's gone.... The Black Mattock is gone too. I'd wager it's been stolen, or worse, destroyed.\
\
'We can't linger here to exact revenge upon Gorgar; we must return to Aslíf. Lord Náin's injuries do not seem grave, but he has lost much.\
\
'Quickly now.'","Defeated Mozrúk the Wind-rider","Náin is trapped behind a locked gate.\
\
Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Use the summoning horn to call Múta","You have obtained the keys needed to free Náin.\
\
You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Solo","You have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison.\
\
You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Defeat Gâdh-and-Shum","Abre la puerta","Múta has something to say.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","You should find Náin's location.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.</rgb>","Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider","Find Náin","You have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold.\
\
You should pick up the summoning horn to call Múta to your side.","High among the catwalks of Deepscrave lies Dhúrstrok, the stronghold of Gorgar the Ruthless. Somewhere within these aging halls filled with dwarf-relics, Gorgar's loyal generals have imprisoned Lord Náin. It is up to you to free him.","Defeated Gâdh-and-Shum"},
