\
'Quickly now.'","Defeated Mozrúk the Wind-rider"},
[1421]={"You have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison.\
\
You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.","Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider","You have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold.\
\
You should find Náin's location.","High among the catwalks of Deepscrave lies Dhúrstrok, the stronghold of Gorgar the Ruthless. Somewhere within these ageing halls filled with dwarf-relics, Gorgar's loyal generals have imprisoned Lord Náin. It is up to you to free him.","Náin is trapped behind a locked gate.\
\
Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.","Find Náin","Talk to Múta","Assault on Dhúrstrok -- Tier 3","Múta has something to say.","You have obtained the keys needed to free Náin.\
\
You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.","Abre la puerta","Defeat Gâdh-and-Shum","Approach Náin","Defeated Gâdh-and-Shum","'His beard... it's gone.... The Black Mattock is gone too. I'd wager it's been stolen, or worse, destroyed.\
\
'We can't linger here to exact revenge upon Gorgar; we must return to Aslíf. Lord Náin's injuries do not seem grave, but he has lost much.\
\
'Quickly now.'","Defeated Mozrúk the Wind-rider"},
[1422]={"'Your battles with the goblins have been well-fought. I commend you for your efforts on the part of the Free Peoples.\
\
'I know that their numbers may seem endless, but they can be taught to fear our strength.'","Assault on Goblin-town","Goblins can be found in great numbers in the halls of Goblin-town in the Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to defeat goblins in the depths of Goblin-town.","'I have spoken with a messenger from Rivendell. Master Elrond has asked that we send able warriors to strike a blow against the goblins of Goblin-town before they complete their preparations for war against the folk living on either side of the Misty Mountains. \
\
'Will you take up arms and strike into the heart of their warrens? Goblin-town itself must feel the sting of our anger ere they are ready to work their mischief upon the innocent settlements below.'","Defeat goblins in Goblin-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of your attack on Goblin-town.","Handarod is concerned with rumours that the Great-goblin is preparing an assault upon the lands on either side of the Misty Mountains in an attempt to enlarge his realm during this time of chaos and war.","Defeated goblins in Goblin-town (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1423]={"Assault on Kala-gijak","Go to Kala-gijak","Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.","Faeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack.\
\
You should meet up with Faeron.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, just in time. My preliminary scouting has revealed some holes in Kala-gijak's defences. Exploit them, and we can win this battle with minimal casualties.\
\
'I have noticed that the gate on this side is poorly guarded. They must be expecting that if the forces of the west come, it would be from Dor Amarth. On top of that, discipline is lax. There are few officers in the lower barracks keeping the grunts in line. They are drunk and distracted; a perfect place to strike.\
\
'Here is the plan: get in there and do some strategic damage. They will be confused and slow to mobilize. After that, we storm in and take out their leader, Brogmaush. It will be over before they know what happened.'","Talk to Faeron","Complete: Take Out the Look-outs","Brogmaush can be found in the upper barracks of Kala-gijak.\
\
You should defeat Brogmaush with the aid of Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk.","'With the gorgûn gone, my people are safer. You are a worthy friend. I will tell you of Seregost.\
\
'The mountain erupted and we were returned to our homeland, but found it changed: foul, sick, cursed. Corruption spreads through the river water of Chaydash. We followed the river to its spring and found a giant castle. Seregost is the source.\
\
'The Orcs captured some of my people and the winged demons take them to Seregost. They are never seen again. We hear they are sacrifices for 'The Lady of Blight'. That is all I know.\
\
'This 'Lady of Blight' is our enemy. She must be killed to restore our homeland, but we need wings to enter Seregost.'","Defeat Brogmaush","Complete: Disarming the Uruks","Talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr","Faeron and the Drúedain have returned to the village of Bhol Rûdh.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Kala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith.\
\
You should complete missions for Faeron in Kala-gijak.","'Meet my warriors outside Kala-gijak. They are brave and fierce. Ready to fight. Do as you say with honour.'","Defeated Brogmaush","Kala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith.\
\
You should go to Kala-gijak.","Faeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","Arrived at Kala-gijak","The Drúedain of the Red Sky Clan are prepared for battle. Meet Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk outside Kala-gijak to begin the assault.","'Excellent work! Now that they are in chaos, we attack their leader!'","Complete: A Foul Brew","'Wonderful, ${PLAYER}. We have surely secured the Red Sky Clan as our allies. They are indeed fierce warriors to take on an Uruk fort and suffer so few casualties. We must not tarry here long, however. We need to gather more information on Seregost and report back. Speak to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr and see what else she knows.'","Faeron and the Drúedain charge into Kala-gijak!"},
[1424]={"Asalto a Khetsok","Girhâzi ha decidido que es hora de pasar a la ofensiva y ha ordenado un asalto al campamento Ordâkhai de Khetsok.","Derrota a los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destruye las provisiones de los Ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Obstaculiza los esfuerzos de los Ordâkhai en Ambarûl derrotando a los soldados y destruyendo sus provisiones en Khetsok.","Ordâkhai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Regresemos a Iridír.'","Provisiones de los Ordâkhai destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1425]={"'This proves to me that you are a warrior devoted to our cause. Come then, let us steel our nerves and sharpen our blades. The Enemy is many and entrenched in that holding, but we have hope and strength to spare.\
\
'The time has come! Baruk Khazâd!'","Assault on Tol Ascarnen","'This aggression will not stand, ${PLAYER}. Angmar has forces all over the Ettenmoors, and Tol Ascarnen is a symbol of hope to us all. I will not stand idly by and allow the forces of the Enemy to hold Tol Ascarnen.\
\
'Nor am I fool enough to assail the keep alone, but with a force of the Free Peoples, I shall stand beside you and storm the walls, taking them for our own once more.\
\
'Prove your valour, ${PLAYER}, in the form of the tokens we bestow at Glân Vraig and bring them to me. Should you give me enough, I will know you are a righteous ${RACE} and stand beside you as we storm the walls of Tol Ascarnen.'","Tokens of valour are bestowed at Glân Vraig. First Marshal Án is at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
First Marshal Án wants to take the Tol Ascarnen back from the Enemy. He will not begin the assault until he knows that there are others who will stand with him. He told you to prove your worth by bringing him tokens of valour.","Collected tokens of valour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The host of Angmar swept into the central keep of the Ettenmoors and drove Captain-General Makan from Tol Ascarnen. This affront is more than an honourable dwarf can stand, and First Marshal Án will stop at nothing to take it back, though he wants assurances that the force he leads will stand beside him.","Collect tokens of valour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I'll not risk an assault until you prove to me that you will stand by my side. Bring me tokens of valour, and I shall be true to my word.'","Deliver the tokens of valour to First Marshal Án at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen"},
[1426]={"All levels of the east tower are being assaulted by Saruman's army. The Rohirrim labourers will attempt to erect barricades to slow the enemy, Legolas will defend the catapult at the summit, and the remaining siege equipment within the tower will be vulnerable to direct attacks from the waves of enemies upon the wall.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Partial</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Major Merit Gain:</rgb>\
* Labourer constructs a barricade\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Munitions cache destroyed\
* Rohirrim Guard defeated\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Rohirrim Labourer defeated\
* Constructed barricade becomes destroyed","A labourer has been defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Legolas is in need of aid in defending against a concentrated attack against the east tower. The Rohirrim labourers require protection as they construct their defensive barricades. The defenders will need your aid if they are to hold back the Orc assault.","Defend the east tower from the waves of attackers (${VALUE}/14)","Do not allow the Rohirrim labourers to be defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Assault on the East Tower"},
[1427]={"'Goldagnir está ansioso por asestar el golpe final. Deberías reunirte con él de inmediato.'","<rgb=#00FF00>Has repelido el asalto del Enemigo en el Patio Interior. Ahora es el momento de reclamar el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo</rgb>","Las fuerzas de Dol Guldur no cederán su fortaleza tan fácilmente. Mantente firme y defiende lo que has reclamado de su ira.","Defiende el Patio Exterior contra el asalto","El Patio Exterior ahora pertenece firmemente a la Hueste Dorada. Es hora de avanzar más profundo y derrotar a los que protegen el Patio Interior.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has reclamado el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo. El corazón de Dol Guldur está ahora expuesto</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has repelido el asalto del Enemigo en el Patio Exterior. Ahora es el momento de reclamar el Patio Interior</rgb>","Toma el Patio Interior","Has reclamado el Patio Interior, pero los maestros de Dol Guldur no lo cederán fácilmente. Defiéndelo para poder asaltar la Torre.","El guardián del Patio Interior ha descendido de la torre. Derrota a él y reclama los patios y el exterior de Dol Guldur para la Hueste Dorada.","Asalto a la guarida de los Espectros del Anillo","Defiende el Patio Interior contra el asalto","Tomar los muros que rodean Dol Guldur dejará las defensas interiores debilitadas y vulnerables","El Patio Exterior protege la entrada a las mazmorras de Dol Guldur, pero lo más importante, las puertas del Patio Interior y el corazón de la fortaleza. Todos los que se encuentren en estas zonas deben ser eliminados para reclamar este lugar.","<rgb=#FF0000>El Enemigo está lanzando un asalto para recuperar el Patio Interior</rgb>","Toma el Patio Exterior","<rgb=#FF0000>El Enemigo está lanzando un asalto para recuperar el Patio Exterior</rgb>","Toma el Antro de los Espectros del Anillo"},
[1429]={"Defeat Orcs at Ânghum-maudhûl (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Harchador at Mithechad","Defeated Orcs at Ânghum-maudhûl (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Word has spread that the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl are preparing for a counter-attack against the Malledhrim. We must strike against them first, before they can muster their full strength.\
\
'I will leave that to you, ${PLAYER}. Bring death to the enemies of the Malledhrim at Ânghum-maudhûl, then return to me with your report.\
\
'Ânghum-maudhûl lies south-east of here, along the road.'","'Your quick action has granted the Malledhrim a reprieve. With the forces of Ânghum-maudhûl diminished, we do not expect a counter-attack until reinforcements arrive.'","Word has spread that the Orcs in Ânghum-maudhûl are preparing for a viscious counter-attack against Mithechad and the Malledhrim.","Assault on Ânghum-maudhûl","Ânghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad.\
\
Harchador has asked you to defeat the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl before they can muster their full strength.","Harchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl.\
\
You should speak with Harchador and let him know that you were victorious.","'Seek out and defeat the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl. Go now!'"},
[1430]={"'I believe that the amulet may be mended by placing it upon the correct cairn stone. Perhaps you will discover if my belief is true....'","Assemble the Amulet","'This amulet may very well be the symbol of an ancient settlement here. The cairn-stones that you visited are said to date back to that time, and now the amulet appears to be mending itself. \
\
'I believe those cairn-stones were left by a branch of an ancient lûth -- clan -- that fell to conflict within itself. This may be what caused the shades to be bound here.\
\
'My hope is that somehow this amulet will allow us to put these poor spirits to rest.'","Find cairn-stones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Several older cairn stones are scattered among the barrows in the Lich Bluffs. Perhaps the ancient writing may provide a clue to the past of the amulet that you recovered.","Talk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary","Found cairn-stones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The ancient cairn-stones are located south of the Hall of Sanctuary, among the rolling hills and barrows.\
\
Lhudd has asked you to seek out ancient cairn-stones and place the amulet upon them. He believes that this may somehow help to mend the amulet.","Lhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs.\
\
You should return to Lhudd with news of your discoveries.","'I wish to thank you for recovering both halves of this amulet, Duvodiad. My hope has been that when this item is mended, that it might weaken the shades that stalk this troubled land. I fear a great evil has bound them here, and they have become dangerous.\
\
'Take both pieces of the amulet and seek out several of the unusual cairn stones that dot the landscape. These ancient cairn stones are covered with inscriptions that are much older than those that surround them. The inscriptions on these stones match that of the amulet and can hopefully be used to help mend it to its original shape.\
\
'Travel to the south-east and locate several of these cairn stones. Place the amulet upon them, then bring me word of the effects, if any, you witness.'"},
[1431]={"Collected armour from barrels in Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sacks and barrels of armour can be found throughout Underharrow in southern Kingstead.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked that you gather materials to aid in the defence of Underharrow. You should search for them in Underharrow.","Assemble warriors of Rohan at Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Assembling the Warriors","Collected sacks in Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ellen Fremedon's distress grows as Underharrow is continually flooded by the people of Rohan, yet remains devoid of riders.","Sticks can be found along the southern border of Underharrow.\
\
Having gathered the components, you should now assemble warriors of Rohan to defend Underharrow using sticks placed near the settlement's edge.","Collect armour from barrels in Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Look around you, ${PLAYER}. Do you see how many people take shelter under these trees?\
\
'We are neither Edoras nor even Middlemead, and to host this many people stretches us far beyond our breaking. Yet, even now, evils lurk in the mountains above and what defences have we? None. \
\
'The men have gone to the side of the King, and left us naught but the shoddy remains of our barricades. What fear has an Orc of a pointed stick?\
\
'Gather sacks and the armour from about town for they will remain unused otherwise, and assemble the crudest warriors you can along the edge of town. If even one Orc is fooled, we may consider our situation better.'","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in southern Kingstead.\
\
You have built several warriors out of the materials Ellen suggested, and should now return to her.","Assembled warriors of Rohan at Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well, where are my warriors?'","Collect sacks in Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Well done, ${PLAYER}, well done...\
\
'These new defences are truly a boon to my people, or they would be... if they were not made of sacks! \
\
'All of these people, all of this weaponry, and none of them of any use to the other! How am I to protect this lot?'"},
[1432]={"'The Elders sent you? Then this must be of grave importance. We will return to Lhan Rhos. \
\
'Thank you, fearsome hunter, for summoning us.'","The hunters are encamped to the south-east of Lhan Rhos. The scouts are encamped to the north-east of Lhan Rhos. The Protectors of the Pristine Glade are encamped to the west of Lhan Rhos. Speak to Maugan under the tree.  He may need you to do additional work for him.\
\
Elder Déin has asked you to gather the people of the Dunbog for Assembly.","'I understand that the Elders seek our presence.  But you must first help us here in the Glade before I can help the Elders.'","'It is time to call the people together for Assembly. We must explain to them that the situation is dire, and the time for action is now.\
\
'I want you to return to the hunters and the scouts and bring them back to Lhan Rhos. You also need to seek out the Protectors of the Pristine Glade to the west of the river. Speak to Maugan underneath the Great Tree. He may need to put his affairs in order before he will help you.\
\
'We must go to war, but we will go to war as a united people!'","Elder Déin has agreed to call an Assembly of the Avanc-lûth.","'You have represented yourself well.  Thank you.  We will talk more shortly.  For now, have this.'","Talk to Elder Déin in Lhan Rhos","You have called the protectors to Assembly","The Elders await your return at Lhan Rhos in the centre of the Dunbog.\
\
Having called the people of Dunbog to Assembly, you should return to the village and speak with Elder Déin.","You have called the hunters to Assembly","'It is time, ${PLAYER}...call the people of Lhan Rhos to the Assembly.'","'Elder Déin sent you? I am glad that they have finally seen fit to do something. All of this endless waiting and time away from my family has been maddening.\
\
'Tell Elder Déin that I will come, and if you see my wife, tell her as well.'","Call the scouts to Assembly","Assembly Call","Talk to Elder Dein","Call the hunters to Assembly","Call Maugan and the protectors to Assembly","You have called the scouts to Assembly","'Well done, ${PLAYER}. You will be remembered always for everything you have done for the Dunbog, though I suspect your chapters are not yet fully written.\
\
'The Assembly will take place tonight. Prepare yourself well.'"},
[1433]={"'The Wargs in Fang Point are a larger pack than I expected. Thank you for the scouting report.'","The Wargs of Fang point have grown increasingly aggressive of late, and Agelmund wishes to know what has caused this change in their behaviour.","Captain Agelmund awaits you at Feldburg in the Wold.\
\
You should return to Captain Agelmund with your assessment of the Wargs in Fang Point.","You assessed the threats in the northern area of Fang Point","You assessed the threats in the southern area of Fang Point","Scout the northern den of Fang Point","Fang Point is south of Feldburg, with two dens associated with the same pack: one to the north, and one to the south..\
\
You should scout the north and south dens of Fang Point.","Scout the southern den of Fang Point","Assessing Fang Point","Return to Captain Agelmund in Feldburg","'You defeated several of the pack-members outside of Fang Point, but I wish to know more about the beasts' movements of late. What is causing this change?\
\
'It would be very helpful to know more; will you scout the north and south of Fang Point, and see what there is to see?'"},
[1434]={"Derrota orcos de la Mano Blanca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","White Hand Orcs rush toward the overturned cart!","Assess the damage done to the overturned waggon","You were warned that the road to Aldburg may be frought with danger.","Orcos de la Mano Blanca derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","This Orc-attack has been quelled, but it is only a matter of time before another one occurs. Nevertheless, you have made travel somewhat safer between Aldburg and Edoras.","White Hand Orcs rush toward the overturned cart ready to attack.\
\
Defeat the White Hand attackers.","Completado","Assessing the Damage","The road from Edoras to Aldburg sees much traffic, which makes it an attractive place for Orcs to attack.\
\
You should be wary as you journey to Aldburg and deal with any threats as they arise."},
[1435]={"Evaluando las forjas","Has descubierto una forja de los orcos de Moria","Knakk se encuentra en la plataforma elevada justo al norte del campamento de los orcos de la Mano Blanca, en el camino hacia la Gran Escalera.\
\
Knakk estará deseando oír cualquier actualización sobre los orcos que trabajan tan cerca de su campamento oculto. Es vital que sigan sin saber que se encuentra allí.","Encuentra el lugar donde se encuentra las tribus de orcos forjan su equipamiento (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Encuentra el campamento de Knakk","Has descubierto una forja de los orcos de la Mano Blanca","'${PLAYER}, es hora de encontrar las forjas que estos orcos han tenido funcionando día y noche en el Cuerno Rojo. Deben estar en algún lugar cercano, porque el olor del material quemado y el metal está en el aire. Sus forjas huelen como hornos sobrecalentados.\
\
'Los campamentos de las dos tribus de orcos deben tener unas cuantas forjas cada uno. Sospecho que estarán bien guardadas, así que mantén los ojos abiertos.'","Moria y los orcos de la Mano Blanca están trabajando duramente para extraer el oro del Cuerno Rojo y producir grandes cantidades de armas y armaduras para sus filas.\
\
Los orcos de la Mano Blanca se han atrincherado en la mitad norte de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, mientras que los orcos de Moria se esfuerzan por conservar la mitad sur.","Los orcos de Moria crearon forjas hace mucho para ayudarles a procesar y usar el mineral que conseguían de los generosos depósitos de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. La Mano Blanca ha invadido y tomado el control de algunas de esas forjas y amenazan con tomar las otras.","'¿Así que has encontrado las forjas, y no están muy lejos de aquí?'\
\
Le describes las localizaciones a Knakk, y tras tomar unas notas dibuja rápidamente un mapa en un trozo de pergamino que tenía extendido.\
\
'Bien, lo he marcado en mi mapa. Enviaré este documento a Róarr e Ingifast, ¡quien espero que algún día usen estas forjas para nuestros propósitos!'"},
[1436]={"Collected the guard's report","Collect the report from Nimish","'Odd that Girgish sent someone else to collect this report. You fit the description that I was given perfectly, though. Please tell her that the Haradrim are getting more brazen. We do not have the force to stand against them if they organize their banners and press an attack upon the outpost.\
\
'Everything is detailed in my report.'","Assessing the Menace","Girgish instructed you to visit Guard Nimish at the southern entrance of the Jax Phanâl outpost. Guard Nimish regularly informs the emissary of goings on along the southern road. Today, Girgish would like you to fetch the guard's latest report.","The emissary takes the note from you and looks it over. She audibly clicks her tongue and then speaks.\
\
'Interesting. I had hoped that the rumours were untrue, for one shipment intercepted is one too many. We shall need to respond.'","Khôltekh's emissary, Girgish, directs you to a soldier on watch duty that has reported the Haradrim further encroaching upon the city's limits.","Deliver the guard's report to Girgish","Nimish provided you a report on the latest movements by the Haradrim. Deliver the report to Girgish.","'Hurry along. We must know what the Haradrim are up to so we can best counter their movements.'","'At the southern end of the outpost there is a guard who stands watch by the name of Nimish. Nimish is invaluable for he possesses a keen eye and pays close attention to details.\
\
'He delivers a report to me on a regular basis. I ask that you retrieve this for me today... if you are willing.'"},
[1437]={"Assessing the Situation","Find the guard post in the sewers","You have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers. You should introduce yourself to Nashôn, who appears to be in charge.","Belondor has asked you to check on a group of guards from the Fleet-fast that he has sent into the sewers under the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. Citizens have reported a problem with crocodiles coming out from the sewers and troubling them, but Belondor believes that this is just a symptom of a larger problem below.","'It is good to see you again, my friend. I heard you have been helping with various tasks around the city, and I wanted to thank you for that. It's important for keeping the peace that citizens don't lose faith in the Kindred after... recent events.'\
\
A darkness begins to creep onto the man's face before he shakes it off and returns to the present.\
\
'Since the re-opening of Dâr Laja, some of the residents of the Sail-haven have come to me with their troubles, as they currently have no representative on the council. They tell me of crocodiles coming out of the city sewers and causing trouble in the streets. Apparently, someone has lost a beloved pet.\
\
'I have dispatched a few guards from the Fleet-fast to go there and assess the situation. I suspect that there is more going on down there than just wandering beasts. I happen to have some familiarity with these tunnels, as it is where Mêshka and I were forced to hide for a time to escape the fires of the All-seeing's priests. The beasts in the tunnels underfoot are content to stay there so long as they are not disturbed. Something else is causing this.\
\
'If you would like to continue giving aid to the people of Umbar Baharbêl, I am eager to receive a report from my soldiers there. You can find them by entering Umbar-môkh through a door between The Wharf-gate and The Fisherfold.'","You have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers beneath the Sail-haven. Their post can be found by entering Umbar-môkh through a door between The Wharf-gate and The Fisherfold.","You have found the guard post","Talk to Nashôn","'Hoi there, traveller! What is it that brings you to Ilmabiri, the home of fierce beasts, foul smells, and now three brave soldiers?'\
\
You introduce yourself and tell him that Belondor has sent you to check on them and ask if they need any help.\
\
'${PLAYER}! That is so kind of you! We are still setting up our post here. I have decided to call it Kruha-sûrja, which in your tongue means Bastion Against the Beasts. Do you like it? We would certainly not refuse your help.'"},
[1439]={"'Be not afraid that I speak, ${RACE}. My voice may be gruff, but if your loyalty is to the Free Peoples whom I have come to support, you have no reason to fear me.\
\
'I have come from the north at the behest of others to see that the Free Peoples stand firm against these wretches. It appears that my arrival is ill-timed as Tirith Rhaw has already fallen. I will support you in an effort to retake the tower, but you must provide me with proof of your loyalty to the Free Peoples.\
\
'Captain-General Lainedhel told me to request proof in the form of tokens proving your valour on the battlefield. Bring these to me, and you shall have my service in reclaiming Tirith Rhaw.'","Collected Token of Valour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Tokens of Valour (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the tokens to Goldhead","'You are true, ${PLAYER}, and so am I. I shall not take all that you offer me.\
\
'Come, let us make our way to the tower and drive these curs from Tirith Rhaw!'","'Return to me when you have the tokens of valour, only then will I join this fight.'","Assistance from the Golden Bears","Goldhead is located at his den east and north of Tirith Rhaw.\
\
Goldhead requested that you bring proof of your loyalty and support of the cause of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors.","Tirith Rhaw has fallen to Angmar's army. Goldhead, the lord of the Morningthaw bears offered his assistance in exchange for proof that you are loyal to the bears and the cause of the Free Peoples."},
[1440]={"Collected bat samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver bat samples to Hórskur","The scholar Hórskur has been trying to study the bats of Grytholm, but with little success.","You have collected several bat samples for Hórskur, who is waiting outside of Tithzagáf.","Collect bat samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hórskur has asked for samples from the hostile bats in Tithzagáf, the cave on Grytholm.\
\
You can collect samples by defeating the bats and their masters.","'Many thanks! I shall study them and see if we dwarves can prepare for whatever the Angmarim and Orcs are planning with these bats.'","Assisted Research","'I wasn't expecting to see a friendly face in this desolate area!\
\
'The Angmarim are making it difficult for me to study the bats living here. Unfortunately, I'm no fighter.\
\
'If your mind is set on entering Tithzagáf, would you collect some bat samples for me? Many of the bats only answer to the enemy now, but they may still be of use to us in death.'"},
[1441]={"Assisting Blómgard","Collect boar meat in Laerlad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Boars can be found in Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should collect boar meat for the Woodfolk of Blómgard.","'Your kindness fills my heart, but more than that: the food you have brought will fill my stomach and those of the village! It is not often we see such charity from strangers, and I am happy to know it has not vanished in the darkness of these days.'","Evorik can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should talk to Evorik.","The Woodmen of Blómgard have been unable to hunt in the woods due to a rise in the number of vicious beasts that lurk within.","Bring the boar meat to Evorik","'Perhaps my wife Odahild has told you that the numbers of those who dwell in Blómgard dwindle year by year? Soon there will not be enough of us to defend the village, nor enough to hunt for food. In better times our hunters ranged the woods for boar meat, and it was enough. Can I ask you to brave the woods of Laerlad and return with boar meat for my village?'","Collected boar meat in Laerlad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1442]={"Habla con Radagast","Complete Rhosgobel: Calming the Wilds","Assisted Radagast throughout the Vales","'You have done much to aid my efforts here in the Vales. Take this as a token of my appreciation.'","Assisting Rhosgobel","Complete Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Tributaries","Radagast has an additional gift for your troubles in assisting his effort to restore the Vales of Anduin to the peaceful and beautiful place that it once was.","Complete Rhosgobel: Calming the Farm","Complete Rhosgobel: The Daily Egg","Complete Rhosgobel: Radagast's Garden","Radagast can be found in Rhosgobel.\
\
You should talk to Radagast.","Radagast has many tasks that need completing in the Vales of Anduin.\
\
You should assist Radagast in the Vales of Anduin.","Complete Rhosgobel: Cleaning the Anduin","Radagast has an additional gift for your troubles in assisting his effort to restore the Vales of Anduin to the peaceful and beautiful place that it once was. Once you have assisted him throughout the Vales, seek out Radagast, and he will reward you for your efforts."},
[1444]={"'Thank goodness you are here. I can deal with a lizard or two but not this Withered Tree!'","Complete Quest: Finding a Breach in the Darkness","'We stopped the Withered Tree this time, but I fear this is not the last we have heard of these damned fools.'","'The Burgsmen's Fellowship has been trying to combat the Withered Tree, who spread lies to those good people who still dwell in the city. I have just gotten word that Rathon has had to deal with the Withered Tree in the Cisterns recently. You must talk to him as I am sure he could use assistance in dealing with these wayward minds.'","Heledon asks you to assist Rathon, the Warden of the Wells, in keeping the Cisterns out of the hands of the Enemy.","Rathon can be found at the northern end of the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon and assist him with protecting the Cisterns.","Speak with Rathon","Assisting the Burgsmen's Fellowship","Speak with Heledon","Heledon can be found in Minas Tirith.\
\
Speak with Heledon."},
[1445]={"Sâghlem, the cook at The Cracked Flagon, is running low on a few key ingredients.","Collected juicy lemons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect fresh herbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected handfuls of olives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected fresh herbs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect handfuls of olives (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah yes, I could smell the herbs before I even saw you coming! I will take those. Thank you for your help! Here is a reward for your effort.'","Bring the ingredients to Sâghlem","Sâghlem has asked you to collect three ingredients that grow on the slopes that rise above Furtherholm.","You have collected the ingredients for which Sâghlem asked. You should bring them to him in the kitchen of The Cracked Flagon in Furtherholm.","'Ya hoi, my friend. What brings you into my kitchen? Khâtaphos sent you? Ah, that is our captain, always looking out for the crew!\
\
'If you are keen on lending a hand, I do have an important task for you. I am running very low on certain ingredients that can be found right here on the island. I need more herbs. They are leafy and bushy and are easy to spot. They also smell delicious! I need lemons, the big juicy ones, ripened on the tree. I also need olives. Many handfuls if you please!\
\
'You can find all of these here on the island, growing on the slopes well above the beach.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Assisting the Cook","Collect juicy lemons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1447]={"Hay un montón de leña en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías llevar los trozos de madera al montón de leña","Habla con Nessa Aliso","¡Eso debería ayudar en las labores de reconstrucción!","Ayudando en la reconstrucción","Recoge trozos de madera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'De hecho, Puente de Caballetes tiene mucho mejor aspecto ahora que se han recogido todos esos trozos de madera y ese desorden. Te agradezco tu esfuerzo por ayudar a la Hermandad, ${CLASS}.'","Por todo Puente de Caballetes se pueden encontrar trozos de madera.\
\
Deberías echar una mano y recogerlos.","Lleva los trozos de madera al montón de leña","'Las reparaciones en Puente de Caballetes avanzan. Me temo que quizá estemos causando más desorden que revitalizando el pueblo. ¿Has visto toda la madera y las tablas esparcidas por ahí?!\
\
'Te pido que recojas parte de este desorden. Puedes añadir los trozos de madera al montón de leña del pueblo después de recogerlos todos. Eso sería de gran ayuda.'","Los constantes ataques han dejado Puente de Caballetes en mal estado, y la Hermandad de los Leñadores está haciendo todo lo posible por reconstruir el pueblo.","Nessa Aliso está en Puente de Caballetes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Nessa Aliso.","Trozos de madera recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1449]={"Mírthar's body appears lifeless when you arrived with the healing concoction. Inspect him to learn any more that you can.","'Greetings. What bring you to Sul Madásh?'\
\
You show the mark you got from Mírthar to Serâna and explain what happened to him.\
\
'I am terribly sorry to hear of his passing. Mírthar was a valued friend and scholar. I will be sure to make sure we can recover his body and give him a proper burial.\
\
'Thank you for all you did and I am grateful you told me of his fate. I am sorry this was the outcome.'","Mírthar has succumbed to the blight. You find a scholar's mark on his clothing","You see a lifeless Mírthar on the ground","Return to Mírthar with the healing concoction","Assisting with Healing","You found Mírthar's scholar's mark when inspecting him. Bring it to the scholar Serâna in Sul Madásh, she would want to know of his fate.","Inspect Mírthar","Bring Mírthar's scholar's mark to Serâna","Lóburdith has helped you complete the healing concoction needed to save Mírthar. Hurry back and give him the medicine.","'Here is the concoction. Please, make haste. I do not know how much longer he can hang on.'\
\
Lóburdith gives you the healing concoction.\
\
'Make sure Mírthar drinks it all and then he should be able to walk enough to make it here where I can treat him properly.'"},
[1450]={"En una encrucijada","Habla con Erlys","A Erlys le gustaría hablar contigo antes de que abandones el Refugio de los Cuan-lûth.","Erlys ha decidido liberar a Cariad de Tornhad con tu ayuda y la de Igrain.\
\
Deberías hablar con ella en el Refugio de los Cuan-lûth cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]}.","'Espero que me demuestres que me equivoco, duvodiad, y que muestres tu fuerza.'","'Nadie captura a un miembro de los Cuan-lûth y vive para contarlo. Yo misma haré pedazos Tornhad para liberar a Cariad. Vienes conmigo; Igrain también. Es hora de poneros a prueba y ver de qué lado estáis realmente.'","'Podrías haber provocado el fin de los Cuan-lûth, pero intentaste ayudar. Sé valorar algo así.\
\
'Lo que decidan hacer los montaraces no importa. Con el tiempo, nos forjaremos un hogar más permanente aquí, con o sin su ayuda.'","Una furiosa Erlys ha exigido que la ayudes a liberar a Cariad."},
[1451]={"'Me has sorprendido, ${PLAYER}, y sé que Celechest también se sorprenderá. Has demostrado tanto un conocimiento superficial de nuestra ciudad como una rapidez que te ha permitido llegar a tiempo, pero hay mucho más que demostrar si deseas ser conocido como un corredor de los flets.\
\
'Busca a ciertos de mis amigos por toda la ciudad si deseas participar en pruebas similares de tu conciencia y rapidez: Leginiel, Lagordal, Bregradel y Lintwen. Ellos medirán tu habilidad.\
\
'No obstante, has ganado esta hoja de oro, ${PLAYER}.'","Encuentra al corredor de los flets cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía","Habla con el corredor de los flets cerca de la sala de artesanía","'¡Estás perdiendo tiempo, ${PLAYER}! El corredor de los flets que quiero que busques está en un flet en lo alto de Telain Galadhrim, cerca del buzón y la entrada a la sala de artesanía.'","En casa entre los árboles","Celechest te ha desafiado a demostrar tu familiaridad con Caras Galadhon en una carrera entre los árboles.","'No cualquiera puede convertirse en un corredor de los flets.'","El corredor de los flets cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía en Telain Galadhrim está esperando para hablar contigo.","'¿Has aprendido a moverte por nuestra hermosa ciudad, ${PLAYER}? Caras Galadhon es tanto hermosa como compleja y encontrar tu camino puede ser abrumador para los recién llegados... lo pocos que hay.\
\
'Aquellos que se vuelven especialmente hábiles para encontrar su camino entre los telain de Caras Galadhon son conocidos como \\qcorredores de los flets.\\q\
\
'¿Tienes las habilidades necesarias? Te desafío a encontrar al corredor de los flets en lo alto del flet de Telain Galadhrim, junto al buzón de correos y la entrada a la sala de artesanía, con toda la rapidez posible.'","'Has completado mi desafío, ${PLAYER}, pero habrá otros.'","Has llegado al corredor de los flets a tiempo","El corredor de los flets se encuentra en un flet con un buzón en lo alto de Telain Galadhrim, cerca de la entrada a la sala de artesanía.\
\
Celechest te ha desafiado a llegar rápidamente a un cierto corredor de los flets."},
[1452]={"Find and pet ten of the cats to be found in Zajâna.","Return to Jarôba in Zajâna with the names and locations of the cats you have found.","Return to Jarôba in Zajâna","Jarôba has asked for your help in finding and feeding many of the cats in Zajâna.","Find and pet cats in Zajâna (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Found and pet cats in Zajâna (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","At Least Fifty Cats","'There are so many cats here! There are at least… five!\
\
'There are so many to hunt for and find! And pet, of course! Will you help me find some of the cats in Zajâna?'","'You helped out the cats? Me too! I keep finding more every day!\
\
'Thanks, I'll add these to my list. There are so many - probably even over fifty!'"},
[1453]={"At Woods' Edge","Neither Hárskor nor his waggon can be found, and many dour glances rise to meet you...","'I must admit, I did not expect Grimbeorn to send an outsider. If he has fulfilled his promise as I hoped, I suppose it is no matter!\
\
'So, where are the provisions?'","'Have the Wizards told you much of the Woodmen, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
'Before you came to the Vales, their settlement of Hultvís was beset by wargs and goblins come down from the mountains. Its fences were splintered and its houses were singed with goblin-fire, but Hultvís endured. Alas, it proved a costly victory. Many hale men and a few of my kin were slain by the goblins, and now the chieftain of the Woodmen, Ríkmar, fears that he must face this tragedy on his own. He will not, and I have promised him my aid.\
\
'My kin have served as guardians of the Woodmen for many years, and it is a time of great need for Ríkmar's people. With many of his hunters slain, his people grow hungry. Worse still, he lacks the men to defend his people should the fences of Hultvís fall to the goblins. Some days ago I sent one of my kin, Hárskor, to the woods' edge with a waggon of provisions, but he has not returned and he is needed here among us. I can spare no others for this task, and you have proven yourself trustworthy in my eyes. Deliver my message to Hárskor, and aid Ríkmar and his people as best you can.\
\
'Perhaps he has remained in Hultvís for reasons of his own, but it is time he returned home!'","Concerned that Hárskor has not returned from his errand, Grimbeorn has sent you to seek him in the Woodmen settlement of Hultvís.","Talk to Ríkmar in Hultvís","The settlement of Hultvís can be found far to the south of the Beorning-lands in Woodsedge.\
\
Grimbeorn has asked you to seek one of his kin, Hárskor, and aid the chieftain of the Woodmen, Ríkmar.","Ríkmar, chieftain of the Woodmen, can be found in the settlement of Hultvís in Woodsedge.\
\
Grimbeorn sent his kinsman, Hárskor, to Woodsedge bearing much-needed supplies for the Woodmen of the Vales of Anduin. However, Hárskor has not returned and you have found no sign of his passing in Hultvís.","Deliver Grimbeorn's message to Hárskor in Hultvís"},
[1455]={"En el borde del bosque","Los osos y los gusanos portadores de la enfermedad se encuentran en la frontera entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur y el Bosque Viejo.\
\
Bob Cardorojo quiere destruir a los osos enfermos antes de que propaguen su plaga por todo el Bosque Viejo.","Derrota gusanos tumularios grandes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'En el borde del Bosque Viejo, hacia el sur por las Quebradas de los Túmulos, hay muchos osos que sufren una terrible plaga. La única forma que veo de salvarlos de su agonía es destruirlos y asegurarnos de que no propaguen esta plaga al resto del Bosque Viejo.\
\
'Encontrarás los osos y los portadores de la plaga en lo profundo del sur, donde los muros del Bosque Viejo se encuentran con las Quebradas de los Túmulos. Destruye a los osos y luego elimina a los gusanos infectados que los infestan.\
\
'También podrías encontrar algunos gusanos portadores de la enfermedad fuera de sus anfitriones.'","Bob Cardorojo te dijo que los osos cerca de los límites del Bosque Viejo, en lo profundo de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur, están siendo devorados desde dentro por gusanos tumularios.","Habla con Bob Cardorojo en el Alto del Hombre Muerto","Derrota osos enfurecidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Osos enfurecidos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gusanos tumularios grandes derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bob Cardorojo se encuentra en el Alto del Hombre Muerto.\
\
Debes regresar con Bob Cardorojo y decirle que el sombrío trabajo que pidió está completo.","'No hay alegría en quitar la vida natural, pero cuando esa vida está demasiado más allá de la recuperación, es nuestro deber asegurarnos de que no sufra más.\
\
'Piensa en esto y sabe que lo que has hecho es por el bien de todos. Te lo agradezco mucho, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'","'Temo que los osos hayan contraído una terrible enfermedad y, para salvar a otros que aún puedan estar libres del mal que se propaga por la naturaleza, debemos actuar. Ve al sur y libera a estas pobres bestias de sus males.'"},
[1456]={"Zhúdo can be found near Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have recalled the other scouts sent to Gundabad. You should return to Zhúdo.","Darfin, Rádek, and Sigvith can be found within the encampments of Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh at the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Zhúdo has asked you to recall Darfin, Rádek, and Sigvith from their missions at the Orc encampments outside Mount Gundabad.","Talk to Zhúdo near Mount Gundabad","'${PLAYER}, some of my scouts have not returned.\
\
'Although I had hoped I would not need to ask this of you, it seems I have no choice. I sent them to scout Gorgar's defences and learn what they could of his plans at the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
'I was to receive word from them by this morning, but I have heard nothing. Darfin, Zhúdo, Rádek, and Sigvith... these are good dwarves and I would not have them come to harm under my command.\
\
'If they are still scouting, inform them that the mission is ended and recall them at once! If some trouble has befallen them....\
\
'You are to go to the gates of Gundabad and find them!'","Zhúdo can be found near Mount Gundabad.\
\
You have found only one of Glóin's scouts, Zhúdo. You should talk to Zhúdo and learn what has happened.","Darfin appears to have been captured by the Orcs of Gundabad!","'I had a feeling the commander would send someone....'\
\
Zhúdo's lip curls slightly.\
\
'The Orcs have built two encampments here, one on each side of the gates of Gundabad—Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. I and the other scouts, Darfin, Rádek, and Sigvith have been working to impair their defences and gather information for the Gabil'akkâ.\
\
'I say we have been here long enough. It will take a concentrated force to break these defences no matter how prepared we might be!\
\
'Go. Find the others and recall them. Our mission is ended!'","Find and aid Rádek","Find and aid Sigvith","In an attempt to gain more knowledge of Gorgar's plans, Glóin sent several scouts to the gates of Mount Gundabad. However, their return is long overdue.","You discover a Zhélruka sheltering near the approach to Mount Gundabad","Darfin, Zhúdo, Rádek, and Sigvith can be found near the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Glóin's scouts have not returned from a mission to the gates of Mount Gundabad. You should search for them.","Rádek is surveying a stable of sorts at the gates of Gundabad","'I am pleased to see that none of my companions came to harm. You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'As for the four of us, we're going back to Annâk-khurfu. If we haven't learned enough to satisfy Commander Glóin by now, he is welcome to send another scouting party!'","Find and aid Darfin","Find some sign of Glóin's scouts near the gates of Mount Gundabad","Sigvith appears to be leafing through a number of dirty papers","At the Gates"},
[1457]={"Defeat Orc raft-builders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Golthor can be found in the tunnels beneath Osgiliath.\
\
You have dealt a harsh blow to the Orcs along the Anduin and should now return to Golthor.","'You have done well, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Their rafts are many, but this shall set them back for a time.'","Orc raft-builders and their designs can be found along the Anduin in southern Osgiliath.\
\
Golthor has asked you to sabotage Orkish bridge-rafts and slay their crafters.","Hoping to slow the advance of the Morgul-host, Golthor has sent you to destroy the bridge-rafts that ferry their forces to the western banks.","At the Mercy of the Anduin","Talk to Golthor","'Although they allow us to sneak freely through the city, the Orkish bridge-rafts along the Anduin pose a great threat to the White City.\
\
'With each passing hour, the host of Minas Morgul sends more forces across the river and draws closer to Minas Tirith. We must destroy their rafts and slow their advance, even if it cannot be stopped!\
\
'Travel to the southern docks, burn their rafts, and slay the Orcs that craft them. Go with haste, for the forces of the Enemy do not rest.'","Burn Orkish bridge-rafts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Burned Orkish bridge-rafts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Orc raft-builders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1458]={"Talk to Spakorth at Lûghash","Stout-axe expeditions can be found throughout Dor Amarth. \
\
Spakorth has asked you to seek the remaining Stout-axe expeditions in Dor Amarth. These expeditions can be found among the rocks and crevices to the south of the road to Lûghash. \
\
You should tell any Stout-axes you encounter to return to Lûghash.","The Stout-axes make for Lûghash!","At the Mistress's Bidding","Spakorth can be found outside the lower gates to Lûghash in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have recalled all the Stout-axes you could find. You should meet with Spakorth outside Lûghash.","'The tale of the Stout-axes is not a pleasant one, friend, but I would share it with you.\
\
'Once we were Drása's Folk—a great kingdom of dwarves, but no longer, and it is only now that Sauron is gone that I dare to utter the name of the Father of our folk. Early in this Age, Sauron ordered us to return the Great Ring of Power he granted to our folk when still we dwelt in the East. The Dark Lord sought for it some unknown purpose, and when our King of old denied him his prize, Sauron summoned forth a vast army and razed our ancestral home and stripped the golden halls of Usk-tóga. Many of our clan were slain, and those few who survived were taken as thralls to Mordor to serve the Dark Lord. We were made to forsake our clan name of old and swear ourselves to Sauron, and so we became the Khirvísa: the Stout-axes of Mordor.\
\
'Yet, throughout our long centuries of toil, we held to the old ways and the line of our Kings of old remained unbroken. We were slaves, yes, but some measure of who we were endured and we made for ourselves a small realm of our own in secret within the lands of Mordor. But Sauron knew all too well that which we had hoped to conceal from him....\
\
'Seventy-eight years ago, the Stout-axes were unmade. In a rage, the Dark Lord returned to Mordor from lands unknown and imprisoned our King and countless other Stout-axes in the dungeons of Barad-dûr. What little freedoms we had were taken from us, and even the lowliest Orcs came to regard us as mere vermin. In the absence of our King, I and many others remained to toil in Lûghash, and whenever Zôreth was not summoned to Barad-dûr, she too dwelt within Lûghash.\
\
'Now Sauron is gone, but still we serve - hated as we are now in the eyes of all in Mordor. After the fall of the Dark Lord, none but the Mistress of Lûghash, Zôreth, deigned to offer the rest of our kin shelter and keep us from the Orcs. In our desperation, it would seem we have traded one master for another, but we are too far from the Black Gate and escape now seems no more possible now than it did when Sauron ruled Mordor. And to where would we even escape? Zôreth desires the weapons and trinkets of the Dark Lord above all else, but what portion of his might remains in them I cannot say. We have sought them nearly every day since his fall, but every search has come to naught.\
\
'Days we have searched now, and with little food or rest. It is time for my kin to return to Lûghash, even if Mistress Zôreth does not wish it.\
\
'There are four other expeditions about in this land, ${PLAYER}. Find them, and send them home to Lûghash!\
\
'If you wish to meet my folk, you shall meet us all!'","Zôreth, Mistress of Lûghash, has sent the Stout-axes in her service to seek treasures that once belonged to the Dark Lord.","'I am saddened to learn that some of my folk fell into the fires of the mountain. It seems even keeping a careful pace is no longer enough....\
\
'The tremors have grown more powerful since Sauron's fall, and new cracks form in the earth with each passing day. It is challenging to keep a steady footing when you cannot trust that the ground shall remain whole beneath you! We shall have to be more careful the next time the Mistress sends us out in search of whatever it is we're meant to find.\
\
'For those that have returned, they shall enjoy a long-awaited rest. You have done my folk a great service, ${PLAYER}.'","Scattered equipment lines the edge of this chasm. These Stout-axes met an unfortunate fate...","Recall Stout-axe expeditions to Lûghash (${CURRENT}/${MAX})"},
[1459]={"Enter the cave where Zúrsnaga is hiding","'Zúrsnaga is no more? Athelward will certainly be pleased to know this. I know not the meaning of Zúrsnaga's words, but the ramblings of a deranged Uruk are of little concern to me.\
\
'I cannot convey how fortunate I am to have an apprentice so quick to learn! Perhaps with enough training, you could even aspire to become as skilled as myself.'","The Uruk-hideout is south-west of Caddabrand's camp, beyond the entrance to the wolf-den.\
\
Caddabrand has tracked the Uruk, Zúrsnaga, to a cave south-west of the wolf den.","The Uruk-hideout is south-west of Caddabrand's camp, beyond the entrance to the wolf-den. Zúrsnaga lies hidden within the caves.\
\
Caddabrand has asked you to find and defeat the Uruk, Zúrsnaga.","Find and defeat Zúrsnaga the Uruk","Return to Caddabrand with news of Zúrsnaga's demise","Reeve Athelward has tasked Caddabrand with eliminating an Uruk-hai captain and has promised a large bounty for the task. Caddabrand is eager to split the reward with someone capable of doing the dirty work.","'Perhaps you are curious as to why I am encamped here and not hunting Orcs near Cliving? Allow me to explain, my dear apprentice. You see, I am on a mission from Reeve Athelward himself. He has placed a rather large bounty on the head of an Uruk named Zúrsnaga, and I plan to collect on it.\
\
'Zúrsnaga and his company unwittingly attacked the gates of Cliving in an attempt to infiltrate the city. Our Riders destroyed the attacking force and sent Zúrsnaga fleeing south. Athelward was outraged by this attack and has demanded the Uruk be slain at any cost.\
\
'I have reason to believe that Zúrsnaga has been hiding in a cave to the south-west beyond the wolf-warrens. You have proven yourself rather skilled... I would not be opposed to letting you handle the Uruk, if you are interested in sharing a portion of the bounty reward with me.'","You notice Uruk-tracks leading deeper into the cave","Caddabrand's camp lies east of the Uruk-hai hideout and the wolf-den.\
\
Caddabrand will be eager to hear the news that Zúrsnaga has been defeated.","Athelward's Bounty","Found and defeated Zúrsnaga the Uruk"},
[1460]={"Inform Garmund of his new role as Athelward's personal guardian","'If Reeve Athelward has decided that I must return to serve him, then I shall obey his judgement. I believe that my actions were just, but I must accept the outcome of disregarding his orders. Allow me time to collect my belongings.\
\
'I regret that I will not be able to further defend the lands that I so greatly love, but by protecting the Reeve, I am in a unique position to keep safe the people I have sworn to honour.\
\
'Perhaps, in time, I will be able to convince Athelward not to sacrifice so much of his domain in order to defend his city. Thank you for standing by me through all of this, ${PLAYER}.'","'Rejoin Garmund? Am I taken for a fool? I have returned to deliver a formal summons by Reeve Athelward. He requests your presence at the Mead Hall, at once.\
\
'Having disclosed the details of Garmund's betrayal, the Reeve seeks a neutral party to discuss a resolution. I hardly consider you neutral, but nonetheless, you have been chosen to discuss the matters with the Reeve.\
\
'Do not let Garmund's arrogance go unpunished.'","'I am rather surprised to find Léofcetel awaiting our arrival. He has made it known that he wishes to speak with you, perhaps he has had a change of heart regarding our purpose.\
\
'You may inform him that I hold no grudge against him for his refusal. If he wishes to assist us once more, we are more than willing to accept his return.'","Léofcetel seems most displeased with his new rank","Léofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Reeve Athelward has judged Léofcetel worthy of the title of Captain of the Guard, receiving the role from his rival Garmund.","'Athelward has made me Captain of the Guard? It is an honourable title, but one wrought with peril and frustration. This feels more of a punishment than a reward! I sought to keep away from the fields of destruction, only to be thrust onto the front lines of our defences.\
\
'I am unsure how this flawed promotion was decided, but I cannot help but think that you are to blame, ${PLAYER}. Off with you! Pester someone else with your good deeds....'","Léofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Captain Garmund wishes to have Léofcetel rejoin his men and to set aside their past differences.","Reeve Athelward resides within his Mead Hall, at the eastern edge of Cliving.\
\
Reeve Athelward has summoned you before him to discuss the matters of Garmund and Léofcetel.","Léofcetel has informed Reeve Athelward of Captain Garmund's disobedience, and Athelward must respond with fair judgement of each man.","Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving.\
\
Athelward has judged Garmund to be a valiant protector and has granted him the duty of becoming the Reeve's personal safe-guard.","Athelward's Judgement","Talk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall","Inform Léofcetel of his promotion to Captain of the Guard","'Thank you for heeding my summons, ${PLAYER}. Léofcetel has told that you have been assisting Captain Garmund and his riders. Please share with me the events that you have witnessed, and your opinion of Garmund's intentions.'\
\
You describe the raid against the Orcs led by Garmund, his respect for Reeve Athelward, and his desire to protect his homeland from the invaders. Athelward listens, nods, and thinks for a moment before speaking.\
\
'I hear truth in the words you speak, ${PLAYER}, and I will now pass judgement on these matters, with your testimony in mind. Inform Léofcetel that I am moved by his loyalty, and his adherence to my commands. As such, I have decided to bestow upon him the title of Captain of the Guard. With this rank, he shall be able to oversee the other men on guard and ensure that none shall risk their lives to attack the White Hand Orcs.\
\
'When you have finished with Léofcetel, speak with Captain Garmund. Garmund is to pack his supplies and return to the Mead Hall. For his noble acts and his great desire to protect others, he will receive the privilege of becoming my personal protector and safe-guard. My life will be more secure with Garmund at my side.'","Talk to Léofcetel"},
[1461]={"Has recogido una jarra de cerveza Rompepicos","Has recogido la cerveza Rompepicos","Lleva la Cerveza Rompepicos a Óli","Recoge una jarra de Cerveza Rompepicos","Óli se encuentra en Hrimbarg, en las Montañas Nubladas, lejos al este de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Óli te ha pedido que le lleves una pinta de \\qCerveza Rompepicos\\q de la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta.","'¡Saludos de nuevo, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! ¿Sigues viajando por las Montañas Nubladas? Mantente atento a los trasgos. Están por todas partes últimamente.\
\
'Ah, y no olvides: si pasas por la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta en Combe, en las Tierras de Bree, por favor tráeme una pinta de \\qCerveza Rompepicos\\q.'","'La cerveza Rompepicos solo se puede conseguir en la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta. ¿No es eso interesante? Creo que sí es muy interesante.'","'Tengo aquí una lista de solicitudes para ayudar a los miembros de la Liga de las Posadas que se encuentran lejos de casa sin el apoyo de sus hermanos amantes de la cerveza. Parece que extrañan sus bebidas favoritas, ¡o en algunos casos ni siquiera las han probado!\
\
'Un buen enano llamado Óli desea probar la bebida favorita de su primo en todo el mundo: nada menos que la Cerveza Rompepicos de La Posada de la Comba y la Cresta.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que has estado en Combe, ¿verdad? Su Cerveza Rompepicos es realmente buena.'","¡Regresa con la Cerveza Rompepicos antes de que se acabe el tiempo!","'Ah, ¡has vuelto con la cerveza Rompepicos! Ahora finalmente sabré de qué ha estado hablando mi primo durante tanto tiempo. ¡Ojalá pudiera darte algo más que mis agradecimientos por esto, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}!\
\
'¡Ten la seguridad de que todos los que me encuentre escucharán sobre el favor que me has hecho!'","La Posada de la Comba y la Cresta se encuentra en el pueblo de Combe, en las Tierras de Bree.\
\
Deberías viajar a Combe y recoger algo de Cerveza Rompepicos en la posada allí.","¡Se acabó el tiempo!","'¡Hola, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! No habría pensado que sería posible encontrar a otro miembro de la Liga de las Posadas aquí, en lo alto de las Montañas Nubladas. Sin embargo, aquí estás... y quizás estés ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a ayudar a un colega necesitado.\
\
'Verás, mi primo, Atli Matarañas, me habló, en su última carta, de una cerveza que parece gustarle mucho, y eso es decir poco. Me escribió páginas y páginas sobre esta cerveza, ¡y ahora simplemente tengo que probarla! Supongo que si hubiera aceptado el Desafío de la Liga de las Posadas la habría probado, pero no tengo tiempo en este momento. Mis deberes con Gloïn me mantienen demasiado ocupado. Sin embargo, quizás puedas ayudarme con esto.\
\
'Si alguna vez estás cerca de la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta en las tierras de Bree, ¿podrías pasar por allí y comprarme una pinta de \\qCerveza Rompepicos\\q?'","Se te ha encargado completar una entrega a un miembro de la Liga de las Posadas que se ha quedado varado lejos del festival esta temporada.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu bitácora de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Recoge la Cerveza Rompepicos en la Posada de la Comba y la Cresta","El favorito de Atli"},
[1462]={"Destruir catapultas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Asegurad la entrada del campamento de Graug.","Derrotad a Graug y aseguraos de que el conocimiento sobre la ubicación de Esteldín esté a salvo.","Asegurad la puerta principal","<rgb=#00FF00>La entrada al campamento de Graug ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Buscad y destruid las catapultas que se encuentran fuera de la tienda de Graug. Esto permitirá a los montaraces asegurar el campamento inferior.","En lo más profundo de la noche, una partida de exploradores trasgos ha descubierto la ubicación del regugio de montaraces conocido como Esteldín. Los trasgos han huido a Dol Dínen, acabad con ellos antes de que puedan traer refuerzos.","Asegurad la puerta central","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta este ha sido asegurada</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis asegurado la zona tras destruir las catapultas. Ahora podéis buscar y derrotar a Graug y a sus exploradores trasgos.</rgb>","'Los montaraces de Esteldín recordarán tus servicios, ${PLAYER}. Sin vuestra ayuda, Esteldín habría caído.'","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta central ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Ataque al alba","Romped la puerta oeste o la puerta este de Dol Dínen y aseguradla.","Asegurad la puerta este","Romped y asegurad la puerta principal de Dol Dínen.","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta oeste ha sido asegurada</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis derrotado a Graug y asegurado el conocimiento de la ubicación de Esteldín</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>No permitáis que ningún explorador trasgo escape.</rgb>","Has permitido que un explorador trasgo escape con el conocimiento de la ubicación de Esteldín","<rgb=#00FF00>La puerta principal ha sido asegurada</rgb>","Con el camino despejado a través de una de las puertas, la puerta central os cierra el paso, es el último obstáculo para alcanzar a los exploradores trasgos.","El patio ha caído. Ahora todo lo que queda es derrotar a Graug y destruir cualquier rastro de la información que hayan podido reunir.","Asegurad la zona.","Asegurad la puerta oeste","Catapultas destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Asegurad la entrada del campamento de Graug, en la cima de la colina que domina la puerta central."},
[1467]={"Lavanferon está en Echad Mothelen, al noroeste de la Guarida de Tejepavor.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Lavanferon con la noticia de tu éxito.","Laehendiel derrotada en la Guarida de Tejepavor","Araña derrotada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me complace que hayas podido terminar con esa malvada reina araña. Te has ganado esta recompensa.'","Derrota a Laehendiel en la Guarida de Tejepavor","Habla con Lavanferon en Echad Mothelen","'Derrota a Laehendiel y a su prole, ${PLAYER}... son una amenaza para los Malledhrim.'","Attercop, Attercop","'Me vendría bien tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Cuando estaba explorando el lugar de Burgûl-stazg, me crucé con una gran araña.\
\
'No puedo caminar por estos bosques de nuestros antiguos parientes sin purgarlo de estas criaturas. Derrota a tantas arañas como puedas, y a su malvada señora, Laehendiel. Su escondite creo que está en la Guarida de Tejepavor, al sureste de aquí.\
\
'Cuando hayas completado esta tarea vuelve a verme, y te recompensaré por tus esfuerzos.'","Muchas criaturas oscuras y malvadas habitan en las profundidades del sur del Bosque Negro. Las arañas son de las más temibles.","Pueden encontrarse arañas por todos los Troncosombríos. Laehendiel se encuentra en la Guarida de Tejepavor, al sureste de Echad Mothelen.\
\
nLavanferon te ha pedido que derrotes a un buen número de arañas y a su señora, Laehendiel.","Derrota a las arañas en los Troncosombríos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1468]={"'Caza los uros en las llanuras. Ten cuidado: un uro macho enfurecido es una presa difícil, incluso para varios hombres.'","'Ah, cuatro excelentes mantos. Te has esforzado mucho para entregarlos y te has ganado mi gratitud. Pronto terminaré mi trabajo y la gente de Puente de Caballetes tendrá la armadura que necesita.\
\
'Este asalto desde el norte ha causado grandes pérdidas a la gente de las Quebradas del Norte, pero con tu ayuda creo que prevalecerán.'","Devuelve los mantos de uros a Gondranc","'Según el libro de Asikko, los cazadores Hijos de la tierra usan los mantos de pelaje espeso que crecen sobre los hombros de los uros para acolchar el interior de su armadura. Este pelaje brinda tanto calor como comodidad.\
\
'Necesito que te adentres en los campos de Rhunenlad o al este de Nan Amlug en busca de estos mantos. Tendrás mejores resultados si cazas los uros machos. No intentes esta caza en solitario, pues los uros son bestias poderosas.\
\
'Cuídate, ${PLAYER}. No hace falta que te sacrifiques por unas pieles.'","Mantos de uros","Recoge mantos de uros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mantos de uros recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A solicitud del Montaraz Gondranc, fuiste al campamento de los Hijos de la tierra al noreste de Esteldín para recuperar un libro de conocimientos sobre trabajo del cuero que Asikko, El líder de los Hijos de la Tierra, le había prometido. Con esos conocimientos podrá fabricar una armadura mucho mejor para la gente de Puente de Caballetes.","Los uros pastan en las llanuras y colinas de Rhunenlad y del este de Nan Amlug.\
\
Gondranc descubrió en el libro de Asikko que los Hijos de la tierra usan los mantos de pelaje que crecen sobre los hombros de los uros para acolchar su armadura. Te ha pedido que caces uros y le traigas esos mantos."},
[1469]={"'Muy bien, ${PLAYER}, ¡muy bien! Me aseguraré de que esta carne de jabalí sea salada y conservada, y debería ayudar a que Musgovilla supere algunos de los meses invernales más fríos, cuando los cinturones deben apretarse y los platos parecen más escasos. ¡Me alegra que esta tarea, al menos, haya resultado útil para el pueblo!\
\
'Sí, he abandonado mi idea de usar esas plumas de Crébain. ¿Una cantidad de usos? Mi esposa dijo que bien podría haber sido cero después de probar la almohada que hice con ellas. \\q¡Bevan, necio!\\q, me dijo, \\q¡se necesiten más de ocho plumas para hacer una almohada, y cualquiera que intente hacerlo con plumas de Crébain, de todas las cosas, merece la torcedura que le dejaría en el cuello!\\q\
\
'Supongo que las buenas ideas que brotan en otoño..... bueno, caen cuando llega el invierno. ¡Prefiero enfrentar la amenaza de partidas de guerra Uruk sueltas en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes antes que presentarle a mi esposa otra de mis ideas completamente nuevas! Creo que desde ahora me limitaré a vigilar el pueblo... ¡es menos perjudicial para mi ánimo!'","'Siempre necesitamos carne de jabalí, y somos afortunados de que muchas de estas criaturas habiten cerca. Si regresas conmigo con buenos cortes de filete de jabalí, toda Musgovilla brindará por tu nombre cuando llegue el invierno.'","Lleva la carne de jabalí a Bevan en la puerta norte de Musgovilla","Bevan está en la puerta norte de Musgovilla, esperándote para que regreses con la carne de jabalí.","Con el invierno acercándose pronto, Bevan sabe que los almacenes de Musgovilla necesitan ser abastecidos con carne de jabalí salada y conservada.","Los jabalíes musgosos habitan cerca del Viejo Camino del Sur, y resultarán una buena fuente de los filetes de jabalí que Bevan solicitó.","El Otoño No Dura","Carne de jabalí recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Pero tales cavilaciones deberán esperar, porque el invierno se acerca y el otoño no dura. Si los almacenes no están abastecidos con carne de jabalí salada y conservada para cuando las noches se vuelvan frías, Musgovilla pasará hambre. ¡A menos que los Uruks regresen, supongo! No, no le digas a nadie que dije eso. No tiene gracia.\
\
'Pero siempre necesitamos carne de jabalí, y somos afortunados de que muchas de estas criaturas habiten cerca. Si regresas conmigo con buenos cortes de filete de jabalí, toda Musgovilla brindará por tu nombre cuando llegue el invierno.'","Recoge carne de jabalíes musgosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1470]={"Destroy sorrowful relics (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Avabárg: Buried Omens","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Audvak believes that destroying sorrowful relics may help lift the darkness that has settled upon Avabárg.","'Three times have the Woodmen attempted to resettle Avabárg, and three times have we failed. Artifacts of the past lie there now, reminders of the misfortune and death that befell us within those walls. Do those reminders serve to draw the gloom toward Avabárg? Destroy them, and perhaps the darkness will abate. It is worth the attempt, ${PLAYER}.'","Destroyed sorrowful relics (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1471]={"Defeated the Spirit of Gloom","'The people of Hultvís believe that it is a time of ill omens, and nowhere is that more evident than Avabárg, where the darkness has settled most heavily! Does some shade or spirit dwell there now, lurking somewhere within the ruins? I think it likely. Find this spirit and put an end to its evil, ${PLAYER}!'","Avabárg: Source of Gloom","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Defeat the Spirit of Gloom","The gloom of which Audvak spoke was not merely metaphorical, and has taken ethereal forms that must be defeated."},
[1472]={"Defeated glooms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat shadow wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Avabárg: Sunken Gloom","Defeated shadow wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","'This gloom that has descended upon Avabárg is of recent vintage, ${PLAYER}, but worse: it has taken ethereal forms that can do harm to wary and unwary alike! This bodes ill for the Woodmen of Hultvís, I assure you of that. Will you defeat these manifestations of gloom and put an end to the danger they pose?'","The gloom of which Audvak spoke was not merely metaphorical, and has taken ethereal forms that must be defeated.","Defeat silent glooms (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1473]={"'Thrice the Woodmen sought to settle Avabárg, but each time resulted in failure. Shamefully, their bones remain on the island, and they were never gifted with the proper burial they deserve. If you gather up their bones we might remedy that, and give them rest at last.'","Avabárg: Wayward Bones","Collected bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Audvak of the Woodmen is concerned about the gloom that has descended upon Avabárg.","Collect restless bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Audvak asked you to collect restless bones from Avabárg so she might give them proper burials."},
[1474]={"'You have not hunted enough avanc to impress me. Anyone can get lucky and kill one avanc. Do you think it so easy that you try to cheat me?\
\
'Go kill avanc in the bog and do not return until you have.'","Collected Avanc-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'One of your first tasks of the hunt will be to survive. I cannot teach you that, it is something you must learn on your own.\
\
'Once you have mastered survival, we will hunt some avanc. A mighty beast, the avanc.\
\
'We will need to collect as much of their meat, tails, and hide as possible, so try to be precise with your attacks! We go at once!'","The avanc, to many beyond Dunland a mythical beast, serve as a staple for the people of the Dunbog.","Avanc for Every Need","Talk to Harri at the hunters' camp","Avanc can be found throughout the Dunbog.\
\
Harri has asked you to help him fight the mighty avanc.","Collect Avanc-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Avanc-tails (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Avanc-skins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected Avanc-skins (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You did well, friend. I am impressed. Do all duvodiad fight as well as you? Actually, nevermind, I know the answer. They do not.\
\
'We must find more suitable tasks for you then, since even the mighty avanc seems easy prey for you.'","Collected Avanc-tails (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1476]={"Trapjaw looks up from his grisly meal angrily, then leaps to his feet to attack!","Find Trapjaw","One of Ivorel's scouts has returned to tell of a deadly black dog named Trapjaw who was seen following Hal Tiller's trail two days ago. Ivorel believes that Trapjaw is likely responsible for his death.","'One of my scouts managed to return on his own, ${PLAYER}, and he brings important tidings. The evening before last he found himself tracking an unusually large and cunning barghest -- he believes the creature may have been stalking  little Hal Tiller at the time -- but he lost the trail when he was himself ambushed and injured.\
\
'This creature -- named Trapjaw by the local folk -- evidently cornered and killed Hal a short while after. Now all that is left to us is to avenge the hobbit and destroy this monster before any more fall to it!\
\
'My scout tells me that Trapjaw has a lair out among the Scuttledells, a distance north of here. Find him and slay him, ${PLAYER}, in the name of Hal Tiller.'","'Trapjaw is dead... and... what? You claim that Hal Tiller yet lives?\
\
'We shall see about that! The little trickster has caused me more worry and care over the last week than I have known in two-hundred years! Here I thought him tormented or dead, and he has been off shirking duty to play hide and seek in the ravines!\
\
'When he returns, I will make him wish that he was safely tucked in Trapjaw's belly!'","Ivorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells, a distance south of Trapjaw's lair.\
\
You should speak with Ivorel and tell her that Trapjaw has been slain and that Hal Tiller is alive.","'The lives of the hobbits are short enough and far too innocent for such matters. It grieves me deeply to realize that I am responsible for the death of one such....'","Trapjaw's lair lies a distance to the north-east of Ivorel's camp in the Scuttledells.\
\
Ivorel has tasked you with avenging Hal Tiller by hunting down the deadly black dog, Trapjaw, within the Scuttledells.","Avenging the Innocent","Habla con Ivorel en su campamento","'Hey there, my good ${RACE}! Glad to see a friendly face out here. That overgrown dog and I have been hunting each other in circles for two days straight! Luckily, I was just ready to spring my trap when you showed up, or it might have gone badly for you.\
\
'Well, I'm off to continue the hunt! Good luck to you!'","Defeated Trapjaw"},
[1477]={"Edsig's Farm is now the Warg-riders' outpost! The farmers must be avenged...","The farmers killed by these Warg-riders have been avenged. But there is much more to be done.","The riders you defeated at Edsig's Farm will go a long way toward avenging those who lost their lives or homes to those Orcs.","Find out what has become of Edsig's Farm","Warg-riders are patrolling all over the area near Edsig's Farm. They keep watch on the road, and the surrounding farmlands, so approaching the farm undetected will not be easy.","Defeat Warg-riders at Edsig's Farm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Warg-riders attacking our farms came fast, and have done too much damage. It is time to strike back! No one is safe while those riders stalk the smoking ruins we used to call home. The destruction they caused should be avenged.\
\
'They have always come from the south, in the direction of Edsig's Farm. That farm was abandoned some time ago. Did the riders burn it to the ground, or have they captured it?'","Avenging the Lost Farmers","Edsig's Farm is near Gárferth's Farm, on the road south of Thrymm's Farm.\
\
Edsig's Farm was abandoned recently, but most of the Warg-rider attacks seem to have come from that direction.","Completado","Defeated Warg-riders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Edsig's Farm was once a very productive farm for Forlaw. It wasn't abandoned like the other farms, but no one that worked or lived there has returned alive. They are all presumed dead, but nobody is quite sure what happened to the farm, though they suspect the enemy has destroyed it."},
[1479]={"'I am not certain what we just witnessed, ${PLAYER}. Had I not seen it with my own eyes, I would never have believed it!\
\
'That one of the servants of the First Crafter would come to our aid in our hour of need...'\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer's eyes are wide with awe.\
\
'What better omen of success could Prince Durin and the Gabil'akkâ have wished for?'","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Abkân'aban in Gloomingtarn.\
\
After defeating Allaban the Collector at Abkân'aban and the revelation of Thrástan's identity, Hermáth Stormhammer wishes to speak with you. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","'There is no time to waste, ${PLAYER}. Are you prepared?'","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Abkân'aban","Awakening","'Although we still do not know the truth of how Thrástan came to dwell in Mount Gundabad, I am inclined to aid him—especially now that he seems to have taken ill. If any good can come from his return to Abkân'aban, I shall not keep him from it! Let us—'\
\
A scout's sudden arrival interrupts your conversation. The scout hands Hermáth a missive, and Hermáth begins to read it. After a moment, his brow furrows in concern.\
\
'It seems we were fated to travel to Abkân'aban this day, ${PLAYER}. I have just received word that the Angmarim of the Iron Crown have gathered their forces and now make for the Stone of Wakening!\
\
'To cede the sacred place of Durin's awakening to these wicked Men—it would be unthinkable! Let us go—all of us—and put an end to the Iron Crown's plans for Gloomingtarn!'","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost.\
\
Determined to both repel the Iron Crown and escort Thrástan to the White Stone Forge, Hermáth Stormhammer has asked you to accompany him and his warriors to Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer","At Abkân'aban, the Stone of Wakening, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown seek to master the white forge of Durin the Deathless, forever defiling the hallowed caverns of Gloomingtarn."},
[1483]={"In the course of a single day, the fates of the Orcs and the Dwarves of Middle-earth would be forever changed.","-'The Ufúrzrak Undone'","-'A Touch of Twistbeard'","-'Spoils Reclaimed'","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have continued your studies of the Battle of Azanulbizar. You should return to Hermáth Stormhammer.","-'Raid on Rung-shakam'","-'The Great Orc-hunt'","Complete any <rgb=#00FF00>4</rgb> of the following quests for the Haban'akkâ of Thráin:","-'Blockade on Barazinbar'","-'Warmth Amidst Winter'","-'Healing the Haban'akkâ'","-'Elusive Prey'","-'Fuel for the Fires'","'At the dawn of the Battle of Azanulbizar, the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ arrayed themselves throughout the dale as the Kings of the Seven Houses had commanded. Among the Haban'akkâ, brave dwarves of every sort fought to ensure victory over Azog and his vile kin and at last win an end to the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs.\
\
'If you wish to continue your studies, there is yet more to be learned.'","-'Provisions for the Haban'akkâ'","-'Assault on Atrad-zarakh'","'So much had transpired in so short a time, but the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ would not bow to Azog or any other Orc!'","Azanulbizar: A Fateful Day (Daily)","Quests for the Haban'akkâ can be accepted from Thorin or King Thráin at Amdân.\
\
Hermáth Stormhammer has suggested that you aid the Haban'akkâ and continue your studies of the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"},
[1484]={"Druggavar can be found within the Slade of Shadows, south of Andreg's position.\
\
Andreg has asked you to defeat the Druggavar summoned by the Old Woman of the Mountain.","Baa, Baa, Black Sheep","Defeat Druggavar at the Slade of Shadows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Slade of Shadows appears to be a focal point for the evil that is growing within the Gravenwood.","'Among the creatures inhabiting the Slade of Shadows are the Druggavar. The presence of these fell spirits is a clear sign that the Old Woman of the Mountain is near at hand, for it was she who summoned them at first to Enedwaith.\
\
'As you investigate the Slade of Shadows, banish as many of the Druggavar as you are able... such fell creatures cannot be allowed to enter our world, for their combined power may prove the undoing of the Free Peoples.'","Defeated Druggavar at the Slade of Shadows (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[1485]={"Search for the Ent the Dunlending spoke of outside Isengard","The strange tree is rumoured to wander outside the eastern edge of Isengard.\
\
The Dunlendings are fleeing in fear from Nan Curunír after being granted freedom by the Ents. They have warned of a tree monster lurking nearby.","Quickbeam can be found to the east of Isengard.\
\
The warning of the Dunlendings has turned in your favour, delivering you to an Ent. You should speak with Quickbeam.","You have encountered the Ent, Quickbeam!","'Stay... stay back, ${RACE}!\
\
'Look at what destruction the trees have brought to the vale... Saruman is undone. They allowed my men and me to flee, but I do not trust them. I know they are still here - I know they are watching us! There is one outside the ring, across the river Isen, I swear. It will not let us live!\
\
'You have delayed us long enough, ${RACE}. If your foolish journey brings you to Isengard, then so be it. We shall not remain long enough for the trees to find us.\
\
'Men, we go to Dunland!'","Back Into The Wild","Talk to Quickbeam outside Isengard","'Ta-rum! Ah, little ${PLAYER}... I remember you.\
\
'Much has changed since we last spoke. More death, more violence, and more of my friends lost. Thankfully, it has finally come to an end, and the land can begin to heal.\
\
'Soon I must return to the forest, but first, perhaps you can aid me in hindering the Tree-killer. Hoom... you should not find it so difficult to enter Isengard this time, my friend.'","After fleeing for their lives from Isengard, the Dunlendings fear the Ents are still pursuing them.","DNT -- Players will not see"},
[1486]={"'Ta-rum! What brings you here, little one?\
\
'This vale has changed from how I once knew it, and many of friends perished in the process. Thankfully, it has finally come to an end, and the land can begin to heal.\
\
'Soon I must return to the forest, but first, perhaps you can aid me in hindering the Tree-killer.'","Search for the Ent the Dunlending spoke of outside Isengard","The strange tree is rumoured to wander outside the eastern edge of Isengard.\
\
The Dunlendings are fleeing in fear from Nan Curunír after being granted freedom by the Ents. They have warned of a tree monster lurking nearby.","Quickbeam can be found to the east of Isengard.\
\
The warning of the Dunlendings has turned in your favour, delivering you to an Ent. You should speak with Quickbeam.","You have encountered the Ent, Quickbeam!","'Stay... stay back, ${RACE}!\
\
'Look at what destruction the trees have brought to the vale... Saruman is undone. They allowed my men and me to flee, but I do not trust them. I know they are still here - I know they are watching us! There is one outside the ring, across the river Isen, I swear. It will not let us live!\
\
'You have delayed us long enough, ${RACE}. If your foolish journey brings you to Isengard, then so be it. We shall not remain long enough for the trees to find us.\
\
'Men, we go to Dunland!'","Back Into The Wild","Talk to Quickbeam outside Isengard","After fleeing for their lives from Isengard, the Dunlendings fear the Ents are still pursuing them.","DNT -- Players will not see"},
[1487]={"Back on One's Feet","'You have gathered it all! You are a fine ${RACE} to be lost in a marsh with, do you know that? Now give me a moment to gather myself up and then I shall be ready to go.'","Return to Malhar","Gathered lizard-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Found a walking stick","Gather lomthond (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Find me lomthond near the Falls of the Rauros, a good walking stick, and some sustaining lizard-meat, and I think I shall be up for the journey, ${PLAYER}.'","Malhar is ready to leave the marshland, but first he must regain his strength before he can leave.","Lomthond can be found near the Falls of Rauros, sticks among the nearby trees, and lizards can be found throughout the Mouths of Entwash.\
\
Bring Malhar some lomthond, a walking stick, and some lizard-meat so that he has the strength to make the trek back out of the marshland.","Gather lizard-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gathered lomthond (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Malhar with the things you gathered, on the hill in the eastern part of Mouths of Entwash.","You recount the details of the ransom meeting and explain that Togbor sent you in search of him.\
\
'Then I beg your forgiveness. My escape has caused you more trouble than if I had stayed put. I am afraid I must be more trouble to you yet, for I do not have the strength to make it back from here.\
\
'But I believe I will, if you could bring me several things. I need a herb named lomthond, or wearywort to the shepherds, which can be found near to the Falls of Rauros and has properties that can ease the pain and grant me some vigour. I must eat, too. Of all the things in this place, the meat of the small lizards found about is most edible. And even with these in my stomach, bolstering my strength, I think I shall need a good stick to lean on. Perhaps there is one lying under one of these trees.'","Find a walking stick"},
[1489]={"Volver a lo básico - Armadura","Ejecutaste la receta de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio","El líder del Gremio de Sastres te ha pedido que crees una armadura de cuero para mostrar a los aprendices lo que podrían hacer, con el tiempo.","'¡Muchas gracias! Parece que podría aguantar una paliza.'","'Gran trabajo en el acolchado. A continuación, vamos a tener una pieza de armadura de cuero adecuada. Hazla un poco elegante. Muéstrales a los jóvenes lo que los profesionales podemos hacer.'","Entrega la armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hambrennil","Ejecuta la receta de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio","Entrega la armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","Habla con Hambrennil","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Crea una armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio.","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","'¿Sigues cosiendo?'"},
[1490]={"Entrega las botas con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hávar","Habla con Hávar","Ejecuta la receta de botas con patrón del gremio","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","Entrega las botas con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","'¿Tienes una cota de malla para mí? ¡Ja! ¿Lo entiendes? ¿Malla?'","El líder del Gremio de Herreros ha pedido que por favor forjes un par de botas para mostrar a los aprendices.","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un par de botas con patrón del gremio.","Volver a lo básico - Botas","La cara del líder del gremio está enterrada en sus manos.\
\
'Un aprendiz acaba de presentarme un par de botas tan horribles que me pregunto si el muchacho ha visto alguna vez un pie. Por favor, haz un par de botas que realmente puedan caber en los pies.'","Ejecutaste la receta de botas con patrón del gremio","'¡Voy a hacer que ese aprendiz corra una milla con estas puestas!'"},
[1491]={"El líder del Gremio de Herreros te ha pedido que crees una cota de malla para ayudar a mostrar a los aprendices cómo debería ser una buena cota de malla.","Ejecuta la receta de una cota de malla con patrón del gremio","Habla con Hávar","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","'¿Tienes una cota de malla para mí? ¡Ja! ¿Lo entiendes? ¿Malla?'","'¡Maravilloso! Déjame ponerme esto y que un aprendiz me golpee. Confiaré en tu artesanía cualquier día.'","'Buenas noticias: tenemos muchos aprendices nuevos en el gremio. Malas noticias: están progresando más lento de lo que me gustaría. Hazles algunos ejemplos de armaduras reales. Dales algo a lo que aspirar. Empecemos con la cota de malla. Todo el mundo piensa que es fácil de hacer, pero tú y yo sabemos que la diferencia entre una buena y una mala cota de malla es la diferencia entre la vida y la muerte.'","Ejecutaste la receta de una cota de malla con patrón del gremio","Volver a lo básico - Cota de malla","Entrega una cota de malla con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","Entrega una cota de malla con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hávar","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Crea una cota de malla con patrón del gremio."},
[1492]={"Volver a lo básico - Yelmo","Ejecuta la receta de un yelmo con patrón del gremio","Habla con Hávar","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","'¿Tienes una cota de malla para mí? ¡Ja! ¿Lo entiendes? ¿Malla?'","Entrega un yelmo con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hávar","'¡Los aprendices harán copias de este yelmo hasta que no pueda distinguir la diferencia entre los suyos y los tuyos!'","El líder del Gremio de Herreros te ha pedido que forjes un yelmo que los aprendices puedan usar como modelo para aprender.","Entrega un yelmo con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","Ejecutaste la receta de un yelmo con patrón del gremio","El Líder del Gremio sostiene en silencio lo que parece ser un yelmo. Señala dónde deberían estar los agujeros para los ojos antes de dejar caer el no-yelmo al suelo.\
\
'Por favor, ayuda.'","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja un yelmo con patrón del gremio."},
[1493]={"Ejecutaste la receta de una camiseta interior con patrón del gremio","Entrega una camiseta interior con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hambrennil","'Perfecto.'","Volver a lo básico - Camisa acolchada","Habla con Hambrennil","'Los que visten de tela necesitan toda la protección que puedan conseguir sin que la armadura les pese. No es el equilibrio más fácil de conseguir para los nuevos sastres. Muéstrales cómo conseguir esa armonía con finura.'","Ejecuta la receta de una camiseta interior con patrón del gremio","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Cose una camiseta interior con patrón del gremio.","Entrega una camiseta interior con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","La líder del Gremio de Sastres te ha pedido que muestres a los aprendices cómo hacer ropa que proteja incluso a los Sabios más imprudentes.","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","'¿Sigues cosiendo?'"},
[1494]={"Ejecuta la receta de acolchado de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas mejoradas.\
\
Crea un acolchado de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio.","Ejecutaste la receta de acolchado de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio","Habla con Hambrennil","'Los aprendices que recibimos en estos días dejan mucho que desear. Estaba pensando que ver una pieza hecha por un verdadero maestro les daría algo por lo que esforzarse. Empecemos por lo básico. ¿Qué tal un acolchado para armadura de cuero? Usa la nueva receta del gremio del vendedor de recetas mejoradas.'","La líder del Gremio de Sastres te ha pedido que prepares un acolchado de armadura de cuero como ejemplo para los aprendices.","Entrega el acolchado de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hambrennil","'Qué buen ejemplo para los aprendices.'","Volver a lo básico - Acolchado","Entrega el acolchado de armadura de cuero con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","'¿Sigues cosiendo?'"},
[1495]={"Habla con Hávar","El líder del Gremio de Herreros te ha pedido ahora que hagas una armadura de placas para mostrar a los aprendices.","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","'¿Tienes una cota de malla para mí? ¡Ja! ¿Lo entiendes? ¿Malla?'","Entrega una coraza con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Herreros en Minas Morgul","Ejecutaste la receta de una coraza con patrón del gremio","Ejecuta la receta de una coraza con patrón del gremio","Volver a lo básico - Placas","'Ahora quiero que hagas una armadura de placas. Una pieza para el pecho. Algo que pueda resistir las malvadas armas de los orcos.'","'Excelente trabajo, amigo mío. Veamos cómo resiste el hacha del líder del Gremio de Armeros.'","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Forja una coraza con patrón del gremio.","Entrega una coraza con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hávar"},
[1496]={"Ejecutaste la receta de una túnica con patrón del gremio","Habla con Hambrennil","'Las túnicas son quizás la forma más incomprendida de 'armadura' que vemos. ¡Libertad de movimiento, protección contra los elementos y los enemigos, bolsillos! Las túnicas son muy funcionales. Estoy seguro de que puedes producir un hermoso conjunto.'","'Cálida, funcional, con el toque justo de estilo. ¡Me encanta!'","Entrega una túnica con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) a Hambrennil","Ejecuta la receta de una túnica con patrón del gremio","Las recetas de artesanía que debes crear se pueden trocar con el vendedor de Recetas Mejoradas.\
\
Cose una túnica con patrón del gremio.","Volver a lo básico - Túnica","La líder del Gremio de Sastres te ha pedido que cosas un hermoso conjunto de túnicas para mostrar a los aprendices.","Entrega una túnica con patrón del gremio (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}) al líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","Habla con el líder del Gremio de Sastres en Minas Morgul","'¿Sigues cosiendo?'"},
[1497]={"'You have done much already for the People of the Avanc, and you have survived all of the challenges my men and I presented you. I am impressed.\
\
'You may go and speak with the Elders. Tell them that you have my respect and gratitude. They will be able to help you more with the duvodiad you seek.'","Talk to Elder Déin at Lhan Rhos","Lhan Rhos is to the north-west of the hunters' camp.\
\
Harri has asked you to return to the village of Lhan Rhos and speak with the Elders there.","Back to Lhan Rhos","'You should speak with the Elders at Lhan Rhos.'","'It is time that we spoke, ${PLAYER}. We have been keeping watch on you, and you have proven good to the Avanc-lûth. It is time that we spoke of some of the secrets of Dunbog.'","The hunters are very impressed with your work. You have earned the respect of the Avanc-lûth Elders, and they wish to speak with you about the plight of the Dunbog."},
[1498]={"Rochwen ha acampado cerca del Último Puente en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur del campamento de Thoroniel en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido que lleves a Rochwen un informe de tu campaña contra las arañas del norte del Bosque de los Trolls.","Las arañas trampilla y roñecarne del norte del Bosque de los Trolls sufrieron una terrible derrota a tus manos.","De vuelta al camino","Habla con Rochwen","'Deberías volver ahora con Rochwen al Último Puente. Llévale un informe de nuestros esfuerzos aquí... querrá saber qué ha ocurrido. Es probable que siga acampada con Alphlanc en el Último Puente, en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, muy al sur de aquí.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}, y que las estrellas iluminen tu camino.'","'Es como temíamos... la maldad del Enemigo está convocando a todas las criaturas oscuras bajo su estandarte.\
\
'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Enviaré un mensaje al maestro Elrond.'"},
}
